window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3601,"title":"Chapter 3601 - Escape","paragraphs":["“Little guy, are you okay?” Temporal Temple Master looked at Jian Wushuang.","“I’m fine, but I’ve already used the life-saving command talisman you gave me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s good. As for the life-saving command talisman...I only gave it to you in the Divine Beginning Realm, but in the Universe Battlefield, it can’t completely protect you from death. Moreover, you’re facing a Ruler who specializes in space-time techniques.” Temporal Temple Master smiled slightly, then, he looked at the two people in front of him.","“The two of you should be from Devil Cloud Star, right? I wonder if that Devil Cloud Star Master is doing well?” The Temporal Temple Master asked.","“My Star Master has great strength. Naturally, he’s doing very well. You’re the Temporal Temple Master from the Divine Beginning Realm? It seems that you’re just a low-level Ruler.” The tall man stared at the Temporal Temple Master, there was a hint of disdain between his brows.","Rulers had different levels of power.","A low-grade Ruler was at the bottom of the Rulers. Even though the tall man and the devilish young man were only at the low-grade Ruler Realm, the two of them had great backgrounds and had seen many things. They were also extremely powerful, an ordinary low-grade Ruler would naturally not take them to heart.","“I know that I’m not strong enough. However, this place is no longer the territory of the Devil Cloud Star. Can the two of you give me some face and call it a day?” The Temporal Temple Master said.","“Call it a day? Temporal Temple Master, you really know how to joke.” The tall man’s voice was cold. “Although you didn’t participate in the battle in the Divine Beginning Realm, you already know the reason behind it. Since that’s the case, you should know the purpose of our trip. If you know what’s good for you, you should just get lost. Otherwise...you should know the consequences.”","“Of course, I know the consequences. However, this little guy is still a member of our Temporal Temple. Right now, he’s right under my nose. As the Temple Master, I can’t just ignore this little guy,” said the Temporal Temple Master.","“If that’s the case, then you should die together with him.” The tall man’s aura was cold, and a shocking killing intent had already burst out from his body.","“Temporal Temple Master, in that battle back then, you were able to keep your life because you hid far away. However, since you want to intervene today, then there’s no need for your Temporal Temple to exist anymore.” The demonic youth said in a low voice.","“Haha!” The Temporal Temple Master suddenly laughed, “The two of you are overestimating yourselves. Although this old man is only a primary Ruler and doesn’t have the confidence to win against any of you one-on-one, if this old man wants to leave, I’m afraid the two of you won’t be able to stop this old man.”","“Really?”","The young man’s eyes turned cold, and the surrounding void instantly froze.","The entire space-time had completely stopped flowing, and everything had stopped moving.","Standing in the void, Jian Wushuang could clearly sense the changes in the surrounding space-time, and he was immediately shocked.","“What a terrifying space-time technique. This man didn’t even use his full strength before,” Jian Wushuang exclaimed.","He knew that if the evil-looking young man had used this technique from the beginning, he would not have been able to crush the life-saving talisman.","However, in the face of such a space-time technique, the Temporal Temple Master just smiled and waved his hand. Like a spring breeze, the space-time around him began to revolve again, and the speed was increasing, the area was also growing larger and larger.","In just an instant, the space-time power of this world was completely under the control of Temporal Temple Master.","“How is this possible?” The demonic youth looked at Temporal Temple Master in shock.","“Haha, I’ve already said that if I want to leave, the two of you won’t be able to stop me. Goodbye.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he saw Temporal Temple Master grab Jian Wushuang with one hand. With a flash, he disappeared into the void.","After Temporal Temple Master disappeared, the fast-moving void regained its calm.","The evil-looking young man and the tall man both stood in the void with unsightly expressions, especially the evil-looking young man. He glanced at the void where Temporal Temple Master had disappeared and found that the traces of space-time remained for a brief moment, but suddenly they were completely wiped out, and even he could not continue to chase after them.","“It seems that we have underestimated this Temporal Temple Master.” The demonic youth said in a low voice, “Although this Temporal Temple Master is only a primary Ruler, his usage of spacetime energy is indeed extraordinary. In fact, he is much stronger than me!”","Just now, this demonic youth had actually fought head-on against the Temporal Temple Master.","But the result of this battle was that the Temporal Temple Master had won!","“With a Ruler Realm expert who uses spacetime energy in such a profound way as a helper, it won’t be so easy for us to continue attacking Heavenly Sword Marquis,” the demonic youth said.","“That’s true, but it’s not as if we don’t have a chance. After all, this time, it’s just the two of us. Both of us are only elementary Rulers, and the high Ruler who came with us this time is still on Sacred Island. That treasure is also with him,” the tall man said.","“That’s true.” The evil-looking young man nodded slightly.","“Let’s go back.”","The two Rulers felt a little regretful that they could not kill Jian Wushuang, but they did not give up. Instead, they returned to the Sacred Island and began to think again.","...","In the void, Temporal Temple Master also appeared quietly.","After he appeared, Jian Wushuang immediately looked around, but he did not see the two Rulers again.","“Don’t worry. I’ve erased the traces of space while I’m moving. They won’t be able to catch up,” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief and then bowed respectfully to Temporal Temple Master. “Thank you for saving me, Temple Master.”","“You’re welcome. You’re a subordinate of the Temporal Temple. It’s my duty to save you.” Temporal Temple Master waved his hand.","Jian Wushuang also smiled, but then he asked, “Temple Master, why are you here?”","Jian Wushuang was indeed puzzled.","“Haha, it’s very simple. I arrived at the Wuxin Lake a few days ago. I originally planned to wait for you at the lake, but on the way, I sensed a strong energy fluctuation in the surrounding void. It must have been an expert at the Ruler Realm, so I went there to take a look. However, before I arrived, I sensed that you used my life-saving talisman...”","Temporal Temple Master paused for a moment and then said, “I immediately understood that the Ruler might be targeting you, so I used spacetime to come here.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and then said in surprise, “Wuxin Lake? You are the Temple Master’s good friend?”"]},{"number":3602,"title":"Chapter 3602 - Return to Star Palace","paragraphs":["Temporal Temple Master was the good friend that Star Palace Master invited to pick him up?","This news surprised Jian Wushuang.","“Why, are you surprised?” Temporal Temple Master smiled. “Actually, it’s nothing. Star Palace Master is the sect master of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. Since our Temporal Temple and the Seven Star Mysterious Sect are in the Divine Beginning Realm, we naturally have some connections.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","He had met the Heaven Ancestor when he was in the Star Palace. Since the Heaven Ancestor could stay in the Star Palace all year round, he naturally had a good relationship with the Star Palace.","Temporal Temple Master and Palace Master Star Palace were also good friends, and it was obvious that they chose to stand on the Star Palace’s side. This immediately caused many ideas to appear in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“Temple Master, you mentioned Devil Cloud Star Master to the two Rulers just now. What sect does Devil Cloud Star belong to?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“This question...” Temporal Temple Master pondered for a moment and said, “This is extraordinary. I’ll take you back to Star Palace first and then talk about it slowly.”","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang also nodded.","He could also see that this so-called Devil Cloud Star was probably his most important enemy.","Soon, the two of them started to return to Star Palace.","With Temporal Temple Master leading the way, Jian Wushuang’s speed was naturally many times faster.","Just a year later, he had already walked out of Devil Smoke Valley and returned to Star Palace.","...","Jian Wushuang stood alone in a magnificent palace in Star Palace. Three figures slowly appeared in front of him.","The three people standing on the far left were the Temporal Temple Master who had just brought him back to Star Palace.","The one standing on the far right was a woodcutter wearing a simple black robe and a bamboo hat. This woodcutter was the Heaven Ancestor, Desolation Emperor, who had taught him how to master the destructive will.","As for the person standing in the middle...he was dressed in a green Daoist robe. His hair and beard were white, and he stood barefoot. He looked like an ordinary Daoist, but he was such a Daoist, however, he was qualified to stand in the middle of the three people. His invisible aura was obviously stronger than that of the Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven Ancestor.","Seeing the Daoist in the middle, Jian Wushuang was shocked.","“Senior Xuan Shen, oh no, it’s Palace Master.” Jian Wushuang immediately bowed respectfully.","That was right, the Daoist in the middle was Xuan Shen, who had helped him to the Divine Beginning Realm!","At the same time, he was the Palace Master of Star Palace. Moreover, the Temporal Temple Master had personally admitted that Xuan Shen was one of the three master-level experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, the sect master of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect!","“Haha, little guy, we finally meet again.” Daoist Xuan Shen looked at Jian Wushuang with a gentle expression, as if he was basking in the sunshine. “You disappeared in Devil Smoke Valley for almost 100,000 years. Even I thought you were dead. At that time, I was sad and disappointed, but fortunately, I survived and my strength increased so much. Haha, this is a big surprise. It seems that Xuan Yi was right about you.”","“You flatter me,” Jian Wushuang said humbly.","In the face of three masters, all of whom were legendary figures in the Divine Beginning Realm, Jian Wushuang would never be able to defeat them, no matter how talented he was, not a hint of arrogance.","“Little fellow, know why I three people want to see you at the same time today?” Daoist Xuan Shen looked down.","“I don’t know.” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","“Actually, I didn’t expect to see you so soon. I just didn’t expect you to improve so quickly. In just 100,000 years, you’ve already reached the strongest level among Principles Masters. Moreover, you’ve already come into contact with Devil Cloud Star. Therefore, after careful discussion, the three of US decided to come to see you together. We’ll tell you the whole story, including the battle that destroyed the Seven Star Mysterious Sect and the biggest secret hidden in the Divine Beginning Realm.” Daoist Xuan God’s expression became serious.","“The biggest secret hidden in the Divine Beginning Realm?” Jian Wushuang was shocked. He raised his head and found that not only Daoist Xuan Shen, but also Temporal Temple Master and Desolation Emperor had grave expressions on their faces.","Jian Wushuang could not help taking a deep breath.","He had been a man for two lifetimes. From his last life, he knew that he had a huge mission on his shoulders. But what was the mission, what he was going to do, and the specific reason for the destruction of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, he also didn’t know about the secrets hidden in the three great holy regions and the Divine Beginning Realm.","He only knew that he had to do his best to increase his strength and make himself stronger as much as possible. He longed for the day when he was qualified to know all of this. And now, this day had finally arrived.","He was finally qualified to know all of this.","“Little guy, you’ve been in the Universe Battlefield for so long, and you have some understanding of the universe. How much do you know about the universe’s Star Worlds?” Daoist Xuan Shen asked.","“Star Worlds?” Jian Wushuang immediately replied, “I only know that there are different levels of Star Worlds. For example, the Divine Beginning Realm is a third-grade star world, which is the most common one in the universe. A third-grade star world will be counted as a chaos cycle from its birth to its self-collapse.”","“Yes, what you know is common knowledge in the universe. However, there is one thing that you don’t know, which is that there is an initial stage in the process of the birth of any astral world. We call this stage the initial stage...” Daoist Xuan Shen slowly explained.","“The initial stage is equivalent to a baby born a month before we humans are born. The body has not fully grown. At this stage, any bit of wind or rain can cause the baby to die or be severely injured. The same is true for the initial stage of the Astral World.”","“At that stage, the astral world hasn’t started to give birth to any living beings. At most, it’s just an embryo. The embryo is still very fragile. At this time, if an expert with a certain level of strength discovered the embryo, he or she would destroy it with a wave of his or her hand. This would cause the astral world to vanish before it started to give birth!”","“The initial stage?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, he said directly, “Even if a powerful cultivator found the embryo of the astral world, he would not be so bored as to destroy it. After all, destroying an astral world is not beneficial to him.”","“You’re right.” Daoist Xuan Shen nodded."]},{"number":3603,"title":"Chapter 3603 - Final Secret (Part One)","paragraphs":["“Under normal circumstances, no one would be so bored as to deliberately destroy an astral world embryo. This is because the astral world was born by the universe itself. Forcibly destroying an astral world embryo can be said to be a public confrontation with the laws of the universe. Although they wouldn’t be punished at the time, in the future, their cultivation would more or less be hindered by the laws of the universe, and the gains wouldn’t make up for the losses.”","“However, the experts who found the astral world embryo by chance will not destroy it, but they can take it by force!” The Daoist Xuan Shen said.","“Take it by force?” Jian Wushuang was shocked. “How is that possible? This is a huge astral world. How can we take it by force?”","“It’s very simple, possession!” The Daoist Xuan Shen said, “You have to know that in the universe, an astral world is actually equivalent to a large life, and the consciousness of this life is the will of the Heavenly Dao...”","“The will of the Heavenly Dao represents the consciousness of the astral world. Under normal circumstances, it has no feelings or thoughts, only knowing to follow the operation of the universal laws and maintain the circulation of the Heavenly Dao. If the will of the Heavenly Dao had already grown up, it would have formed a connection with the universal laws. Naturally, no one could shake it.”","“However, in the initial stage, it’s just an embryonic astral world. The will of Heavenly Dao is too weak. If an expert comes to possess it, there is a certain possibility that the possession will succeed. Once the possession is successful, the will of Heavenly Dao, which only knows how to operate according to the laws of the universe, will be directly erased. Instead, the cultivator’s own consciousness will become the will of Heavenly Dao in this astral world and control everything!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s heart was in turmoil.","The heavenly will of an astral world had no thoughts and no feelings.","But the heavenly will of the Divine Beginning Realm was obviously not like that.","“In other words, the heavenly will of the Divine Beginning Realm is the consciousness of a cultivator. was the Divine Beginning Realm possessed by someone when it was still in its embryonic stage?” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice.","“Yes, that’s right.” Daoist Xuan Shen nodded slightly.","“Little guy, you should be able to tell that if the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm doesn’t have feelings or thoughts, then it’s impossible for it to support the three Saint Realms. To put it bluntly, the three saint realms exist to allow it to better control the Divine Beginning Realm. The three masters of the Saint Realm are the representatives of the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm. But look at the other star realms around this territory, there’s no such thing.” Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank.","It was true that he had roamed the Universe Battlefield for a period of time, but he had some understanding of this territory. As far as he knew, the other astral worlds in this territory were completely dominated by the cultivators themselves, there was no heavenly will at all. The heavenly will of the astral world was just to maintain the astral world’s self-operation.","“Forcibly destroying an astral world embryo not only doesn’t bring any benefits, but it will also be restricted by the universal laws in the future. Is it allowed by the universal laws to forcefully possess an astral world and take it as his own?” Jian Wushuang frowned and said.","“No, forcibly possessing an astral world in the embryo will be punished by the universal laws in the future. Although it’s not as strong as forcibly destroying an astral world embryo, possessing an astral world is not without benefits. On the contrary, it has incredible benefits,” Daoist Xuan Shen said.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","“Little guy, you should know that the process of an astral world, even if it’s only the lowest level three astral world, from the moment it’s born, to its slow growth, to its self-destruction, is all related to the laws of the universe.”","“If a cultivator possesses an astral world and it becomes the will of the Heavenly Dao of this astral world, he can observe the evolution of the astral world from the closest distance, and he can also activate the unfathomable laws of the universe. This is a dream for any cultivator. Not to mention the chaos Ruler, even legendary supreme existences yearn for it,” Daoist Xuan Shen said.","“A supreme-being?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, and he deliberately looked puzzled.","“A supreme-being is a supreme expert who is above a Ruler. He is a top figure in the entire vast universe. You haven’t become a real Ruler, so you may not have heard of this level,” the Heaven Ancestor said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang was relieved, but he secretly smiled.","In fact, he knew about the supreme-being. When he met the Golden War God, Wind Demon, in that special space, he knew about the existence of the supreme-being. Wind Demon was a supreme-being, not to mention the Master of Planet Lingyun.","However, he did not want others to know about his encounter. Therefore, when Daoist Xuan Shen mentioned the supreme-being, he deliberately showed a puzzled look.","“Little guy, now you understand why someone would choose to possess an astral world rather than bear the conflict of the universal laws, right?” Daoist Xuan Shen smiled faintly. “To put it bluntly, the benefits of possessing an astral world are so great that he is willing to bear the conflict of the universal laws.”","“I see.” Jian Wushuang understood. “Is the person who possessed the Divine Beginning Realm that Devil Cloud Star Master?”","“Yes, it’s him.” Daoist Xuan Shen nodded slightly.","At the mention of the Devil Cloud Star Master’s name, the three Rulers’ expressions turned extremely cold.","“The Devil Cloud Star Master is the will power of the Divine Beginning Realm. We have paid a heavy price over the years and have long investigated the background of this Devil Cloud Star Master.” Daoist Xuan Shen continued to explain.","“Devil Cloud Star is an incomparably mature second-grade astral world that has long since matured. In the entire astral world, there are no less than dozens of Ruler-level experts, and they are extremely powerful. However, because Devil Cloud Star is quite far away from our territory, even a Ruler-level expert would need at least tens of thousands of years to reach our territory at the fastest speed. Thus, under normal circumstances, Devil Cloud Star is unable to touch our territory.”","“There are always exceptions. Our Divine Beginning Realm just happened to encounter this accident.”","“At that time, there was a Ruler in Devil Cloud Star who had offended many experts and was forced into a desperate situation. Because he couldn’t stay in Devil Cloud Star any longer, he chose to wander around. This wandering came to our territory, and coincidentally, he discovered the embryonic state of the Divine Beginning Realm!”","“You have to know that the astral world within the embryo is very well hidden. In addition, the void of the universe is vast and boundless, ordinary people wouldn’t be able to encounter it at all. And this Ruler who escaped from the Devil Cloud Star just had to be lucky!”"]},{"number":3604,"title":"Chapter 3604 - The Final Secret (Part Two)","paragraphs":["“Sh*t luck?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“It’s just sh*t luck. It’s really great luck!”","“After all, the universe law knows that the embryonic stage is the most fragile during the process of nurturing the astral world, so it’s also the most well-protected. Ordinary cultivators, even if they spend a long time wandering in the universe, wouldn’t be able to encounter such an astral world embryo.”","“According to the rumors, there are some incredibly powerful autarch-level Rulers who would go to great lengths to find an astral world embryo like this in order to increase their power. Autarch-level experts are far more skilled than Rulers, but even so, they are often unable to find an astral world embryo like this even after hundreds or thousands of chaos cycles.”","“In the vast universe, if an astral world embryo is found anywhere, countless experts will immediately come to fight for it. This fight is no less than a feast for experts. You can imagine how lucky you are to find such an astral world embryo,” said Daoist Xuan Shen.","Hearing Daoist Xuan Shen’s words, Jian Wushuang could not help but be shocked.","If what Daoist Xuan Shen said was true, even an expert at the supreme level could not find an embryo of an astral world even after searching for hundreds or thousands of chaos cycles in the universe void, then the Ruler who was forced to come out of the demonic cloud planet...it was indeed a stroke of good luck to find the Divine Beginning Realm, which was in the embryonic stage, in this territory.","“Not only is this Ruler from Devil Cloud Star extremely lucky, but he is also very bold. After all, even in the embryonic stage of the astral world, it is extremely difficult for ordinary experts to possess it at its most vulnerable period.”","“Under normal circumstances, only Rulers have the possibility of possessing the astral world. Moreover, the success rate of possession is also very low. It is already considered good if one out of dozens of Rulers succeeds in possession. However, once the possession fails, they will immediately suffer a backlash. Their souls will be destroyed and they will die. Therefore, if a Ruler forcefully tries to possess the embryonic stage of the astral world, he will still have a slim chance of survival. In fact, it might even be better than that!”","“As for the Ruler who left Devil Cloud Star, he wandered in the universe void because he had no other choice. Now that he finally encountered an embryonic astral world, he tried to possess it even though he knew there was a slim chance of survival. In the end, he really succeeded!” Daoist Xuan Shen said, he could not help clenching his hands.","Jian Wushuang was also secretly amazed. He had a little more respect for the Ruler who had run away from Devil Cloud Star.","Under the premise that he was wise enough to risk his life, he took the risk to possess the Ruler. In the end, he succeeded. Although the Ruler was his enemy, his luck, boldness, and decisiveness were still worthy of respect.","“After he took over the Divine Beginning Realm, his strength soared and reached a new level in a very short time. Then he left a trace of his consciousness in the Divine Beginning Realm, and his original body returned to the Devil Cloud Star.","“After returning to the Devil Cloud Star, he immediately defeated many of his former enemies with absolute strength. He even swept across the entire Devil Cloud Star world and made the entire Devil Cloud Star submit to him. He also became the Devil Cloud Star Master!” Daoist Xuan Shen said.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang smacked his lips.","This was because at the beginning, this person was just a Ruler who could not survive in the Devil Cloud Star and was forced to leave. He was a wanderer in the universe void. Such a Ruler’s strength was definitely not that strong, however, because he possessed the Divine Beginning Realm, his strength had suddenly grown to the point of sweeping across the entire Devil Cloud Star.","It was clear how much help a cultivator would receive if he took over an astral world.","“What happened after that? Since the Star Master had already taken over the Divine Beginning Realm and obtained what he wanted, why did he attack the Seven Star Mysterious Sect?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“He didn’t want to attack the Seven Star Mysterious Sect in the beginning. After all, although he took over the Divine Beginning Realm, what he needed was the process of the Divine Beginning Realm’s evolution. During this process, he could communicate with the laws of the universe and improve his strength by observing the complete evolution of an astral world. As for the internal affairs of the Divine Beginning Realm, it has nothing to do with him. Logically speaking, he should be able to maintain the operation of the Divine Beginning Realm like the normal will of the Heavenly Dao.”","“As for the many cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm, it doesn’t matter whether he is an outsider or not. As long as the will of the Heavenly Dao works normally, the cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm can accept him even if he created the three Saint Realms to be his spokesperson. However, the Devil Cloud Star Master is too ambitious.” Daoist Xuan Shen said in a low voice.","“Ambitious?” Jian Wushuang was confused.","“He is ambitious. To be exact, he is too impatient. Of course, it is also possible that he is at the most critical stage of cultivation. For example, he is only one step away from becoming a supreme-being...” He paused, Daoist Xuan Shen continued. “He longed to break through to become a supreme-being as soon as possible. For this reason, he spared no effort. Therefore, he forcefully accelerated the evolution of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“Speed up the evolution of the Heavenly Dao by force? How?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","“It’s simple. He didn’t hesitate to squeeze the potential of the Divine Beginning Realm and did everything he could to make the Divine Beginning Realm collapse. Naturally, he could experience the evolution of the astral world earlier so that he could gain more earlier. However, the damage to the Divine Beginning Realm would be too great,” Daoist Xuan Shen said.","Jian Wushuang’s expression turned solemn.","Although he did not know what the consequences would be for the Divine Beginning Realm, it was not a good thing for the Divine Beginning Realm to accelerate the evolution of the Divine Beginning Realm and squeeze its potential.","“To speed up the evolution of the Divine Beginning Realm and squeeze it, it is to push the seedling to grow, and it is the most extreme way to push the seedling to grow. It is like a person who has a lifespan of 100 years forcibly increasing his growth speed and squeezing his potential. In the end, although he has lived his whole life, he may only live for 50 years, or even 30 years, or 20 years...”","Jian Wushuang was shocked.","A person who could live for 100 years could only live for 20 to 30 years after forcefully accelerating his growth rate?","“In other words, if Devil Cloud Star Master does this, his lifespan in the Divine Beginning Realm will be extremely short, and he won’t be able to live for one chaos cycle at all?” Jian Wushuang asked in surprise."]},{"number":3605,"title":"Chapter 3605 - The Final Secret (Part Three)","paragraphs":["“Not only that, because the potential of the Divine Beginning Realm has been greatly exploited, the number of geniuses and experts born in the Divine Beginning Realm in the latter half of the process will be less and less. At most, it will be comparable to other level three star worlds, or even only one-third of the amount,” said the Daoist Xuan Shen.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang suddenly understood.","“As I said before, if the Devil Cloud Star Master had allowed the Divine Beginning Realm to operate according to the laws of the universe after he took over the Divine Beginning Realm, the cultivators of the Divine Beginning Realm would not have any objections. However, for his own selfish reasons, he did not hesitate to exploit the potential of the Divine Beginning Realm, and his strong point was to accelerate the evolution of the Divine Beginning Realm. The damage caused to the Divine Beginning Realm was unimaginable. The cultivators of the Divine Beginning Realm would naturally not be happy to see this.”","“If you don’t like it, the resistance will begin,” Daoist Xuan Shen said solemnly, “The Seven Star Mysterious Sect was already recognized as the number one force in the Divine Beginning Realm. Naturally, the resistance began with the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. However, the Divine Beginning Realm was still in the initial stage of evolution. Its foundation was weak and its overall strength was weak. It could not pose any threat to Devil Cloud Star Master, until Xuan Yi attacked.”","“Master!” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","“Yes, it’s your Master Xuan Yi.” Daoist Xuan Shen looked at Jian Wushuang and smiled. “Your Master Xuan Yi is the first perfect-level life form born in the Divine Beginning Realm. To be honest, it’s extremely difficult to give birth to a perfect-level life form even in a first-class astral world. Perhaps it’s because the Devil Cloud Star Master squeezed too much of his potential that the cultivation environment in the Divine Beginning Realm for a period of time has even exceeded that of a first-class astral world.","“It was also at that time that the Divine Beginning Realm gave birth to several experts at the Ruler Realm, and a super genius like Di Shisan appeared. Your Master Xuan Yi was also born in that era!”","“Originally, Devil Cloud Star Master did not pay much attention to the many experts born in the Divine Beginning Realm, even if there were a few more Rulers. After all, these Rulers could hardly threaten him. However, when Xuan Yi appeared and gradually rose to power, Devil Cloud Star Master sensed some threats.”","“Why?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled. “Why can’t so many Rulers threaten the Star Master, but master can? Is it because he is a cultivator at the perfect life level?”","“Yes, because he is a cultivator at the perfect life level.” Daoist Xuan Shen smiled. “Little guy, I just told you that a Ruler Realm expert wants to possess a star world. If he fails, his soul will be destroyed on the spot. In other words, to possess a star world, the most important thing is to rely on the soul!”","“Only a strong and powerful soul power can successfully take over an astral world. Moreover, this is only in the embryonic stage. However, because of the possession of the Devil Cloud Star Master, the Divine Beginning Realm has already passed the initial stage and is now in the complete stage. At this time, even if a supreme-level expert forcibly takes over an astral world, he would not be able to shake the Devil Cloud Star Master at all. However...a perfect-life-level cultivator is an exception.”","“Little guy, you’re also a cultivator at the perfect life level. Can’t you guess the reason?” Daoist Xuan Shen looked at Jian Wushuang.","“It’s the soul of a cultivator at the perfect life level. It’s different from the others!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed.","Hearing this exclamation, not only Daoist Xuan Shen, but the Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven Ancestor also laughed.","Although they were not perfect life-level cultivators, they knew some of the mysteries of the perfect life-level.","Jian Wushuang himself was the owner of the perfect life-level, so he was even clearer.","He knew that a perfect life-level cultivator had almost no weaknesses, and the most invincible one was the soul!","The soul of a cultivator at the level of a perfect being was unbreakable. Even if his soul was destroyed on the spot and completely destroyed, he could easily recover to the peak by relying on his divine power in the next second, and this kind of recovery also consumed very little of his divine power.","In other words, no matter who it was, it was absolutely impossible to kill a cultivator at the level of a perfect being from the aspect of the soul.","And to possess an astral world depended on the power of the soul!","For an ordinary Ruler or even a paragon to forcibly possess an astral world that had already grown up was simply courting death. However, a cultivator at the level of a perfect being was different. He could do so without any scruples! If he failed once, he would try ten times. If he failed ten times, he would try a hundred times or a thousand times!","Even if the chances of him succeeding were slim, he would succeed one time after another.","“I understand now. I finally understand why my master can threaten the Star Master. I also understand that the three Saint Realms will kill me at all costs when they know of my existence. Once I grow up, I can indeed deal a fatal blow to the Star Master, which means that the heaven’s will of the Divine Beginning Realm will be dealt a fatal blow!” Jian Wushuang said solemnly.","“Yes, that’s right.” Daoist Xuan Shen nodded as well. “However, your current level of power is still a bit too weak. Although your battle-power is close to that of a Ruler, your level of power is only at the level of a saint. A saint isn’t even qualified to possess the Divine Beginning Realm. Even if you break through to become a Principles Master in the future...your master, Xuan Yi, was also a Principles Master in the past. He tried to possess the Divine Beginning Realm a million times, but he failed!”","“Therefore, he came to the conclusion that even a perfect life-level cultivator must reach the Ruler Realm before they are qualified to refine the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“Must I reach the Ruler Realm?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","For the current him, the Principles Master Realm might be close, but the Ruler Realm was too far away.","Although his current battle-power was close to that of a Ruler, and once he broke through to become a Principles Master, his battle-power would definitely be comparable to that of a Ruler. However, he was still very far away from truly becoming a Ruler.","“You have to become a Ruler; otherwise, you won’t even have to try,” Daoist Xuan Shen said in a low voice, “Back then, your master was at the level of a Principles Master, and he attempted to possess someone. He attempted to possess someone a million times, but in the end, he still failed. However, this insane attempt to possess someone completely terrified the Devil Cloud Star Sect!”","“That Devil Cloud Star Master was worried that your master would break through to become a Ruler, which was why he immediately acted. He sent a total of twelve Ruler Realm experts from Devil Cloud, and even his true body personally acted. With lightning speed, he annihilated the Seven Star Mysterious Sect and killed your master!”"]},{"number":3606,"title":"Chapter 3606 - Indirect Help","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled.","Only now did he fully understand the reason for the true destruction of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","Indeed, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed because of Xuan Yi.","It was Xuan Yi who made the Devil Cloud Star Master feel a great threat and wanted to kill him. The Seven Star Mysterious Sect was also wiped out by the Devil Cloud Star Master because they tried their best to protect it.","“There was nothing we could do. At that time, the foundation of the Divine Beginning Realm was too thin. In front of the Devil Cloud Star Master’s peerless strength, there was no room for struggle at all. Thus, when the Devil Cloud Star Master gave the order, the four great divine races and the eight directions celestial sect immediately responded. Although these sects and factions didn’t know the secret of the Devil Cloud Star Master, the difference in strength was too great. They could only form a battle team like this.”","“When that battle really broke out, our Seven Star Mysterious Sect had already predicted the final outcome. That’s why when we noticed the movements of the Devil Cloud Star Master, we immediately left behind many backup plans!” Daoist Xuan Shen slowly explained.","“First, the three great freedom alliances did not participate in this battle. After all, everyone in the Divine Beginning Realm knows that Xuan Yi is a member of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. The Seven Star Mysterious Sect will not be able to escape this disaster, and it is unavoidable. However, the three great freedom alliances can only not participate in this battle and not stand on the Seven Star Mysterious Sect’s side. Then, the Devil Cloud Star Master should not attack the three great freedom alliances!”","“Secondly, Xuan Yi immediately prepared a plan to rise up in the future. This plan was very crazy. At that time, everyone thought that it was almost impossible to succeed. However, because Devil Cloud Star acted too suddenly and completely sealed off the entire Divine Beginning Realm, Xuan Yi was no longer able to escape. Although the chances of success of this plan were very slim, it was still a glimmer of hope.”","“Fortunately, he made the right bet. Countless cultivators in the Seven Star Divine Realm sacrificed their lives to set up the formation for him.” Daoist Xuan Shen laughed.","“Formation? Palace Master, are you talking about the formation that has been sealing the Seven Star Divine Realm?” Jian Wushuang asked in a deep voice.","After the battle, the Seven Star Divine Realm was completely sealed by the formation. In his previous life, Jian Wushuang was born in the Sealed Divine Realm, where he met the consciousness left behind by his master, Xuan Yi, after obtaining a great opportunity, his master finally acted and reincarnated into the Divine Beginning Realm.","Although he had been in the Divine Beginning Realm for a long time, deep in his heart, the sealed heaven and earth, the Seven Star Divine Realm, or the eternal chaotic world, was his real home!","“Apart from the formation, what other formation is there?” Daoist Xuan Shen smiled. “That Grand Formation was something I acquired by chance from the cosmic battlefield. It was of an extremely high level, and it was executed by several of us Rulers at the same time. In addition, countless cultivators in the Seven Star Divine Realm sacrificed their lives to create this blood essence power, which was why it was set up!”","“Once this formation was set up, even planet Devil Cloud Star Master wouldn’t be able to break it open. After all, although his power is monstrous, and the heavenly Daos of the Divine Beginning Realm have always been within his control, the unseen laws of the universe have caused his true body to be restricted by his power in the Divine Beginning Realm. He wouldn’t be able to unleash his full power, and he wouldn’t be able to break open this grand formation at all. This left us with hope of rising to power.”","“You know what happened next. Even though your master, Xuan Yi, died, the consciousness he left behind in the sealed Seven Star Divine Realm spent countless years and effort to perfect the technique again and again. Finally, you were born!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","He knew that his master had sacrificed too much for him to obtain the perfect chaotic creature.","He had nurtured the green fire world with his own blood essence and tried step by step. Finally, he appeared. Although he succeeded in inheriting his master’s perfect life in the end, he had put in a lot of effort in the process, however, it was mainly because his master had prepared too much for him.","“After you were born, everything went according to plan. He borrowed the opportunity of the three great Saint Realm Masters to barely open the sealed heaven and earth and sent you into reincarnation to the Divine Beginning Realm. In fact, the reason why the three great Saint Realm Masters were able to open the passage was because we helped them in the dark.","“As soon as you were born, I came to pick you up. As for the rest of your growth, it was all done by you, step by step, until today.”","At this point, Daoist Xuan Shen stopped and looked at Jian Wushuang.","Temporal Temple Master and Heaven Ancestor also stared at Jian Wushuang.","There was a trace of joy in their eyes.","Jian Wushuang did not know that from the moment he was born in the Divine Beginning Realm, his every move and his growth had been seen by the three of them. They had been watching Jian Wushuang and his growth, however, other than the appearance of Daoist Xuan Shen, the Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven Ancestor had been in the dark. Even if they had helped him along the way, they had never told him the specific reason.","It was not until now that the three of them appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and told him everything, that Jian Wushuang finally understood.","“Now I finally understand why the temple master treated me so well before,” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","Temporal Temple Master...when he was in the Temporal Temple, he personally taught him for 300 years and gave him a life-saving token. On Saha Island, Temporal Temple Master came to his rescue personally, at that time, Temporal Temple Master was so good to him that many people were puzzled. Jian Wushuang himself was the same.","Temporal Temple Master was the same, so was the Heaven Ancestor, and so was the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, who had never shown his face.","After all, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was the first to give Jian Wushuang an opportunity. He had never entered the core level of the heaven-cleaving union, but the heaven-cleaving union made an exception and allowed him to enter the Heaven-cleaving Secret Realm, it was something that countless genius disciples of the heaven-cleaving union yearned for.","Not only that, but the three Palace Masters of the heaven-cleaving union had also given him a lot of benefits, such as the token of the two Palace Masters and the token containing his doppelganger that the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master had personally refined.","Even the most outstanding and potential geniuses in the heaven-cleaving union would not receive such treatment.","However, Jian Wushuang, an outsider, did!","There was also the Heaven Ancestor...although the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect had not given him much help when he was in the Divine Beginning Realm, when he came to the Universe Battlefield and came to the Star Palace, the Heaven Ancestor had met him in person, afterwards, he had personally taught him axe techniques, given him opportunities, and allowed him to directly grasp the will of destruction, allowing him to completely comprehend the principles of destruction.","All of this was indirectly helping him!"]},{"number":3607,"title":"Chapter 3607 - Requirements","paragraphs":["“Phew!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and bowed solemnly, “Thank you!”","After knowing everything, Jian Wushuang knew that he had received a great favor from the people in front of him.","Jian Wushuang had to hurry up and remember this favor.","“Haha, little guy, you don’t have to thank us. After all, we are helping ourselves and the entire Divine Beginning Realm. Although the Divine Beginning Realm has reached the middle stage due to the accelerated evolution of the Star Master, as long as you can take it back, the Divine Beginning Realm can still be saved,” Daoist Xuan Shen said seriously.","“Moreover, it’s different from the last battle. Our Divine Beginning Realm’s foundation was too weak, and the arrival of the Devil Cloud Star Master and his subordinates was too sudden. As a result, we didn’t have much power to resist. However, it’s different this time.”","“From the end of that battle until now, a long, long time has passed. Even I can’t remember how long it has been. And from the end of that battle, we’ve started to make plans for today. We’ve been preparing and waiting for the right time!”","“Even now, the power we have in our hands is still not comparable to Devil Cloud Star, let alone fighting him head-on. But...if Devil Cloud Star Master comes again, our Divine Beginning Realm will not be powerless to resist. We are even confident that we can protect ourselves!”","“Protect ourselves?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","He did not expect that even after preparing for so many years, Daoist Xuan Shen and the others could only barely protect themselves.","“It’s already good enough that we can barely protect ourselves. At least this time, we won’t be completely defeated. As long as we can protect ourselves, we will be able to counterattack. For us, the biggest counterattack is nothing more than breaking through to the Ruler Realm and then...taking over the Divine Beginning Realm again!” Daoist Xuan Shen’s voice was solemn.","“Once you take over the Divine Beginning Realm again, the Divine Beginning Realm will be under your control. At that time, as long as the experts from the outside world enter the Divine Beginning Realm, you can try your best to suppress their strength to an extremely low level. On the other hand, you can choose not to suppress the local experts like us. Under this situation, the people from Devil Cloud Star will not dare to step into our Divine Beginning Realm again!”","“Yes, as long as you can take back the Divine Beginning Realm, we will win this battle!” Temporal Temple Master nodded heavily.","“That’s true. However, if I want to take back the Divine Beginning Realm, I have to be at least at the level of a Ruler. But now, I’m far from the Ruler Realm.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","A Ruler had to completely comprehend the four principles, and he had to completely fuse the four principles.","However, he had only comprehended three principles, and if he fused them together, he would only be able to fuse two. He was still far from breaking through to become a Ruler.","Furthermore, he was a cultivator at the level of a perfect being, and the level of a perfect being was limited by the principles of the universe. The conditions for breaking through might be much more difficult than ordinary cultivators.","For example, from the Immortal Saint to the Principles Master...","An ordinary Immortal Saint could make a breakthrough as long as he completely comprehended one principle and grasped a part of the power of his will.","However, he had already comprehended three principles and merged two principles, but there was still no sign of a breakthrough.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang was worried that after he became a Principles Master, it would be much more difficult for him to break through to the Ruler Realm than for ordinary cultivators.","“You’re still far from the Ruler Realm, so you should try your best to improve your strength. What we need to do is to do our best to help you improve your strength.”","Daoist Xuan Shen said in a low voice, “Little guy, you’ve made it clear. You know how important you are to us, so you don’t need to be polite or pretentious. If you need anything that can help you improve your strength, just tell us. We’ll do our best to help you.”","“Yes, not only in terms of cultivation, but also all kinds of treasures and supreme treasures. If you need anything, you can tell us directly.” Temporal Temple Master also nodded. As for the Heaven Ancestor, he was also very determined.","The three of them knew that Jian Wushuang was the only one who could save the Divine Beginning Realm from danger.","What Jian Wushuang needed to do was to improve his strength as much as possible and reach the Ruler Realm as soon as possible. What they needed to do, of course, was to help Jian Wushuang become a Ruler. As long as Jian Wushuang could become a Ruler as soon as possible...they would do anything.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang stopped being unreasonable and said directly, “Seniors, I do need something now.”","“Speak.” Daoist Xuan Shen looked over.","“First of all, there are some rare treasures. Here is the list. Take a look first.” Jian Wushuang took out a list of treasures.","The treasures on the list were necessary for him to cultivate the first level of the supreme eternal celestial body. Although there were only six of them, they were extremely rare. Before he obtained the supreme eternal celestial body...Jian Wushuang had never even heard of these six treasures. Therefore, although he took out the list of six treasures, he did not know if Daoist Xuan Shen and the others could collect all of them.","Sure enough, after seeing the six treasures on the list, Daoist Xuan Shen, Temporal Temple Master, and Heaven Ancestor’s expressions changed immediately.","“Little guy, each of the treasures on the list is indeed extremely rare. There are none in my Star Palace. Even including the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, Temporal Temple, and Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect, there are only two of them.” Daoist Xuan Shen sighed softly.","“Is there no way to collect all of them?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“That’s not the case.” Daoist Xuan Shen changed the topic. “We already have two of the six treasures. We know where to get three of the remaining four treasures, and we are confident that we can get them. The last one, the Netherfire Blood Crystal, is a bit troublesome.”","“I’ve heard that someone has obtained the Netherfire Blood Crystal, but it has been tens of millions of years. I don’t know whether the news is true or not. Even if it is true, I can’t confirm who has it. However, I can contact the experts who might get the Netherfire Blood Crystal. I’ll get it no matter what the price is,” the Heaven Ancestor said in a deep voice.","“How long will it take?” Jian Wushuang asked."]},{"number":3608,"title":"Chapter 3608 - The Supreme Treasure?","paragraphs":["“Within 100 years,” the Heaven Ancestor said, “the key is to find out who has the nether-fire blood crystal. As long as we can confirm it, it’ll be easy. We can think of other ways to exchange for it. If the other party doesn’t agree...then we’ll use force. No matter what, there will be a result within 100 years.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He was willing to wait for a hundred years.","“In addition to the treasures on this list, I also need an offensive magic weapon, one above the Pinnacle Universe Supreme Treasure,” Jian Wushuang said.","“A magic weapon?” Daoist Xuan Shen and the other two looked at each other in dismay. They were not surprised by this request.","They all knew that the magic weapon Jian Wushuang used before was only at the advanced universe supreme treasure level. Even if he killed Nine Sword Demon Master and obtained the Supreme Treasure in his hands, it would only be a top-tier universe supreme treasure magic weapon.","Top-tier universe true treasures...for Principles Masters, they were indeed rare treasures. However, Jian Wushuang’s strength had already exceeded the scope of Principles Masters, and he had already begun to make contact with Rulers, a top-tier universe true treasure alone was definitely not enough.","“It’s easy to use a magic weapon. There’s a top-tier universe true treasure magic sword in my Star Palace true treasure vault that I can give you directly. However...it’s only a top-tier universe true treasure. Is it enough?” Daoist Xuan Shen said with great interest.","“Um...” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Was he going to use a pinnacle universe supreme treasure?","Was Daoist Xuan Shen going to give him a pinnacle universe supreme treasure?","As if seeing through Jian Wushuang’s thoughts, Daoist Xuan Shen smiled. “In fact, I have been paying attention to the most powerful supreme treasure magic weapon that is suitable for you. After all, you will grow up sooner or later, and when you grow up, you will definitely need to use a suitable and powerful supreme treasure. However, it’s a supreme treasure after all, and it’s too precious. Most Rulers in this territory don’t have a supreme treasure with them.","“As for the sword type supreme treasure that is suitable for you...I know that a person has one and he doesn’t need it, so we can exchange it with him.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly lit up.","“Don’t be happy too early. I just said that there is a chance, and it is very small. Because the Ruler who has the sword type supreme treasure is not only extremely powerful, but also much stronger than the three of us. He is also the leader of a major force and has a very high status.”","“Although he has the most powerful sword-type supreme treasure, he has never taken it out to exchange for other treasures. He has left it for his juniors. If we want to exchange for it with him, we will definitely have to take out something that will move his heart. However, the main point is that in this territory, there aren’t many treasures that can move him.” Daoist Xuan Shen sighed softly.","The Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven Ancestor obviously knew who the Ruler was. They both looked a little helpless.","They were very clear about his strength and status. It could be said that the Ruler was one of the most powerful people in this territory. It was not easy to impress such a super existence with treasures in exchange for the strongest sword-type magic weapon in his hand, it was indeed not easy.","“There’s no need to rush this Supreme Treasure Magic Weapon. It’s enough for me to have a supreme universe supreme treasure magic weapon now. As for the supreme treasure magic weapon, I’ll think of a way later,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Well, that’s it for now. You can go to the supreme treasure vault and use the supreme treasure first.” Daoist Xuan Shen nodded. “The attack magic weapon can be taken care of temporarily. As for the Supreme Treasure armor, I see that the armor you’re wearing now is of a high level.” Daoist Xuan Shen looked at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang could not help but smile. “I have indeed gained a lot during my years in Devil Smoke Valley. This supreme treasure armor is one of them. Without this armor, my battle strength would never have exceeded that of an expert at the pinnacle of the six realm.”","What he said was the truth.","The reason why he was so powerful and was able to sweep through the pinnacle of the six levels was largely because of the tremendous power that the Blood Demon Cave Armor had given him, which made him much more powerful than the average pinnacle of the six levels.","Without the Blood Demon Cave Armor, he would be very powerful, but at most, he would only be comparable to the average pinnacle of the six levels. It would be impossible for him to sweep through the pinnacle of the six levels.","“It’s already good enough to have a top-tier supreme treasure armor. Even the few of us only have this level of supreme treasure armor. As for the supreme treasure armor, we don’t have it, so we can’t get it for you.” Daoist Xuan Shen spread out his hands and said.","Jian Wushuang smiled. It was understandable.","The supreme treasure armor in terms of attack alone was extremely precious, and the supreme treasure armor was something that many Rulers would go crazy over. There were probably only a few such supreme treasure armors in this territory, all of them were in the hands of the most terrifying experts. It was too difficult for Star Palace to get one.","However, Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry. After all, although he did not have such a supreme treasure now, he must not forget that the three battlefields were a huge treasure trove in front of them. There were countless supreme treasures and many opportunities, who knew if he would be lucky enough to get one or two of them in the future?","“The problem of the supreme treasures has been temporarily solved. What else do you need?” Daoist Xuan Shen looked over.","“I still need some things that can help me integrate the destruction principles, especially the destruction principles, space-time, and reincarnation principles. The more treasures I can use for reference, the better,” Jian Wushuang said solemnly.","“Oh, are you finally going to integrate the three rules?” Temporal Temple Master said slowly.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Before, I had only grasped the destruction rules, so I couldn’t integrate them with the other two rules. But after being trapped in the special space-time in Devil Smoke Valley for nearly 100,000 years, I’ve made some progress in the principles. If I integrate them now, I won’t be able to do so. But as long as I have some time and some treasures that I can use for reference, I should be able to integrate the three principles.”","“Once all three principles are fused, I’ll be able to break through and become a Principles Master.”Jian Wushuang could not help holding his hands.","Principles Master...","Under normal circumstances, he should have broken through a long time ago, but because he was a perfect being, he had been stuck there.","He had been working hard before, but he was still far from fusing the three principles. Now, he was close to fusing the three priciples."]},{"number":3609,"title":"Chapter 3609 - I Won’t Let You Down","paragraphs":["“These things are quite easy to deal with.” Daoist Xuan God smiled. “How about this? I’ll give the order. From today onwards, you will be the young Palace Master of our Star Palace. Your position in the Star Palace will be second only to mine. In addition, you can use any of the resources in the Star Palace as long as they are of use to you. You Don’t have to pay a price for them.","“For example, you can use all the supreme treasures in the Supreme Treasure Vault as long as you think you can use them. You don’t have to use contribution points to exchange for them. You can also go to the Supreme Treasure Vault to look for the things you just mentioned that can only be used for reference. You should be able to find them.”","“Thank you, Palace Master.” Jian Wushuang was pleasantly surprised.","As the young Palace Master, he could use all the resources in Star Palace at will. Such treatment...","However, Jian Wushuang also understood that he had gained a lot, but he would have to pay more in the future.","He was the only one who could save the Divine Beginning Realm. His growth was crucial to the Divine Beginning Realm. That was why Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor had helped him so gratuitously.","Now that he had received their benefits, he had to complete his mission.","His responsibility was very great.","“Do you need anything else?” Daoist Xuan God continued to ask.","“Not for the time being,” Jian Wushuang said.","The things he had just mentioned were helpful to his cultivation or strength. At the moment, he only needed these things to improve his strength. As for other things, he would talk about them later.","“Well, then you should cultivate well and break through to become a Principles Master as soon as possible. When you become a Principles Master, you can open the holy region that has been sealed all this time,” Daoist Xuan God said with a smile.","“Open the seal?” Jian Wushuang was stunned, but then he said excitedly, “Palace Master, who are you? As long as I break through to become a Principles Master, I can open the seal, enter the Seven Star Divine Realm, and return to my hometown?”","His hometown...the eternal chaotic world, the Green Fire World!","He had too many relatives there.","His parents, his brothers, and his good friends were all there.","In this life, although he also had parents and brothers, in terms of feelings, they were slightly worse.","“In the past, countless cultivators in the Seven Star Divine Realm sacrificed their lives to seal the Seven Star Divine Realm. The seal was very strong, and even several Rulers working together could not break it. However, the seal was just to leave a way out for the Seven Star Mysterious Sect and the Divine Beginning Realm, and a glimmer of hope. The seal was led by Xuan Yi, who left some special means on the seal. This means was specially reserved for you!”","“When you’re weak, you can’t break the seals. But when you reach the level of a Principles Master, your strength shouldn’t be weaker than Xuan Yi at his peak. The Divine Beginning Realm has the ability to fight with Devil Cloud Star again. At this time, you can break the seals and wake up the experts left by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect and return to the Divine Beginning Realm!” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang could not help but shake his hands.","“Not only that, in order to ensure that the seal is safe, one of the three freedom alliances, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, is also the strongest among us. He has been guarding around the seal all year round and has been paying attention to everything inside. When you break the seal, you will be able to see him for real,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master?” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","He had used a token to guide a consciousness clone of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master on the Saha Island. At that time, a Saint Realm Master had mentioned that the original body of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master had been guarding a certain place, he had not left for hundreds of millions of years. Now it seemed that the place that the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was guarding was the place where the heavy seal was.","For such a long time, he had not left for even half a step...countless cultivators in the Seven Star Divine Realm would have to remember the favor of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang slowly bowed to the three people in front of him, “Seniors, I will do my best to live up to your expectations. No, there are also my master, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the countless cultivators who risked their lives to set up the great formation, and the millions of lives in the Divine Beginning Realm!”","“Go.”","Daoist Xuan God smiled and waved his hand.","Jian Wushuang turned and left.","In the palace, Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor were still standing together. They looked at each other with a smile on their faces.","“We have prepared for so many years for this little guy. I hope this little guy will not forget our disappointment. After all, the Divine Beginning Realm can not accept another failure.” Daoist Xuan God sighed.","Yes, the last defeat had left the Divine Beginning Realm riddled with holes, but there were still some things left. There was also time for them to make sufficient preparations before coming back.","However, if they were to experience another defeat like that...not to mention that the Divine Beginning Realm had reached the middle stage of its lifespan, they would not have enough time to prepare for so many years, there was probably no one who could change everything.","Jian Wushuang was able to appear because of Xuan Yi’s endless years of hard work and effort, as well as that era, which happened to be a stage where all the potential of the Divine Beginning Realm was completely exploited. In addition to that, he was extremely lucky, that was how he succeeded.","Indeed, Xuan Yi had created Jian Wushuang.","However, Xuan Yi was only a step that Jian Wushuang could take to be born.","The heaven, earth, and people were in harmony with each other.","The potential of the Divine Beginning Realm was being squeezed endlessly. Although it was pushing the seedlings to grow, it was also pushing the seedlings to a high explosive stage. At that time, the cultivation environment of the Divine Beginning Realm was no less than that of the first-class astral world, naturally, it was easier for geniuses to be born at that stage. That was the heaven and time.","The geographical advantage was naturally the Seven Star Divine Realm!","Countless cultivators risked their lives to gather all their luck in one place, and that place was Jian Wushuang’s hometown, the Green Fire World!","The combination of the three factors created Jian Wushuang.","But if one of them was missing, Jian Wushuang would not be able to withstand the weather.","But now in the Divine Beginning Realm, there was no such geographical advantage. At most, there were only people.","“Believe in this little fellow, just like how you believed in Xuan Yi back then...” Temporal Temple Master smiled.","“Speaking of Xuan Yi, actually, I still can’t believe it. At such a critical moment, he made a crazy and unbelievable plan at the last minute. In the end, he actually succeeded. He actually created a new perfect life form, giving us a chance to make a comeback and fight again.” Heaven Ancestor could not help but exclaim."]},{"number":3610,"title":"Chapter 3610 - Fawning","paragraphs":["“Not to mention you, I also find it hard to believe.” Daoist Xuan God smiled, then, he said seriously, “Since God has given us a chance to fight again, we must not make any mistakes this time. After all, our Divine Beginning Realm can’t afford to fail again.”","“You’re right. From now on, this little guy’s life is more important than any of us,” Temporal Temple Master added.","“Well, go do what you have to do. Heaven Ancestor, go and find out about the Netherfire Blood Crystal. If you need any help, feel free to call us,” Daoist Xuan God said, the three of them immediately disappeared.","...","Jian Wushuang was flying slowly in the Star Palace alone. He was still a little excited.","In this life, he had worked hard for a long time. Finally, he was only one step away from becoming a Principles Master. Once he broke through to become a Principles Master, he could return to the Green Fire World, his hometown, and meet his family and friends.","Star Palace occupied an Earth Star and had many experts under its command. Although most experts roamed the three battlefields all year round, some stayed in Star Palace. When Jian Wushuang was flying in Star Palace...many people had already noticed his existence.","“Look, isn’t that Blood Sword Master?”","“Yes, it’s Blood Sword Master!”","“Blood Sword Master entered the unknown region of Devil Smoke Valley alone and went missing for nearly 100,000 years. Not long ago, he walked out of the Life and Death Realm, and his strength Sky Rocketed. He defeated five experts at the pinnacle of the six realm by himself. Now, he is publicly recognized as the number one Principles Master. How could he be from Star Palace?”","“You just found out that Blood Sword Master came from Star Palace. This news has long spread in this territory. Just now, the Palace Master personally ordered that from today on, Blood Sword Master is the Young Palace Master of Star Palace. His position in Star Palace is second only to Palace Master.”","“Young Palace Master?”","Everyone was secretly amazed.","Jian Wushuang was now very famous in this territory. Many cultivators in Star Palace were undoubtedly proud that such a supreme Principles Master came from Star Palace.","While Jian Wushuang was flying, many Principles Masters of Star Palace took the initiative to fly up.","“Blood Sword Master!”","“Greetings, young Palace Master!”","“Greetings, sir!”","One after another, compliments rang in Jian Wushuang’s ears. However, Jian Wushuang just nodded indifferently with an extremely cold expression.","He knew that these people were so respectful to him because they knew his strength and status. Now, they just wanted to make friends with him. However, when he was not so strong and his strength was not so great...but no one took the initiative to make friends with him. This was the reality.","When you were unknown, no one would pay attention to you. But when you were famous, there were a lot of people who took the initiative to come over.","Jian Wushuang obviously saw these real people very clearly.","If before, when he was not so famous, someone took the initiative to make friends with him, he would be happy to make friends with them.","But now...he could not be bothered with these people.","“Blood Sword Master.”","Another voice sounded.","However, when he saw the person who appeared in front of him, Jian Wushuang’s cold expression finally eased, and a trace of a smile gradually appeared on his face.","“Heavy Master, didn’t you go to the battlefield with Purple Sound Master?” Jian Wushuang asked with a smile.","Heavy Master was one of the few cultivators in Star Palace who had interacted with each other, and they had a good relationship.","“My brother and I just came back from the Devil Smoke Valley. When we came back, we heard that you had a shocking battle in Devil Smoke Valley. To be honest, I was shocked when I heard the news. Now, everyone in this territory says that you’re the strongest Principles Master,” Heavy Master said with a smile.","He could not help thinking back to the first time he met Jian Wushuang. He did not put Jian Wushuang in his eyes at all, but as soon as they arrived at Devil Smoke Valley, he and Master Zi Ming encountered a trap set by Master Fei. It was a life-and-death situation, it was Jian Wushuang who arrived in time and saved his life. From that moment on, he changed his opinion of Jian Wushuang. He sincerely befriended Jian Wushuang, and they even worked together to snatch the Puluo God parts.","When Jian Wushuang had revealed himself in the fight for the Puluo God parts, he had been extremely surprised. However, he had not expected that in less than 100,000 years, Blood Sword Master...had suddenly become the number one Principles Master in this territory.","Now that Heavy Master was standing in front of Jian Wushuang and looking at him, he felt like he was dreaming.","Jian Wushuang’s progress was too terrifying.","“Heavy Master, I have something to do now, so I won’t talk much. When I’m free, I’ll come and have a drink with you and Master Zi Ming,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Okay, okay, sure.” The Heavy Master nodded quickly.","Jian Wushuang left, but the Heavy Master was overjoyed.","He stood there, but he could feel many jealous eyes around him.","“This Heavy Master is really lucky!”","“That’s right. So many of us took the initiative to curry favor with Blood Sword Master, and Blood Sword Master didn’t even bother to look at him. But this Heavy Master, Blood Sword Master actually chatted and laughed with him, and even said that he wanted to have a drink with him... Clearly, they have a relationship.”","“Ai, back when Blood Sword Master was weak, it was easy for us to curry favor with him. But now, he is already publicly recognized as the number one Principles Master in this territory. If we continue to go up to him like this, it will become a form of fawning and flattery. Unlike this Heavy Master, who had a relationship with Blood Sword Master back then, even now Blood Sword Master is willing to chat and drink with him.”","“In other words, if Heavy Master encounters any trouble in the future and asks Blood Sword Master for help, Blood Sword Master will at least listen to him, even if he won’t agree immediately.”","“Heavy Master is really lucky.”","Many cultivators in Star Palace were secretly discussing, and they were very envious of Heavy Master.","They all knew how high Jian Wushuang’s status was in the Star Palace. As for Heavy Master, it would be much more convenient for him to do things in the Star Palace in the future since he was able to talk to Jian Wushuang.","Heavy Master himself knew this, so when he noticed the envious gazes around him, he raised his head and laughed complacently. Then, he left under the burning gazes.","Jian Wushuang did not know about these things, so he did not bother to pay attention to them. Now, he had arrived in front of the top officials of Star Palace."]},{"number":3611,"title":"Chapter 3611 - The Results of the Investigation","paragraphs":["Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, Star Saint Master, and Seven Emotions Master, the four highest-ranking officials of Star Palace, stood respectfully in front of Jian Wushuang.","“My young friend, let me introduce you. This is Seven Emotions Master, a member of the highest-ranking officials of Star Palace. Usually, the four of us handle all the matters of Star Palace together,” Axe One Master said.","“Seven emotions, greetings, young Palace Master,” Seven Emotions Master said respectfully.","In fact, Seven Emotions Master had doubted Jian Wushuang at the beginning. However, as Jian Wushuang’s progress became faster and faster, it had only been 100,000 years, becoming the number one Principles Master in this territory, Seven Emotions Master had completely submitted to Jian Wushuang.","“Young Palace Master?” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. “This title sounds a little awkward. From now on, you should call me Heavenly Sword Marquis friend as before.”","Upon hearing this, Axe One Master and the other two looked at each other and smiled.","The status of Star Palace young Palace Master was definitely much higher than the four of them. Coupled with Jian Wushuang’s absolute strength, they had no choice but to treat Jian Wushuang with great respect and even caution, it was almost the same as when they faced the Palace Master of Star Palace.","But now, Jian Wushuang’s simple words made them feel a lot more relaxed.","Obviously, although Jian Wushuang had reached the stage where they could only look up to him, his attitude toward them was very gentle and did not put on any airs, which made them feel much more comfortable.","“Four, although Palace Master has given me the identity of the Young Palace Master, the four of you will manage the Star Palace from now on. I won’t interfere. However, the many resources in the Star Palace...” Jian Wushuang had not finished his words.","“Don’t worry, my friend. Palace Master has ordered that you can use any resources in the Star Palace at your will. However, in order to maintain the normal order of the Star Palace, you just need to let me know what resources you use,” Axe One Master said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded. Then he looked at Axe One Master and said, “Axe One Master, I asked you to find out some information for me. Is there any result now?”","Before he set off for the depths of Devil Smoke Valley, he had specifically asked Axe One Master to find out information about ice heart glazed jade and Master Star Luo. It had been almost 100,000 years, so there should have been a result.","As expected...Axe One Master said with a serious expression, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, my young friend, I have tried my best to do the two things you asked me to inquire about. The first is the ice heart glazed jades. I told you before that a total of three pieces of ice heart glazed jades were born in this territory. One of the first two pieces was destroyed on the spot, and the other piece was taken by a Ruler to save his wife. The last piece was obtained by the Earth Saint Star Master!”","“Earth Saint Star Master is a reclusive and bloodthirsty Ruler Realm expert. Over the years, I’ve tried to contact him on behalf of Star Palace to exchange for the iceheart glazed jade. However, Earth Saint Star Master sent me a message.”","“What message?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Earth Saint Star Master’s original words were, ‘I don’t have the iceheart glazed jade. Get lost and don’t bother me!’after receiving this message, I haven’t had any further contact with Earth Saint Star Master,” Axe One Master said.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","In the past 100,000 years, Axe One Master had only had one contact with the Earth Saint Star Master, but this one contact was enough to show Star Saint Master’s attitude.","“Axe One Master, have you ever asked him if he really doesn’t have the icy heart glazed jade?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Of course I want to ask, but the Earth Saint Star Master didn’t give me a second chance. Besides, he has already spoken, so I don’t dare to pester him anymore. After all, everyone in this territory knows that the Earth Saint Star Master is a crazy person who likes to kill and is terrifyingly strong. Even my Star Palace would not dare to provoke such a person,” Axe One Master said helplessly.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. He also understood the helplessness of Axe One Master.","Earth Saint Star Master was indeed not to be trifled with.","Not only was Earth Saint Star Master powerful, but he also had many tricks up his sleeve. Even if he asked Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor to deal with Earth Saint Star Master personally, they might not be able to take him down completely.","Moreover, Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor had been busy trying to find a way for him to get the Nether Fire Blood Crystal and the Supreme Universe Supreme Treasure Divine Sword, how could he make any requests to the three Rulers at this time.","“Forget it. I’ll put Earth Saint Star Master aside for now. After the three Rulers have gathered what I need, and I’ve truly broken through to become a Principles Master, I’ll go to Earth Saint Star myself.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a hint of fierceness.","“What about Star Luo Master? Have you heard anything about her over the years?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“I’ve investigated her thoroughly, but I’ve never heard of her. I’m sure that she either doesn’t wander around the territory, has no contact with anyone, or has never revealed her strength or identity,” Axe One Master said.","“No News at all?” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","“It’s not that there’s no news at all.” Axe One Master changed the topic. “I’ve asked around, but I did get a piece of news. It might be related to Star Luo Master.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang immediately looked over.","“That was more than 80,000 years ago. During the period when they were trapped in the deepest part of Devil Smoke Valley and lost their tracks, someone once met a mysterious female Ruler in the deepest part of Red Rock Mountain, one of the three battlefields. Not only was the Ruler beautiful, but she was also accompanied by a beautiful woman who had reached the level of Principles Master. If I’m not mistaken, that woman should be the disciple of the female Ruler.” Axe One Master said.","“A beautiful Ruler with a beautiful female disciple?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","She had seen Star Luo Master, and she was indeed extremely beautiful.","As for Leng Ruxue, her body was Leng Rushuang, and her beauty was almost incomparable. After so many years, under the guidance of Star Luo Master, Leng Ruxue had reached the level of Principles Master, it was normal.","In this case, the Ruler in the depths of Crimson Rock Mountain had a beautiful female disciple with him. It was very likely that they were Star Luo Master and Leng Ruxue!","“What happened after that?” Jian Wushuang immediately asked."]},{"number":3612,"title":"Chapter 3612 - Netherfire Blood Crystal","paragraphs":["“There was no later.” Axe One Master shook her head. “The female Ruler and her disciple only appeared once and did not attack. After that, no one has seen them or anyone has seen them, but our Star Palace did not find them.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","In his opinion, the female Ruler and her disciple who appeared in the depths of Crimson Rock Mountain were likely to be Star Luo Master and Leng Ruxue, but unfortunately, Star Palace’s intelligence could only find them this time, and it was more than 80,000 years ago.","“Axe One Master, please continue to investigate this matter,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Axe One Master nodded.","“There’s nothing else. Everyone, go on with your work.”","After saying this, Jian Wushuang turned around and left.","After that, Jian Wushuang made a trip to the supreme treasure house and left a moment later.","Before leaving, he took the Supreme Universe Supreme Treasure Divine Sword mentioned by Daoist Xuan God, as well as many treasures that were helpful in integrating the destruction principles, the space-time principles, and the reincarnation principles. In addition...Jian Wushuang also took a flying and domain supreme treasure.","As the Young Palace Master of Star Palace, he could freely use the many resources of Star Palace, including the many supreme treasures and treasures in the Supreme Treasure Vault. As long as he felt that they were useful, he could take them without paying any price.","However, although Jian Wushuang took these things, he still left some of the treasures that he had collected over the years in the Supreme Treasure Vault.","For example, the top-tier universe supreme treasure divine weapon left by the Star Thunder Ruler, the Shadow Devil Thunder Stick!","There was also the axe, which was a top-tier universe supreme treasure, and the spear, which was a top-tier universe supreme treasure, which he had obtained when he first entered the special space-time.","These treasures were all extremely valuable.","After leaving the Supreme Treasure Vault, Jian Wushuang returned to his residence and began to cultivate in seclusion.","He had met with three master-level experts, namely Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and Heaven Ancestor. After knowing the reason, he felt even more stressed and could not afford to slack off, after all, he did not know when Devil Cloud Star Master would personally come. Once he arrived, the final battle would begin immediately.","Before that, all he had to do was try his best to increase his strength.","Right now, the fastest way to increase his strength was to fuse the three principles and break through to become a Principles Master!","Once he broke through, his strength would definitely reach a whole new level, and he could even completely rival a Ruler!","Nine years passed in the blink of an eye.","In this territory, on an Earth Star that was quite far away from the Star Palace.","Rumble...","Three terrifying auras descended at the same time, pressing down on this Earth Star. There were quite a few Principles Masters on this Earth Star, and when they felt these three auras, they instantly began to tremble, and their hearts trembled.","In the void at the center of this Earth Star, a cold middle-aged man who was over three meters tall stood there, looking around at the source of the three auras. He frowned deeply. He was the master of this planet. He was also the most famous person in this territory, Ruler Guyou.","“Star Palace Master, Temporal Temple Master, and the Empyrean Patriarch, the three of you came from the incomparably distant primordial starworld. If you were to travel here by foot, it would probably take thousands of years. Even if you were able to rely on a cosmic tunnel, the price you would have to pay for such a long-distance teleportation is incredibly high. Even though you know this, the three of you still came,” Ruler Guyou said in a low voice.","“Guyou, let’s cut to the chase. You should know why the three of us are here. Hand over the Netherfire Blood Crystal, and the three of us will leave immediately. Otherwise...” Daoist Xuan God’s eyes turned cold.","In another void, the Temporal Temple Master’s face flickered. Instantly, boundless spacetime energy swept out, completely sealing off the surrounding spacetime.","Ruler Guyou’s face sank as he glanced at the Temporal Temple Master. “It’s rumored that this Temporal Temple Master’s understanding and usage of the spacetime laws have already reached the peak. Now that I look at it, it seems that this is indeed the case. With him around, I don’t even have the chance to escape. If these three Rulers join forces and attack me at the same time, I’m definitely no match for them.”","Taking a deep breath, Ruler Guyou raised his head again. “Is it worth the trouble of the three of you for a Netherfire Blood Crystal?”","“Of course it is,” Heaven Ancestor growled. “Guyou, hand over the Netherfire Blood Crystal honestly. The conditions I promised you will not change. However, if you continue to be stubborn, be careful that this Ruler of yours will really die here.”","“It’s just a single Netherfire Blood Crystal. Although it is of some use to me, it isn’t enough for me to risk my life for it. The reason I rejected you earlier was because I wanted you to pay an even greater price. Now that you have gone through so much trouble, you can just take the Netherfire Blood Crystal.” Ruler Guyou waved his hand, instantly, a streak of blood-colored light shot toward the Empyrean Lord.","The Heaven Ancestor stretched out his hand to receive it. After giving it a sweeping glance, he nodded toward Daoist Xuan God and the Temporal Temple Master.","Now that they had acquired the Netherfire Blood Crystal, the three of them naturally had no plans to attack.","“Ruler Guyou, we’ve offended you in many ways today, but the Netherfire Blood Crystal is of great importance to us. We can only come up with this plan. I’m sorry. This is what I promised you previously.” The Heaven Ancestor waved his hand, tossing an interspatial ring to Ruler Guyou, then, the three of them left.","Seeing the three of them leave, the cultivators on this Earth Star let out a heavy sigh.","As for Guyou Ruler, after he received the Heaven Ancestor’s interspatial ring, he glanced at it and his expression became strange.","“Although the Netherfire Blood Crystal is rare, it shouldn’t be too important to a Ruler. However, these three people actually paid such a high price to rush here from the Divine Beginning Realm just for a Netherfire Blood Crystal. They actually came to kill me?","“What is the use of the Netherfire Blood Crystal to them?” The Guyou Ruler frowned, but he did not think too much about it.","As for what happened today, it was a bit aggrieved for him. However, facing three Rulers at the same time, and one of them was a Ruler who had reached the peak of space-time, he had no choice but to bow his head, after that, the other party had apologized to him personally and left him some face. Therefore, he did not hold a grudge. At most, he felt a little unhappy.","After the Daoist Xuan God trio obtained the Netherfire Blood Crystal from the Guyou Ruler, they immediately returned to Star Palace as fast as they could. They handed over the Netherfire Blood Crystal and the other treasures on the list that Jian Wushuang had given them, all of them were given to Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3613,"title":"Chapter 3613 - No Feeling","paragraphs":["After collecting all the treasures, Jian Wushuang started to cultivate the supreme eternal celestial body without any delay.","This cultivation lasted for 80 years.","After 80 years, Jian Wushuang finally succeeded in cultivating the first level of the supreme eternal celestial body.","“Is this a divine body comparable to a supreme treasure?”","Jian Wushuang clenched his hands and felt his divine body. His eyes lit up. “This feeling...is so powerful!”","It was not as if he had never encountered a body-refining secret skill before.","When he was weak, he had cultivated the primordial void celestial body, a body-refining secret skill of the ancient clan, which was one of the four great divine clans. However, although the primordial void celestial body was one of the top ten body-refining secret skills in the Divine Beginning Realm, it was not very helpful to Principles Masters, when he cultivated this secret skill to the top, it would only be of little help to the Principles Master.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang had stopped cultivating this secret skill a long time ago.","However, the supreme imperishable celestial body was different.","The supreme imperishable celestial body was a secret skill that came from the inner heart of the Planet Lingyun.","Planet Lingyun used to be an Ruler in the deepest part of the universe, and there were many supreme experts. The supreme imperishable celestial body, when cultivated to an extremely high level, was of great help to Rulers and even supreme experts. It was also of great help to the Principles Master, it was even more helpful.","Jian Wushuang was only at the level of the Immortal Saint Now. It was also because of the magic of the perfect life that he could barely cultivate the first level of the supreme-level Immortal Xuan body. Once he cultivated it, his divine body could be comparable to an elementary universe supreme treasure!","A divine body at the level of an elementary universe supreme treasure. How strong was such a divine body?","Jian Wushuang did not know. He could only feel that his current divine body was very strong, hundreds or thousands of times stronger than before.","How much help would this divine body be to his strength?","“Let’s try it.”","With a smile on his face, Jian Wushuang slowly stood up and left his residence.","Soon, Jian Wushuang found the woodcutter who was chopping trees in the special tower, which was the Heaven Ancestor.","The Four Masters of the Star Palace Camp, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, stayed in the Divine Beginning Realm all year round to guard the seal.","After Daoist Xuan God and the Heaven Ancestor obtained the Netherfire Blood Crystal, they left the Star Palace to help Jian Wushuang find the Supreme Treasure Divine Sword.","As for the Temporal Temple Master, he also went to the quicksand demon area, one of the three battlefields. Now, only the Heaven Ancestor was still in the Star Palace.","“Little guy, why did you come to see me?” The Heaven Ancestor looked at Jian Wushuang.","“I did.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “I just mastered a secret skill, but I don’t know its exact power. That’s why I wanted to practice it with you, Senior Heaven Ancestor.”","“Is that so?” The Heaven Ancestor raised his eyebrows. “Then what do you need me to do?”","“It’s very simple. Senior Heaven Ancestor, you just need to attack me with all your strength,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s it?” The Heaven Ancestor was stunned for a moment, but then he smiled and said, “Alright, but you have to be careful. After all, I’m a Ruler, and my attacks are not something an ordinary person can withstand.”","“I’m confident. Senior Heaven Ancestor, you just need to focus on your attacks,” Jian Wushuang said with great confidence.","“Alright, be careful.” The Heaven Ancestor did not waste any time. He raised the axe in his hand, which had been chopping trees. Jian Wushuang had used this axe before, so it looked just like an ordinary mortal’s axe, but now, in the hands of the Heaven Ancestor, it suddenly revealed an earth-shaking power!","This power carried an extremely powerful aura.","“Supreme true treasure!” Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","He had been cultivating with this axe for a long time and had thought that it was very ordinary. But now, it seemed that he was too weak to sense the real power of the axe.","There were not many supreme true treasures, even among experts at the Ruler Realm, but the Heaven Ancestor had one.","“I’m coming.”","As soon as the Heaven Ancestor finished his words, he appeared in front of Jian Wushuang as if he had teleported. The axe he raised also fell straight down.","Whoosh! It was a light axe, but the moment he swung it, he felt as if everything was torn apart.","Seeing the axe falling down, Jian Wushuang did not move at all. He did not have any intention of waving his sword to block it.","“This kid isn’t going to block it?” The Heaven Ancestor frowned. “Does he want to use his divine body to block my axe?”","Clang!","The axe struck Jian Wushuang’s body without any resistance. The terrifying power burst out and left a white mark on the armor on Jian Wushuang’s body, however, Jian Wushuang still stood there unscathed until the power of the axe was completely exhausted. His expression did not change at all.","“How could it be?” The Heaven Ancestor was shocked.","“Haha, Heaven Ancestor, you put too much water in, right?” A voice with a smile sounded.","“That’s right. If you put too much water in, you’ll lose face.” Another gentle voice sounded.","Two blurry figures appeared in the void out of thin air.","These two people were, of course, Daoist Xuan God and Temporal Temple Master. However, they were not their original bodies. They were just consciousness incarnations left in the Star Palace.","Although they were consciousness avatars and did not have much battle strength, their vision was still there.","“Senior Heaven Ancestor, how much strength did you use with your axe just now?” Jian Wushuang looked over.","“10%,” Heaven Ancestor said.","He was worried that his attack would be too powerful and hurt Jian Wushuang, so he deliberately suppressed his strength.","Although he only used 10% of his strength, an expert at the Ruler Realm could crush any Principles Master under normal circumstances. Unexpectedly...","“Only 10% of his strength? No wonder I didn’t feel anything,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You didn’t feel anything?” The Heaven Ancestor was stunned.","“Haha, Heaven Ancestor, you have to work harder. Otherwise, this little guy will look down on you.” Daoist Xuan God laughed very happily.","“No, I don’t mean to look down on senior Heaven Ancestor. It’s just that I really didn’t feel anything from Senior Heaven Ancestor’s axe just now.” Jian Wushuang spread his hands and said.","He was telling the truth.","He had the Blood Demon Cave Armor to protect him, so he could directly weaken the Ruler Realm attack by more than 90%. The remaining 10% of the power would be absorbed by his divine body, which meant that the strike from the Heaven Ancestor...only less than 1% of the power was used on his divine body. With his divine body, which was comparable to a supreme treasure, he could indeed ignore this 1% of the power.","“Heaven Ancestor, try 50% of your strength,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Okay.” Heaven Ancestor nodded slightly.","Before, he was afraid of hurting Jian Wushuang, so he did not dare to use too much strength. But now that he knew Jian Wushuang’s ability to protect his body, he was not so cautious.","Soon, Heaven Ancestor attacked again."]},{"number":3614,"title":"Chapter 3614 - The Divine Body Was Comparable to a Supreme Treasure","paragraphs":["Whoosh!","The axe still swung out, and its speed was extremely fast. Like a bolt of lightning, it landed on Jian Wushuang’s body in an instant.","Rumble! A terrifying power burst out in an instant.","The strike of the Heaven Ancestor with 50% of its power could be said to be earth-shattering.","However, Jian Wushuang only trembled slightly and took two steps back, but he immediately stopped.","“How was it?”","The Heaven Ancestor, Daoist Xuan God, and Temporal Temple Master all looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes, it’s much stronger than the previous strike. However, it still hasn’t broken through the limit of my divine body,” Jian Wushuang said.","“What do you mean?” The Heaven Ancestor asked.","“That is to say, Senior Heaven Ancestor, your axe didn’t cause any damage to my divine body, so it can’t destroy my divine power,” Jian Wushuang said.","Jian Wushuang said it tactfully, but the three Heaven Ancestors immediately understood.","“You didn’t use any of your divine power?”","“It’s intact?”","“How is that possible?”","The Heaven Ancestor widened his eyes.","Even Daoist Xuan God and Temporal Temple Master were surprised.","The Heaven Ancestor used 50% of his power to attack Jian Wushuang with his axe, but he still could not do any damage to Jian Wushuang?","“Heaven Ancestor, use your full strength!” Temporal Temple Master said in a low voice.","“Yes, not only use your full strength, but also use the secret skill you created,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Okay.” The Heaven Ancestor nodded solemnly, and his eyes became sharp.","“Use your full strength?” Jian Wushuang licked his lips, but there was an excited smile on his face.","Boom!","The Heaven Ancestor’s body shook, and his terrifying power burst out without any concealment.","For a moment, the terrifying power of the Ruler Realm filled this special space.","“Indestructible, God Slayer!”","The Heaven Ancestor raised the huge axe in his hands at the same time. With a low shout, the huge axe was brought down.","Hua!","A shocking axe shadow appeared in this space-time. As soon as the axe shadow appeared, the space-time began to tremble crazily, as if it could not withstand the power.","Indeed, although this space-time was created by the Heaven Ancestor, and its endurance was extraordinary, the Heaven Ancestor was giving it his all. Furthermore, he had used his ultimate technique. This was the full power attack of a Ruler Realm expert, it was normal that the space-time could not withstand it.","“Good timing.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up when he saw the axe shadow coming at him. However, he had no intention of dodging it.","He just stood there quietly and let the axe shadow come at him. His heart was filled with anticipation. “Don’t disappoint me with the supreme imperishable celestial body!”","With endless anticipation, the earth-shaking axe finally struck his divine body.","In an instant...rumble...a large area of space cracks appeared, and the space began to collapse crazily.","In the center of the space-time, Jian Wushuang was immediately sent flying. He was sent flying to the edge of the space-time and crashed into the space-time barrier, the astonishing power contained in the axe also rushed into Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","Jian Wushuang stood there with his eyes closed.","In the void in front of him, Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor had stood together again. They all frowned slightly.","“I wonder how the little guy is doing.” Temporal Temple Master said with some worry.","“If the Heaven Ancestor’s axe didn’t hurt him at all, he should be fine even if it did,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“You two asked me to use all my strength. Don’t blame me if I hurt him badly.” The Heaven Ancestor rolled his eyes and said.","While the three of them were waiting, Jian Wushuang finally opened his eyes and rushed in front of them.","“Little guy, how was the result?” Daoist Xuan God immediately looked over.","“As expected of Senior Heaven Ancestor. The power of the axe just now was indeed very strong. It could already hurt me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Hurt you?” The Heaven Ancestor looked strange. “How badly?”","“Well...” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. “Let me use up one-thousandth of my divine power.”","“Excuse me?”","Heaven Ancestor, Daoist Xuan God, time and Temporal Temple Master are all stunned.","1 in 10,000?","An expert at the level of a Ruler attacked Jian Wushuang with all his strength without any hindrance. As a result, Jian Wushuang only lost one-tenth of his divine power?","1 in 10,000? How could that be called a loss?","“Little guy, is what you said true? Did you really only use 1 out of 10,000 of your divine power?” Daoist Xuan God looked at Jian Wushuang with a strange expression.","“That’s true.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Senior Heaven Ancestor’s attack just exceeded the limit of my divine body and caused a little damage to my divine body. I only used 1/10,000 of my divine power to completely recover from this little damage.”","“Impossible, this is impossible!” Heaven Ancestor shook his head crazily, he growled, “Even an expert at the same level as a Ruler, who is good at defense, can’t only use 1 out of 10,000 of his divine power as long as he doesn’t have a supreme true treasure armor.”","What he said was the truth.","The full-strength strike of a Ruler Realm expert was so powerful that even a Ruler would suffer some damage if he took it head-on.","But what Jian Wushuang said now was only one-thousandth of his divine power, which was incredible.","“Senior Heaven Ancestor, you don’t have to be amazed.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “During my years in Devil Smoke Valley, I’ve indeed obtained an extraordinary opportunity. One of them is an incomparably powerful body-refining secret technique. This secret technique is of an extremely high level. The list I gave you before is the list of the natural treasures needed to cultivate this secret technique. Now, the first level of that secret technique has already been refined by me, and after refining it, my godly body is already comparable to a low-level universe true treasure!”","“What?”","Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and Heaven Ancestor were all shocked.","“A supreme...supreme treasure?”","“Little guy, you said your divine body is comparable to a universe supreme treasure?”","The three Masters looked at Jian Wushuang in astonishment.","“It’s like this.” Jian Wushuang nodded again. “It’s because my divine body is comparable to an elementary universe supreme treasure that I dared to withstand the attack of Senior Heaven Ancestor.”","“The power of the Heaven Ancestor’s axe just now was indeed extremely powerful. However, I have the supreme true treasure armor to protect my body. The power of the supreme true treasure armor was reduced by more than 90% at the first moment. Less than 10% of the power of the axe was used on my divine body. My divine body is comparable to an elementary universe true treasure, so less than 10% of the power was barely able to reach my limit. That’s why it caused me a bit of damage.”"]},{"number":3615,"title":"Chapter 3615 - Walk Horizontally","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang had explained in great detail how he had received the blow, and it was the truth.","However, Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and Heaven Ancestor were still confused and shocked.","After a long time, the three finally managed to regain their senses, but their faces were still filled with shock and disbelief.","“A godly body comparable to a universe supreme treasure? This is simply inconceivable!”","“That’s right. We’ve roamed this territory for so long, and we’ve come into contact with some of the surrounding territories, but we’ve never heard of anyone with a godly body that’s as powerful as a universe supreme treasure!”","“Incredible, truly incredible!”","The three Rulers were also very excited at this moment.","After a while...","“Little guy, you just said that you’ve only mastered the first level of the secret skill?” Temporal Temple Master suddenly looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “The level of the secret skill is very high. Just by mastering the first level of the divine body, it can be comparable to an elementary universe true treasure, and by mastering the second level, it can be comparable to an advanced universe true treasure, and so on. Unfortunately, the threshold for cultivating the secret skill is very high. The first level alone requires a Principles Master to cultivate it. I can barely master the first level because of my perfect life form!”","“In addition, during the process of cultivating this secret art, you will need some natural treasures to assist you. In addition, these natural treasures are extremely rare and precious. For example, the first level’s natural treasures can be acquired in our territory, but the second level’s natural treasures are hundreds of times more valuable and rare than the first level’s natural treasures. It is virtually impossible to find them in this territory!”","“In other words, you can only cultivate the first level in this territory?” Daoist Xuan God asked.","“Yes, if you want to cultivate the second level, you have to leave this territory and go to the deepest part of the universe. Only there can you find the genius earthly treasures needed to cultivate the second level,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s a pity.” Daoist Xuan God sighed.","“Yes, the first level alone is so heaven-defying. If you have the chance to cultivate the second level, then you are truly invincible in this territory. Your divine body is comparable to an advanced universe supreme treasure. Who can shake it?” The Heaven Ancestor also sighed.","“However, even if you can’t cultivate the second level, just the first level alone is already incredible. This is definitely a big surprise for us,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Yes, yes, a big surprise. This is definitely a big surprise.” Daoist Xuan God was also excited. “A divine body comparable to an elementary universe supreme treasure, coupled with a pinnacle universe supreme treasure armor, even if you take a full-strength attack from a Ruler Realm expert, you only use one-tenth of your divine power. This means that you can completely ignore an ordinary elementary Ruler. Even if you stand in front of him, he probably won’t be able to do anything to you.”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile.","Indeed, he had now experienced two primary Rulers.","One was the tall man from the three Saint Realms who had ambushed him in Devil Smoke Valley, and the other was the Heaven Ancestor.","In terms of strength, the tall man from the three Saint Realms was probably stronger, but he was definitely not much stronger.","Now that the Heaven Ancestor’s full-strength attack had hit his body, it had only consumed 1 out of 10,000 of his divine power. It was like scratching an itch and could not shake him at all. After all, the speed at which he absorbed divine power...was even faster than this.","And that tall man’s full-strength attack could only cause 2 out of 10,000 damage to him at most. It still could not affect him much.","Besides, if he were to really fight against a Ruler, there was no way he would just stand there and allow his opponent to attack him. If that was the case, then in this territory, a junior Ruler really would not be able to do anything to him.","“It’s not just a junior Ruler. Even a senior Ruler like the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master wouldn’t be able to do anything to your godly body,” Daoist Xuan God said with a laugh.","“Yes, with your current divine body and the protection of your supreme true treasure armor, you can completely ignore a primary Ruler. As for a senior Ruler, he can barely hurt you, but it’s impossible for him to threaten your life. Even if two or three senior Rulers joined forces, it would be difficult for them to kill you.”","“The only one who can really threaten you is probably a top-tier Ruler, but as far as I know, there’s only one such Ruler in this territory. And that Ruler has always paid attention to his status. He doesn’t have any enmity with my Star Palace, so he won’t come to deal with you for no reason. In other words, you can almost do whatever you want in this territory now,” the Heaven Ancestor said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang also smiled.","He knew that once he mastered the first level of the supreme eternal celestial body, his life-saving ability would be greatly enhanced. In this territory, there were very few people who could kill him.","At least, he did not have to care too much about ordinary Rulers.","“Of course, you should not be too conceited. After all, the Devil Cloud Star Master definitely has the strength to kill you,” Daoist Xuan God suddenly said.","Jian Wushuang was stunned, and his expression became serious.","Indeed, his biggest enemy, Devil Cloud Star Master, was a Master of a second-grade star world. He had dozens of masters under his command, and experts of that level had long reached the peak of the Master Realm. Of course, they had the strength to kill him.","“Not only that, as far as I know, Devil Cloud Star Master also has an extremely special supreme treasure in his hand. That supreme treasure is different from the others, and it has an extremely special power. That power is the bane of all special life forms. When the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed, Xuan Yi was heavily injured by that supreme treasure and lost most of his divine power, which was why he died,” Daoist Xuan God said seriously.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank.","“Senior Xuan God, is the Supreme Treasure you mentioned a spear?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes, you know it?” Daoist Xuan God looked at him in surprise.","“I was lucky enough to see a picture of that battle in the Seven Star Divine Realm. In the picture, my Master Xuan Yi was pierced through the heart by a spear. That attack should be fatal to him,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes, it was that spear that caused your Master Xuan Yi’s death,” Daoist Xuan God said seriously, “Your Master Xuan Yi is also a peerless genius. He has also obtained many great opportunities. Not only is his strength extremely strong, but he also has perfect control over the Mountain River Map as a supreme treasure. At the same time, he also obtained a heaven-suppression tablet by chance!”"]},{"number":3616,"title":"Chapter 3616 - The Heaven-Suppressing Tablet","paragraphs":["“Heaven-suppressing tablet?” Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","Of course, he was familiar with the heaven-suppressing tablet.","In his previous life, Di Shisan had taken him to a heaven-suppressing tablet, and through it, he had obtained an extraordinary opportunity.","At that time, he had heard from Di Shisan that there were nine heaven-suppression tablets, and one alone was enough to shock the world. If the nine heaven-suppression tablets were gathered together, they could suppress the world!","One could imagine how powerful the heaven-suppression tablet was.","“The Mountain River Map, the two Supreme Treasures Xuan Yi had, is the most powerful one in the domain category. It should be in your hands now.” Daoist Xuan God looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes, it’s in my hands.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","The Mountain River Map had been his most powerful supreme treasure since his last life. It was also one of his most powerful trump cards. He would not use it unless it was absolutely necessary, after all, he knew that this supreme treasure was extraordinary.","In addition, he had never fully exerted the power of this supreme treasure since he got it. Even when he was on Saha Island, the power of the entire Blood Wave Realm was infused into his body because of the blood waves, it had allowed him to possess the combat power of a Ruler for a short period of time. However, even so, he was still unable to fully unleash the power of the Mountain River Map.","For example, the most terrifying killing move of the Mountain River Map, the nine dragons heaven-cleaving great formation, had only been able to unleash the two dragons heaven-cleaving great formation.","One had to know that the most powerful move of the nine dragons heaven-cleaving great formation was the nine dragons heaven-cleaving great formation.","Moreover, the Mountain River Map was a domain-type supreme treasure. Its most terrifying technique was a domain, not an offensive technique. However, the most powerful domain of the Mountain River Map...he could not use it.","“A domain-type supreme treasure? Master really gave me a good treasure,” Jian Wushuang sighed.","He had never been clear about the level of the Mountain River Map. Before he came to the Universe Battlefield, he thought the map was a top-tier universe supreme treasure, but after arriving here...he immediately changed his mind. After all, he had come into contact with many supreme treasures.","A top-tier universe supreme treasure could never have such tyrannical power and could not be used by him. Therefore, Jian Wushuang had guessed at that time that the Mountain River Map might be a supreme true treasure. Now, it seemed that it was true!","A supreme supreme treasure, a domain-type supreme treasure, might not be able to unleash its full power even if it was a Ruler Realm expert. He was just a saint, and even if he had the invincible battle strength of a Principles Master...how could he unleash its full power?","“As a domain-type supreme treasure, the Mountain River Map is coveted by countless Ruler Realm experts. Back then, Xuan Yi relied on this supreme treasure to fight against several Rulers at the same time. However, the Mountain River Map was not Xuan Yi’s supreme treasure. His true supreme treasure was still the heaven-suppression tablet!” Daoist Xuan God’s voice was low.","“The heaven suppressing monoliths were obtained by Xuan Yi from the core of the Quicksand Demon Realm, one of the three great battlefields. There were a total of nine heaven suppressing monoliths, and only three of them appeared in the Quicksand Demon Realm. However, even if only three of them appeared in the Quicksand Demon Realm, the commotion they caused was still unbelievably huge!”","As he spoke up to this point, Daoist Xuan God could not help but exclaim in admiration.","“That was indeed a huge commotion.” The Temporal Temple Master nodded as well. “The three great battlefields have existed in this territory for so many years, and countless treasures have been born within them. Even Supreme Treasures have been born before. Every time a supreme treasure is born, there will be some commotion. However, there has never been a supreme treasure that has been born that is comparable to the birth of the heaven suppressing tablet!”","“That scene not only shocked the entire quicksand demon area, but even the other two battlefields and the territory we’re in can sense the astonishing energy fluctuation.”","“The entire territory can sense the fluctuation?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","After all, the territory he was in was extremely vast. There were dozens of astral worlds, and these astral worlds were connected to each other. Even him, who traveled at the speed of a Principles Master...it would take hundreds or even thousands of years to reach here. These were only two astral worlds that were connected to each other.","From this, one could imagine how vast the entire territory was.","However, when the heaven suppressing tablet appeared, the commotion it caused could actually affect the entire territory?","“At that time, the commotion was too great, causing all the experts in this territory to be alarmed. Countless experts even dared to head into the depths of the Quicksand Demon Realm like madmen, including many Rulers. In the end, it caused the most intense battle in this territory!”","“During that battle, I remember that there were a total of eighteen Rulers who participated in it. As for the Principles Masters, there were countless of them. There were so many experts who wanted to obtain the heaven-suppressing monument, yet there were only three. Hence, the frenzied battle began. In the end, the three Rulers died on the spot. As for the Principles Masters, a large number of them died. No one even bothered to count them.”","“In the end, two of the three heaven-suppression tablets fell into the hands of two extremely powerful Rulers in this territory. As for the other one, it was obtained by your Master Xuan Yi.”","“Master actually obtained a heaven-suppression tablet from that multi-Ruler expert?” Jian Wushuang could not help exclaiming.","He knew that his master was only a Principles Master at his peak. Although his battle strength was comparable to a Ruler, there were a total of 18 Rulers on the battlefield. In the end, a total of three Rulers died, how difficult would it be to obtain a heaven suppression tablet from that multiple Ruler.","“At that time, your master’s combat power was only comparable to that of a low-level Ruler. He was considered average among the eighteen Rulers. However, he had many tricks up his sleeve, and his life-saving abilities were even more impressive. Most importantly, he still had the mountain river country map, a domain type supreme true treasure. In addition, he was only a Principles Master. Those Rulers didn’t guard against him in the beginning, which was why he was able to succeed.”","Daoist Xuan God smiled and said, “When your master obtained the heaven-suppressing tablet, his strength reached a whole new level, and he could even rival a superior Ruler!”","“What?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","“Why? Isn’t it incredible?” Daoist Xuan God looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","According to Daoist Xuan God, his master was only comparable to a primary Ruler at that time. However, after obtaining the heaven-suppressing tablet, he was now comparable to a superior Ruler!","A superior Ruler was two levels higher than a primary Ruler, and there were probably no more than three such Rulers in this territory.","A treasure could allow Xuan Yi’s battle strength to go from a primary Ruler to a superior Ruler and directly match a superior Ruler?"]},{"number":3617,"title":"Chapter 3617 - 3,000 Years of Closed-Door Cultivation","paragraphs":["“What level is the heaven-suppression tablet?” Jian Wushuang asked in shock.","The heaven-suppression tablet was so terrifying that someone with the battle strength of a primary Ruler could instantly rival a superior Ruler.","“I don’t know what level it is, but I’m sure it’s more powerful than a supreme treasure. Only supreme-beings are qualified to use such a treasure,” Daoist Xuan God paused for a moment, then he said seriously, “Little guy, there’s only one reason why I’m telling you so much...”","“Your master is as strong as a superior Ruler. Although he doesn’t have your terrifying divine body, which is comparable to an elementary universe supreme treasure, the treasure in his hand is extremely powerful. Even so, he still died under that special spear. There’s no room for struggle. So, you must be very vigilant against that spear. In the future, if you meet an expert invited by the three Saint Realms and see him take out a strange spear, don’t hesitate and run away immediately. Do you understand?”","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded heavily.","He knew that it was the existence of that special spear that caused his master’s death.","He did not want to follow in his master’s footsteps. Of course, he had to be wary of that spear, which had a great restraining effect on any special life form.","“By the way, I’ve seen master’s heaven-suppressing tablet before,” Jian Wushuang said.","“It’s not strange.” Daoist Xuan God smiled. “Although your master died, he left a way out for the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. He sealed the entire Seven Star Divine Realm and kept all his treasures. He gave you the Mountain River Map, but the heaven-suppression tablet is too high-level. You were too weak to refine it.”","“But the heaven-suppression tablet must be left to you in the end. After you break through to become a Principles Master and break the seal, you can go to the heaven-suppression tablet and try to refine it!","“Once you refine the heaven-suppression tablet, your strength will certainly reach a new level.”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","The heaven-suppression tablet...Jian Wushuang had a trace of desire in his heart to make Xuan Yi, who only had the strength of a primary Ruler, a supreme treasure that could rival a superior Ruler in one leap.","“Well, continue to cultivate.” Daoist Xuan God waved his hand and said.","Jian Wushuang bowed respectfully to the three Rulers in front of him and then turned to leave.","After Jian Wushuang left, the three Rulers began to chat again.","“This little guy is worthy of being created by Xuan Yi, who gathered all the Heavenly Dao and good fortune in the Seven Star Divine Realm and the Divine Beginning Realm. He is even more blessed than Xuan Yi,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Yes, a body-refining secret skill that can make your divine body comparable to a universe supreme treasure. I’ve never heard of it before. It’s too abnormal. Such a secret skill must come from the deepest part of the universe. In the deepest part of the universe, only some big forces can have it. To be able to get such a secret skill, it’s really extraordinary.” The Heaven Ancestor sighed.","“Not only that, he also had a special opportunity in the Blood Wave Realm. The Master of the Blood Wave Realm is undoubtedly a super powerful warrior from the depths of the universe. However, such a powerful warrior helped him with all his strength during the battle on the Saha Island. He even caused the entire Blood Wave Realm to collapse. It can be seen that their relationship is no small matter. After he came out from the Blood Wave Realm, his power has soared. It can be seen that the opportunity he got in the Blood Wave Realm is not small either.” Temporal Temple Master chuckled.","“He already has a heaven-defying opportunity. With the help of us and the things Xuan Yi prepared for him, he has thousands of opportunities in his body. If he can’t take the final step, there won’t be anyone else in the Divine Beginning Realm who has the same opportunity as him.”","The three sighed. Soon, Daoist Xuan God and Temporal Temple Master gradually disappeared. The Heaven Ancestor continued to pick up the axe in his hand and began to chop the trees next to him.","...","Jian Wushuang returned to the courtyard where he lived, but his heart was still very heavy.","“The supreme-level Immortal Xuan body did not disappoint me. It’s comparable to a divine body of an elementary universe supreme treasure, so I don’t have to care about ordinary elementary Rulers or even advanced Rulers now. However, just as Senior Xuan God said, Devil Cloud Star has a treasure that is specialized in restraining special life forms. My master died under that long spear. Although my current body-protection ability may be stronger than my master’s, that long spear can still pose a fatal threat to me.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","“Keep cultivating. I need to fuse the three rules as soon as possible and break through to become a Principles Master. When that happens, my strength will Sky Rocket. If I can refine the heaven-suppression tablet again, I might be even stronger than my master when he was at his peak. By then, even if my opponent has the special spear, as long as the real body of Devil Cloud Star Master doesn’t arrive personally, it shouldn’t be able to pose a fatal threat to me!”","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang began to cultivate in seclusion again.","This time, he was in seclusion purely to merge the three rules and break through to become a Principles Master.","Moreover, he had made up his mind that he would not come out of seclusion until he had completely merged the three princples!","Time passed quietly.","The merging of the three principles was dozens or even hundreds of times more difficult than the previous two principles!","However, Jian Wushuang had already mastered the destruction will. After so many years of groping, especially when he was trapped in the eighteen ultimate formation, the breakthrough in sword principle triggered the Universe Origin of Sword Principle. Although the universe origin was in the aspect of sword principle, it was more or less helpful to the various principles of heaven and earth.","Because of this, he had already made some progress in the fusion of the three principles. Now, he had obtained a large number of treasures from the Supreme Treasure Vault that combined the destruction principles, the space-time principles, and the Samsara principles, this allowed him to go further and further in the fusion of the three principles.","It was not until the 3000th year of Jian Wushuang’s seclusion.","Finally, he had completely fused the three principles he had comprehended.","“The three principles of destruction, space-time, and Samsara are perfectly fused!”","Jian Wushuang sat in the secret chamber with his eyes open, but his eyes were full of surprise and excitement.","After 3,000 years of secluded cultivation, he had finally taken this step and perfectly integrated the three principles. At the moment of integration, he immediately gained an additional power of will, however, this power of will was not what Jian Wushuang really wanted.","What he wanted was to break through the bottleneck that had troubled him for a long time.","“As I expected, after the three rules were merged, I could clearly sense where the bottleneck was. What I have to do now is to force a breakthrough!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed.","“Let’s begin!”","The Principles Master’s breakthrough began."]},{"number":3618,"title":"Chapter 3618 - Breakthrough","paragraphs":["The perfect fusion of the three principles had long exceeded the requirements for an Immortal Saint to break through to the Principles Master Realm.","Even though Jian Wushuang was a perfect being and was extremely restricted by the universe principles, after the fusion of the three principles, he had finally met the requirements for the breakthrough. What he lacked now was a final kick.","He had to forcefully kick it away.","In the secret chamber, Jian Wushuang’s face was cold and his divine power surged.","At the same time, a light cyan divine sword appeared in his hand. This light cyan divine sword was the Pinnacle Universe Supreme Treasure he had obtained from the Supreme Treasure Vault. It was called the Cyan Spirit Divine Sword. Compared to the many divine swords he had used before, its blade was not as sharp as before.","Such a divine sword would allow Jian Wushuang to display the strongest tearing effect when he used the sword art of laceration.","However, the sword with a thicker body was stronger under the gravitational force, so its power was naturally much stronger.","“Break for me!”","With a low shout, Jian Wushuang’s three principles merged divine power crazily rushed toward the barrier in his body. At the same time, he swung the Cyan Spirit Divine Sword in his hand.","It was the most powerful skill that Jian Wushuang had created, Starfire Burning Sun!","Boom!","The space trembled, and Jian Wushuang’s body roared crazily. After a while, the barrier in his body collapsed.","“I’ve made a breakthrough!” Jian Wushuang was overjoyed.","In fact, it was quite normal.","He had already met the requirements for a breakthrough. In addition, he had accumulated enough power before, so it was natural for him to make a breakthrough.","As he made a breakthrough, the vast and majestic divine power in his body surged and began to change qualitatively.","During the process of the divine power’s transformation, the divine power gathered in his body also increased at an incredible speed.","...","The Star Palace. That special tower was the tower where the Empyrean Patriarch was located.","Within the special space on the top floor of the tower, the forest had already disappeared. What replaced it was an enormous estate.","This estate was incredibly beautiful and majestic.","In the center of the estate was a stone pavilion. Daoist Xuan God, the Temporal Temple Master, and the Empyrean Patriarch were seated together, casually drinking tea while chatting.","“That little fellow has been in closed-door training for three thousand years, right?” The Empyrean Patriarch said slowly.","“Right. It has been three thousand years. It seems he intends to completely break through to become a Principles Master before coming out. I wonder how long he will need,” the Temporal Temple Master said.","“There’s no rush.” Daoist Xuan God just smiled. “A long time ago, I sent some people to the territory which Devil Cloud Star is located in. I’ve been keeping an eye on Devil Cloud Star’s movements, and from the information I’ve received, Devil Cloud Star doesn’t have any intentions of personally coming to our territory. He doesn’t even have any intentions of sending a few Rulers here. As long as Devil Cloud Star doesn’t come here in person, we have nothing to worry about.”","“That’s true.” Temporal Temple Master nodded slightly.","They already knew that Devil Cloud Star had sent three Rulers to this territory and that they were staying on the Sacred Island. However, they did not care about these three Rulers, even if they were very strong, moreover, they were not worried about bringing the spear that could restrain Jian Wushuang.","With Jian Wushuang’s current life-saving skills, it would be too difficult to kill him.","What they were afraid of now was Devil Cloud Star Master, who had reached the peak of the Ruler Realm. If their original body came in person, together with the spear that could restrain Jian Wushuang...that would be a fatal threat to Jian Wushuang.","However, since Devil Cloud Star Master did not intend to come to this territory, they were not worried.","“Not only that, they also said that Devil Cloud Star seems to have caused some trouble recently. The entire planet is very busy. I’m afraid that we won’t be able to take care of our territory in a short time,” Daoist Xuan God said with a smile.","“Haha, that’s great!” Temporal Temple Master was overjoyed.","“This is indeed good news for us.” The Heaven Ancestor nodded solemnly.","As long as the original body of the Devil Cloud Star Master did not arrive in this territory, they would have one more day to prepare. Jian Wushuang could also have one more day to improve his strength. If the Devil Cloud Star Master delayed for tens of thousands of years or hundreds of thousands of years before coming here...that would be even better. After all, with Jian Wushuang’s talent and speed of improvement, he might have become a Ruler in hundreds of thousands of years.","By that time, even if Devil Cloud Star Master noticed it, it would be too late for him to rush over.","“I just hope that Devil Cloud Star Master can’t get away. He can’t worry about this place and give the little guy enough time. Even better, he might as well give up on the Divine Beginning Realm completely,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Give up on the Divine Beginning Realm? How is that possible?” Temporal Temple Master sneered, “To possess an astral world and comprehend the workings and evolution of an astral world is a tremendous opportunity. Even many top Rulers and even legendary Autarchs would covet it. Why would he give up?”","“Not necessarily. You have to understand that the reason why planet Devil Cloud Star Master is so crazy about accelerating the evolution of the Divine Beginning Realm is because he wants to squeeze out the potential of the Divine Beginning Realm in order to break through as soon as possible. However, if he has truly broken through and Moyun has caused trouble for his flawless clone, he might really give up on this place,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“If? How can there be so many ifs in this world? In my opinion, it’s absolutely impossible for him to give up on the Divine Beginning Realm,” the Heaven Ancestor said seriously.","“I was just casually saying that.” Daoist Xuan God smiled awkwardly.","“Let’s not talk about this for now.” The Temporal Temple Master waved his hand. “Blackgod, you said earlier that you wanted to get that little fellow a suitable supreme attack treasure. What was the result?”","“That supreme treasure is a bit troublesome,” said Daoist Xuan God.","“Why? Can’t I get it?” Temporal Temple Master frowned slightly.","A supreme supreme treasure was much more powerful than a pinnacle supreme treasure.","Jian Wushuang only had a pinnacle supreme treasure divine sword, which he had just obtained. However, if Jian Wushuang could get a supreme supreme treasure divine weapon that was suitable for him, then his attack would definitely be improved, it was gonna be a big step up.","“I can’t say that I can’t get it at all. It’s just that there are some problems, and I can’t solve them either.” Daoist Xuan God pondered for a moment before saying, “In short, there are some twists and turns in this process, or wait for the little guy to come out of seclusion, I will tell him in detail.”","“Yes.” The Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven Ancestor all nodded, two people also did not continue to inquire.","And right at this moment...","Boom!","The entire world suddenly shook."]},{"number":3619,"title":"Chapter 3619 - Divine Might Unrivalled","paragraphs":["The world trembled, and the special spacetime where the three Rulers were located began to shake wildly, as though it would collapse at any moment.","“What’s going on?”","The three Rulers, who were chatting leisurely, all had solemn looks on their faces.","“Such a huge commotion. Could it be...” Daoist Xuan God glanced at the Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven Ancestor, only to discover that the latter two were just like him, and their eyes were filled with a hint of excitement.","“Let’s go out and take a look.”","The three Rulers immediately moved out of spacetime, arriving in the void outside the Star Palace.","As soon as they left, they immediately sensed the source of that enormous disturbance.","“As expected, this disturbance came from the place where that little fellow lived.” Daoist Xuan God was incomparably excited.","“Haha, it seems that that little fellow has finally made a breakthrough.” The Temporal Temple Master was overjoyed as well.","They all understood that it was impossible for such a disturbance to appear within the Star Palace for no reason.","Without a doubt, it was definitely caused by humans. Under normal circumstances, when a cultivator’s strength reached a certain level, their breakthrough would cause some sort of disturbance. Moreover, the higher the level of the breakthrough, the more heaven-defying the cultivator would be, the disturbance that would be caused would also be greater.","An ordinary Immortal Saint breaking through to become a Principles Master would also cause some commotion. However, the commotion was not very big and would not attract the attention of the three Rulers. The key point was that the commotion that was spreading out at this moment...it was so huge that it caused an uproar in the entire Star Palace.","In addition, the source of the commotion was where Jian Wushuang lived. Therefore, there was no doubt that Jian Wushuang had broken through.","“This little guy did not disappoint us. He broke through to become a Principles Master so quickly. What a big commotion. When I broke through from a Principles Master to a Ruler, the commotion I caused was not as big as his,” the Heaven Ancestor said with a smile.","“Not good.” Daoist Xuan God’s expression suddenly changed. “It’s a good thing that the little guy made a breakthrough, but we didn’t expect him to cause such a big commotion. We didn’t hide anything for him. There are so many cultivators in Star Palace, so they must have known that he made a breakthrough at the first moment. I’m afraid this news can’t be hidden. Soon, all the forces in this territory will know, and so will Sacred Island.”","“If you know, then so be it.” The Temporal Temple Master waved his hand. “Since this little fellow has already broken through, unless he doesn’t use his full strength or doesn’t meet with a Ruler Realm expert, he will definitely be exposed. We can’t hide it even if we want to. We might as well let the world know. It’s not a big deal. Even if that Devil Cloud Star Master gets the news, he probably won’t be too alert.”","“Yes, Xuan Yi had reached the level of Principles Master and stayed there for a long time, but he was still killed by the Star Master. With Xuan Yi’s example, the star master might not take him seriously,” the Heaven Ancestor added.","Daoist Xuan God was worried that the news of Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough would alert the star master and speed up his arrival. However, just as the Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven Ancestor had said, the news of Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough would spread sooner or later.","Moreover, because of Xuan Yi’s example, Devil Cloud Star Master thought that he could still kill Xuan Yi who had been in the Principles Master for a long time, therefore, even if Jian Wushuang was allowed to stay in the Principles Master Realm for a period of time, as long as his original body made a move, he could still kill Jian Wushuang easily and would not take it seriously.","Hearing their words, Daoist Xuan God frowned and did not say anything more.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s divine power had clearly begun to transform. A terrifying divine power swept out from where he was, covering the entire Star Palace in an instant.","This divine power was too strong!","It had completely exceeded the scope of Principles Masters, and it was still improving crazily.","Within the Star Palace, other than the three Rulers, there were still quite a few Principles Masters present. When that divine might completely filled the area, these Principles Masters instantly became extremely terrified. Some of the weaker ones...their legs even began to go weak, and they almost knelt down.","Divine might was unrivalled!","This divine might suppressed everything in the surroundings, causing all the Principles Masters within the Star Palace to tremble in fear.","This sort of fear was as if they were facing a powerful Ruler alone, and that Ruler was unleashing all of his divine might to suppress them.","They were indescribably terrified!","Most importantly, this divine might was still increasing at a terrifying speed.","“Too terrifying, this divine might is too terrifying!”","“Who is it? Who is emitting this divine might? How can it be so terrifying! !”","“Blood Sword Master is Blood Sword Master! The commotion was caused by him, so he must be the one who released the divine power. It’s obvious that he has made a breakthrough!”","“A breakthrough? To become a Ruler?”","The Principles Masters in Star Palace were all shocked. They were both envious and terrified of Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough.","Blood Sword Master had been recognized as the strongest Principles Master before he made the breakthrough. Now that he had become a Ruler, how strong would he be?","They could feel it just by looking at the divine power in front of them.","The divine power emanating from Jian Wushuang was obviously not something an ordinary Ruler could have.","“This divine power is really scary.”","The three Rulers stood in the void of the Star Palace and felt the divine power from up close. Their expressions were quite interesting.","“It’s indeed terrifying. It’s much more powerful than an ordinary Ruler. When I broke through from Principles Master to Ruler, the Divine Power I released was probably not even one-third as strong as his,” the Heaven Ancestor said.","“You are nothing more than the most ordinary Ruler of this universe. How can you compare yourself to a freak at the level of a perfect being?” Daoist Xuan God laughed, “The special lifeforms of this universe are all extraordinary creatures to begin with. They are far more powerful than ordinary cultivators, especially when it comes to divine power. They have a tremendous advantage, while perfect lifeforms are even more heaven-defying.”","“I’ve seen mystic one make a breakthrough before, and the commotion was just as terrifying. He only broke through to become a Principles Master, but the commotion of his breakthrough and the godly power he released were much greater than many Rulers who had just broken through. And this little guy is naturally no weaker than mystic one. In fact, from what I can see, the godly power he is displaying now is even stronger than mystic one’s. This proves that his potential is definitely greater than mystic one’s!”"]},{"number":3620,"title":"Chapter 3620 - Triple!","paragraphs":["Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and Heaven Ancestor were chatting and laughing.","On the other side, Jian Wushuang’s transformation of divine power was coming to an end. The overwhelming divine power that had filled the entire Star Palace was finally beginning to fade away.","In the secret chamber, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes.","The moment he opened them, he clenched his hands tightly and instantly felt a terrifying power that could easily crush stars.","This power was much stronger than his previous Saint level.","“It’s just as I guessed. At the Immortal Saint Realm, my divine power is no less than that of an ordinary Principles Master, or even stronger than an ordinary Principles Master. Now that I’ve broken through to the Principles Master Realm, my divine power is comparable to a Ruler!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a hint of surprise.","The innate advantage of a perfect life-level cultivator was simply too great.","And this innate advantage was first reflected in the power of divine power.","He had only just broken through to become a Principles Master, but his divine power was already comparable to a Ruler. Of course, this also had a few functions of the power of will. After he broke through, the power of will he had grasped...it had also undergone a qualitative transformation and had reached a new level.","Moreover, this was only the basic power of divine power.","“Life divine power...”","With a thought, Jian Wushuang activated the life divine power.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang felt that his strength had increased by a large margin, almost by 40%.","“It has improved so much all of a sudden?” Jian Wushuang was immediately delighted.","He had obtained the life divine power from Blood Wave. It was a secret skill from the Life Palace, which was specially for special life forms to cultivate, to a large extent, it could allow special life forms to exert their innate advantages.","However, the effect of this secret skill had a lot to do with the realm of the cultivator.","Previously, Jian Wushuang was only at the level of the Immortal Saint. After using this secret skill, the increase in power was equivalent to an additional portion of the power of the will.","Now that he had reached the level of Principles Master, his divine power was comparable to that of a Ruler. When he used the life divine power, his power was increased by another 40%!","Don’t underestimate this 40% power. This was the power of a Ruler. Just an additional 10% was enough to have a great impact on a big battle. 40%..’ Search / ‘ .this meant that if he encountered a primary Ruler in the future, he could definitely crush his opponent in the power of divine power.","“Although senior Blood Wave gave me the life divine power, this life divine power is only the first level. There is still a limit to the advantages I can bring out. If I can learn the complete life divine power one day, it will be even more helpful to me.” Jian Wushuang sighed.","He knew very well that he could only exert 10% of his innate advantage by using the first stage of the life divine power. However, he had heard from Blood Wave that the creator of the life divine power had cultivated the life divine power to the peak, he could exert more than 10% of his innate advantage.","Unfortunately, he did not have the complete life divine power.","In addition to the life magic power, Jian Wushuang had another trump card, which was the heaven-cleaving skill.","“Now that I have broken through to become a Principles Master, my realm is no weaker than that of my master at his peak. Logically speaking, I should be able to exert the strongest power of the heaven-cleaving skill. I wonder how much the heaven-cleaving skill can improve my strength?” Jian Wushuang had a trace of expectation in his heart.","The heaven-cleaving skill was the most powerful skill created by his master.","Most importantly, this skill was very unique. When Jian Wushuang used it, even Blood Wave was shocked by it.","At that time, Blood Wave said that if he could use all the power of his heaven-cleaving skill, he would be able to use 30% of his innate advantage!","After all, the life divine power he was cultivating now could increase his own power by 40%, but this 40% was only 10% of his innate advantage.","If he could use 10% of his innate advantage, he would be able to use 40% more of his divine power. As for the 30% innate advantage...","“Let’s give it a try.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a sharp light. He waved his right hand and immediately used the heaven-cleaving skill.","The moment he used the heaven-cleaving skill, the power in his hand suddenly increased.","Boom!","A low sonic boom was heard in the void. The void in front of him was almost shattered by him.","“This power...” Jian Wushuang widened his eyes.","He could clearly feel the sudden increase in power when he used the heaven-cleaving skill.","The power had more than doubled!","“The 30% innate advantage didn’t disappoint me.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, a hint of surprise on his face. Then he tried again.","He wanted to fully understand the level of power he had reached after using the life divine power and heaven-cleaving skill.","After trying again and again, he soon figured it out.","“My current power is equivalent to that of an ordinary Ruler, maybe a little stronger than an ordinary primary Ruler. When I use the life divine power, my power will increase by 40%, which is equivalent to 140% of my power. But once I use the heaven-cleaving skill, my power will more than double. If I count all of them, I estimate that my power will be 280% or 290%!” Jian Wushuang muttered.","280% , or even 290%?","This was almost three times the power of an ordinary primary Ruler.","“Three times the power of a primary Ruler. If I only talk about power, I’m afraid I can compete with an ordinary advanced Ruler.” Jian Wushuang exclaimed.","He had to admit that the life divine power and the heaven-cleaving skill had given him a great surprise, especially the heaven-cleaving skill.","One had to know that he had already activated the origin of the Sword Dao universe and had already created a seventh-tier high-grade ultimate art. Combined with the power that was comparable to that of a high-grade Ruler, his battle prowess would be able to reach the level of a high-grade Ruler in a short period of time, even if he couldn’t completely compare to a high-grade Ruler, he would at least be very close.","As for a high-grade Ruler, one had to know that even in this territory, there were very, very few of them. Daoist Xuan God, the Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor were all just low-grade Rulers. In the Divine Beginning Realm, after Xuan Yi had fallen...it seemed that only the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master had the battle strength of a senior Ruler.","However, now that he had broken through to Principles Master, his battle strength had risen to the level of a senior Ruler, which surprised Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3621,"title":"Chapter 3621 - Blood Sword Ruler?","paragraphs":["After a long while, Jian Wushuang calmed himself down.","Then he stood up and walked out of the secret chamber.","At this moment, Star Palace was no longer as quiet as it used to be. On the contrary, it was very lively.","There were hundreds of experts under Star Palace. Although most of them had gone to the three battlefields to explore, there were still nearly 80 who stayed in Star Palace. These nearly 80 Principles Masters were alarmed at this moment, all of them gathered in the void in front of Jian Wushuang’s courtyard.","Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and Heaven Ancestor were also standing there.","As Jian Wushuang walked out of his residence, the surrounding heated gazes instantly shot toward him.","At the same time, the nearly 80 Principles Masters also bowed down one after another.","“We pay our respects to the Blood Sword Ruler!”","His voice reverberated throughout the entire Star Palace.","“Ruler?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows, but his expression was rather strange.","At this moment, his divine power had already been restrained, and there was not a trace of divine power or aura spreading out. With the naked eyes of these Principles Masters, they could not see that Jian Wushuang had accumulated any power at all, however, when the Principles Masters thought of the enormous divine power and movement just now, they had already determined that Jian Wushuang had broken through to the Ruler Realm.","Therefore, as soon as Jian Wushuang came out, they immediately kowtowed.","However, in reality, Jian Wushuang had not reached the Ruler Realm.","“Haha, Blood Sword Ruler, congratulations.”","Hearty laughter rang out. Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and Heaven Ancestor also came to Jian Wushuang, and all three of them smiled.","“Seniors, even you...” Jian Wushuang did not know whether to laugh or cry.","He was not a Ruler. Although the Principles Masters could not see it, the three Rulers could see it at a glance.","However, the three of them clearly saw it, but they did not point it out. Instead, they addressed him as a Ruler.","“It’s not convenient to say so much here. Let’s go to my space,” Heaven Ancestor said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded and then followed the three of them to the space.","While they were leaving, Daoist Xuan God gave an order. “Don’t mention what happened today to anyone else. Otherwise, you will be severely punished!”","This order made the Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven Ancestor feel very strange.","Because the three of them had said that since so many people had seen Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough, it was impossible to stop the transmission of the news. But knowing this...Daoist Xuan God still gave such an order...","In that special space, in the beautiful manor.","“Haha, little guy, you’ve finally broken through to Principles Master.” Daoist Xuan God laughed very happily.","“Xuan God, pay attention to how you address him. Jian Wushuang has already broken through to Principles Master. If nothing goes wrong, his strength should be comparable to that of a Ruler. His strength is already on par with ours. You can’t call him little guy anymore,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Yes, yes, I was slow. Please don’t take offense, Heavenly Sword Marquis,” Daoist Xuan God apologized on purpose.","Jian Wushuang did not know whether to laugh or cry, “Seniors, although you have already broken through, you are indeed just a little guy in front of the three of you. You can call me that. It doesn’t matter. Besides, the three of you are from the same era as my master, so it’s reasonable to call you that even according to seniority.”","“No.” The Temporal Temple Master shook his head. “Although in terms of age, we are indeed much older than you. However, from ancient times until now, cultivators have always depended on their strength, not on who is older. Your current strength is no weaker than ours, so naturally, you will communicate with us as equals. This is a rule among cultivators, and you can not go against it.”","“Yes, my dear Heavenly Sword Marquis, just listen to us. As for your master, you don’t have to pay attention to him. He has already fallen. Even if he is still alive, I dare say that he will let you communicate with me as equals,” the Heaven Ancestor said.","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly, but he did not refuse again. “In that case, I have offended the Black God, Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor!”","“Haha, that’s more like it.” Xuan God immediately laughed.","“My young friend, although you’ve just made a breakthrough, you should have some understanding of your current strength, right?” Temporal Temple Master looked over.","“I do have some understanding. I’m certainly not inferior to an ordinary primary Ruler in terms of battle strength. As for what will happen when I encounter an advanced Ruler, I’m not sure,” Jian Wushuang said.","He was already very humble.","He knew very well that with his full strength, the power of a primary Ruler was three times stronger than that of a primary Ruler. In addition, he had created an advanced level seven secret skill. Even if he encountered an advanced Ruler, he would still be able to fight against an ordinary primary Ruler, he would definitely be able to crush them.","After hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the eyes of the three Rulers lit up, Daoist Xuan God added, “Since you can’t make an accurate judgment, let us help you. Heaven Ancestor, it’s better for you to fight with this little guy.”.","“I have no objection.” The Heaven Ancestor nodded.","“In that case, please enlighten me, Heaven Ancestor.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","In this space-time, Jian Wushuang and the Heaven Ancestor fought again.","The last time they fought, Jian Wushuang was just testing the strength of his divine body, so he did not dodge the attack of the Heaven Ancestor. Instead, he used his divine body to receive it.","But in this battle, the two of them were going to fight head-on. Although in this space-time, their strength was limited, so they might not be able to completely let go of their hands and feet, but in some simple exchanges, was enough for them to have a certain understanding of each other’s strength.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","A series of terrifying explosions could be heard in this space-time.","Jian Wushuang and the Heaven Ancestor were fighting madly in this space-time. Every time they collided, the space-time would tremble violently as if it could not withstand the power of the two. In the end...the space-time was even on the verge of collapse.","Soon, an hour passed, and the space-time was on the verge of collapse. At this time, Jian Wushuang and the Heaven Ancestor finally stopped.","The two put away their magic weapons and stood together. Daoist Xuan God and Temporal Temple Master, who had been watching the battle, also walked over.","However, at this moment, Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor, who had been fighting Jian Wushuang, all had strange expressions on their faces.","“My dear Heavenly Sword Marquis, you didn’t use your full strength just now, did you?” The Heaven Ancestor looked at Jian Wushuang seriously.","“Well...” Jian Wushuang just laughed dryly.","“I knew it.” The Heaven Ancestor sighed heavily, “I could tell from your calm and composed look when you fought with me that you didn’t use your full strength, but even so, you still completely suppressed me.”"]},{"number":3622,"title":"Chapter 3622 - Trouble","paragraphs":["“He really didn’t use his full strength.” Daoist Xuan God and Temporal Temple Master nodded to themselves.","They had clearly seen the battle just now.","Apart from some of his trump cards and life-saving methods, the Heaven Ancestor had indeed used all of his strength.","But what about Jian Wushuang?","From the beginning to the end, he had been very casual and relaxed. No matter what kind of attack the Heaven Ancestor used, he could easily resolve it. Even if he used his swordsmanship casually, it would still be extremely terrifying.","It was so relaxed and comfortable that it was obvious that he had not used all of his strength. Even so, the battle in the last hour had been one-sided. The Heaven Ancestor had been completely suppressed by Jian Wushuang.","“It seems that your strength is much stronger than we thought after you broke through to Principles Master,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“That’s normal. During the years I was trapped, my cultivation of sword principle had improved greatly. I have created advanced level seven absolute arts. As for elementary level seven absolute arts, I have created many of them. Now that I have made a breakthrough, my strength is no weaker than that of an ordinary Ruler. With the advantage of the absolute arts, I can indeed gain the upper hand when fighting with an ordinary elementary Ruler. Of course, the Heaven Ancestor must have held back a little,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Don’t hold back for me. I know very well whether you have held back or not.” The Heaven Ancestor curled his lips.","Jian Wushuang could only smile.","“Not bad. To have such strength right after breaking through is already much stronger than we expected. If you can get a suitable supreme treasure divine weapon, your strength should be even stronger,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Xuan God, is there any result for the Supreme Treasure Divine Sword?” Jian Wushuang immediately looked at Daoist Xuan God.","Before he went into seclusion, Daoist Xuan God had told him that he would find a way to get a supreme treasure divine sword for him. Now that 3,000 years had passed, there should be a result.","“That divine sword is a bit troublesome.” Daoist Xuan God frowned.","“Troublesome?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“My young friend, I told you before that the most powerful supreme treasure, the Divine Sword, is in the hands of an extremely powerful Ruler, who is also the leader of a major force.” Daoist Xuan God said seriously, “Originally, I had prepared sufficient resources. Not to say that I could completely impress him, but using these things I prepared to exchange for the most powerful supreme treasure, which he doesn’t need at all, he should have definitely made a profit. The possibility of him agreeing should be very high, but the result was completely beyond my expectations.”","“Did he refuse?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It would be easy if he refused on the spot. Since he refused so decisively, it means that the supreme true treasure divine sword is not useless to him. On the contrary, he may value it more. For example, if an expert who specializes in sword principle breaks through to become a Ruler, he can leave the divine sword to him. But the key point is that he did not refuse directly at the beginning.”","He paused for a moment, Daoist Xuan God continued, “He didn’t reject me directly. Instead, he asked me who I wanted to give the supreme treasure sword to. Since the Ruler had nothing to do with the Sacred Island and had no grudge with my Star Palace, I didn’t think too much about it and said that it was for you. Unexpectedly, the Ruler immediately changed his mind and said that he would never give you the supreme treasure sword.”","“What?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","At first, he did not refuse, but when he heard that Daoist Xuan God would give him the divine sword, he immediately changed his face?","It was obvious that the Ruler had a lot of opinions about him.","“What’s going on, my young friend, apart from Sacred Island, have you offended other Rulers in this territory?” Temporal Temple Master looked at him.","“Well...I don’t know. Although I’ve been in the three battlefields for a while, I haven’t really offended many experts. As for the Rulers, I’ve been in the three battlefields for a long time, but I’ve never met any other Rulers except those from Sacred Island,” Jian Wushuang said.","He was puzzled.","When he was in the three battlefields, he had been very careful and did not offend any experts, let alone the Rulers.","Why did any of the Rulers have such a strong opinion of him?","“Xuan God, what’s going on?” Temporal Temple Master looked at Xuan God.","“I asked and the Ruler told me the reason. It does have something to do with the Heavenly Sword Marquis.” Xuan God took a deep breath, he asked, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, when you were in Devil Smoke Valley, did you have any dealings with the people of the North Sea Palace?”","“The North Sea Palace?” Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","Among all the forces in this territory, the North Sea Palace, which was ranked in the top three, could be said to be an Ruler in this territory.","Jian Wushuang really had dealings with the North Sea Palace.","“Could it be them?” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened, he said, “When I was wandering in Devil Smoke Valley, I met with the Shi Yan Master and the Red Eye Master. The Shi Yan Master and the Red Eye Master worked together to search for prey in the Nine Twists Demon Cave in the depths of Devil Smoke Valley and forcibly seized the treasures in each other’s hands. At that time, they found me.”","“What happened in the end?” Daoist Xuan God asked.","“They were strong, but they were not as skilled as me. I was fine during the encounter, but they suffered a great loss,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Not just a great loss. I heard from the Ruler that you almost killed the Red Eye Master during the encounter,” Daoist Xuan God said strangely.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “If they wanted to kill me, I would fight back with all my strength. If I had the chance to kill one of them, I wouldn’t show any mercy. Red Eye Master underestimated me and was severely taught a lesson. If it weren’t for one of the masters, she would have been dead.”","“That’s it.” Daoist Xuan God shrugged. “The Ruler who has the Supreme Treasure Divine Sword is one of the leaders of the North Sea Palace, Master Sky Roc. He is also the strongest expert in the North Sea Palace. The Red Eye Master who almost died in your hands is one of his direct descendants.”","“Direct descendants?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“My young friend, you might not know this, but the Sky Roc Ruler is an extremely ancient Ruler. He rose to power very early. When he rose to power, his family soared to the sky because of him and became a great Ruler of his Fang Xingjie. He has stood tall and firm for a long time. After so many years, there are many members in his family, and naturally, some of them are extremely talented!”"]},{"number":3623,"title":"Chapter 3623 - Going to the North Sea Palace","paragraphs":["“The Red Eye Master is the most outstanding of the junior disciples of the clan which Sky Roc Ruler belongs to. She is highly regarded by this Sky Roc Ruler. In fact, Sky Roc Ruler once personally guided her for a period of time. In the North Sea Palace, she received far more treatment than many peak six stage experts, and you nearly killed her.” Daoist Xuan God sighed.","“Of course, you didn’t kill the Red Eye Master, and the Red Eye Master provoked you, so the Sky Roc Ruler wouldn’t lower himself to deal with you. However, not dealing with you doesn’t mean that he doesn’t care about it. Therefore, when he found out that I was going to give you the divine sword, he changed his mind.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","The Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven Ancestor were also puzzled.","“What bad luck.” Jian Wushuang could not help sighing, “I have been in the three battlefields for a long time, and the only one who has a grudge with me is the Red Eye Master. I didn’t expect the Red Eye Master to have such a great background. Moreover, the most powerful supreme treasure magic weapon happened to be in the hands of Master Sky Roc.”","Jian Wushuang felt bitter in his heart.","He was indeed unlucky. The only person who had a grudge against him happened to have a close relationship with Master Sky Roc.","“If I had known, I would have just run away when I was forced by Shi Yan Master and Red Eye Master.” Jian Wushuang felt a little regretful.","“There’s no other way. Even in the North Sea Palace, not many people knew about the relationship between Red Eye Master and Master Sky Roc, and the outside world didn’t know about it. They only treated her as an ordinary expert of the North Sea Palace. In the end, that’s all that happened,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“If that’s the case, I’m afraid this supreme true treasure sword is really troublesome.” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened slightly. “How could a person who almost killed his beloved junior disciple be willing to give this sword to me? If it were me, I wouldn’t be willing either.”","“That’s why he sent me away earlier,” Daoist Xuan God said calmly, suddenly, his expression changed. “Although this matter is very troublesome and it’s impossible for him to exchange the Supreme Treasure Divine Sword for ours, there’s still a way to get it.”","“What way?” Jian Wushuang, the Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor immediately looked over.","“I only thought of it after I saw the divine body of the divine marquis, which is comparable to an elementary universe supreme treasure.” The Daoist Xuan God smiled slightly, then he said, “You three should have heard of the Sky Roc Ruler. He is a superior Ruler, and his strength is far stronger than ours. In addition, his North Sea Palace is one of the top three forces in this territory. He must be very arrogant.”","“Arrogant?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“Yes, arrogant. And that’s what we’re going to use.” Daoist Xuan God smiled and explained his plan briefly.","After listening to Daoist Xuan God, Jian Wushuang, Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor all looked very strange.","“This method is really stupid.” Jian Wushuang could not help but say.","“Haha, the method is a little stupid, but it might actually work.” Heaven Ancestor smiled.","“Yes, but you still have to be careful. Don’t go too far. After all, it’s the territory of the North Sea Palace. If you go too far and force the Master Sky Roc into a corner, it’s hard to guarantee that he won’t do anything.” Temporal Temple Master smiled strangely. “By the way, is that why you ordered the experts of Star Palace not to spread the news of the Heavenly Sword Marquis’ breakthrough?”","“Yes.” Daoist Xuan God nodded. “What I said is indeed a little stupid. Moreover, this method can only be used before the news is completely spread. That is to say, when the Sky Roc Ruler believes that the Heavenly Sword Marquis is only a Principles Master, he might be fooled. However, if the news is completely spread and everyone knows that the Sky Roc Ruler has made another breakthrough to become a Ruler, then the Sky Roc Ruler might not be fooled.”","“Although the Heavenly Sword Marquis is still a Principles Master and hasn’t reached the level of a Ruler, he might still be wary of Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough in the Star Palace. That’s why I gave the order!”","“Of course, although I gave the order, I know clearly that it’s impossible for the experts in the Star Palace to carry it out. Therefore, the news will definitely spread. However, it won’t be so brazen, and it won’t spread too fast. That gives us time to complete the task.”","“In other words, we have to go to the North Sea Palace and get the Supreme Treasure Divine Sword before the news spreads to the North Sea Palace?” Temporal Temple Master said in a deep voice.","“That’s right.” Daoist Xuan God nodded.","“The North Sea Palace is one of the top three forces in this territory. They have many universal passageways in this territory. I know one that can help us get to the North Sea Palace as quickly as possible. If nothing goes wrong, we can get there before the news reaches the North Sea Palace,” Daoist Xuan God said.","Jian Wushuang understood what had happened and let out a sigh of relief, he said, “I had planned to return to the Divine Beginning Realm to open the seal and return to my hometown after my breakthrough, but now it seems that I have to put this matter aside and wait until I come back from the North Sea Palace.”","Jian Wushuang felt a little regretful, but he soon looked up again with a fierce gleam in his eyes. “Let’s not delay. Xuan God, Let’s go to the North Sea Palace Now!”","“Okay.”","Daoist Xuan God nodded.","They immediately rushed to the North Sea Palace as fast as they could.","As for the Temporal Temple Master and the Heaven Ancestor...they did not participate in it.","After all, Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God were going for the Supreme Treasure Divine Sword, and their opponent was the North Sea Palace of the Sky Roc Ruler, which had the strength of a top-tier Ruler, moreover, there was not only one Ruler in the North Sea Palace, so they could not force him like when they had obtained the Netherfire Blood Crystal. They could only use their wits.","They had already made a plan, and only Jian Wushuang and Xuan God were needed to complete it.","The North Sea Palace was one of the Rulers of this territory. The Three Palace Masters of the North Sea Palace were all experts at the Ruler Realm, especially the Sky Roc Ruler, who was widely recognized as a top-tier Ruler. Among all the Rulers in this territory, he was definitely one of the strongest Rulers in this territory.","The North Sea Palace was located in the east of this territory, and its base was also on Earth Star. However, the North Sea Palace occupied a total of three Earth Stars, and its scale was not something the Star Palace could compare to."]},{"number":3624,"title":"Chapter 3624 - In the North Sea Palace","paragraphs":["“This is the North Sea Palace? It’s so grand.”","Jian Wushuang stood in the void of the universe and looked at the three triangular-shaped world stars in front of him. The three world stars were connected with each other in a magic formation. Although they were three huge world stars, they looked like a whole.","“After all, he is one of the Rulers of this territory, so of course he is generous,” Daoist Xuan God said, “follow me.”","Daoist Xuan God brought Jian Wushuang to one of the Earth Stars very quickly. However, because of the existence of the magic formation, they could not enter the Earth Star directly.","“I have already sent a message to the people of the North Sea Palace. Someone will come to pick us up soon. My young friend, when we enter the North Sea Palace and meet the Master Yunchen, you must do as I told you on the way. We must cooperate with each other so that we can trick the Master Sky Roc,” Daoist Xuan God warned.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","It did not take long for a figure to walk out from the sector star.","It was a middle-aged man in a white robe with a gentle face. Jian Wushuang recognized him the moment he saw him.","“Master Yunchen, one of the seven experts of the pinnacle of the six realm in the North Sea Palace. He is also the personal disciple of the Master Sky Roc.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","There were not many ultimate experts of the six realms in this territory, but the North Sea Palace had a total of seven. This showed how powerful the North Sea Palace was.","As for Master Yunchen, although Jian Wushuang had never met him, he had read his information.","“Master Xuan God, you are here again.” Master Yunchen bowed slightly to Daoist Xuan God after he arrived. When he raised his head, he looked at Jian Wushuang, and his expression immediately turned cold.","“You are...Blood Sword Master?” Master Yunchen’s voice became low.","Master Yunchen knew that Jian Wushuang had caused such a huge commotion in Devil Smoke Valley and was now recognized as the strongest Principles Master in this territory, he had also seen the mirror image of Jian Wushuang fighting with the five experts of the pinnacle of the six realm. He remembered Jian Wushuang’s appearance, so he recognized him at a glance.","Compared to the mirror image, Master Yunchen’s heart was slightly moved when he saw Jian Wushuang in person.","Although Jian Wushuang had restrained his divine power and he could not sense any aura, just standing there made him feel an extremely dangerous aura. This aura...he had never sensed it from other Principles Masters.","“It’s said that Blood Sword Master is the strongest Principles Master in this territory. I had some doubts before, but now it seems that he is indeed the strongest,” Master Yunchen muttered to himself.","After all, he was also an expert at the pinnacle of the six realm. Among the many experts at the pinnacle of the six realm in this territory, he was also extremely powerful.","However, Jian Wushuang gave him a sense of danger just by standing there and not making a move. Jian Wushuang must be much stronger than him.","“Hello, Master Yunchen.” Jian Wushuang greeted Master Yunchen with a smile.","“I didn’t expect you, Blood Sword Master, to come to the North Sea Palace in person. I’m surprised.” Master Yunchen gave Jian Wushuang a deep look and then waved his hand. “Follow me.”","Master Yunchen immediately led the way.","With the guidance of Master Yunchen, the magic formation of the North Sea Palace did not make things difficult for Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God. They soon entered the North Sea Palace.","When they arrived at the North Sea Palace, many experts of the North Sea Palace immediately noticed the presence of Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God.","“Look, among the two people following Master Yunchen, is the person carrying the divine sword the Blood Sword Master?”","“Yes, it’s him. I’ve seen the battle between him and the five Blood Spirit Kings. It’s exactly the same!”","“It really is the Blood Sword Master. He actually came to our North Sea Palace?”","“The person beside the Blood Sword Master seems to be a Ruler. Could it be the one from Star Palace?”","“It’s him. Not long ago, the Palace Master of Star Palace also came to our North Sea Palace. Last time, he came alone, but this time, he actually brought the Blood Sword Master with him. What are they trying to do?”","The entire North Sea Palace began to discuss.","Because the North Sea Palace had three Earth Stars, Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God only appeared on one of them. However, the experts of the North Sea Palace did not see them on the other two Earth Stars, the two Earth Stars were still very calm.","On one of the Earth Stars stood a huge Golden Tower.","This Golden Tower had a total of thirty-three floors and was extremely majestic. This tower was extremely famous in the North Sea Palace and was one of the most important cultivation resources in the North Sea Palace. There was only one use for this Golden Tower...and that was to temper the strength of one’s soul.","It was precisely because of this that experts from the North Sea Palace would often wander around the Golden Tower, making their souls stronger and more resilient.","At that moment, on the thirtieth floor of the Golden Tower, there was a beautiful woman wearing a purplish-red robe. Her eyes were strangely red, which meant that the Red Eye Master was sitting there cross-legged, she allowed the surrounding waves of soul power to madly charge at her. She forced her eyes to clench their teeth and forcefully endure the soul power.","What she was good at was the soul, and the soul attack from the Golden Tower was a form of cultivation for her. It could make her soul stronger faster.","At this moment...","“Red Eye, Red Eye!”","A communication token in her interspatial ring started to vibrate crazily.","Red Eye Master opened her eyes and took out her communication token. She replied, “Shi Yan, what’s wrong?”","“Are you still training your soul power?” On the other end of the token, Shi Yan Master’s voice sounded urgent.","“Yes.” Red Eye Master was puzzled.","She and Shi Yan Master had quite a good relationship. Previously, the two of them had been adventuring in the depths of Devil Smoke Valley together, and they had even worked together to snatch treasures from various experts. However, it had not been long before the two of them had returned to the North Sea Palace, all these years, she had been training her soul power. As for Shi Yan Master, she had also stopped adventuring and remained in the North Sea Palace.","“Stop training. Quick, come to this Earth Star of mine and become the Ruler of this place,” Shi Yan Master said hurriedly.","“What’s going on?” Red Eye Master was even more puzzled.","“It’s Blood Sword Master,” Shi Yan Master said suddenly.","Upon hearing this name, Red Eye Master was instantly stunned, and her gaze instantly turned cold.","Blood Sword Master...this name had always been engraved in her heart force. She had never forgotten it.","Back in Devil Smoke Valley, she had nearly died at the hands of this Blood Sword Master!"]},{"number":3625,"title":"Chapter 3625 - Sky Roc Ruler","paragraphs":["“What’s wrong with Blood Sword Master?” Red Eye Master asked in a low voice.","“He’s here. He came to our North Sea Palace personally. He’s on this Earth Star. It seems he’s here to look for the Ruler.” Shi Yan Master said.","“What did you say?” Red Eye Master was furious!","Furious, furious to the extreme!","One had to know that she, Red Eye Master, was born very high. Her family was the Ruler of the astral world, and the person in power behind her was the strongest person in the North Sea Palace, Ruler Sky Roc. It could be said that her background was extraordinary, and her talent was also extremely high, she had not been born for too long, but she had already reached the level of a sixth grade Principles Master. Furthermore, she had extremely high attainments in the aspect of the soul. Even Ruler Sky Roc doted on her very much.","It was also because of this that she had rarely encountered any major setbacks or trouble along the way. As for the dangerous ones, she had encountered them before, but there had never been a time when she had been so close to death, after all, many of the upper echelons of the North Sea Palace had held her in their hands.","But that time in Devil Smoke Valley...","That time, the Red Eye Master had encountered this Blood Sword Master.","At that time, Blood Sword Master was only a well-known Principles Master. Although she had some strength, it was nothing in Red Eye Master’s eyes, not to mention that she had a Shi Yan Master by her side.","Therefore, when they met Jian Wushuang in the Nine Twists Demon Cave, they thought they were going to take him down.","However, she did not expect that Jian Wushuang, whom she did not care about, had shown his terrifying strength and skills. Most importantly, his amazing plan had forced her into a desperate situation. That battle...she was lucky. In addition, Shi Yan Master had saved her at the fastest speed possible.","However, if she was a little less lucky or Shi Yan Master had come a little slower, she would have died!","It could be said that it was indeed the closest she had come to death.","That was why she held a grudge against Jian Wushuang. After the incident, she frantically used the power of the North Sea Palace to search for Jian Wushuang, hoping to avenge herself.","However, she did not expect that Jian Wushuang would completely disappear not long after meeting them. Moreover, he had been missing for nearly 100,000 years.","At that time, Red Eye Master thought that Jian Wushuang had died. Therefore, she could only accept the fact and did not continue to pursue the matter. However, who knew that...Jian Wushuang, who had been missing for nearly 100,000 years, suddenly appeared again.","Moreover, he had defeated five experts of the pinnacle of the six realm by himself in an invincible manner among Principles Masters.","The Red Eye Master could not accept such a terrible result at first, but she could not do anything about it.","After that battle, the senior officials of the North Sea Palace had decided to let the matter go as long as Jian Wushuang did not provoke the North Sea Palace.","This made the Red Eye Master even angrier.","But she also knew very well that even the North Sea Palace would not easily provoke a supreme expert who could be called the strongest among the Principles Masters. There was nothing wrong with the decision of the higher-ups of the North Sea Palace. Even her backer, the Sky Roc Ruler, did not stand up for her.","This lets the Red Eye Master also very helpless, also can only put down that matter first.","But who would have thought that she had already decided to let it go and no longer bother with the Blood Sword Master, but the other party did not give up and actually took the initiative to find her in the North Sea Palace, and also to find the Master Sky Roc.","“This Blood Sword Master is really courting death!”","Red Eye Master’s eyes were burning with flames. Without hesitation, she immediately left the Golden Tower and rushed toward the Earth Star where Jian Wushuang was located.","...","On the other side, although many experts of the North Sea Palace were discussing this Earth Star, no one dared to follow Jian Wushuang’s path.","Under the guidance of Master Yunchen, Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God soon arrived at the palace where Master Heaven Roc lived.","It was called a palace, but upon entering it, one would find that it was a vast grassland. On the grassland, there were thousands of fierce beasts, some big and some small, and some strong and some weak, but without exception, they had all been completely tamed. On this prairie, they were like ordinary livestock, actually eating grass.","And on top of one of the tall fierce beasts, a barefooted man wearing a thunder shirt was lazily lying there. In the end, he even had a weed in his mouth.","This barefooted man was the Sky Roc Ruler.","As for the grassland and the tens of thousands of beasts, they were all deliberately created by the Sky Roc Ruler in order to reminisce about the past.","No one knew that the Sky Roc Ruler was actually just a cowherd in the mortal world from the very beginning. It was only because of the drastic changes in his family that he began to grow up step by step. He rose up step by step and experienced a long period of time, only now did he become one of the most powerful figures in this region.","“Master, Master Black God has arrived.” Someone stood there in the air above him, then bowed respectfully toward Sky Roc Ruler, who was seated atop the savage beast.","“Sky Roc Ruler.” Daoist Xuan God bowed slightly as well.","Although they were both Rulers, there was a massive difference in power between them. When faced with Sky Roc Ruler, Daoist Xuan God truly had to show a hint of humility and even reverence.","“Xuan God, you’re here again. And this time, you even brought the little guy here. It seems that you still don’t want to give up.” The Sky Roc Ruler remained motionless on the Beast and did not look at Daoist Xuan God.","Daoist Xuan God smiled slightly and then gave Jian Wushuang a look.","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and bowed. “Blood Sword greets the Sky Roc Ruler.”","“Little guy, I know you. You defeated five experts of the pinnacle of the six realm by yourself. Now everyone in this territory says that you are the number one Principles Master. No Principles Master in the North Sea Palace is as strong as you.” Master Sky Roc’s voice sounded slowly, “But you are too bold. How dare you come to the North Sea Palace in person? Aren’t you afraid that I will kill you?”","“You must be joking, Ruler. I don’t have any deep enmity with the North Sea Palace. If that’s the case, why wouldn’t I dare to come?” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Oh, really?” The Sky Roc Ruler finally raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang with his dark eyes.","It seemed that he was going to see through Jian Wushuang completely.","However, Jian Wushuang was no longer the same as before. He still stood there calmly in the face of Master Sky Roc’s gaze.","At this moment...","“Blood Sword Master, how dare you!”","A fierce shout suddenly sounded in the void."]},{"number":3626,"title":"Chapter 3626 - Narrow-Minded","paragraphs":["This voice was filled with monstrous fury. With a flash, the Red Eye Master appeared beside Sky Roc Ruler, accompanied by the Shi Yan Master.","“Clan Master.”","“Ruler.”","Both the Red Eye Master and the Shi Yan Master bowed respectfully to Sky Roc Ruler.","The Red Eye Master was a descendant of the Sky Roc Ruler’s clan, so he had always addressed the Sky Roc Ruler as the Clan Master.","“Yes.” The Sky Roc Ruler only nodded slightly.","The Red Eye Master’s eyes flashed and instantly fixed on Jian Wushuang. “Blood Sword Master, how dare you come to the North Sea Palace!”","“I don’t have any life-and-death feud with the North Sea Palace, so why wouldn’t I dare?” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Hmph, no feud? Don’t forget that you almost killed me in the Nine Twists Demon Cave. Isn’t this still a feud?” The Red Eye Master snorted.","“Red Eye Master, it was you and the Shi Yan Master who came to me first in the Nine Twists Demon Cave. It was you two who wanted to kill me first. I was just fighting back normally. Do you think that if you two want to kill me, I can only let you kill me without any resistance?","“If that’s the case, then your North Sea Palace is too overbearing,” Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice.","“You really know how to quibble.” Red Eye Master smiled coldly and then looked at Master Sky Roc. “Master, Blood Sword Master almost killed me in the Nine Twists Demon Cave. If Shi Yan Master hadn’t arrived in time, I would have died!”","“I didn’t want to bring it up again, but I didn’t expect Blood Sword Master to come to the North Sea Palace. This is too much. If I don’t punish him severely, people will think that the North Sea Palace is easy to bully. So, please help me, master!”","Red Eye Master knelt down and said in a loud voice.","Master Sky Roc’s face darkened slightly. He glanced at Jian Wushuang and asked, “Blood Sword Master, why did you come here today?”","“Master Sky Roc, to tell you the truth, I came here today to apologize,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Apologize?” Master Sky Roc was surprised.","Red Eye Master looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","Jian Wushuang smiled, he said, “I know that there was some unhappiness between Red Eye Master and Shi Yan Master. Although it was Red Eye Master and Shi Yan Master who provoked me, in the end, it was Red Eye Master who suffered a loss. However, I didn’t know about the relationship between Red Eye Master and Master Sky Roc. Now that I know, I have to apologize.”","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Red Eye Master snorted and said, “You’re smart.”","Master Sky Roc also nodded slightly. “Since you didn’t know about it before, and it didn’t cause too much of a consequence, and now you’ve taken the initiative to apologize, then this matter is completely understood. From now on, the North Sea Palace will not mention it again.”","“Thank you, Master Sky Roc.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Haha, it seems that the misunderstanding has been resolved.” Daoist Xuan God’s laughter rang out at this moment. “Master Sky Roc, since this matter has been completely settled, then what I told you before...”","Master Sky Roc’s expression suddenly turned cold. “Xuan God, I guessed that you must have come because of the previous matter.”","Daoist Xuan God laughed awkwardly.","“Hmph, you’re right. The matter between the bloodsword Ruler and red eye has indeed been put behind us, but that doesn’t mean that it hasn’t happened before. Do you think that just because you dragged the bloodsword Ruler over to my North Sea Palace to apologize and give me a way out, I’ll agree to that?”","“Hmph!” Sky Roc Ruler let out a cold snort.","“Let me tell you this. Although your Star Palace and my North Sea Palace weren’t enemies, we definitely weren’t on very good terms. As for what you said just now, don’t even think about it.”","Upon hearing Sky Roc Ruler’s words, Daoist Xuan God’s face instantly changed. “Sky Roc Ruler, do you really not have any leeway at all?”","“Not at all.” The Sky Roc Ruler waved his hand decisively.","It was obvious that he had already made up his mind. He would never give the Supreme Treasure Divine Sword to Daoist Xuan God.","Even if Daoist Xuan God brought Jian Wushuang here to apologize and put the matter of the red eye behind him, he would not agree.","Daoist Xuan God’s expression turned somewhat ugly when he saw the Sky Roc Ruler’s spear-shadow attitude. At this moment, Jian Wushuang, who was beside him, ‘exploded’.","“Humph, Palace Master, did you see that?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. “I’ve said before that even if I take the initiative to apologize and lower myself, they will never agree to that. After all, this is the North Sea Palace, one of the top forces in this territory. The Sky Roc Ruler is one of the top three Rulers in this territory. Such a Ruler is very arrogant. He won’t take our sincerity seriously...”","Before Jian Wushuang could finish his sentence.","“Blood Sword, don’t talk nonsense,” Daoist Xuan God immediately interrupted him.","“What? Did I say something wrong?","“Since I’ve offended the North Sea Palace, it doesn’t matter if I’m here to apologize or what I’ve done. The North Sea Palace will hold a grudge against me. As for the Sky Roc Ruler, he may be very strong, but he’s still arrogant and self-righteous. He’s as narrow-minded as the average superior,” Jian Wushuang sneered, there was even a hint of disdain in his eyes.","Not only Daoist Xuan God, but the other Principles Masters of the North Sea Palace were also shocked.","“Blood Sword Master, how dare you!” Red Eye Master was completely enraged. She carefully glanced at Ruler Sky Roc from the corner of her eyes.","As expected, Ruler Sky Roc’s face turned completely gloomy.","“Boy, what did you say just now?” Master Sky Roc stared at Jian Wushuang with a cold gaze. A terrifying aura was slowly gathering on his body.","“Master Sky Roc, I’m sorry. This little guy has only cultivated for a short time and acted too rashly. He offended you and the North Sea Palace with his words. I’m here to apologize. I hope you don’t mind.” Daoist Xuan God immediately apologized.","However, Jian Wushuang was even more unhappy. “Palace Master, Why are you apologizing? I’ve already said that Master Sky Roc is arrogant. As long as you offend him, it’s useless no matter what you do afterward. Moreover, he’s a narrow-minded villain, but on the surface, he looks like a sanctimonious person. What a joke.”","“Shut up, don’t mess around!” Daoist Xuan God was completely anxious.","The Ruler’s gaze became completely cold and emotionless as well.","The nearby Red Eye Master was frightened by this gaze."]},{"number":3627,"title":"Chapter 3627 - Giving You a Chance","paragraphs":["“I’ve never seen such a terrifying gaze from the clan leader.” Red Eye Master was alarmed.","Beside him, Master Yunchen and Shi Yan Master were also throbbing their throats.","“Is this Blood Sword Master courting death? How dare he say such words? Does he not know who he is facing?” Shi Yan Master was secretly amazed.","What kind of figure was the Sky Roc Ruler?","He was a supreme Ruler, an almost invincible existence in this territory.","Such a figure was absolutely high and aloof in this territory.","As for Jian Wushuang? He was just a Principles Master.","Although he was publicly recognized as the strongest Principles Master, he was still a Principles Master. In front of the Sky Roc Ruler, he was still a little guy.","However, this little guy actually pointed at the Sky Roc Ruler’s nose and called him a narrow-minded person in the North Sea Palace. In front of his disciples and juniors, was he not courting death?","Everyone present thought that Jian Wushuang was crazy. They looked at him as if he was a fool.","However, Jian Wushuang did not pay attention to them, he continued, “Master Sky Roc, I know that you are high and mighty, but because of that, you can’t help the Red Eye Master because of your status. Tsk, tsk, this is really embarrassing.”","“Boy, have you said enough?” Master Sky Roc finally spoke. His voice was as cold as ice.","The surrounding air had also been completely frozen, and a faint killing intent had surrounded the space.","“What, do you want to fight?” Jian Wushuang smiled. “If you want to fight, then don’t hold back. Just fight. Let me see what you are capable of, the high and mighty Sky Roc Ruler.”","At this point, a normal person would have already attacked, but Master Sky Roc did not. He narrowed his eyes and stared at Jian Wushuang. He wanted to see through Jian Wushuang, but no matter how he looked at him...he could not figure out what was going on.","“Why aren’t you fighting? I gave you a chance. Are you afraid that if you kill me here, the experts will laugh at you and bully me in your own territory?” Jian Wushuang laughed heartily, “If you’re really afraid, let’s make a bet!”","“You can kill me within 10 breaths. If I die in your hands within 10 breaths, then I deserve it. My Palace Master will not complain about the North Sea Palace, and he will come out and explain to the outside world that I offended you and was killed by you. You don’t have to worry about being called a bully!”","“But if I don’t die in ten breaths, I want what I want. What do you think?”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang looked at the Sky Roc Ruler.","But after hearing him, the Sky Roc Ruler’s expression and eyes became calm.","“That thing?” The Sky Roc Ruler smiled faintly. “Sure enough, you’ve said so much, but your ultimate goal is still that thing.”","Jian Wushuang was stunned, and Daoist Xuan God’s heart sank.","The process of meeting the Sky Roc Ruler in the North Sea Palace was discussed by Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God. Their goal was to obtain the Supreme True Treasure Divine Sword of the Sky Roc Ruler.","However, the problem was that the Sky Roc Ruler was an ancient Ruler who had lived for God knows how many years. It was not easy for them to scheme against such a Ruler.","As expected, Master Sky Roc saw through their real purpose at a glance.","“Haha, I admit that my ultimate goal is to get the thing in your hand. But at the same time, Master Sky Roc, do you dare to say that you don’t want to kill me at all?” Jian Wushuang smiled coldly. “I can clearly feel the killing intent that filled this space and time just now. Even now, the killing intent hasn’t completely disappeared.”","“Indeed. Before I met you, I did not have any killing intent toward you. However, I do now.” The Sky Roc Ruler coldly said.","His killing intent had indeed risen.","After all, he was an incomparably aloof Ruler. Over the many years, no one had ever dared to speak to him in such a manner. Moreover, they had even pointed at his nose and scolded him. Even an ordinary person would not be able to endure this, much less him.","In the face of such humiliation, it would be a joke if he did not make a move.","Although he knew that Jian Wushuang was deliberately luring him to make a move, Jian Wushuang’s plan was bound to succeed.","“Boy, just as you said, ten breaths is too long. As a mere Principles Master, no matter how strong you are among Principles Masters, one breath is enough for me to kill you,” said the Sky Roc Ruler.","“One breath? Then I’ll let you do it, Master Sky Roc.” Jian Wushuang smiled happily.","Not only Jian Wushuang, but Daoist Xuan God, who was behind him, looked anxious, but he was also very happy.","Others did not know Jian Wushuang’s real strength, but he knew it very well.","He already had the strength of a Ruler, and he had a divine body that was comparable to an elementary universe supreme treasure and boundless divine power. Such a means and ability...even if Master Sky Roc was given four or four hours...he would not be able to kill Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang had said that he would give the Sky Roc Ruler a chance to kill him in ten breaths. He did not expect the Sky Roc Ruler to say that he would only take one breath?","One breath could only kill Jian Wushuang?","Even if the Devil Cloud Star Master came personally, he might not be able to do so.","However, the Sky Roc Ruler clearly did not know this. Just as Daoist Xuan God had said, he was indeed a supreme figure. Such a supreme figure would be somewhat arrogant or conceited, the Sky Roc Ruler had such arrogance.","He was a Ruler and a superior Ruler. Although Jian Wushuang had restrained his divine power, he could tell at a glance that Jian Wushuang was still at the level of a Principles Master. Since he was only a Principles Master, he could kill him in a breath’s time, of course, he could kill him easily.","Soon, the Sky Roc Ruler made his move.","Rumble!","As the Sky Roc Ruler slowly raised his hand, the world instantly shook, and a world-shaking power instantly gathered in his palm.","The sky collapsed, and the earth shook wildly.","The thousands of fierce beasts on the grassland began to run for their lives.","This was the Sky Roc Ruler. The power formed with just a thought completely exceeded the limits of this special space-time.","Boom!","Suddenly, the Sky Roc Ruler’s finger descended."]},{"number":3628,"title":"Chapter 3628 - One Breath","paragraphs":["Space-time was completely crushed.","Endless power was pressing toward Jian Wushuang, making him secretly shocked.","Although he knew that the Sky Roc Ruler was a superior Ruler and would be very powerful, when the Sky Roc Ruler really attacked, he was still shocked. Just the finger in front of him...gave him a feeling that he could not resist it at all.","If he fought it head-on, this finger could easily crush him.","However, Jian Wushuang knew that this finger was not the strongest strength of the Sky Roc Ruler.","Jian Wushuang struck out with his sword.","He slashed out with his sword and instantly activated the origin of the sword principle universe. However, in terms of power...Jian Wushuang only used less than 10% of the power of his sword.","Although it was only 10%, it was still much stronger than an ordinary Principles Master. In addition to the Ruler Realm secret skill, Jian Wushuang displayed the most powerful battle strength of the Principles Master that everyone recognized before he made a breakthrough.","Of course, he did this on purpose.","Bang!","The finger directly collided with the longsword in Jian Wushuang’s hand. Almost in an instant, Jian Wushuang’s sword momentum collapsed and the longsword in his hand almost flew out. However, the finger of the Sky Roc Ruler continued to attack, finally, it landed on his divine body.","A terrifying power suddenly exploded on Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","Jian Wushuang let out a muffled groan and shot backward like a meteor. Until the very edge of the space-time, he smashed into the space-time barrier, which cracked.","Seeing this, the Red Eye Master, who was standing in the void, sneered, “Blood Sword Master is overestimating himself. He thinks he has some strength and is invincible among Principles Masters, so he can challenge a Ruler. What a joke. The gap between a Ruler and a Principles Master is not so easy to make up for. Moreover, he chose the clan master, the strongest superior Ruler in this territory!”","“Red Eye, I don’t think it’s that simple.” Shi Yan Master suddenly said, “Look at Blood Sword Master. He’s still alive.”","“Huh?” Red Eye Master immediately looked over. Sure enough, Jian Wushuang had already stood up.","“You should be proud of yourself for being able to take my finger and not die. But that’s all.” Master Sky Roc’s face was cold. He glanced at Jian Wushuang and then moved, a shocking power gathered in his hand again.","It should be known that Jian Wushuang and Master Sky Roc were limited to one breath.","One breath might be very short for ordinary cultivators, but for super experts like Master Sky Roc, one breath was enough for him to do many things. For example, when he fought with Jian Wushuang now, one breath was enough for him to attack Jian Wushuang at least five times, just now, it was only the first time.","Then, the Master Sky Roc attacked again with more power.","In the face of the Master Sky Roc’s terrifying strength, Jian Wushuang seemed to be vulnerable.","He seemed to be trying his best to resist the Master Sky Roc’s attack, but he was easily defeated by the Master Sky Roc.","In the blink of an eye, the Master Sky Roc had attacked four times, and he had almost used up the time of one breath. He was just a little bit short of time.","Sky Roc Ruler only had one last chance.","Weng!","Time and space started to tremble crazily. A purple glove appeared in Sky Roc Ruler’s hand, and it gave off a suffocating aura.","Supreme universe true treasure!","As a top-tier Ruler, Sky Roc Ruler had a supreme attack true treasure that was suitable for him. However, he had not taken out any of the previous four attacks, but this fifth and final attack was Sky Roc Ruler’s, clearly, he was going all out.","“Star-crushing finger!”","A fierce light flashed in Master Sky Roc’s eyes, and a large amount of blood-colored fog surrounded him. The blood-colored fog gathered crazily and eventually formed a huge blood-colored vortex as Master Sky Roc pointed out.","The blood-colored vortex immediately covered Jian Wushuang.","For a moment, the world changed color.","The surrounding spectators, even someone as powerful as Daoist Xuan God, had a drastic change in expression when they saw the blood-red vortex.","As for the Principles Masters, their hearts trembled.","“This power...master, you used your full strength!” Red Eye Master exclaimed.","“A top-tier tier-7 ultimate skill. This is the strongest continuation created by master. 200 million years ago, in the depths of Crimson Rock Mountain, when Master was fighting for a supreme treasure with a top-tier Ruler, I saw the Ruler use it. In order to kill Blood Sword Master, master actually used his strongest ultimate skill?” Master Yunchen was also shocked.","The most powerful skill created by Master Sky Roc was not something that could be used easily. Normally, he would only use it when he was facing an opponent that was on par with him. But now, he had used it.","Perhaps it was because the previous four attacks were not fatal to Jian Wushuang. In order to be safe, Master Sky Roc had used his killer move with all his might in the last attack, it was not only for the supreme true treasure magic weapon, but also to protect his reputation.","The Sky Roc Ruler would definitely not allow a Principles Master to live for more than a breath in his hands.","Feeling the power of the Sky Roc Ruler’s final attack, the corners of Jian Wushuang’s mouth curled up slightly. “As expected, I finally used my full strength in the final attack. Unfortunately, it’s too late.”","Jian Wushuang smiled coldly. At this juncture, he finally stopped holding back.","He had deliberately shown weakness in his previous four exchanges with the Sky Roc Ruler. The strength he had displayed could only be described as invincible among Principles Masters, but it did not meet the standards of a Ruler. But now...buzz!","Jian Wushuang’s divine power finally burst out completely. At the same time, he immediately activated his life divine power and heaven-cleaving skill, making his divine power three times stronger than that of an ordinary Ruler!","In addition, the Blood Demon Cave Armor he was wearing was a top-grade supreme treasure armor. As Jian Wushuang’s strength increased, he could now activate the second level of power, which was 100 times the power of the pinnacle of the six realm, this made Jian Wushuang’s divine power a little stronger.","“Let me see how powerful a top-grade Ruler is.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with excitement. The top-grade supreme treasure in his hand, the Cyan Spirit Divine Sword, also trembled slightly. In an instant, an extremely violent power rose up and a large area of flames swept over, it was as if it could burn the world.","It was a seventh-level advanced absolute art, Star Fire Burning Sun!","Whoosh!","The sword light fell.","The three people who had been watching the battle in the surrounding void, including Red Eye Master, master of cloud-sinking, and Shi Yan Master, were all shocked when they saw Jian Wushuang’s sword light."]},{"number":3629,"title":"Chapter 3629 - Ruler”?","paragraphs":["“This sword...how is it possible?” Red Eye Master was in disbelief.","“The power of a Ruler. This sword is definitely at the level of a Ruler. It’s even stronger than an ordinary Ruler,” Master Yunchen said.","“Has Blood Sword Master already broken through to become a Ruler?” Shi Yan Master was also shocked.","They were all Principles Masters, so they could see that Jian Wushuang’s sword was more powerful than that of a Principles Master. It was definitely at the level of a Ruler.","But why had Blood Sword Master not shown his strength before?","Instantly, the three Principles Masters had a bad premonition, especially the Red Eye Master.","Boom!","The enormous blood-red vortex, with its incredible strangling power, finally collided with Jian Wushuang’s sword light, which could burn everything in the world. Although Jian Wushuang had used all his strength, the power it released was barely comparable to that of an advanced Ruler.","However, he was facing the full-strength attack of the Sky Roc Ruler, so the final result was still that Jian Wushuang’s sword light was mercilessly destroyed, and the blood-red vortex still enveloped Jian Wushuang, then, the terrifying strangling power completely affected Jian Wushuang’s body.","Splash!","Jian Wushuang only felt that his divine body was constantly being attacked by divine power. Even though the power of the Blood Demon Cave Armor was greatly weakened and his divine body was comparable to an elementary universe supreme treasure, the impact of divine power at this level...still reached the limit of his divine body and began to destroy his divine power.","In the end, when the strangling power in the blood-red vortex was completely exhausted, Jian Wushuang’s divine power was also depleted by a full one percent!","“Amazing. As expected of the Sky Roc Ruler. He actually used one percent of my divine power in one strike.” Jian Wushuang could not help exclaiming in his heart.","He was truly amazed.","It must be known that before he made a breakthrough, his divine body, which was comparable to an elementary universe supreme treasure, could already make an ordinary elementary Ruler or even an advanced Ruler despair.","For example, the Heaven Ancestor had tried, but his full-strength attack could only deplete 1 out of 10,000 of Jian Wushuang’s divine power. This was because Jian Wushuang was just standing there and did not resist at all.","But now, he was using his full strength to resist. He had already unleashed his strongest move, which was to use Starfire Burning Sun to clash with the Sky Roc Ruler’s finger, which had already weakened a lot of the power of the finger, however, the last finger had still dep leted 1% of his divine power.","In other words, the power of the Sky Roc Ruler’s finger was hundreds of times stronger than that of the Heaven Ancestor!","Of course, this was also because the Sky Roc Ruler had used his most powerful supreme treasure divine weapon, but even so, it was still very terrifying.","“If the Sky Roc Ruler can destroy 1% of my divine power in a head-on fight, then as long as he can find a way to stop me from escaping, I’m afraid there’s a glimmer of hope that he can kill me.” Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly.","Jian Wushuang was amazed by the strength of the Sky Roc Ruler.","However, the Sky Roc Ruler was overwhelmed with emotions.","“He’s not dead. How could he survive my strongest attack?” The Sky Roc Ruler’s eyes were cold. “Not only is he not dead, but his aura is well-preserved. In other words, I didn’t even manage to severely injure him.”","The Master Sky Roc could not accept this result at the moment.","“Master Sky Roc, the time for one breath is up. Thank you,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Master Sky Roc took a deep look at Jian Wushuang. After a while, he nodded and said, “Blood Sword Master, it seems that I have indeed underestimated you. The people of this territory have also underestimated you.”","Jian Wushuang just smiled awkwardly.","“This is what you want.” Master Sky Roc waved his hand and threw an interspatial ring to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang took it and scanned it with his consciousness. He was immediately delighted.","There was nothing else in the interspatial ring except a sword, a floating black magic sword that gave off a terrifying aura.","“Thank you, Master Sky Roc.” Jian Wushuang immediately thanked him.","“Take your things and get lost.” Master Sky Roc waved his sleeve and turned around.","Jian Wushuang was not annoyed. He glanced at Daoist Xuan God.","“Haha, Master Sky Roc, sorry to bother you.” Daoist Xuan God laughed heartily and immediately left with Jian Wushuang.","After Jian Wushuang and Xuan God left, Master Sky Roc’s face immediately darkened.","“Yunchen,” Master Sky Roc said.","“Master.” Master Yunchen immediately walked over.","“Go to the Heaven-Jun Pavilion,” Master Sky Roc said.","“Heaven-Jun Pavilion?” Master Yunchen was stunned.","The Heaven-Jun Pavilion was the department in the North Sea Palace that was responsible for collecting intelligence. In this territory, not only the three battlefields, but also the various forces in the astral world were all collected by the Heaven-Jun Pavilion.","“Go ask the Star Palace and the Blood Sword Master. Once you have done that, come back to me,” Ruler Sky Roc said.","“Yes.” Master Yunchen immediately turned and left.","“Patriarch...” The Red Eye Master and master stonehate were still standing there. They raised their heads and carefully glanced at Ruler Sky Roc, but when they saw the look on his face, they were so frightened that they did not dare to say anything else.","They knew very well that the Sky Roc Ruler had lost all his face today. and the one who had caused all of this was the Blood Sword Master.","After just half a day, Master Yunchen returned once again. “...”","“Master, when I arrived at the Heaven-Jun Pavilion, I asked for information about the Star Palace and the Blood Sword Master over the years. However, there was no problem. I immediately asked them to investigate carefully and asked someone to inquire. In the end, they quickly found out that a major incident had happened in the Star Palace a few days ago.” Master Yunchen’s voice was somewhat anxious.","“What’s the matter?” The Sky Roc Ruler asked.","“It’s that Blood Sword Master. He caused a huge commotion in the Star Palace and even exploded with an incomparably terrifying divine might. That divine might even surpassed that of an ordinary Ruler. The many Principles Masters who stayed in the Star Palace saw it with their own eyes. They all believed that this Blood Sword Master had already broken through to become a Ruler. Even the Star Palace Master, Temporal Temple Master, and Heaven Ancestor, when they saw this Blood Sword Master, they immediately addressed him as the Blood Sword Master!” Master Yunchen said.","“What did you say?”","Hearing Master Yunchen’s words, Red Eye Master immediately exclaimed, “You said that Blood Sword Master has already broken through to become a Ruler?”","“That’s right, and from the strength he just displayed, that is indeed a Ruler Realm battle strength,” Master Yunchen said solemnly.","“Bastard, he clearly has already broken through, yet he still disguised himself as a Principles Master to gamble with the clan master and let the clan master kill him within a breath. This is clearly deceiving the clan head. Clan master, we can not let this matter rest!” Red Eye Master shouted sternly."]},{"number":3630,"title":"Chapter 3630 - One Must Accept One’s Loss","paragraphs":["“Yes, deceiving a Ruler is unforgivable,” Shi Yan Master said in a low voice.","“Clan leader, that Blood Sword Master is not far from my North Sea Palace. If we chase after him now, it will definitely be in time,” Red Eye Master said.","“Shut up!” Master Sky Roc finally spoke.","Red Eye Master and Shi Yan Master were so frightened that they did not dare to make a sound.","“Do you really think I’m that stupid?” Master Sky Roc said in a low voice, “Do you think I can’t tell whether Blood Sword Master is a Principles Master or a resident?”","Red Eye Master was stunned.","Yes, Jian Wushuang had shown his strength in front of Master Sky Roc. If he was really a Ruler, Master Sky Roc would have seen through him. But the truth was...the Sky Roc Ruler had always thought that Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master.","“In this territory, no one can hide their true cultivation in front of me. Even if he really got a great opportunity and cultivated a special secret skill to hide his aura, once he shows his divine power, he will be exposed. However, the Blood Sword Master was a bone master from the beginning to the end. Therefore, we can be sure that the Blood Sword Master is only at the level of a Principles Master. There is no dispute about that.”","“As for the breakthrough he made in Star Palace not too long ago, it wasn’t necessarily a breakthrough to become a Ruler. It was a major breakthrough in other areas, such as the laws or top-tier secret arts, which allowed him to instantly become comparable to Rulers in terms of combat power,” Ruler Sky Roc said.","“But the divine power he displayed during his breakthrough was at the Ruler Realm as well,” Master Yunchen could not help but say.","“So what?”","“The universe is vast, and it is filled with all sorts of strange things. Even though he is only at the level of a Principles Master, his godly power is comparable to that of a Ruler. There are also some in this universe, such as those special lifeforms who are blessed by nature!”","“These special lifeforms have an astonishing innate advantage. The higher the level of the special lifeform, the greater the innate advantage. For ordinary cultivators, it is indeed inconceivable for Principles Masters to possess the godly power of a Ruler, but for special lifeforms, it is not impossible,” Master Sky Roc said.","“Master, are you saying that the Blood Sword Master is also a special life form?” Master Yunchen asked in surprise.","“The Blood Sword Master came from the Star Palace, and the origin of the Star Palace is the Divine Beginning Realm. I have some understanding of the Divine Beginning Realm, and I have seen a supreme character in the Divine Beginning Realm. If the Blood Sword Master is related to that supreme character, then everything can be explained,” the Sky Roc Ruler said.","He was extremely certain that there were some terrifying special lifeforms in the universe. At the level of a Principles Master, their divine power was already comparable to a Ruler’s. That was because many years ago, in the Quicksand Demon Realm, three heaven suppressing monoliths were born, he had personally fought for one of them. However, his luck was not good and he was not able to obtain a single heaven suppressing monoliths.","However, he could clearly see the process of that battle. There was one person who attracted the attention of others. That person was a Principles Master!","Although he was a Principles Master, his strength was not inferior to an ordinary Ruler. In fact, when he unleashed his full strength, he was much stronger than an ordinary low-level Ruler. From the start, he was just like an ordinary Principles Master, staying in the surrounding void, he did not participate in the battle until a perfect opportunity presented itself. He directly acted and suddenly unleashed his full strength, catching the other Rulers off guard. He actually managed to obtain a heavenly suppression monument before escaping.","During that battle, many Rulers were ruthlessly tricked by that person. He, the Sky Roc Ruler, was one of them. Naturally, his memory was still fresh in his mind.","Later on, he also learned that that person came from the Divine Beginning Realm. His name was Xuan Yi. Later on, although he did not meet Xuan Yi again, he heard some things about Xuan Yi. For example, after Xuan Yi refined the heaven suppressing tablet...relying on the stele, actually can burst out the top of the dominator’s combat strength, but at that time in this area caused a sensation.","Although later do not know exactly what reason, this mystic one fell, but he created before those legends, but still.","Therefore, with Xuan Yi’s experience, he could accept that Jian Wushuang was only at the level of Principles Master, but his battle strength was no less than that of an ordinary Ruler.","“Regardless of the reason, regardless of whether Blood Sword Master had planned it in advance or not, he managed to survive for one breath in my hands despite being at the level of a Principles Master. If he is willing to bet, he must admit defeat. Even I have nothing more to say,” Sky Roc Ruler said.","If he was willing to bet, he must admit defeat!","As soon as he said these words, the surrounding Red Eye Master, no matter how unwilling they were, could only be impatient.","After all, the bet between Master Sky Roc and Jian Wushuang was a fact. It was also a fact that Jian Wushuang had won the bet. It would be a real disgrace if the mighty Master Sky Roc could not even accept his defeat.","“Listen up. Don’t mention what happened today to anyone. Red Eye, let’s put an end to the grudge between you and Blood Sword Master. In the future, if it’s not necessary, don’t provoke Blood Sword Master. If you meet him in the three battlefields, avoid him immediately, just like when you meet other masters. Do you understand?” Master Sky Roc looked down.","“Yes.” Although the Red Eye Master was still somewhat unwilling, he still nodded heavily.","“Master, are we really not going to pursue the matter today?” Master Yunchen could not help but ask.","“How are we going to pursue it? Do you want me to personally take action and kill that Blood Sword Master?” The Sky Roc Ruler glanced at Master Yunchen. “Let’s not talk about my status. If I were to recklessly pursue and kill a Principles Master, it would cause all the experts to laugh at me. Most importantly, that Blood Sword Master isn’t weak at all. In addition, his protective techniques are even more inconceivable. I’ve already used all my strength with my finger earlier, but in the end, his divine power wasn’t depleted at all!”","“In other words, even if I attack with all my strength, I won’t be able to kill him. If that’s the case, then why should I waste my strength and not gain any benefits?”","“Also, there’s another point. This Blood Sword Master is only at the level of a Principles Master, and his battle prowess is already so tyrannical. If he breaks through to become a Ruler one day, how strong will his strength be?","“I’m afraid that even I might not be his match at that time.”","“It’s better for the North Sea Palace not to provoke a person with such incredible potential unless it’s necessary.”","Although Sky Roc Ruler was arrogant, he was not stupid. He was very sensible and knew his limits.","He knew that he might not be able to do anything to Jian Wushuang. However, if Jian Wushuang grew up in the future, he might be able to do something to him. In that case, it was better for him not to provoke Jian Wushuang when there was no big enmity between them.","Master Yunchen, Red Eye Master, and Shi Yan Master also nodded and quickly left."]},{"number":3631,"title":"Chapter 3631 - River Styx","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God were flying side by side in the dark void of the universe.","“Haha, I just wanted to try my luck. I didn’t expect it to work.” Daoist Xuan God beamed with joy.","“Xuan God, your plan is very thoughtful and well-matched with mine. Otherwise, the Sky Roc Ruler would never fall for it,” Jian Wushuang said.","“My plan was stupid and easy to see through. The reason why I succeeded this time was because the Sky Roc Ruler was too confident,” Daoist Xuan God said with a smile, then he sighed and said, “I still can’t calm down. The Sky Roc Ruler is a supreme Ruler in this territory. He is a superior existence, but this time, we have set him up.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled.","Set him up...","Yes, they had set the Sky Roc Ruler up from the beginning to the end.","They made use of the Sky Roc Ruler’s confidence and his arrogance.","To be honest, Daoist Xuan God’s plan was very stupid. First, he would anger the Sky Roc Ruler and make the Sky Roc Ruler kill Jian Wushuang. Then Jian Wushuang would give the Ruler a chance to kill him, in other words, it was a provocation.","It was a very simple provocation that could be easily seen through. Master Sky Roc also saw through it at a glance. He could see that Jian Wushuang had deliberately said so many things to annoy him, his purpose was still for the Supreme Treasure Divine Sword.","But even if he saw through it, Master Sky Roc could not refuse the bet.","Jian Wushuang had indeed angered and offended him. As a superior Ruler, his dignity and pressure were all there. If he did not get angry after being offended, then where was his dignity as a Ruler?","Therefore, he had to make a move. At least, he had to teach Jian Wushuang a big lesson, not to mention killing him.","At this time, Jian Wushuang had given him an opportunity to gamble, so he could only seize it.","The most important point was that Sky Roc Ruler could see that Jian Wushuang was indeed just a Principles Master. Out of absolute confidence in his own strength, he did not think that Jian Wushuang could really last a breath of time in his hands, so he agreed.","But the final result was beyond Sky Roc Ruler’s expectations.","It could be said that this matter had been planned by Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God from the beginning to the end. The Sky Roc Ruler knew it was a plan, but he could only jump in.","“My young friend, why don’t you take out the sword that the Sky Roc Ruler gave you?” Daoist Xuan God asked.","Jian Wushuang smiled and flipped his hand. The black magic sword, which gave off a cold and heart-palpitating aura, appeared in his hand.","As soon as the black magic sword appeared, a supreme treasure aura swept out, and the surrounding void seemed to immediately sink into an ice cave.","“It’s so strong and cold. This is the strongest attack supreme treasure!” Daoist Xuan God’s eyes were shining.","“Indeed, compared to a pinnacle universe supreme treasure, this sword is much stronger.” Jian Wushuang could not help exclaiming in surprise.","Although he had not completely refined the sword and made it recognize him as its master, he could feel the supreme power contained in the sword just by holding it in his hand, its power was much stronger than the Cyan Spirit Divine Sword he was using now.","A supreme universe true treasure seemed to be only one level away from a pinnacle universe true treasure, but the difference was too great.","A pinnacle universe true treasure could usually be used by an ordinary Ruler, but a supreme universe true treasure, even a Ruler, could hardly use all its power. That was the difference.","“Hurry up and refine it,” Daoist Xuan God urged.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and immediately began to refine it.","The process of refining was not easy. After all, a Supreme Treasure had a spirit, and the spirit of a top-tier universe supreme treasure was extremely arrogant. It was extremely difficult for ordinary cultivators, even Rulers, to get its recognition and refine it, Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master.","Therefore, when he first felt Jian Wushuang’s cultivation, the spirit of the supreme treasure was very resistant to Jian Wushuang. Fortunately, Jian Wushuang had activated the origin of the sword principle universe and truly stepped into the origin of the sword principle universe, when he used the origin of the sword principle universe, the resistance of the spirit of the supreme treasure was immediately eliminated. On the contrary, it became extremely excited.","The subsequent refining process was extremely smooth. Soon, Jian Wushuang completely refined the divine sword.","After completely refining it, Jian Wushuang also learned the real name of the divine sword.","It was called...Netherworld!","It meant the Netherworld of Hell, and it was an extremely cold killing divine sword.","At the same time, after Jian Wushuang communicated with the spirit of the divine sword, he learned that the reason why the spirit of the divine sword immediately changed its attitude after sensing the origin of the universe of sword principle was because the origin of the universe of sword principle was too high-end, it was difficult for ordinary Rulers to master it, but Jian Wushuang was only at the level of Principles Master, which showed his talent in sword principle and his future achievements were bound to be limitless.","Because of this, the spirit of the divine sword immediately changed its attitude and allowed Jian Wushuang to refine it.","“Netherworld, Netherworld Divine Sword.”","Jian Wushuang held the black divine sword in his right hand and felt the terrifying coldness contained in the sword. He was pleasantly surprised, “The strongest universe supreme treasure is much stronger than a pinnacle universe supreme treasure. When I used the Cyan Spirit Divine Sword, my battle strength could barely match an advanced Ruler. Now that I have this magic sword, my strength will definitely be at the advanced Ruler Realm. Even among the advanced Rulers, I can be considered very strong!”","“Supreme true treasure!”","He knew very well that with a supreme true treasure godly weapon in hand, his offensive power would definitely rise to a new level. In addition to his incredible protective techniques, he could practically do whatever he wanted among senior Rulers, after all, many Rulers did not have supreme true treasures.","Furthermore, the offensive godly swords of supreme true treasures would cause an even greater impact on those true treasure armors that were below the level of supreme true treasures.","For example, if a supreme true treasure armor was attacked by a Ruler, if the opponent’s attack divine weapon was only a supreme true treasure, the armor could still reduce the power of the Ruler’s attack by about 90 percent, however, if the opponent was holding a supreme true treasure, it would be completely different.","The attack of the supreme true treasure and the armor of the supreme true treasure level could only reduce the power of the armor by 80 percent at most. As for the supreme true treasure armor, few people in this territory had it.","It could be said that Jian Wushuang’s attack and defense were one. The only drawback was that the heaven-cleaving skill consumed too much divine power, so he could not use it recklessly."]},{"number":3632,"title":"Chapter 3632 - Saint Star","paragraphs":["“My young friend, it seems that you are very satisfied with this divine sword.” Daoist Xuan God looked at him.","“Yes, of course I am.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","What could he not be satisfied with?","“Although the Sky Roc Ruler gave me the Netherworld Divine Sword, he must be unwilling to accept it. After a little investigation, he will probably find out what happened in Star Palace. By then, he will know that we have set him up.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“That’s right, but it doesn’t matter. Master Sky Roc has lived for a long time. He’s not a fool. He knows your potential and that he can’t kill you. Therefore, even if he feels uncomfortable, he won’t come to deal with you openly. Unless one day you die, he may come to deal with Star Palace. However, if you die, there’s no point for Star Palace to exist,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly, but suddenly his expression changed. “By the way, the North Sea Palace is in the east of this territory, and if I remember correctly, the Earth Saint Star seems to be nearby.”","“Earth Saint Star? Why, are you going to the Earth Saint Star?” Daoist Xuan God asked.","Previously, Jian Wushuang had asked Axe One Master for information about the ice heart glazed jade, but Daoist Xuan God did not know about it.","“Earth Saint Star Master has a piece of ice heart glazed jade, which is very important to me. However, when I asked axe one to negotiate with him on behalf of Star Palace, he did not give Star Palace any face at all and casually dismissed Axe One,” Jian Wushuang said.","“If it’s something in the hands of Earth Saint Star Master, and he refused decisively before, it won’t be easy to get it from him again.” Daoist Xuan God narrowed his eyes.","“But I must get the icy-heart glazed jade, no matter what the price.” Jian Wushuang’s expression turned cold. “Xuan God, how strong is the Earth Saint Star Master?”","“The Earth Saint Star Master is not very strong. He is considered average among the Rulers, slightly weaker than the Heaven Ancestor. Moreover, the Heaven Ancestor obtained a supreme treasure by chance, but the Earth Saint Star Master doesn’t have a supreme treasure,” Daoist Xuan God explained.","“However, no matter how weak he is, he is still a real Ruler. He has many tricks, strong life-saving abilities, and a weird and irritable personality. Therefore, he has always been a Ruler who is not easy to provoke.”","“Take Star Palace as an example. If it’s not necessary, we definitely don’t want to provoke such a Ruler. After all, a barefooted person is not afraid of wearing shoes. Earth Saint Star Master has nothing to worry about, and Star Palace is involved in many things. As long as we provoke him and can’t kill him, he can attack our experts without any scruples. When that happens, our Star Palace will have a headache.”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly.","Daoist Xuan God noticed the change in Jian Wushuang’s expression and immediately changed the topic, “My young friend, It’s okay if you really need the ice heart glazed jade. It’s just an Earth Saint Star Master. We can just kill him and force him to hand it over.”","“Xuan God, didn’t you just say that the Earth Saint Star Master is not to be trifled with?” Jian Wushuang looked over in puzzlement.","“Yes, previously, the Earth Saint Star Master was indeed not to be trifled with.” Daoist Xuan God smiled.","“Previously, although there were four Rulers in Star Palace, the strongest Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master had been staying in the Divine Beginning Realm and could not escape at all. On the other hand, I, spacetime, and the Heaven Ancestor are only primary Rulers, and spacetime is not good at fighting head-on. The Heaven Ancestor and I are not much stronger than the Earth Saint Star Master. Even if the three of us join hands, we can only force the Earth Saint Star Master into a very sorry state, but we can not really threaten his life.”","“Since his life isn’t in danger, there’s no need for him to be afraid of us. But now, the Star Palace has one more Ruler, and that’s you. You have the most powerful attack true treasure, and you’re good at Sword Dao and Killing Dao. If you attack, you’ll be able to crush him by yourself. Plus, spacetime and I will help him, making it impossible for him to escape. That will be enough to threaten his life.”","“Although this Earth Saint Star Master is irritable and eccentric, he is a master who bullies the weak and fears the strong. As long as his life is not threatened, he will not give face to anyone. However, for the top forces in this territory, such as the North Sea Palace and the three Rulers of the North Sea Palace, the Sky Roc Ruler alone is enough to kill him. He will never dare to provoke such a force.”","“As long as we can put enough pressure on him and make him feel that his life is in danger, he will have no choice but to bow his head!”","“I see.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “In that case, let’s go to the Earth Saint Star now and send a message to time and space to ask him to come as soon as possible.”","“I’ll send a message now.” Daoist Xuan God immediately sent the message, and the two of them immediately went to the Earth Saint Star.","The Earth Saint Star was a very ordinary Earth Star. It was not big, and its geographical location was not as good as the Earth Star occupied by the major forces. However, because of its remote location, the Earth Saint Star Master had completely become the Ruler of this territory, after occupying this place, he had completely become the Ruler of this territory.","He was basically an unruly existence around here. No one dared to provoke him, and his life was extremely comfortable.","However, at this moment, in a dark void near the Earth Saint Star, Jian Wushuang, Daoist Xuan God, and Temporal Temple Master were standing side by side.","“The Earth Saint Star is ahead. The Earth Saint Star Master hasn’t been to the three battlefields for a long time. He should be in the Earth Saint Star now. Should we kill him directly?” Daoist Xuan God said.","“There’s no rush.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand. “Let’s go and meet the Saint Star Master first. If he changes his mind now and is willing to hand over the ice-heart glazed jade or give it to us, it will save us a lot of trouble. If he is still as tough as before, it’s not too late for us to attack him.”","“How about this? I’ll go to the Saint Star with Xuan God. You stay in the void around the Saint Star and wait for my news. As long as we don’t make a deal with the Saint Star Master, I’ll send a message to you. Then you can directly seal the space around the Saint Star Master and not give him a chance to escape,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Temporal Temple Master nodded.","“Xuan God, let’s go and meet Earth Saint Star Master.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and immediately rushed toward Earth Saint Star with Daoist Xuan God. In the blink of an eye, they arrived in front of Earth Saint Star."]},{"number":3633,"title":"Chapter 3633 - Get Lost!","paragraphs":["Before they reached the Saint Star, several streams of light rushed out from the Saint Star and blocked Jian Wushuang.","“Who are you two?”","A cold voice sounded. These people were obviously the guards of the Saint Star.","It was naturally impossible for the Earth Saint Star Master to be the only one on such a huge Earth Saint Star. In addition, there were also many cultivators who relied on him. They were all Principles Masters with different strengths. For example, these people in front of them were also Principles Masters, however, their strength was very ordinary. They were only at the second or third level of the void.","However, even if their strength was weak, because of the Earth Saint Star Master behind them, they were able to walk unhindered in the surrounding territories. As time passed, their mentality also changed and they became arrogant.","Especially in such an occasion...when someone came to the Earth Saint Star, they would normally come to visit the Earth Saint Star Master. Therefore, their attitude became even colder and they even had a trace of arrogance.","This was also the order of the Earth Saint Star Master. Whoever came to the Earth Saint Star would first show off their strength.","But this time, it was obvious that they had raised an iron plate.","Seeing the arrogant expressions of the people in front of him, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile. Daoist Xuan God, who was next to him, snorted coldly. In an instant, his aura at the Ruler Realm swept out directly, it pressed down on the bodies of the Principles Masters.","The Principles Masters were immediately suppressed to the point that they did not dare to breathe loudly. The arrogance on their faces disappeared in an instant. There was only fear.","“Master, Ruler!”","They immediately understood the identity of the person who had come, and they became even more afraid.","“Go and inform them that Star Palace Master, Xuan God, and Blood Sword Master have come to pay a visit to Earth Saint Star Master,” Xuan God said.","“Star Palace Master? Blood Sword Master?”","The Principles Masters immediately looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","They were not very familiar with Xuan God, but from his aura, they knew that he was a high and mighty Ruler. He looked at Earth Saint Star Master behind them.","However, Blood Sword Master was a well-known figure to them.","As the strongest among the Principles Masters, Jian Wushuang was very famous in this territory, and the Principles Masters were full of admiration and admiration for him.","He had defeated five experts of the pinnacle of the six realm by himself, which was enough to make countless Principles Masters look up to him.","After knowing the identities of Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God, the Principles Masters immediately became respectful. One of them returned to the Earth Saint Star to report the news.","Daoist Xuan God was right. Earth Saint Star Master was indeed in the Earth Saint Star, and he was living a very leisurely life.","In the center of a huge and beautiful manor, there was a high platform. On the high platform, there were many beautiful dancers dancing gracefully. These dancers were all captured from the star world around Earth Saint Star Master, they were all very weak and had not reached the level of the Principles Master. They were only at the level of Saints. However, in the Earth Saint Star, Saints were no different from the Principles Master.","What these beauties had to do was to make the Earth Saint Star Master believe in them as much as possible.","Around the high platform, there were three beautiful women who were wearing revealing clothes. Two of them were serving them, and one of them was sitting on the Earth Saint Star Master’s lap, the Earth Saint Star Master was drinking the fine wine and fruits that Mei Ji had handed over to him while moving his hands up and down on Mei Ji’s lap. It was needless to say how much he enjoyed it.","But at this time...the Principles Master who had come in to report had arrived in the manor, he respectfully called out from a distance, “Star Master, Star Palace Master Xuan God and Blood Sword Master have already arrived outside the star. They say that they’re here to pay you a visit.”","“Oh?”","Earth Saint Star Master’s expression slightly moved, and the flush on his face slightly faded. He slowly stood up, he said, “I also know Star Palace Master. He is just a low-grade Ruler. Who is that Blood Sword Master? A Principles Master. Do you want me to know about him?”","“Star Master, that Blood Sword Master is now publicly acknowledged as the strongest Principles Master in this territory. Not long ago, in the depths of Devil Smoke Valley, he single-handedly defeated five pinnacle of the six realm experts and even killed one of them. His name shook the world,” the Principles Master respectfully said.","“Oh?” The Earth Saint Star Master raised his eyebrows, but then he sneered, “To be able to defeat five pinnacle of the six realm experts by himself, his strength is indeed not bad. But so what? He’s still just a Principles Master, an ant.”","“Tell them that I’m currently in high spirits and have no time to care about them. Tell them to scram!”","With that, the Earth Saint Star Master continued to lie down, enjoying the service of the surrounding beauties.","As for the Principles Master who had come in to report, his expression was bitter.","He had been in the Earth Saint Star for many years and knew what kind of temper this Earth Saint Star Master had. However, the crux of the matter was that the one waiting outside was a Ruler after all, and the strongest of the Principles Master...directly asking the other party to scram...even though the Earth Saint Star Master dared to say this, he might not dare to say it.","“Listen, tell them exactly what I just said. If you say one wrong word, I’ll cut you into pieces.” The voice of the Principles Master rang out again.","“Yes, yes.” The Principles Master, who was still hesitating, immediately left the manor in fear.","When he came to the outside of the Earth Saint Star and saw Daoist Xuan God and Jian Wushuang, the Principles Master felt bitter in his heart, but he still told them exactly what the Principles Master had said, however, his tone was certainly not as tough as the Earth Saint Star Master’s.","“Guys, my Star Master said that he is in high spirits and has no time to care about you. He wants you to...get lost!” After saying that, the Principles Master lowered his head in fear, he did not dare to look at Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God.","However, he did not know that Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God did not get angry after hearing that. Instead, they smiled faintly.","“Earth Saint Star Master is indeed as unreasonable as the rumors say.” Daoist Xuan God smiled.","“At least there’s a Ruler visiting us now. It’s fine if Earth Saint Star Master doesn’t want to see us, but he wants to chase us away. Tsk, tsk. No wonder he doesn’t have any good friends in this territory.” Jian Wushuang also smiled.","“If he doesn’t want to see us, what should we do now?” Daoist Xuan God asked.","“There is a layer of formation in the Earth Saint Star, but it doesn’t seem to be very strong. With our strength, it shouldn’t be difficult to break it,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile, “Since the Earth Saint Star Master doesn’t want to see us, we can only force our way in.”","“Force our way in? Sure.” Daoist Xuan God smiled.","Hearing the conversation between Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God, the Principles Masters in front of them were frightened."]},{"number":3634,"title":"Chapter 3634 - Saint Star Master","paragraphs":["“My lords!”","The Principles Masters wanted to say something, but Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God had already made their moves.","Boom!","The earth-shaking aura of the Ruler suddenly erupted and immediately caused the suppression of the array on Saint Star. However, the array on Saint Star was not too profound, it was not a problem to stop the Principles Master, but it was not realistic to stop the Ruler.","Jian Wushuang did not make a move at all, but Daoist Xuan God easily broke the array and the two of them directly entered the Earth Saint Star.","Rumble...","The array broke and the entire Earth Saint Star began to shake crazily. In the central manor of the Earth Saint Star, the dancing beauties stopped and scattered in fear. Earth Saint Star Master, who was on the exquisite bed, suddenly stood up, a fierce look flashed in his eyes.","“Haha, Saint Star Master, you really know how to enjoy yourself.”","Hearty laughter also rang out in the Saint Star. Daoist Xuan God and Jian Wushuang, who were speaking, had also arrived in the void where the manor was. They both looked at Saint Star Master on the bed.","“This is Saint Star, Xuan God. You broke into the formation without my consent. It seems that you don’t care about me at all.” Saint Star Master’s voice was cold. “Humph, just you wait. I’ll go to your Star Palace in a while.”","“Haha, my Star Palace’s base is there. You can go if you want to. But I don’t know if you’ll be able to come out again.” Daoist Xuan God was very relaxed.","What a joke. Now that Jian Wushuang had joined the Star Palace, the battle strength of four Rulers was there. In addition, Daoist Xuan God had operated the Star Palace for so many years. The various arrays and techniques in the Star Palace...the Earth Saint Star could not compare to it.","If the Earth Saint Star Master had recklessly run to the Star Palace, he was really confident that he could completely keep the Earth Saint Star Master.","“Earth Saint Star Master, we came here specially to visit you. We have no ill intentions,” Jian Wushuang said.","“No ill intentions? What a joke. You directly broke through the formation and entered the Earth Saint Star. How dare you say you have no ill intentions?” The Earth Saint Star Master sneered, “And who are you? You’re just a Principles Master, but you can’t even greet me. You’re so disrespectful to me. I can kill you for that.”","“Um...” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","He had heard that Earth Saint Star Master had a strange temper and was very difficult to get along with. It seemed that he was right.","“Earth Saint Star Master, the Blood Sword Master beside me has an extraordinary position in our Star Palace. He is no less than my Palace Master. You’d better be a little more polite to him,” Daoist Xuan God said coldly.","“Haha, I’m dying of laughter. How can I be so respectful to a mere Immortal Saint? Xuan God, you’ve lived for so many years. Have you become a dog?” Earth Saint Star Master laughed.","Daoist Xuan God’s face turned cold.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes also turned cold. “Since Earth Saint Star Master is so difficult to talk to, there’s no need to be polite with him. Earth Saint Star Master, let me ask you, do you have the iceheart glazed jade?”","“Iceheart glazed jade?” Earth Saint Star Master curled his lips. “I guessed that you’re here for the iceheart glazed jade. Tens of thousands of years ago, someone from your Star Palace came to me to ask about the whereabouts of the iceheart glazed jade, but I sent him away. I didn’t expect that he would come here in person.”","“So, you have the iceheart glazed jade in your hand?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“What does it have to do with you?” Earth Saint Star Master sneered, “And who do you think you are? How dare you speak to me in such a tone? I will discipline you on behalf of my realm today.”","With that, Earth Saint Star Master waved his hand. Instantly, a surge of majestic divine power gathered in the fat void around Jian Wushuang and formed a huge palm that flapped toward Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","“Humph!”","Daoist Xuan God snorted. Similarly, a surge of divine power swept over the huge palm, which immediately began to collapse inch by inch.","“Blood Sword, there’s no need to waste words with him. Just attack. Earth Saint Star Master is a typical bully. He won’t be honest until he suffers a little,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and the Cyan Spirit Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","“What, do you want to fight?” Earth Saint Star Master looked disdainful. “Xuan God, it’s not that I look down on you. What can you do to me by yourself?","“You can’t do anything to me. Although I can’t do anything to you, I can do something to those people in your Star Palace. Just you wait. I won’t let today go.”","“Earth Saint Star Master, you’ve misunderstood. Your opponent this time is not me, but him.” Daoist Xuan God pointed at Jian Wushuang with a playful smile.","“Him?” Earth Saint Star Master looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise, then burst into laughter, “Haha, he’s just a Principles Master. Do you expect him to fight with me? Xuan God, have you been kicked in the head by a donkey?”","‘Humph, laugh, laugh. You’ll cry later.’ Xuan God sneered in his heart.","Jian Wushuang directly attacked.","Whoosh!","His figure flashed and floated forward like a ghost. A cold killing intent had completely locked onto Saint Star Master.","“You’re courting death.”","Saint Star Master’s eyes also flashed with killing intent. He directly swung his palm toward Jian Wushuang.","An expert at the Ruler Realm could shake the world with a single move.","It seemed like a simple slap, but the divine power contained in it was enough to easily crush an expert at the pinnacle of the six realm.","Unfortunately, he met Jian Wushuang, the only Principles Master in this territory.","The moment the Earth Saint Star Master slapped his palm, Jian Wushuang also struck out.","Buzz!","A cold scarlet sword light with a suffocating brutal aura slashed out, like an angry ancient ferocious beast that had completely exploded.","The Peerless Sword Manual, Xi Xiang!","It must be known that during the 100,000 years in that special space, he had made an incredible breakthrough in swordsmanship. His strongest skill, Starfire Burning Sun, was already an advanced level seven skill, while the other swordsmanship...for example, most of the swordsmanship in the Wushuang Sword Manual had been upgraded to the level of a level seven skill.","For example, this move by Xi Xiang was an absolute skill at the level of a rank seven Ruler. At this moment, Jian Wushuang did not conceal his strength too much. He used all his strength to burst out the power of a Ruler."]},{"number":3635,"title":"Chapter 3635 - Advanced Ruler!","paragraphs":["Crash!","The void of the Saint Star was mercilessly torn apart.","The extremely violent sword light struck the palm and instantly cut it open. However, the sword light did not completely disappear. It still carried extremely powerful power and slashed toward the Saint Star Master behind him.","“What?” Saint Star Master was shocked.","He never expected that Jian Wushuang’s sword would be so powerful that it could even defeat his attack.","However, he was an expert at the Ruler Realm after all. In the face of this sudden change, he could still deal with it calmly. He took a step back and a golden-red hammer appeared in his hand. He casually smashed the hammer into the void, however, ripples began to spread out crazily. When the ripples reached the sword light, the power of the sword light was weakened to the extreme. In the end, the sword light completely disappeared.","Earth Saint Star Master regained his balance and looked at Jian Wushuang again. However, there was no longer the mockery and disdain in his eyes. Instead, there was a more serious look.","“The battle strength of a Ruler?”","“You have already broken through to become a Ruler? No wonder you were able to defeat five masters of the sixth realm in Devil Smoke Valley. Humph, it turns out that you deliberately concealed your aura,” Saint Star Master snorted.","He thought that Jian Wushuang had long broken through to become a Ruler, but he had concealed his aura. Therefore, when he was in Devil Smoke Valley, Jian Wushuang was able to defeat many Principles Masters with his battle strength of a Ruler.","However, he did not know that when Jian Wushuang was in Devil Smoke Valley, he did not have the battle strength of a Ruler. Instead, he waited for his return to Star Palace and entered closed-door cultivation for 3,000 years to make a breakthrough. However, even if he made a breakthrough, his battle strength was only at the Ruler Realm, his true realm was only that of a Principles Master.","However, the Earth Saint Star Master was not as confident as the Sky Roc Ruler. The Sky Roc Ruler was powerful and had a high vision. He was confident that no one in this territory could hide his aura from him. Therefore, he was very sure that Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master.","However, the Earth Saint Star Master did not dare to think so. He thought that Jian Wushuang had made a breakthrough and only used a secret skill to hide his aura, so he did not see through it.","“Earth Saint Star Master, I just told you that your opponent is him,” Daoist Xuan God sneered.","“Humph, so what if the Blood Sword Master has made a breakthrough and become a Ruler? He still can’t do anything to me,” the Earth Saint Star Master snorted.","“Really?” Jian Wushuang curled his lips and attacked again.","Whoosh!","The sword light, with a hatred that would not rest until death, charged toward Saint Star Master.","It was a rank seven absolute art that would not rest until death!","“Boy, do you really think I’m afraid of you?” Saint Star Master was not afraid at all. He held a golden-red sledgehammer in each hand. The two golden-red sledgehammers emitted a monstrous power and continuously smashed out, they collided with Jian Wushuang crazily.","Clang! Clang! Clang! Clang! Clang!","A series of low collision sounds could be heard. Each collision produced a huge boom and power, causing the surrounding void and the earth to tremble crazily.","The entire Saint Star was on the verge of collapse.","In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang and Saint Star Master had collided dozens of times. The two could be said to be evenly matched. Jian Wushuang had barely gained the upper hand with his various sword skills, but it was only a slight advantage.","“Haha, I said that you, a newly-made Ruler, can’t do anything to me. Even if you join forces with the Xuan God, I won’t be afraid. If you two have the ability, kill me today. Otherwise, after today, I will launch a crazy revenge on your Star Palace. Unless the experts of your Star Palace are hiding in their nest, I will kill every single one of them until all the experts of your Star Palace are killed. Hahahaha...”","Earth Saint Star Master laughed with a hint of madness in his voice.","He was an extremely crazy person.","His craziness, unbridled recklessness, and terrifying killing were well-known in this territory.","Because of this, few people in this territory dared to provoke him. However, Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God had offended him by coming to kill him. With his character and style, he would certainly take revenge crazily.","Seeing how crazy the Earth Saint Star Master was, Daoist Xuan God narrowed his eyes slightly.","As for Jian Wushuang, his eyes turned cold. “If you want to take revenge on Star Palace, it depends on whether you can survive today.”","As soon as he finished his words, Jian Wushuang’s body suddenly shook. He activated his life divine power and heaven-cleaving skill.","Once these two secret skills were used, especially the heaven-cleaving skill, Jian Wushuang’s divine power instantly doubled. It was his original power, which was three times the power of a Ruler.","When the power exploded, Jian Wushuang also attacked.","Boom!","The void shook, and a huge sword shadow swept up. In an instant, it turned into a burning flame with unparalleled terrifying power and directly covered the Earth Saint Star Master in front of him.","It was an advanced level seven skill, the strongest skill created by Jian Wushuang, Starfire Burning Sun!","This sword move was awe-inspiring. The most important thing was the terrifying explosive power hidden in the swordsmanship.","Saint Star Master seemed to have noticed that Jian Wushuang’s sword move was extraordinary. At this moment, he also used all his strength to swing the two red-gold hammers in his hands at the sword light. At first, the power of the two seemed to be too far apart, it was not until the sword light that was burning with raging flames collided with the hammers.","Boom!","It was as if a volcano that had been silent for many years suddenly erupted!","The power of the sword shadow completely exploded. The power was completely beyond the imagination of the Saint Star Master.","“Impossible!”","The Saint Star Master’s face changed dramatically, and his eyes were wide open.","He could clearly sense the terrifying power of the Sword Shadow. The power crushed him, and the two hammers in his hands changed directions. Then the sky was filled with flames and sword light, it was mercilessly devouring his godly body.","Hu!","Even with the protection of his supreme true treasure armor, Earth Saint Star Master was still in a terrible state. He was forced back, and it took him a long time to stop. When he raised his head again...blood oozed out of the corner of Saint Star Master’s mouth. His aura was obviously weaker than before.","“Advanced Ruler!”","“You have the battle strength of an advanced Ruler!” Saint Star Master stared at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","However, Jian Wushuang flipped his hand slightly and a black magic sword suddenly appeared in his hand.","Seeing the black magic sword, Saint Star Master could no longer calm down."]},{"number":3636,"title":"Chapter 3636 - Bullying the Weak and Fearing the Strong","paragraphs":["“The most powerful Supreme Treasure Divine Sword!”","Earth Saint Star Master’s heart was already surging with waves.","He did not even have a supreme treasure in his hand, but now Jian Wushuang took out a sword-type divine weapon that was just right for him to use.","At this moment, the pressure on Earth Saint Star Master increased sharply.","“Saint Star Master, you should know very well that just now, I only used a supreme true treasure magic weapon to hurt you, and if I used this supreme true treasure magic sword, it would be enough to kill you!” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","Upon hearing this, no matter how reluctant Saint Star Master was, he had to admit that Jian Wushuang was telling the truth.","Jian Wushuang had clearly displayed the battle strength of an advanced Ruler. An advanced Ruler was already a threat to him, but if this advanced Ruler had another supreme true treasure magic weapon that was just right for him...his attack power would sky rocket, and he would become an extremely terrifying existence in terms of killing. To him, it was indeed a threat that could threaten his life.","However, even though he knew this, Earth Saint Star Master did not intend to bow his head so quickly.","“Blood Sword Master, so what if you’re stronger than me? You can kill me, and I can escape. You still can’t do anything to me,” Earth Saint Star Master said.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God both laughed.","“Earth Saint Star Master really won’t shed a tear until he sees his coffin,” Daoist Xuan God sneered.","“Earth Saint Star Master, do you really think that we’re completely unprepared?” Jian Wushuang also smiled coldly. At the same time, he had already sent a message to the Temporal Temple Master in the outside world.","Suddenly, a vast power of time and space exploded, covering the entire Earth Saint Star Master in the blink of an eye.","A powerful space-time pressure directly pressed down on Saint Star Master.","“This is...space-time lockdown? He actually used space-time lockdown in the universe void. How high is the use of space-time principle?” Saint Star Master’s expression changed drastically.","Space-time lockdown was a relatively simple way to use space-time.","One had to know that it was very easy to use space-time lockdown in an ordinary astral world, but in the universe void, it was much, much more difficult to use space-time lockdown than in an astral world, under normal circumstances, even a Ruler who was good at the space-time rule would find it difficult to use the space-time seal in the universe void, but now...","“As expected of the Temporal Temple Master. He can use such a large space-time seal in the universe void. His use of the space-time principles is superb.” Jian Wushuang was secretly amazed.","Of course, he knew that the Temporal Temple Master must have used a space-time supreme treasure to use the space-time seal, but even so, it was still amazing.","“Earth Saint Star Master, I’m afraid you don’t know that I’m not the only Ruler in Star Palace. There are three of them. The one who cast the time-space seal is another Ruler in Star Palace who specializes in space-time principles. Now, do you still think you can escape from us?” Daoist Xuan God sneered.","Earth Saint Star Master’s face had completely darkened.","With Jian Wushuang’s strength and the Supreme Treasure Divine Sword in hand, he did not dare to confront him head-on. After all, if he were to fight Jian Wushuang head-on, with his strength, he could kill him as long as he had time.","However, the surrounding space and time had been completely sealed, and with Xuan Yi and Temporal Temple Master, he had no chance to escape.","Knowing this, the Saint Star Master was terrified.","“Saint Star Master, hand over the ice heart glazed jade, or else...” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with killing intent.","“Blood...Blood Sword Master,” Saint Star Master said, but his tone and attitude had completely changed.","Previously, when he faced Jian Wushuang, he was high and mighty, and his face was full of disdain for Jian Wushuang, the Principles Master.","Even after Jian Wushuang revealed his battle strength as a Ruler and made him restrain his disdain, his words and actions were still extremely arrogant, but now...the Saint Star Master revealed an extremely hypocritical smile.","“Sure enough, just like what Xuan God said, the Saint Star Master is a bully.” Jian Wushuang observed the change in the Saint Star Master’s expression and could not help but reveal a trace of ridicule.","“Blood Sword Master, it’s not that I don’t want to hand over the ice heart glazed jade, but I really don’t have it.” Earth Saint Star Master said bitterly.","“You don’t have it?” Jian Wushuang’s expression turned cold. “You’re still lying. It seems that you really think you’ve lived for too long...”","As soon as he finished his words, Jian Wushuang swung his sword toward Earth Saint Star Master with one hand.","Jian Wushuang had also activated his life divine power and heaven-cleaving skill, displaying the power of an advanced Ruler. Most importantly, he had used the Netherworld Divine Sword.","The pitch-black sword light mercilessly cut through the void and silently appeared in front of the Saint Star Master.","The Saint Star Master was shocked and immediately brandished his sledgehammer to block the attack. However, he was immediately sent flying and his body began to tremble violently. His aura...his aura was instantly depleted.","“It’s too powerful! His swordsmanship is too powerful!”","“I blocked the attack head-on, but the power of the attack still reached my body and destroyed a lot of my divine power. If I couldn’t block this attack, the power of his attack would be enough to destroy 30% of my divine power. Four strikes would be enough to kill me.”","Earth Saint Star Master was scared half to death. When he saw that Jian Wushuang was going to attack again, he immediately roared, “Blood Sword Master, stop! I’ll tell you where the iceheart glazed jade is.”","Jian Wushuang stopped what he was doing and stared at Earth Saint Star Master. “Hand it over!”","“Blood Sword Master, I don’t have the iceheart glazed jade now. I can swear on the universe origin principles,” Earth Saint Star Master said in a deep voice.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly.","The universe origin principles was the supreme principles in the universe, which maintained the normal operation of the universe.","The universe origin principles was supreme and followed the truth of the Great Dao. Under normal circumstances, no one dared to violate the oath made to the universe origin principles, even some powerful Rulers, even some supreme-beings did not dare to violate it.","Since the Earth Saint Star Master dared to swear to the universe origin principles, he most likely did not have the ice heart glazed jade.","“Impossible. My Star Palace has investigated clearly. There are three pieces of ice heart glazed jade in this territory. One of them was destroyed, and the other one was used first. And the last one was obtained by luck. Is there anything wrong with that?” Jian Wushuang said coldly."]},{"number":3637,"title":"Chapter 3637 - Had Been Used","paragraphs":["“The news from Star Palace is correct. I did get a piece of ice-heart glazed jade, but I used it a long time ago,” said Saint Star Master.","“Used it?” Jian Wushuang was stunned, but then his eyes turned cold. “Although this ice-heart glazed jade is an extremely rare treasure, its use is very limited. What can you do with it?”","“Well...if I tell you, Blood Sword Master, are you willing to leave?” Saint Star Master asked carefully.","“Are you bargaining with me?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold, and he tightened his grip on the Netherworld Divine Sword. The already terrifying killing intent in his body suddenly increased a little at this moment.","Saint Star Master was terrified. He gritted his teeth and said, “Blood Sword Master, I have indeed used the iceheart glazed jade. If you don’t believe me, just wait here for a while. I will naturally find a way to prove it.”","“Wait for a while?” Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment. “How long will it take?”","“It won’t take long. Just a few days,” Earth Saint Star Master said.","“A few days?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. “Earth Saint Star Master, are you trying to play some tricks?”","“Blood Sword Master, my life is in your hands now. How can I dare to play any tricks? Besides, I have already sworn to the universe origin principles. Blood Sword Master, are you still unwilling to believe me?” Earth Saint Star Master said.","“Well, I’ll wait here for a few days.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","In fact, he could choose to kill Earth Saint Star Master directly and then investigate his interspatial ring.","However, there was a certain risk in doing so.","First of all, Earth Saint Star Master had been famous in this territory for a long time, and he had killed crazily and offended many experts. However, he was still alive and well, it was difficult to guarantee that he would not have any trump cards in his hands.","Although he could now pose a fatal threat to the Earth Saint Star Master, he was not completely confident that he could really kill the Earth Saint Star Master. Moreover, if he did not kill the Earth Saint Star Master, with his character, he would take revenge crazily afterwards, it would be enough to give the Star Palace a headache.","Secondly, he was also worried about what the Earth Saint Star Master had said. If the ice heart glazed jade was not in his hands but given to someone else or used in another place, he would at least have to know the exact whereabouts of it, once he killed the Saint Star Master and did not find the glazed ice jade in his interspatial ring, it would be too difficult for him to find out more information about it.","Therefore, he could only wait and find out what was going on before deciding whether to attack the Saint Star Master.","Moreover, he was not afraid of what the Saint Star Master would do in just a few days. After all, everyone knew the Saint Star Master’s character. Even if he wanted to call for help, no one would help him in this territory.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang did not have to worry about anything.","Soon, ten days passed.","“Earth Saint Star Master, it’s been ten days.” Jian Wushuang glanced at Earth Saint Star Master.","“Don’t worry, we’ll be there soon,” Earth Saint Star Master said.","Jian Wushuang frowned.","At this moment, a white-robed figure suddenly appeared in the void where Temporal Temple Master was outside the Earth Saint Star.","“Hello, Temporal Temple Master.”","The voice sounded and the person stared at Temporal Temple Master. A Ruler Realm aura suddenly rose.","“Huh?” Temporal Temple Master’s expression suddenly changed.","...","In the Saint Star, Jian Wushuang was still waiting, but Temporal Temple Master suddenly smiled and said, “Blood Sword Master, the person who can prove it has come.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly. At this time, the Temporal Temple Master sent a message directly, “My young friend, a Ruler has arrived.”","“Who is it?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s Ruler Wuqing,” the Temporal Temple Master said.","“It’s him?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","Jian Wushuang had also heard of Ruler Wuqing. He was a Ruler who had just risen not long ago. Before his rise, he was not famous at all. Even if he became a Ruler and roamed the three battlefields...after he became famous, no one knew his background. No one knew which astral world he came from, which forces he came from, or which friends he had.","Many cultivators in this territory had a simple understanding of the Ruler of bluish-green. They only knew his name and strength.","The Ruler of bluish-green was not very strong among the primary Rulers, but he had many means. He was also an extremely difficult Ruler. In the years since he rose to power, he had roamed the three battlefields.","But now, he was here?","“Earth Saint Star Master, did you invite him here?” Jian Wushuang glanced at him.","“Yes.” Earth Saint Star Master nodded slightly. “But I didn’t invite him here to help me escape. I asked him to prove that I don’t have the ice heart glazed jade anymore.”","“How do you prove it?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s simple. Blood Sword Master and Xuan God, you two, feel my soul origin aura carefully.” As Saint Star Master spoke, the purest soul aura immediately rose from his body, it rose directly from Saint Star Master’s body.","Soul origin...if a cultivator’s core was his soul, then this soul origin was the core of the core.","The soul origin represented a person’s own dominant consciousness. A cultivator was doomed from the moment he was born, and there was no way to change it. Regardless of whether the cultivator became stronger in the future, even if he became a Ruler...his soul origin would not change.","Under normal circumstances, a cultivator would never show such a core soul origin. But now, the Earth Saint Star Master had revealed his soul origin aura, Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God were puzzled.","“Now, release your soul power and feel the soul origin aura of the Ruler of bluish-green outside the Earth Saint Star,” the Earth Saint Star Master said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God looked at each other. Although they were puzzled, they still released their soul aura according to the Earth Saint Star Master’s instructions, sure enough, outside the Earth Saint Star, they sensed the soul origin aura of the Ruler.","Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God were shocked.","“It’s the same!”","“Two soul origin auras are exactly the same!”","“How is this possible?”","Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God were shocked.","“Nothing is impossible. The Ruler is my clone, so his soul origin aura is exactly the same as mine,” Earth Saint Star Master said with a smile.","“Doppelganger?” Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan God were stunned.","Doppelganger?","The Ruler who had made a name for himself in this territory was the doppelganger of Earth Saint Star Master?"]},{"number":3638,"title":"Chapter 3638 - Glazed Doppelganger","paragraphs":["“Earth Saint Star Master, what’s going on?” Jian Wushuang asked with a frown.","“Blood Sword Master, as I said earlier, I have indeed used the glazed ice jade. As for its use...I have used it to create a glazed doppelganger for me,” Earth Saint Star Master replied.","“Glazed doppelganger?” Jian Wushuang’s expression was a little ugly.","“The reason for this is that when I was adventuring in the depths of Crimson Rock Mountain, I accidentally entered a fortuitous land and obtained an extremely special doppelganger secret skill. This doppelganger secret skill can create a doppelganger whose strength is equivalent to my own realm. This doppelganger can even have its own consciousness and can go adventuring alone. This is of great use to me,” Earth Saint Star Master explained.","“After all, there are many places in the three great battlefields that are simply too dangerous. Even rulers are treading on thin ice in those dangerous places. The slightest carelessness will result in eternal damnation. This is precisely why I don’t dare to venture into many places even though I know that there are many opportunities there. This is because I am afraid of death. However, if I have a clone that is identical in strength to me, it will be completely different!”","“As long as I have this clone, my true body can choose to stay on this planet. I can enjoy whatever I want, no matter how lawless it is. My clone can follow my will and go on adventures in the dangerous places of the three great battlefields. Even if I die on the way, I will only lose one clone!”","“Because of that, after I obtained this secret technique, I was pleasantly surprised. I immediately began to think of ways to create such a clone. However, although this secret technique is amazing, the threshold to cultivate it is extremely high. In addition, there are too many treasures needed to create a clone. It is too rare. I simply couldn’t collect all of them until one day, I obtained a piece of ice heart glazed jade...”","“The ice-heart glazed jade can create a glazed body, which is impervious to poison and extremely powerful. At that time, I wondered if I could use the glazed body created by the ice-heart glazed jade to replace my doppelganger. When I tried it, I really succeeded. Therefore, I have the ruler you see now.”","After Earth Saint Star Master finished speaking, he fell silent.","Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan Shen also fell silent.","They had already understood the whole story.","Earth Saint Star Master had indeed obtained a piece of ice heart glazed jade, but he had used it to create a glazed doppelganger, the ruler of bluish-green.","The ruler of bluish-green was the product of the ice heart glazed jade. After the glazed doppelganger was successfully created, the original body of Earth Saint Star Master had stayed in the Earth Saint Star, he had allowed the jadestone clone to use the name of Ruler Azurejade to roam the three great battlefields, adventuring for him and searching for treasures and fortuitous opportunities.","“No wonder Ruler Azurejade wasn’t famous at all before he rose to prominence, and no one was able to find out where he came from. So he’s just a clone of the Starlord. As for the Starlord, no wonder he’s been staying on the planet all these years without any worries. His clone has been adventuring all this time.”","“The doppelganger, Ruler Azurejade, has a very different aura from the original Earth Saint Star Master. He hasn’t revealed his soul origin aura, so no one has connected them over the years.” Daoist Xuan Shen’s face darkened, he could not help but look at Jian Wushuang.","He immediately noticed that Jian Wushuang’s face had become extremely ugly, and there was a hint of anger between his brows.","Of course, Jian Wushuang was angry!","It was not easy for him to find out that the Earth Saint Star Master had a piece of ice heart glazed jade in his hands. This piece of ice heart glazed jade represented great hope and was extremely important to him, therefore, he did not hesitate to come to the Earth Saint Star personally.","However, he did not expect that the Earth Saint Star Master had used up the ice heart glazed jade many years ago and used it to create a glazed doppelganger!","He had used it, but no one in the outside world knew about it. He had come here with great expectations. How could he not be angry?","“Glazed doppelganger? Earth Saint Star Master, you are very good, very good.” Jian Wushuang’s voice was extremely cold.","Hearing this, the Earth Saint Star Master was nervous. He could see that Jian Wushuang had a great desire for the glazed ice jade. It was obvious that Jian Wushuang could not accept this result.","“Blood Sword Master, I have no choice. I have provoked too many experts in this territory. Many people will attack me without hesitation as soon as they have the chance. Therefore, I have to be careful in my actions. For example, although I have created this glazed doppelganger, I have never mentioned it to anyone. This is also to cover up my trump card. I didn’t expect to attract you here, Blood Sword Master. I’m really sorry.” Saint Star Master could only apologize repeatedly.","But in fact, he did not need to apologize for this.","After all, everyone was the same. He had used a trump card, but he had kept it hidden and would not reveal it easily. The Earth Saint Star Master had used the icy heart glazed jade to create a glazed doppelganger that was almost as strong as his original body, of course, he would not flaunt it. If Jian Wushuang had not come to him this time, he would have had no choice but to expose it in front of Jian Wushuang.","From the perspective of the Earth Saint Star Master, it was true. However, from Jian Wushuang’s perspective, he was full of expectation, but he had to leave in disappointment. It was inevitable that he would be angry and unwilling, of course, he had to vent his anger on the Earth Saint Star Master.","“Earth Saint Star Master, you used the ice heart glazed jade to create a glazed doppelganger. This is your freedom. I won’t blame you for this. However, you spoke rudely to me before and directly attacked me to kill me. How should I deal with this?” Jian Wushuang glanced at the Earth Saint Star Master coldly.","“This...” Earth Saint Star Master looked bitter and said, “Blood Sword Master, I didn’t know you had become a ruler. If I had known you were a ruler, I wouldn’t have dared to offend you.”","“Humph, fortunately I’m a ruler. If I wasn’t a ruler, wouldn’t I have been insulted by you for nothing? Even if I was killed by you, I would have died for nothing.” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“Blood Sword Master.” Earth Saint Star Master wanted to say something.","“Cut the crap. Hand over three magic weapons at the pinnacle true treasure level, and we’ll call it a day. Otherwise...even if your clone, Ruler Azurejade, has arrived, I’m confident that I can kill you. Do you believe me?” Jian Wushuang stared at Earth Saint Star Master."]},{"number":3639,"title":"Chapter 3639","paragraphs":["“Of course, I believe it!”","Earth Saint Star Master no longer had any doubts about Jian Wushuang’s strength.","Even though his doppelganger had arrived and he had some trump cards, Jian Wushuang still had Daoist Xuan Shen and Temporal Temple Master, two Ruler-level experts around him. He was not confident that he could escape unscathed, in that case, he had no choice but to bow his head.","“Blood Sword Master, I should apologize to you for my rudeness before, but aren’t these three pinnacle true treasures a little too much...” Earth Saint Star Master said bitterly.","Pinnacle true treasures were also very important to Rulers. After all, many Rulers did not have supreme true treasures, and they used pinnacle true treasures.","The three supreme true treasures that Jian Wushuang mentioned, even though they were just ordinary offensive true treasures and magic weapons, were still very valuable. They were enough to make any novice Ruler feel pain.","“How much?” Jian Wushuang gave Earth Saint Star Master a cold glance.","“Earth Saint Star Master, you are an expert at the Ruler level. How much do three supreme true treasures mean to you?","“Besides, your clone, Ruler Azurejade, has been adventuring in many dangerous places on the three battlefields over the years. He must have obtained many opportunities and true treasures, right?” Daoist Xuan Shen sneered.","“Alright, I’ll give you three pinnacle true treasures.” Earth Saint Star Master exhaled, “But I also have a condition. It’s about my glazed doppelganger. I hope the three of you can keep it a secret for me. After all, this glazed doppelganger is very important to me.”","Jian Wushuang and Daoist Xuan Shen looked at each other and nodded.","Seeing that Jian Wushuang agreed, Saint Star Master immediately waved his hand and threw out an interspatial ring, “There are three supreme treasures in this interspatial ring. One is a sword-type magic weapon, one is a saber, and the last one is a long staff. Blood Sword Master, take a look.”","Jian Wushuang took the interspatial ring, glanced at it, and nodded slightly. “Earth Saint Star Master, for the sake of your sincerity, let’s call it a day. But from now on, you’d better behave yourself. Don’t be too conceited, especially when facing the cultivators under Star Palace. You’d better pay more attention to your status and manners.”","“Of course, of course.” Earth Saint Star Master nodded and smiled apologetically.","Jian Wushuang glanced at Daoist Xuan Shen, then the two of them turned around and left. Temporal Temple Master, who was outside the Earth Saint Star, also stopped the sealing of space and time. Soon, the three of them disappeared from Earth Saint Star Master’s sight.","Seeing that the three of them had completely left, Earth Saint Star Master heaved a heavy sigh of relief.","Whoosh!","Earth Saint Star Master’s glazed doppelganger, Ruler Azurejade, appeared next to him.","“This Blood Sword Master is very powerful,” Ruler Azurejade said.","“He is very powerful. He has just broken through to become a Ruler, and his combat power far surpasses mine. He has even reached the senior Ruler level. Most importantly, he has another supreme true treasure sword that is suitable for him. It is enough to put me under great pressure,” Earth Saint Star Master said.","“If you are willing to use your last move, not only will Blood Sword Master be unable to do anything to you, he might even leave his life here,” Ruler Azurejade said.","“No.” The Earth Saint Star Master waved his hand without hesitation. “I spent a great deal of effort to obtain that final move of mine. Once I use it, I won’t have a second chance to use it. This is my strongest trump card, and also my last resort. Unless it is a true life-or-death situation, I absolutely can not use it.”","The Earth Saint Star Master was, after all, a Ruler-level expert who had been famous for a long time. In addition, his luck had always been good. First, he had obtained that special secret clone technique, then he had obtained the iced heart glazed jade. As for other treasures and trump cards...he had once obtained a great opportunity and mastered the strongest trump card.","This trump card was his greatest asset. However, he could only use it once. Once he used it, he would lose it.","“That trump card is too important to me. Although Blood Sword Master forced me repeatedly, he did not push me to the extreme. He did not force me to risk my life. He only made me pay the price of three pinnacle true treasures. I don’t need three pinnacle true treasures anyway. I’ll just give them to him.” Earth Saint Star Master thought out loud.","Unless Jian Wushuang was really determined to kill him, or the conditions he offered were completely unacceptable to him.","Otherwise, as long as it did not exceed his bottom line, he would agree to it.","These three supreme true treasures clearly did not exceed his bottom line.","“In the end, my strength is still too weak. The key is that I have been adventuring for so many years, and I don’t even have a suitable supreme true treasure. Otherwise, I would not be in such a sorry state when facing Blood Sword Master.” Earth Saint Star Master sighed softly.","“Supreme true treasures are not easy to get,” said Ruler Azurejade.","“I know, so you have to work harder to find a way,” said Earth Saint Star Master.","“I know.” Ruler Azurejade nodded heavily.","One of them was his original body and the other was his doppelganger, but they were talking to each other as if they were two people.","This was the strange thing about the doppelganger secret skill that Earth Saint Star Master had obtained. Although it was a doppelganger, it had its own independent consciousness and only acted according to the original body’s will.","After the three of them left, the Earth Saint Star Master quickly calmed down.","...","In the universe void, Jian Wushuang, Daoist Xuan Shen, and Temporal Temple Master were walking side by side.","Jian Wushuang still looked a little upset. After all, he did not get the glazed ice jade that he wanted the most during this trip to the Earth Saint Star, and without the glazed ice jade, he could not create a glazed body for his wife, it would allow his wife to completely wake up.","“I didn’t expect that the Earth Saint Star Master had already created a glazed doppelganger with the glazed ice jade. It was a wasted trip.” Daoist Xuan Shen sighed softly.","“It was not a wasted trip. After all, we also got three supreme treasures.” Temporal Temple Master said.","“That’s true.” Daoist Xuan Shen nodded slightly and then looked at Jian Wushuang. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, don’t think too much. You Didn’t get this piece of ice-heart glazed jade from the Earth Saint Star Master, but it doesn’t mean that you won’t get it in the future. After all, the three battlefields in our territory have too many opportunities. Who knows when the ice-heart glazed jade will appear or if there are other treasures that can replace it?”","“Yes, I know.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. He did not think too much about it.","Daoist Xuan Shen was right. He would still have a chance to get his hands on the ice heart glazed jade.","Moreover, the ice heart glazed jade was not the only way for his wife to recover her body. Leng Ruxue was still alive. As long as he could find her, his wife’s body would be safe."]},{"number":3640,"title":"Chapter 3640 - Return to the Divine Beginning Realm","paragraphs":["“I’ve already obtained the most powerful supreme treasure. As for the icy heart glazed jade, I can only wait for another opportunity. Now, it’s time for me to return to the Divine Beginning Realm,” Jian Wushuang said.","“I’m the Palace Master of the Star Palace after all. I can’t escape from Star Palace, so I’ll let spacetime accompany you back,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","The three of them returned to Star Palace very quickly. After returning to Star Palace, Jian Wushuang and Temporal Temple Master went to the Divine Beginning Realm.","After passing through the universe passage and spending some time, Jian Wushuang and Temporal Temple Master arrived at the edge of the Divine Beginning Realm.","“We’re back.”","Jian Wushuang was a little excited to return to the Divine Beginning Realm. After all, he had left the Divine Beginning Realm for nearly 100,000 years.","Nearly 100,000 years was nothing to ancient existences like Daoist Xuan God and Temporal Temple Master. However, it was indeed too long for Jian Wushuang.","“It’s your first time returning to the Divine Beginning Realm from the Universe Battlefield. Don’t you feel different?” Temporal Temple Master looked at him.","“A little.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“It’s normal. It took me a long time to explore the Universe Battlefield for the first time. When I came back, I was also filled with regret. However, I’ll get used to it after exploring it more often in the future,” Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang understood.","He also knew that many Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm explored the Universe Battlefield, and it took them a long time to do so. It was normal for them to spend 100,000 years or hundreds of thouShas of years exploring the universe, some experts, such as Daoist Xuan God and Temporal Temple Master, who were Rulers, usually stayed in the universe for millions of years or tens of millions of years. Usually, they rarely returned to the Divine Beginning Realm.","Even if they did, they would only stay in the Divine Beginning Realm for a short period of time.","After all, there was nothing for them to stay in the Divine Beginning Realm after reaching their level of strength. Therefore, they spent most of their time in the Universe Battlefield.","“My young friend, now that you have returned to the Divine Beginning Realm, can you feel the pressure of the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao?” Temporal Temple Master suddenly asked.","“Pressure?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, but he shook his head. “No.”","“Then try circulating your divine power,” Temporal Temple Master added.","Jian Wushuang immediately circulated his divine power and even attacked as Temporal Temple Master had instructed.","The power of divine power, which was comparable to that of a Ruler, burst out from Jian Wushuang’s hand.","“I don’t feel any pressure. Even if I attack, the power doesn’t weaken at all,” Jian Wushuang said.","“I knew it.” Temporal Temple Master smiled. “Just like Xuan Yi. Although his battle strength is comparable to that of a Ruler, or even better than an ordinary Ruler, he is still a Principles Master, so he won’t be suppressed by the power of the will of heaven in the Divine Beginning Realm. However, it’s different for us Rulers.”","Jian Wushuang immediately remembered that in the Divine Beginning Realm, the strength of a Ruler expert would be suppressed by the power of the will of heaven, so that the Ruler would not be able to exert the battle strength of an ordinary Ruler, he should be between a Ruler and a Principles Master, just slightly stronger than a Saint Realm Master with the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao.","Daoist Xuan God, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor would all be greatly suppressed in the Divine Beginning Realm.","The Ruler, Death King, whom Jian Wushuang had met before, would be suppressed even more because he was an external Ruler.","However, Jian Wushuang was different. Although he had the battle strength of a Ruler, he was still a Principles Master. Since he was a Principles Master, he would not be suppressed by the power of the will of heaven, even if his battle strength was much stronger than that of a Ruler, he would not be restricted in the slightest.","“Your strength is not restricted in the Divine Beginning Realm. In other words, you are still a primary Ruler, or even close to a senior Ruler. In other words, you should be able to sweep through the three Saint Realms alone. Even if the three Saint Realm Masters join forces, they will have no choice but to flee from you,” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","“Logically speaking, it should be like this.” Jian Wushuang also smiled.","Once upon a time, he had been forced into an extremely miserable state by the three masters of the Saint Realm. He had even died at their hands more than once.","But now, after the trip to the Universe Battlefield and breaking through to become a Principles Master, the situation had been completely reversed.","Now, the three masters of the Saint Realm were nothing to him.","“How about we destroy the three Saint Realms now?” Temporal Temple Master asked with a smile.","“No rush.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand. “The three Saint Realms will be destroyed sooner or later, but there’s no rush. The most important thing for me now is to rush to the Seven Star Divine Realm and break the seals so that the countless experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect can see the light of day again.”","Of course, Jian Wushuang still had something to say. He could return to the Seven Star Divine Realm to meet his family and friends.","“Oh, spacetime, you’re the Temporal Temple Master. You should know what happened in the Divine Beginning Realm in the past 100,000 years, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes.” Temporal Temple Master nodded. “In the past 100,000 years, two major events happened in the Divine Beginning Realm. The first one was the rise of the Purple Blood Sect.”","“The Purple Blood Sect?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","The Purple Blood Sect was the sect of Demon Master Chenhuo. The Purple Blood Sect had been destroyed, but with the return of Demon Master Chenhuo, an expert at the pinnacle of the six realm, the rise of the Purple Blood Sect was inevitable.","“Because of your good friend, Demon Master Chenhuo, the Purple Blood Sect’s prestige and strength in the Divine Beginning Realm have surpassed that of the other sects. In less than 100,000 years, it has become a top force that can contend with the Eight Directions Celestial Sect. In terms of top strength, the experts of the Eight Directions Celestial Sect are far inferior to your good friend. However, the Purple Blood Sect’s foundation is still slightly inferior to the Eight Directions Celestial Sect,” Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and asked, “What’s the second thing?”","“The second thing happened in the Demon Realm. It happened to Xiao’er, the Clan Master of the Nine-tailed Clan who has a close relationship with you. Because she has mastered the nine-life heaven charm, her charm is extremely terrifying. Almost no one below the pinnacle of the six realm can resist her. She used this secret skill to devour the clans in the Demon Realm and control many experts to crazily increase her own strength!”","“Up to now, this Nine-tailed Clan is already the strongest clan in the Demon Realm, and their overall strength is so strong that the other three peak clans can barely contend against them only if they join forces.”"]},{"number":3641,"title":"Chapter 3641 - Protection","paragraphs":["“During this time, the Nine-tailed Clan has been in direct confrontation with the three peak clans. It seems that Miss Xiao’er has the momentum to annex all three peak clans and unify the Demon Realm,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Unify the Demon Realm?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. “Miss Xiao’er is quite ambitious.”","Of course, Jian Wushuang only secretly praised her, but he had no intention of intervening.","After all, his position now was completely different from before.","Just like Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Heaven Ancestor, they had already reached an extraordinary position and reached their level, they had long lost interest in the various conflicts of interests in the Divine Beginning Realm. What they really cared about was the stability of the overall situation in the Divine Beginning Realm.","As long as the Divine Beginning Realm could develop normally, they would not care even if the internal conflicts between the various forces were chaotic.","“Temporal Temple Master, take me to see the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Temporal Temple Master nodded. With a wave of his sleeve, the power of spacetime engulfed Jian Wushuang and disappeared in a flash.","The moment Jian Wushuang and Temporal Temple Master returned to the Divine Beginning Realm, the power of the divine will of the Divine Beginning Realm sensed it at once and informed the three masters of the Saint Realm directly.","In the Life and Death Divine Realm, one of the three Saint Realms.","The grand and tall hall was covered in a dazzling gold.","At the top of the hall, there were three thrones standing side by side. Normally, the three masters of the Saint Realm sat on these thrones, but at this moment, there were three other people sitting on the thrones. As for the three masters of the Saint Realm...they were standing below the great hall with incomparable respect.","The three Rulers who were sitting on the thrones above were naturally the ones who had rushed over from Devil Cloud Star. These three Rulers had been staying in the Sacred Island previously, but now, they had already arrived in the Divine Beginning Realm.","“To be honest, I really don’t want to come to the Divine Beginning Realm. The power of the Heavenly Dao will in a grade three astral world is too great of a restriction to us. We are simply unable to display our strongest strength here.” The tall and big man said.","“That’s right. If we were in our Devil Cloud Star, a grade two astral world, we wouldn’t be subjected to any restrictions at all.” That devilish young man curled his lips and said.","“All of you should bear with it. After all, this is an order from Lord Star Master.” The last one, that child-faced brown-haired old man, advised.","In the vast cosmos, a grade three astral world, because it was the lowest grade of astral world, would naturally be able to bear a smaller range of power.","This was because the laws of the universe gave a grade three world star a great restriction. As long as one’s battle prowess was above the Ruler Realm, they would be greatly suppressed within a grade three world star. They would not be able to display their Ruler Realm battle prowess at all.","However, a grade two world star, because it was of a higher grade, would be able to endure a greater range of power. The Ruler Realm power would not have too much of an effect on a grade two world star. Hence, within a grade two world star...a Ruler could freely display his strength.","Since the three Rulers had come to the Divine Beginning Realm, they would naturally be suppressed by the divine will of the Divine Beginning Realm. The Divine Will was dominated by Devil Cloud Star Master, but the universe laws were inscrutable, even Devil Cloud Star Master could not disobey it.","“Jian Wushuang has returned to the Divine Beginning Realm?” The tall man looked down.","“Yes, not only that, master also said that Jian Wushuang has broken through to become a Principles Master. As for his battle strength, I’m afraid he can already rival a Ruler,” one of the three Saint Realm Masters said, Life and Death Saint Master said.","“A Principles Master can rival a Ruler? That’s a perfect chaotic creature. No wonder Star Master is a little afraid of him,” the tall man sighed.","“Since Jian Wushuang’s battle strength can fight against a Ruler, and he’s only a Principles Master in the Divine Beginning Realm, his strength won’t be suppressed. In other words, he can easily defeat any one of us one-on-one in the Divine Beginning Realm. Even if the three of us join hands, we might be able to fight him head-on,” the evil-looking young man said.","“It’s like this. Even if we have that treasure in our hands, it’s impossible for the three of us to kill him in the Divine Beginning Realm,” said the white-haired old man.","“If that’s the case, then why does Lord Star Master want the three of us to come to the Divine Beginning Realm?” The tall man asked in a deep voice.","“If I’m not wrong, Lord Star Master’s order should be that he wants the three of us to do our best to protect these three Saint Realms.” The white-haired old man looked down at the three Saint Realm Masters below.","“Protect these three trash?” The tall man glanced at the three Saint Realm Masters below, but the corners of his mouth curled up in disdain.","He could tell at a glance that these three Saint Realm Masters in front of him were actually only at the pinnacle of the six realm.","There were too many peak sixth level Principles Masters in the Universe Battlefield. In their eyes, they were like ants, but because of the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao...these three people were able to display the power of a Saint Realm Master who was stronger than a pinnacle of the six realm.","This tall man naturally did not think much of these three Saint Realm Masters.","And the three Saint Realm Masters below also knew their own weight. When they heard the discussion of the three people above, they had already lowered their heads and did not dare to say a word.","The elder with white hair smiled, he said, “Although these three are not very strong, they are still servants of Star Master. It was not easy for him to find three experts at the peak of the sixth realm in the Divine Beginning Realm who could receive the heavenly will perfectly!”","“Most importantly, these three Saint Realms exist to maintain the order of the Divine Beginning Realm. If they are destroyed by Jian Wushuang, it will be very troublesome to rebuild them in the future. It would be better if they can be preserved.”","“Humph.” The tall man snorted and said in a low voice, “From today on, you three keep a close eye on Jian Wushuang. Report to me immediately if there is any movement.”","“Yes.”","The three masters of the Saint Realm accepted the order.","“Alright, get lost.” The tall man waved his hand.","The three masters of the Saint Realm immediately left in fear. They no longer looked as high and mighty as before.","After the three masters of the Saint Realm left...","“By the way, isn’t that woman Xing Luo in this territory? Why didn’t you find her? She’s much stronger than the three of us. If she helps us, we’ll be able to deal with Jian Wushuang more easily,” the tall man said.","“Xing Luo?” The white-haired elder shook his head. “Although she’s from the Devil Cloud Star, she’s always been very withdrawn. She’s been training her disciple all these years. Even when I sent a message to her, she completely ignored it. I’m afraid that she won’t bother with us unless the Star Master personally gives the order.”","“That woman...” The tall man could only secretly hate her."]},{"number":3642,"title":"Chapter 3642 - The Fourth Heaven","paragraphs":["After returning to the Divine Beginning Realm, Jian Wushuang did not alarm too many people. Instead, he directly headed toward the seal of the Seven Star Divine Realm under the guidance of the Temporal Temple Master.","As the Temporal Temple Master teleported again and again, it did not take long for Jian Wushuang to arrive at a hidden special space.","This special space was barren and devoid of any life. The only thing that existed was a special formation in the center of this special space.","Jian Wushuang and Temporal Temple Master came to the front of the formation.","“Is this...a space passage?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","“It’s a space passage, but it only leads to one place. To open it, you need the power of a Ruler. In the Divine Beginning Realm, although I’m suppressed by the will of the Heavenly Dao, I’m still a Ruler, so I can barely open this space passage,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Where does this space passage lead to? The Seven Star Divine Realm?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“You’ll know when you get there.” Temporal Temple Master smiled and began to open the space passage.","With the divine power of Temporal Temple Master, the space passage quickly began to operate. Complicated and mysterious secret patterns rose up, and a surge of supreme power spread out from the space passage.","“This space passage seems extraordinary?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“Let’s go in,” Temporal Temple Master said and then entered the space passage with Jian Wushuang.","There was a flash of light, and when they reappeared, Jian Wushuang found himself on a vast land.","The land was boundless, but what surprised Jian Wushuang was that there was no life in the land, and it was full of death.","“Where is this?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“This is the Fourth Heaven of the Divine Beginning Realm!” Temporal Temple Master said.","“The Fourth Heaven?” Jian Wushuang was stunned and looked at Temporal Temple Master.","“Yes, the core of the Divine Beginning Realm is the Third Heaven. The Third Heaven is stronger than the first, especially the Third Heaven. The cultivation environment is far better than other places and it is the absolute core of the Divine Beginning Realm. The strongest overlords of the Divine Beginning Realm, such as the three Saint Realms, the four divine clans, and the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, are all in the Third Heaven.”","“But a long time ago, before the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed, there was a total of four heavens at the core of the Divine Beginning Realm. At that time, the Fourth Heaven was the core of the Divine Beginning Realm and the place with the most outstanding cultivation environment. In terms of cultivation conditions, the Fourth Heaven was several times stronger than the Third Heaven!”","“There was only one force in the Fourth Heaven, and that was...Seven Star Mysterious Sect. At that time, Seven Star Mysterious Sect was the only overlord in the Fourth Heaven. At the same time, it also represented its supreme power in the Divine Beginning Realm. Such power is far beyond the three Saint Realms now.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help revealing a shocked expression.","In the past, the Fourth Heaven, which had many times better cultivation conditions than the present Third Heaven, was completely occupied by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. It was evident how powerful the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was.","After a pause, Temporal Temple Master continued, “However, since the battle broke out, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed and the entire Seven Star Divine Realm was sealed. Because of the formation of the seal, not only did it absorb the vitality of countless cultivators, but it also absorbed almost all the vitality of the Fourth Heaven. In addition, the seal has been operating for countless years and still crazily devouring the vitality of the Fourth Heaven. This led to the complete abandonment of the Fourth Heaven.”","Jian Wushuang was shocked.","It used to be the core of the Divine Beginning Realm and the Saint Realm with the best cultivation conditions, but now it had become so lifeless, which made Jian Wushuang sigh in his heart.","“After the Fourth Heaven was completely abandoned, the cultivators could hardly sense the existence of the spiritual Qi of heaven and earth, so they could not cultivate. Therefore, many cultivators in the Fourth Heaven left. After all, no one wanted to stay in a place where they could not even sense the spiritual Qi,” Temporal Temple Master continued to explain.","“Because of this, the Fourth Heaven slowly withdrew from the public’s view until it was forgotten. Until now, most cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm only know of the Third Heaven, but they never knew that there was actually a Fourth Heaven in the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“However, although the Fourth Heaven is abandoned, that seal will still be there. The Seven Star Divine Realm is still inside that seal, so others will forget about this place. However, we won’t. Moreover, because the spiritual qi here has been completely exhausted, the many spatial passages that originally existed in the Fourth Heaven have already lost their use. No one can use the spatial passage to come here again. So, I, the mysterious God, the Heaven Slayer, and the Heaven Ancestor joined hands to wipe out the connection between the Fourth Heaven and the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“This means that in the entire Divine Beginning Realm, only the space passage we took just now can lead to the Fourth Heaven. It’s almost impossible for others to get to the Fourth Heaven through normal means.”","“Is this the only space passage that can lead to the Fourth Heaven?” Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","It was obvious that the Temporal Temple Master and the others had protected the only passage to the Fourth Heaven very tightly. The passage could only be activated by the power of a Ruler. Naturally, over the years, no one could come to the Fourth Heaven except for the Temporal Temple Master and the others.","“That’s not right.” Jian Wushuang suddenly frowned. “If no one can come to the Fourth Heaven and come into contact with the sealed Seven Star Divine Realm, how did the three masters of the Saint Realm open the seal and come to the Seven Star Divine Realm?”","In his previous life, the three masters of the Saint Realm had all come to the Seven Star Divine Realm in the last battle.","If the three masters of the Saint Realm could not come to the Fourth Heaven and come into contact with the seal of the Seven Star Divine Realm, they naturally could not come.","“I just said that it’s impossible to come to the Fourth Heaven through normal channels, but the three masters of the Saint Realm are different. After all, the three masters of the Saint Realm are supported by the power of the will of heaven. They are guided by the will of heaven. Even if they don’t use the space passage, they can still find a way to come to the Fourth Heaven and touch the Seven Star Divine Realm,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“I see.” Jian Wushuang understood.","After all, the Fourth Heaven was in the Divine Beginning Realm. As the heavenly will of the Divine Beginning Realm, it was not difficult for the three masters of the Saint Realm to reach the Fourth Heaven."]},{"number":3643,"title":"Chapter 3643 - Seal","paragraphs":["“By the way, Temporal Temple Master, hasn’t the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master been guarding around the seal? He should be in the Fourth Heaven. How come I don’t see him?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Don’t worry, I’ve sent a message to tell him to come here.” The Temporal Temple Master smiled.","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang saw a figure appear at the end of the barren void.","The figure took one step after another at an incredible speed. In the blink of an eye, he had appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","The figure was a two-meter-tall burly man. He wore scarlet armor and his skin was dark. His long and narrow eyes swept across the sky like a pair of gemstones. His gaze was enough to overshadow the sky and earth, most importantly, he was the burly man’s domineering aura.","This domineering aura was unparalleled. It was as if the entire universe was under his feet.","The man was the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master!","Jian Wushuang had summoned the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master’s consciousness avatar with bamboo leaves on the Saha Island. Apart from its great strength, the most profound influence of the consciousness avatar was its domineering aura.","That domineering aura was really admirable.","The domineering aura of the Consciousness clone was so strong that even Jian Wushuang could not help feeling apprehensive when he saw the real body of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","He knew very well that the reason for his domineering aura was not only because of the cultivation technique and secret skill, but also because of his extremely strong strength.","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was the strongest among the masters in Star Palace. He had long reached the advanced Ruler Realm, so he must be even stronger now.","“Haha, Heavenly Sword Marquis, you’re finally here.” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master’s domineering laughter echoed in the world. His eyes were burning as he looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Greetings, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.” Jian Wushuang bowed slightly.","“Haha, you’re welcome. The Xuan God has already sent me a message. He said that your current strength is barely comparable to that of an advanced Ruler. Your strength is not much weaker than mine. It’s good that I’m bored in this damn place. Now that you’re here, come and fight with me first.” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master’s voice was deep, as soon as he finished speaking, a surge of majestic divine power rose up.","“Um...” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","At this moment, Temporal Temple Master smiled, he said, “Zhan Tian, you’re here to seal the Seven Star Divine Realm, not to fight with you. Moreover, the Fourth Heaven is in the Divine Beginning Realm. You’re also suppressed by the will of the Heavenly Dao here, so your strength is probably not much stronger than mine. However, you’re only a Principles Master, so your strength is not restricted at all.”","“If you fight with him here, aren’t you just asking for trouble?”","“Yes, yes.” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master nodded repeatedly. “I almost told him about this. He is like Xuan Yi, a perfect life-form. A Principles Master can have the battle power of a Ruler, and his strength will not be restricted in the astral world. Fighting with him here is indeed too disadvantageous for me.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, when we get to the Universe Battlefield, we’ll have a good fight.”","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile.","After a simple conversation, he could see that although the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was extremely powerful and domineering, he was a carefree person who did not care about his identity, Jian Wushuang was very willing to make friends with such a person.","“Alright, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, take us to the place where the seal is,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Okay, follow me.”","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master immediately led the way, while Jian Wushuang and Temporal Temple Master immediately followed.","The three of them flew quickly and crossed an extremely long distance. However, they still used more than half of space-time to reach the core area of the Fourth Heaven, where there was a huge circular formation, it covered a long and distant territory.","“Is this the location of the seal?” Jian Wushuang looked at the formation in front of him with a trace of shock.","The formation was so big that it blotted out the sky and the sun. Even with his strength, he could not sense the existence of the edge of the formation.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang could sense that the formation was running at an extremely slow speed. While it was running, the formation was constantly devouring and squeezing the life force of the Fourth Heaven.","“The life force of the Fourth Heaven has almost been completely devoured and squeezed out, but the formation is still devouring?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“There’s no other way. After all, the seal can only be maintained if the formation is in a constant state of operation. As for the energy needed to operate the formation, that’s the reason why Zhan Tian has been staying here for so long!” The Temporal Temple Master said seriously, “Although there isn’t much life force left in the Fourth Heaven and it is difficult to supply the formation with energy, there is still some left.”","“What Zhan Tian needs to do here is to keep an eye on the life force of the Fourth Heaven and not let it be completely cut off. After all, once the life force of the Fourth Heaven is completely cut off, the Fourth Heaven will directly collapse. However, as long as it still has a trace of life force, as long as it doesn’t collapse, it will have a certain amount of recovery ability.”","“At that time, Zhan Tian will replace the Fourth Heaven and supply a large amount of energy to the formation. The energy depends on the natural treasures!","“Over the years, Star Palace, Heaven-cleaving Alliance, Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect have paid an uncountable price to supply the operation of the formation.”","Jian Wushuang was secretly amazed.","He also knew how much energy was needed to maintain such a huge magic array. It was obvious that it could not be maintained by devouring the vitality of the Fourth Heaven, naturally, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the others had put in a lot of effort to maintain this magic array until now.","“Before, there was no other way. This magic array had to keep running. Once it stopped, the seal would exist forever, and it would never be broken. The Seven Star Divine Realm in the seal, as well as the countless experts left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, would never have the chance to see the light of day again. But now that you’re here, everything is easy to handle,” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said with a faint smile.","“Back then, when mystic one used this seal, she said that as long as you reached the level of a Principles Masters, you would be able to open this seal and let the Seven Star Divine Realm see the light of day again. Now, go and try it.”"]},{"number":3644,"title":"Chapter 3644 - Awakened Remnant Soul","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang did not delay any longer and directly rushed toward the seal formation.","“How do I break this seal formation?”","Looking at the vast seal formation in front of him, Jian Wushuang felt a headache.","Although his master had said that as long as he broke through to Principles Master, he would be able to break this seal formation, but he did not know the process and steps of breaking it.","“We don’t know the exact process. You can try to communicate with the seal first,” the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded and closed his eyes immediately. His consciousness had already covered the huge seal formation in front of him.","When his consciousness covered the seal formation, Jian Wushuang immediately connected with the seal formation. At the same time, the remnant soul that had been in the seal gradually woke up.","“Little guy, you’re finally here.” A gentle voice sounded.","Hearing this voice, Jian Wushuang’s body trembled.","He was too familiar with this voice.","“Master, master? Is that you?” Jian Wushuang’s voice trembled.","“It’s me.” The gentle voice sounded again. At the same time, a hazy figure slowly formed in the seal formation.","He was tall and straight, and his face was gentle, giving people an extremely intimate feeling. The faint smile on his face made people’s hearts feel warm.","The familiar face, the familiar smile, and the familiar feeling. It was obvious that the figure who appeared in the seal formation was his master, Xuan Yi!","However, his master had already died, and what appeared here was only a wisp of remnant soul left in the seal formation. This wisp of remnant soul was still very weak and had been sleeping for a long time, it was only when it sensed Jian Wushuang’s aura that the remnant soul was awakened.","Only Jian Wushuang could sense the awakened remnant soul. As for the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the others, they could not sense his existence.","“Little guy, how long has it been since you reincarnated?” Xuan Yi asked.","His remnant soul had been sleeping, but he did not know how long it had been sleeping.","“Master, it has been 100,000 years,” Jian Wushuang replied respectfully.","“100,000 years...it’s a little later than expected, but it doesn’t matter. You were able to break through to become a Principles Master and wake up my remnant soul before coming to the seal formation in the Fourth Heaven. This means that my original plan should have gone smoothly,” Xuan Yi said.","“Yes, I ran into some trouble along the way, and I was hunted down by the three Saint Realms more than once. Fortunately, I wasn’t lucky enough to escape,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Since you’re here, it means that you’ve come into direct contact with the Xuan God, right?” Xuan Yi continued to ask.","“Not only Senior Xuan God, but also the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor. I’ve come into contact with them, and thanks to the help of these four seniors, I’ve been able to get to where I am today,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Have they told you about your mission and the Ultimate Secrets of the World?” Xuan Yi asked.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“In that case, you should know what you should do.” Xuan Yi smiled slightly and then said, “Last question, how is your strength now?”","“Master, I just broke through to Principles Master not long ago, but because I have gotten some good opportunities over the years, I can barely match an advanced Ruler in strength. With the help of Senior Xuan God, I got a supreme true treasure magic weapon. Now, my battle strength is definitely not lower than an advanced Ruler. If I really fight with my life, I won’t be afraid even if I meet some terrifying existences among the advanced Rulers. The only difference is that there are some restrictions on the use of the heaven-cleaving skill,” Jian Wushuang said.","Previously, Jian Wushuang had more or less concealed his strength.","Even when Daoist Xuan God, Temporal Temple Master, and divine ancestor had asked, Jian Wushuang had only been able to fight against a Ruler. However, he had not told them the exact level of his battle strength.","However, he was now facing his most respected and grateful master, Xuan Yi. He did not conceal his strength at all and was able to tell them all of his trump cards and strength.","This was his absolute trust and trust in his master.","“That’s right. You’ve just broken through and are already able to fight against a high-level Ruler. This is something that I would have to fight for in the past.” Xuan Yi laughed, “As for the heaven severing art...this secret art is very unique. Back then, I was able to create it because I encountered an incredible opportunity. In addition, my luck was also very good. However, this secret art consumes a lot of divine power. Fortunately, our perfect lifeforce is rich in divine power. If it was someone else, even a Ruler would not be able to use this secret art so many times.”","“As long as you use this secret skill properly, it will improve your strength. As for whether you want to use this secret skill in the future, it’s up to you.”","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","“Well, I’ve asked you so many questions. In fact, I just want to know your situation these years. Now it seems that it’s not bad.” Xuan Yi smiled, he continued, “You are here to break the seal formation?”","“Yes, master, but how can I break the seal formation?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Break the formation?” Xuan Yi’s expression changed, but then he smiled and said, “It is not difficult for you to break the formation, but it is not easy to say it is easy.”","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“Little guy, I’ll tell you the truth. The reason why the seal formation has always existed is not only to protect the sleeping experts in the Seven Star Divine Realm and give the Seven Star Mysterious Sect a chance to rise again, but also for a more important purpose,” Xuan Yi said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was even more confused.","“Little guy, Xuan God and the others must have told you that I tried to possess the power of the Divine Beginning Realm’s will after I broke through to the Principles Master Realm. Unfortunately, I tried countless times and failed,” Xuan Yi said.","“Senior Xuan God told me about this. He said that you tried millions of times and failed. In the end, you concluded that to possess the power of the Divine Beginning Realm’s will again, you have to break through to the Ruler Realm with your perfect life,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes, but it’s not just that.” Xuan Yi’s expression became serious."]},{"number":3645,"title":"Chapter 3645 - Small Astral World","paragraphs":["“When I broke through to become a Principles Master, I tried to take over the Divine Beginning Realm again. In the end, I tried millions of times. Although I failed, I could feel that I had the chance to take over the Divine Beginning Realm again. It was just that I wasn’t strong enough.”","“Therefore, I thought that as long as I broke through to become a Ruler, I would be able to take over the Divine Beginning Realm again. But soon, as my strength improved and my vision became more and more profound, I understood that it was not as simple as breaking through to become a Ruler to take over the Divine Beginning Realm again,” Xuan Yi said.","“It’s not just about becoming a Ruler?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","It was already extremely difficult to become a Ruler. Jian Wushuang was still a long way from becoming a Ruler.","However, he did not expect that he would need more than that to take over the Divine Beginning Realm.","“If I just break through to the Ruler Realm, even though my power will greatly increase and most importantly, my soul will also undergo a metamorphosis, which will be of great help when I take over the Divine Beginning Realm, the current Divine Beginning Realm is not at its weakest stage. It has already evolved to the middle stage. Moreover, the Divine Beginning Realm was seized once before. Now, the power of the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm is dominated by that Devil Cloud Star Master.”","“The Heavenly Dao will, which is dominated by Devil Cloud Star Master, is completely different from the Heavenly Dao will of an ordinary astral world. The Heavenly Dao will of an ordinary astral world has no emotions and no thoughts. It only knows how to operate according to the laws of the universe. Even if it is suddenly possessed, its ability to resist is limited.”","“However, Devil Cloud Star Master is a human cultivator. Moreover, he is an extremely terrifying Ruler-level great being. If he is possessed, he will definitely resist with all his might. If it is at the last moment, he might even do some crazy actions. For example, he might directly self-destruct, causing the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm to completely collapse. Without the restriction of the Heavenly Dao will, the Divine Beginning Realm would similarly collapse without the operation of the principles.”","“Or, he could directly control the will of the Heavenly Dao to destroy the Divine Beginning Realm...these are all consequences that we can not accept.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression became extremely grave.","Indeed.","Devil Cloud Star Master was not a cultivator in the Divine Beginning Realm at all. He possessed the Divine Beginning Realm only for his own cultivation and to help him increase his strength. As for the Divine Beginning Realm itself, he did not care.","Under normal circumstances, he would not destroy the will of the heavenly axiom or control the will of the heavenly axiom to destroy the Divine Beginning Realm. At most, he would forcefully speed up the evolution of the Divine Beginning Realm, let him gain more in a short time.","However, when the time came, when Jian Wushuang could pose a great threat to it and could take over the Divine Beginning Realm again, and he could not stop it, he could not be sure, he was not sure if he would do something crazy.","After all, if he could not stop Jian Wushuang and let him take over the Divine Beginning Realm again, then the Divine Beginning Realm would have nothing to do with him.","Since he could not get it himself, he might not let others get it either.","“That’s why I was worried. I was worried that even if you broke through to become a Ruler, you would not be able to take back the Divine Beginning Realm. That’s why I specially left this seal formation to completely seal the Seven Star Divine Realm inside,” Xuan Yi said.","“Master, is there anything special about this seal formation?” Jian Wushuang asked, puzzled.","“Of course there is.” Xuan Yi smiled. “This seal formation is a great opportunity that I obtained in the past. Its function is very strange. Not only does it completely seal the Seven Star Divine Realm inside, but most importantly, the seal formation will gradually evolve over a long period of time.”","“Evolve?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“The original sealing formation will gradually evolve into a complete world, and it will even gradually give birth to the power of the will that can dominate this world,” Xuan Yi said mysteriously.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was shocked. “A complete world? It can even give birth to the power of the will that dominates this world? Isn’t that the same as an ordinary astral world?”","“Yes, when the sealing formation is activated to the end, it is equivalent to forming a small astral world!” Xuan Yi smiled. “This small astral world also has its own operating rules. The power of the will that dominates this world is equivalent to the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm. To put it bluntly, it is an astral world, but it is much smaller than an ordinary third-level astral world. However, the basic operating rules, including the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao, are still there.”","“Of course, in many aspects, this small astral world can not be compared to the astral world that is naturally born from the universal magic array. For example, in the growth space, an ordinary level three astral world can give birth to countless Immortal Saints and a large number of Principles Masters, including a few experts at the Ruler Realm. However, after the evolution of the sealing magic array, this small astral world can not even give birth to an Immortal Saint. You should know this very well.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He had walked out of the seal formation and knew very well what the limit of a cultivator’s growth was in the world inside the seal formation.","In the seal formation, aside from the experts left behind by the Seven Star Divine Realm and the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, the strongest experts born in the world seemed to be at the Chaos Realm. In the ordinary astral world...the Chaos Realm was no different from an ant.","“Although there is no room for growth in this small astral world and no experts can be expected to be born in it, there is one thing. It has a normal cycle of Heavenly Dao, which is not much different from that of the ordinary astral world. If you can master this small astral world and fully understand its Heavenly Dao operating principles, it will be of great help to you when you take over the Divine Beginning Realm in the future!” Xuan Yi said.","Jian Wushuang understood.","If what his master said was true, this small astral world would not be too different from the Divine Beginning Realm’s Heavenly Dao operation rules, then he would be able to master the small astral world, it was equivalent to completely understanding the process of the Divine Beginning Realm’s Heavenly Dao operation rules. In the future, when he started to possess again, the process of possession would definitely be much easier.","“I’ve said before that the Divine Beginning Realm’s Heavenly Dao will is now controlled by Devil Cloud Star. He knows how to resist and how to risk his life. He might even make crazy moves. But if you’ve already broken through to the Ruler Realm and have a complete understanding of the Divine Beginning Realm’s Heavenly Dao operating principles, then you can easily take possession of the Divine Beginning Realm again. You Won’t give him any chance to counterattack!” Xuan Yi said seriously."]},{"number":3646,"title":"Chapter 3646 - Refine?","paragraphs":["“I see.” Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","“Mastering this small astral world will not only make it easier for you to take over the Divine Beginning Realm in the future, but it also has a complete cycle of Heavenly Dao. As long as you master it, it will be of great benefit to your cultivation. At the very least, it will be of great help to you in breaking through to the Ruler Realm,” Xuan Yi added.","Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat.","Yes, Devil Cloud Star Master was originally just an ordinary Ruler who could not even make it on the planet. However, it was because he had taken over the Divine Beginning Realm by chance that his strength had greatly improved, he had become the overlord of Devil Cloud Star. It could be said that Devil Cloud Star Master had gained a lot of benefits after taking over the Divine Beginning Realm.","The benefits he could gain from mastering the miniature astral world derived from the sealing formation were far from that of possessing a normal astral world. However, there were still some benefits, Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master and was far from being a Ruler. If he could master such a miniature astral world at this time, he would definitely gain a lot of benefits.","“But master, how can I master this small astral world?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“There’s only one way for you to master this small astral world, and that is to completely refine it,” Xuan Yi said.","“Refine it?” Jian Wushuang was stunned. “Refine it like refining a supreme treasure? But how can I do that?”","Jian Wushuang knew himself well.","Although it was only a small astral world, it was once a Seven Star Divine Realm. Its territory was also extremely vast, and it had formed a complete cycle of Heavenly Dao. How could such a small astral world be refined so easily, how could it be refined so easily?","“Don’t worry. Although this small astral world is extremely difficult to refine, it was created by me. When I created it again, I had left some methods behind. As long as it is a perfect life form at the level of a Principles Master, it can be refined. Of course, the refining process will not be easy,” Xuan Yi said with a smile.","“Master, what should I do?” Jian Wushuang asked respectfully.","“You can leave here now and find an ownerless Secret Realm. You can try to refine it first,” Xuan Yi said.","“Secret Realm?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“All Principles Masters will create their own Secret Realm. However, there are two ways to do it. One is to spend a long time and energy to create a complete world based on the circular shape of the heaven and earth and many treasures. This way, you can really create a Secret Realm with your own strength. This Secret Realm is the most complete and most helpful to the strength of Principles Masters!”","“Under normal circumstances, when a Principles Master uses his own methods to open up a complete Heaven and Earth Secret Realm, this Principles Master will have an additional will power.”","“The second method of opening up can be said to be a shortcut. It doesn’t require too much time and energy. It’s just to directly find a Heaven and Earth Secret Realm that has no owner or is already broken and no one cares about it. Refine this Heaven and Earth Secret Realm again and turn it into your own.”","“However, because I didn’t create the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm in this way from the very beginning, even if I refined it in the end, I would still get a portion of the power of the will. However, this Principles Master is unable to fully display the power of the will. Most of the time, I can only display 80-90% of the power of the will.","“Because of this, in the Divine Beginning Realm, only a small number of Principles Masters who find it troublesome or have no ambition would find a helpless Secret Realm to refine it. Most Principles Masters would choose to test their ability to open a Secret Realm, but for you, there is no need to spend so much time and energy to open a Secret Realm.” Xuan Yi said.","“Why?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Did they not say that only by opening the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm could he exert the strongest power of the will?","“It’s simple. First, you have to open the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm by yourself. It takes too much time and energy. You are the only hope of the Divine Beginning Realm. The Devil Cloud Star Master knows about your existence and may come here at any time. Therefore, you have to make every second count and try to improve your strength as fast as possible. It’s unnecessary to spend so much time and energy just to gain a little power of the will!","“Most importantly, with the small astral world that I prepared for you, you don’t need to open the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm?","“Even if you do open it, will the power of your will be better than the power of your will given by the small astral world?” Xuan Yi sneered.","“Master, you mean, you want me to refine this small astral world into my Heaven and Earth Secret Realm?” Jian Wushuang widened his eyes.","“Yes, the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm is a world, and this small astral world is also a world. Why not refine this small astral world into your Heaven and Earth Secret Realm?” Xuan Yi said with a smile.","“But, this is a bit too exaggerated,” Jian Wushuang said in surprise.","Exaggerated. In his opinion, this was indeed too exaggerated.","Previously, when Xuan Yi asked him to refine this small astral world, he thought it was incredible. However, Xuan Yi actually wanted him to refine this small astral world as if it was a Heaven and Earth Secret Realm.","The Heaven and Earth Secret Realm was his own heaven and earth. The strength of the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm could determine how much will power he could obtain and how much strength he could increase.","If he really refined such a huge small astral world into his Heaven and Earth Secret Realm, how much will power would he get?","How strong would he be able to increase his strength?","Just thinking about it made Jian Wushuang feel that it was incredible.","Could such an incredible thing really be realized?","“Little guy, I deliberately arranged this seal formation to transform it into a small astral world so that you could refine it into a Secret Realm. This is my last surprise for you. As for the refining process, don’t doubt it. As long as you do as I say, I’m sure you can refine this small astral world into your Secret Realm,” Xuan Yi said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and suppressed the excitement in his heart. He bowed respectfully and said, “Master, please teach me!”","“I’ve already taught you again. First, find an ownerless Secret Realm to refine. After refining it and accumulating experience, you can directly destroy the Secret Realm...”"]},{"number":3647,"title":"Chapter 3647 - Arrived in the Demon Realm","paragraphs":["“Under normal circumstances, when the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm is destroyed, the power of the will given to it will completely collapse. This is certainly an unprecedented heavy blow for an ordinary Principles Master, but for you, a perfect life, it’s nothing more than the loss of some divine power. However, you have gained the experience of refining the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm. Next, you will come here and refine this small astral world. It will be twice the result with half the effort,” Xuan Yi said.","“I see. In that case, I’ll come here after refining a Heaven and Earth Secret Realm,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Go.” Xuan Yi waved his hand.","Jian Wushuang bowed respectfully and returned to his original body.","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes again outside the huge seal formation.","“My young friend, how is it? Can you break the seal formation?” Temporal Temple Master looked over immediately.","“Yes, I can, but there are still some steps to be taken.” Jian Wushuang told them about how he saw Xuan Yi’s remnant soul in the seal and their conversation.","After hearing this, both Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were shocked.","“No wonder Xuan Yi told us to find a way to keep the seal working before he died. I see.”","“The purpose of the seal formation is not only to protect the experts left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, but also to allow you to better possess the Divine Beginning Realm.” Temporal Temple Master sighed quietly.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you’re looking for an ownerless Secret Realm to refine, right?” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master looked over.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“It’s easy. Although it’s difficult to find an ownerless Secret Realm under normal circumstances, since you need it, we can find a Principles Master who has opened the Secret Realm and kill him. Then we can forcibly take his Secret Realm,” the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“No need.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand. “I happen to know where there is an ownerless Secret Realm that is suitable for me to refine. I once promised the owner of the Secret Realm that I would do something for him. Although I have done all these things, I haven’t returned to give him an answer. It’s a good time for me to go there.”","Jian Wushuang was talking about the Xue Bei Secret Realm!","Back then, he had obtained a great opportunity in the Xue Bei Secret Realm. He had indeed promised Xue Bei to help him go to the bloodline of the Blood Ancestor in the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect to accomplish some things. He had already done that. At that time, Xue Bei had told him to go back there and refine the Xue Bei Secret Realm, after he became a Principles Master, he could go back there and refine the Xue Bei Secret Realm.","Now that Jian Wushuang had become a Principles Master and his strength was comparable to a Ruler, the Xue Bei Secret Realm was no longer attractive to him. However, now that he needed to refine a Secret Realm to accumulate experience, the Xue Bei Secret Realm became his first choice.","He could also go back and give an answer to the Xue Bei Secret Realm.","“The Xue Bei Secret Realm is in the Endless Territory. Since I’m going to the Endless Territory, I might as well go to the Third Heaven and pick up my parents,” Jian Wushuang thought.","His parents, Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin, originally came from the Endless Territory. They were forced to come to the Third Heaven because of him. It had been more than 100,000 years, Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin definitely wanted to go back to the Endless Territory and visit their hometown.","“My young friend, since you already have a Heaven and Earth Secret Realm that you can refine, you can go. With your current strength, you can do whatever you want in the Divine Beginning Realm. There’s no need for us to remind you anymore,” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. Soon, he left the Fourth Heaven and headed toward the Third Heaven.","In the Divine Beginning Realm, Jian Wushuang’s every move was watched by the will of heaven. When Jian Wushuang arrived at the Third Heaven, the will of heaven immediately informed the three masters of the Saint Realm about it.","The three masters of the Saint Realm immediately looked as if they were facing a great enemy.","“My lords, Heavenly Sword Marquis has already arrived at the Third Heaven. It is very likely that he has come directly to the three Saint Realms.” The three masters of the Saint Realm stood there respectfully, their faces full of anxiety.","“What are you three worried about?”","The three masters who were sitting high above looked down with cold eyes. “Even if Heavenly Sword Marquis’ power isn’t restricted in the Divine Beginning Realm, he’s only one person. His battle strength is at most comparable to an ordinary primary Ruler. With his battle strength, even if the three of us are restricted, as long as we work together, we can still suppress him.”","“You’re right. If Heavenly Sword Marquis is alone, there’s no need to worry at all. If he comes and the three of us work together, he definitely won’t be able to gain any advantage. If he’s a bit careless and I find an opportunity to use that divine weapon, I might even be able to kill him.” The white-haired elder smiled.","“You can leave now. Just keep an eye on Heavenly Sword Marquis. There’s no need to make a fuss.” The evil-looking young man waved his hand.","The three masters of the Saint Realm were still worried, but they had no choice but to leave.","The three masters of the Saint Realm were worried that Jian Wushuang’s purpose in coming to the Third Heaven was to attack the three Saint Realms. However, they did not know that Jian Wushuang had no intention of attacking the three Saint Realms directly.","After arriving at the Third Heaven, he headed straight for the Demon Realm.","The Floating-fire City was one of the eight cities in the Demon Realm that could be called the ‘Pure Land’!","When Jian Wushuang first came to the Demon Realm, his parents in this life, as well as his eldest sister and second brother, all lived in the Floating-fire City.","However, when he came to the Floating-fire City again, he did not find any trace of his parents.","“They are not in the Floating-fire City?” Jian Wushuang was not surprised.","He had heard from Temporal Temple Master that one of the biggest changes in the Divine Beginning Realm over the years was the rise of the Nine-tailed Clan in the Demon Realm. The rise of the Nine-tailed Clan was unstoppable, forcing the other three peak clans to join forces, they could only fight together.","The eight cities in the Demon Realm were still ‘Pure Land’ on the surface, but in the dark, the Nine-tailed Clan and the other three peak clans were in charge, now that the Nine-tailed Clan was fighting with the three peak clans, it was no longer safe for his parents to stay in the Floating-fire City.","Therefore, if nothing went wrong, his parents, his elder sister, and his second brother should be in the Nine-tailed Clan and protected by them.","“Let’s go to the Nine-tailed Clan.”","Jian Wushuang immediately flew toward the Nine-tailed Clan."]},{"number":3648,"title":"Chapter 3648 - Young Master Sha","paragraphs":["The Nine-tailed Clan was once one of the four great God clans, and it was not considered very powerful among the four great God clans. But now, the Nine-tailed Clan was publicly recognized as the number one clan in the demon area, and its strength was so strong...it was already far above any other peak clan. Even if the other three peak clans joined forces, they could only barely contend with the current Nine-tailed Clan.","The vast tribal land was covered by a huge array.","This array was the Nine-tailed Clan’s guardian array, the five elements array.","Although this array was broken by Marquis Duan Yu in the battle back then, it was only temporarily broken. After the battle ended, the Nine-tailed Clan would be able to restart this array...under the rule of Miss Xiao’er, the Nine-tailed Clan became stronger and stronger. They used more treasures and resources in the formation, making it stronger than before.","Now, the formation was like an iron wall. Even a master of the Saint Realm would not be able to shake it.","However, this formation was not a threat to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s figure flashed and he arrived at the edge of the light membrane. He casually raised his finger and pointed at the light membrane in front of him. A faint divine power spread out.","In an instant, a passage appeared in the light membrane that allowed people to enter and exit normally, but the magic array itself did not change or move at all.","Until Jian Wushuang entered the Nine-tailed Clan through the passage, there was no movement. The experts of the Nine-tailed Clan did not notice anything.","After entering the ancestral land of the Nine-tailed Clan, Jian Wushuang directly spread out his soul power. Immediately, the entire Nine-tailed Clan was exposed in front of him.","“As expected, father and mother are indeed in the Nine-tailed Clan.” Jian Wushuang smiled slightly.","He had sensed the aura of his parents. They were now in a manor in the north of the ancestral land of the Nine-tailed Clan. There were not only many guards in the manor, they were also completely protected by magic arrays. It was clear that Miss Xiao’er had done a good job in protecting his parents.","“After nearly 100,000 years, the Nine-tailed Clan is indeed much stronger than before. There are more than 100 Principles Masters in the clan land alone?","“There are seven Principles Masters in the six realms of the void. Two of them have reached the pinnacle of the six realm, and one of them has reached the pinnacle of the six realm?”","Jian Wushuang felt the more powerful auras in the Nine-tailed Clan, but he was quite surprised.","He knew that Miss Xiao’er had mastered the nine-life charming heaven skill, and her charming skills were so powerful that she could control people without making a sound. With such skills, he could easily control a large number of experts, it was normal for him to control some experts of the six realms.","Even if she controlled two experts of the pinnacle of the six realm, Jian Wushuang could understand it.","But what Jian Wushuang did not expect was that there was another expert of the pinnacle of the six realm in the Nine-tailed Clan?","Although the pinnacle of the six realm was nothing to Jian Wushuang now, it was definitely the pinnacle of existence in the Divine Beginning Realm, second only to the Rulers and the three masters of the Saint Realm.","He remembered that 100,000 years ago, he had asked Elder Dark Bone and learned that there was only one other expert at the pinnacle of the six realm in the Divine Beginning Realm, except for Elder Dark Bone himself and the recently broken through Demon Master Chenhuo, there was only one other expert at the pinnacle of the six realm in the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","Could it be that the other expert at the pinnacle of the six realm was the one in the Nine-tailed Clan?","“No wonder the Nine-tailed Clan is recognized as the number one clan in the Demon Realm. Even the other three peak clans could barely fight against it. It turns out that the strength of the Nine-tailed Clan has reached such a level.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, he did not care about this.","But at this moment...","“Huh?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed and he frowned slightly.","He was still standing in the void above the Nine-tailed Clan. No one could detect his presence. He looked at the manor where his parents lived, outside the manor, several figures stopped a woman who was about to enter the manor.","“Princess Ying, why are you in such a hurry to go back without even greeting me?”","Among those people, the leader was an evil-looking young man in a white robe. This evil-looking young man had a wicked smile on his face as he stared at the beautiful woman in front of him. While he was talking...his hand even patted the woman’s shoulder symbolically.","The beautiful woman was startled. She immediately took a few steps back and said coldly, “Young Master Sha, I already have a husband. Please have some self-respect.”","“Haha, so what if I have a husband?”","There were many cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm who had lived for a long time. After such a long time, it was normal for them to have dozens or even hundreds of husbands. So what?","“Princess Ying, in my opinion, why don’t you give up that useless husband of yours and follow me from now on?” The evil smile on the white-robed wicked young man’s face became more prominent, he moved closer to the beautiful woman and extended his hand toward her.","“Stop!”","A fierce shout suddenly sounded, and a figure hurriedly walked out of the manor.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing in the void above, smiled when he saw the person who walked out.","The person who walked out was his second brother, Zhuo Peng. As for the beautiful woman, of course, it was his wife, Princess Ying of the Blood Marten Clan.","“Young Master Sha, what are you doing?”","Zhuo Peng came to Princess Ying’s side and after comforting Princess Ying, he turned his ashen face toward the white-robed man, who was also Young Master Sha.","“What do you mean what am I doing? Did I do anything?” The expression on that Young Master Sha’s face had also changed, becoming somewhat sinister and cold.","“Hmph, it’s best that you didn’t do anything. Otherwise...you should be clear of the orders given by the Nine-tailed Clan Master. The people of our Clearwater Villa are different from those ordinary members of the Nine-tailed Clan. You’d better show some respect.” Zhuo Peng said with a cold snort.","After he finished speaking, Zhuo Peng no longer paid attention to this Young Master Sha. He brought Princess Ying and directly returned to the manor.","When he saw Zhuo Peng and Princess Ying enter the manor, that Young Master Sha’s expression completely darkened.","“Young master, this subordinate doesn’t understand. This Zhuo Peng is merely an ant at the level of a saint. As for that Princess Ying, although she is a princess of the Blood Marten Clan, the Blood Marten Clan is nothing in front of you. Why don’t you just use force?” A servant beside Young Master Sha could not help but ask."]},{"number":3649,"title":"Chapter 3649 - The Woman He Took a Fancy To","paragraphs":["This servant was very clear about Young Master Sha’s identity and the power in his hands.","A mere Blood Marten Clan, this Young Master Sha would not put them in his eyes at all. But in reality, this Young Master Sha had been bumping into a wall all these years, and had no way of getting that Princess Ying.","When he heard the servant’s words...this Young Master Sha shouted in a low voice, “Idiot, what do you know? If I could use force, this young master would have used force long ago. Do I need you to say that? However, this Clearwater Villa is indeed very different from the members of the Nine-tailed Clan.”","“When father and I came to the Nine-tailed Clan, the Nine-tailed Clan Master had already said on the spot that no matter who I wanted to obtain in the entire Nine-tailed Clan, it would not be a problem. However, I can not touch this Clearwater Villa. You must know that his words were said in front of my father.”","“In front of master?” The servant was shocked.","“The Nine-tailed Clan Master has been asking for help from father all these years. She is usually very polite to father. However, she said these words unyieldingly that time. It is obvious that the Clearwater Villa has a high position in her heart. I have investigated the Clearwater Villa over the years and know that the reason why it is special is because the third son of the Clearwater Villa is the Heavenly Sword Marquis who shocked the entire Divine Beginning Realm!","“Heavenly Sword Marquis!” Young Master Sha said.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis!” The servant was shocked.","Heavenly Sword Marquis...in the Divine Beginning Realm, as long as one was an undying saint or a Principles Master, there was no one who did not know his name.","He was the number one monster in the history of the Divine Beginning Realm. At the level of a saint, he dared to face the three great Saint Realm Masters head-on. Although it had been almost 100,000 years, Heavenly Sword Marquis had disappeared without a trace, however, the stories and legends about him had been circulating in the Divine Beginning Realm.","“The talent and potential of this Heavenly Sword Marquis are indeed incredible. Moreover, his background is extraordinary. Even my father didn’t dare to underestimate him. He also told me not to provoke the people of the Clearwater Villa. However, I’ve been staying in the Nine-tailed Clan all these years. Although the clansmen of the Nine-tailed Clan are all charming and charming, I’ve long been tired of playing with them. And this Princess Ying of the Blood Marten Clan is indeed very attractive, so...”","Young Master Sha did not finish his words, but his servants already understood what he meant.","They had been following Young Master Sha all this time, and they knew very well what kind of character this Young Master Sha was. He was a master who relied on his father to act in a lawless manner. Ever since they had followed Young Master Sha...as long as it was a woman that Young Master Sha looked like, there was almost nothing that could not be obtained.","Even if the other party had some background and some power, as long as Young Master Sha wanted it, he could easily get it. That was because those backgrounds were nothing in front of Young Master Sha’s father. No matter what kind of enemies he provoked...his father could easily deal with them.","Only this time, he was tired of playing with the Nine-tailed Clan’s clansmen. Then, he took a fancy to Princess Ying. However, Princess Ying was a member of the Clearwater Villa. To that third brother of the Clearwater Villa, the legendary genius of the Divine Beginning Realm...although his father was not afraid, he did not want to provoke her easily.","Therefore, he had been eyeing this Princess Ying for many years. However, he didn’t dare to use force. At most, he just wanted to find an opportunity to harass her.","“Young master, since this Princess Ying has the backing of Heavenly Sword Marquis, do you want to give up on her?” The servant next to him asked in a low voice.","“Give up?” Young Master Sha snickered, “There has never been a woman that I haven’t been able to get. It’s the same for Princess Ying. So what if she has the backing of the Heavenly Sword Marquis? That Heavenly Sword Marquis has already disappeared without a trace for nearly 100,000 years. Who knows if he’s dead or alive now?","“Moreover, I’m not stupid. I won’t really force my way into the Clearwater Villa to snatch her. I can wait for an opportunity!”","“As far as I know, this Princess Ying will be accompanied by Zhuo Peng every once in a while. She will stay with a few guards and return to the Blood Marten Clan. Although the Nine-tailed Clan and the Blood Marten Clan are allies, they are two different tribes after all. There isn’t a direct spatial passageway. She will still have to return to the Nine-tailed Clan on her own, and we can definitely make our move on the way!”","“Kill their guards. Kill Zhuo Peng. Don’t give them any chance to send a message or call for help. As for Princess Ying, suppress her first. When I’m tired of playing with her, I’ll just kill her. There are many dangers in the demon territory, and there are countless ways to kill them. As long as our hands and feet are clean, who can guess that we did it?”","“As for Heavenly Sword Marquis, even if he does come back one day, he won’t be able to find us.”","“Young master is wise.”","The servants immediately began to compliment Young Master Sha upon hearing his words.","Young Master Sha’s face was also filled with a proud smile.","However, they did not know that their conversation had been heard by Jian Wushuang, who was in the void above them, and that Jian Wushuang’s expression had become extremely cold.","Whoosh!","Without any warning, Jian Wushuang had already dived down.","Outside the Clearwater Villa, Master Sha still looked at the manor with some reluctance. He waved his hand and said, “Let’s go back and find a few clansmen of the Nine-tailed Clan to play with.”","Master Sha turned around, and so did his servants.","But when they turned around, they were shocked to find that a figure had appeared in front of them.","This human figure had arrived too suddenly.","One had to know that although this Young Master Sha was only a peak level undying saint, his father had personally arranged for those ordinary people. They were all Principles Masters, and the one who had just talked to this Young Master Sha...was also a peak fourth level Principles Master.","This kind of strength was already an extremely tyrannical existence in the Divine Beginning Realm.","However, even the Principles Master, who had reached the fourth realm, did not realize when this figure had arrived behind them.","“Who are you?” Master Sha frowned and looked at the person in front of him.","“You just said that you would kill Princess Ying and Zhuo Peng on her way back to the Blood Marten Clan?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold as he stared at Master Sha.","“So what if I did?” Master Sha said coldly. He did not expect that his conversation with his servant would be heard by the person in front of him.","“Nothing. I just want to tell you that you died because of what you just said.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were emotionless. As soon as he finished speaking, he slowly raised his right index finger, he pointed at Master Sha."]},{"number":3650,"title":"Chapter 3650 - Beheading Sha","paragraphs":["“No!”","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s sudden attack, the faces of the servants of Master Sha changed greatly.","These ordinary people were arranged by Sha’s father to stay by Sha’s side in order to protect’s safety. Now that they saw someone actually make a move on Sha’s son...even though they did not know who the person in front of them was, they did not hesitate to rush forward to stop Jian Wushuang.","However, just as they moved, a trace of divine power swept out from Jian Wushuang’s body and covered them at the same time.","There were four servants beside Master Sha, all of whom were Principles Masters. However, when the trace of divine power covered them, the four Principles Masters looked terrified and all four of them stopped in their tracks, three of them watched as their divine bodies began to collapse.","They could not stop the collapse at all, and their divine power was also rapidly disappearing.","In an instant, the divine bodies of the three Principles Masters completely collapsed, and the three figures also completely disappeared from this world.","The only one who survived was the Principles Master who had reached the fourth realm of the void.","Although he was not dead, he could not move at all. He could only look at the ‘disappearance’ of his three servants in horror. At the same time, Jian Wushuang pointed his right index finger at Young Master Sha. There was no change on the surface of Young Master Sha’s face, but the divine power in his body had been wiped out in an instant. His breath had been completely cut off, leaving only a cold corpse. He was still standing there with his eyes wide open.","From the beginning to the end, neither the three servants nor the young master had the time to scream, but all four of them died.","“Do you know why you are not like them?” Jian Wushuang withdrew his palm and looked at the servant who had reached the fourth void realm indifferently.","The servant was already scared silly. Hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, he looked at Jian Wushuang with a dull expression.","“You didn’t die because I want you to bring the corpse of your master to your master and tell him why he died. The person who killed him is called Heavenly Sword Marquis.”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was very calm, but it sounded like thunder in the servant’s ears.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis? He is Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","The servant was shocked.","Heavenly Sword Marquis was very famous in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Even though he had disappeared for nearly 100,000 years, all kinds of legends about him were still circulating in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Just now, he had talked about Heavenly Sword Marquis with Master Sha. He knew that even the person behind them did not want to provoke Heavenly Sword Marquis. Now, the person who killed Master Sha...Heavenly Sword Marquis!","“You can leave now.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand.","The servant did not dare to stay any longer. He immediately picked up Master Sha’s body and rushed to the void nearby.","Jian Wushuang glanced in the direction where the servant left, but a cold smile appeared on his face. “Master Sha’s father should be at the pinnacle of the six realm, the pinnacle of the six realm of the Nine-tailed Clan...haha, I hope he can make a smart choice.”","To him, Master Sha was obviously targeting his family. He even planned to kill Princess Ying on her way back to the Blood Marten Clan. After all, Princess Ying was his sister-in-law and Zhuo Peng was his second brother.","Since he wanted to kill his family, he would kill them without hesitation, no matter who they were or what their status was.","Moreover, he could do whatever he wanted in the Divine Beginning Realm. He did not even care about the three Saint Realms. As for the father behind Master Sha, Jian Wushuang did not care about him at all.","“If he doesn’t know what’s good for him, then it’s not my fault.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a sharp light, and then he walked into the Clearwater Villa.","The array of the Clearwater Villa was nothing to Jian Wushuang. He clearly came to the Clearwater Villa and soon arrived outside the hall.","Before entering the hall, Jian Wushuang heard the conversations of his relatives in the hall.","“Ying ‘er, don’t worry. As long as the Clearwater Villa is still standing, Master Sha won’t dare to hurt you.” Zhuo Peng comforted Princess Ying in his arms.","“The Nine-tailed Clan Master has long given the order that no one is allowed to act impudently in the Clearwater Villa. Although that Young Master Sha has an extremely impressive father, but when faced with the Nine-tailed Clan Master’s explicit orders, he would not dare to overstep his boundaries. However, this Young Master Sha’s status and status is clearly there. All these years, he has been acting wantonly within the Nine-tailed Clan and no one has been able to control him. Now that he has set his sights on Ying ‘er and sister-in-law, that will definitely be a big problem for us.” Zhuo Bing said.","“Father, why don’t we talk to the Nine-tailed Clan Master again?” Zhuo Peng could not help asking.","“No?” Zhuo Yunfeng, who was sitting at the top, waved his hand and said, “After all, although Master Sha has overstepped his bounds, he hasn’t really done anything excessive.”","“The Nine-tailed Clan is now the number one clan in the Demon Realm, and the other three great divine clans have been working together to fight against the Nine-tailed Clan. The Nine-tailed Clan Master has been very busy in recent years. At this time, we can’t trouble her for a small matter. Otherwise, we might arouse the resentment of the Nine-tailed Clan Master.”","Zhuo Yunfeng knew very well that his family was only temporarily attached to the Nine-tailed Clan. The Nine-tailed Clan Master took good care of them because of Jian Wushuang, moreover, the Nine-tailed Clan Master had done enough for them over the years. If they took the initiative to trouble the Clan Master for a trivial matter, it would inevitably cause dissatisfaction.","“We can’t let that bastard continue to pester Ying ‘er,” Zhuo Peng said in a deep voice.","But he had just finished speaking..","“Don’t worry. From now on, you don’t have to worry about Master Sha anymore.” A voice suddenly echoed in the hall.","As soon as the voice fell, a familiar figure suddenly appeared in the center of the hall.","Jian Wushuang immediately revealed a smile as soon as he appeared. “Father, mother, eldest sister, second brother, I’m back.”","Zhuo Yunfeng and the others were stunned at first, but then they were pleasantly surprised.","“Shuang ‘er!”","Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin immediately stood up.","“Third brother!”","Zhuo Bing and Zhuo Peng immediately came up to Jian Wushuang, their faces full of surprise and joy."]},{"number":3651,"title":"Chapter 3651 - The Furious Demon Master Sha Sea","paragraphs":["“Shuang ‘er, you’re finally back.”","The first person to come to Jian Wushuang was Luo Xinqin.","As a mother, she was most worried about Jian Wushuang.","Although Zhuo Yunfeng, Zhuo Bing, and Zhuo Peng were worried about Jian Wushuang’s absence for so many years, they all knew Jian Wushuang’s strength and ability, and they believed that he would definitely come back, however, they were delayed by some things.","Only Luo Xinqin was worried about Jian Wushuang. Even though she knew that her son was very strong, she still worried about him day and night.","Until now, when she saw Jian Wushuang in front of her, she was finally relieved.","“Mother, I’m sorry to have made you worry all these years,” Jian Wushuang said apologetically.","He also knew that he had taken too long to travel outside.","The most important thing was that he had been trapped in that special space for nearly 100,000 years. Even if he came out, he would not be able to tell his family members that he was safe in the universe void, it would naturally cause them to worry.","“Anyway, it’s good that you came back,” Zhuo Yunfeng said with a smile.","“Yes, third brother, you actually spent nearly 100,000 years on this adventure. At first, we were a little worried, but now, as long as you return safely, there won’t be any problems,” Zhuo Bing said with a smile.","“Right, third brother, when you just entered the door, you said that you don’t have to worry about that Young Master Sha anymore. What’s going on?” Zhuo Peng asked.","“It’s simple. When I came in, I saw him pestering sister-in-law. I also heard that after you entered the Clearwater Villa, Master Sha discussed with his servants that when sister-in-law and you returned to the Blood Marten Clan, he would kill you on the way. So I came out and killed Master Sha,” Jian Wushuang said casually.","Hearing his words, Zhuo Peng and the others were shocked.","“Third brother, what did you say? Did you kill Master Sha?” Zhuo Peng looked at Jian Wushuang in horror.","“Yes, I did.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Not only him, but three of his servants are dead. As for his body, I asked his remaining servant to take it back.”","“Third brother, although Master Sha wanted to kill us on the way back to the Blood Marten Clan with Ying ‘er, he shouldn’t be killed.” Zhuo Peng frowned.","“Yes, third brother. Although Master Sha is not a person, he has a very good father. His father is even respected by the current Nine-tailed Clan Master,” Zhuo Bing added.","“Shuang ‘er.” Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin also looked at Jian Wushuang worriedly.","Jian Wushuang smiled. “Second brother, eldest sister, you don’t have to worry. Although I haven’t met Master Sha’s father, I have already sensed his existence when I came to the Nine-tailed Clan. Since I dare to kill Master Sha directly, I can naturally deal with his father.”","“Deal with his father?” Zhuo Peng looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","Although his strength was still at the Saint Realm, he was very special in the Nine-tailed Clan because he came from the Clearwater Villa. He had a lot of contacts with the clansmen of the Nine-tailed Clan, naturally, he had heard of Master Sha’s father’s ability.","As far as he knew, Master Sha’s father was said to be the strongest Principles Master in the Divine Beginning Realm. In the Divine Beginning Realm, only the three Saint Realm Masters and the legendary Ruler experts were qualified to be above his father.","Such a super strong, his third brother can easily deal with?","“Third brother, you really have confidence?” Zhuo Bing also looked over.","“Don’t worry. If Master Sha’s father doesn’t come, it’s fine. But if he does, it’s the same as losing himself.” Jian Wushuang smiled with absolute confidence, at the same time, there was also disdain for Master Sha’s father.","Indeed, he did not care about a mere Principles Master at the pinnacle of the six realm.","Now, only an expert at the level of a Ruler, and not an ordinary primary Ruler, was worthy of him treating him seriously.","Who was Master Sha’s father?","Jian Wushuang was talking with his family members, but at this moment...","“Get out of the Clearwater Villa!!”","An angry roar suddenly exploded in the area.","The roar contained a terrifying shock wave. It was extremely powerful and immediately shattered the array around the Clearwater Villa. At the same time, there was a powerful pressure, it immediately pressed down on the people in the Clearwater Villa.","Under this pressure, the guards in the Clearwater Villa knelt on the ground in fear, all of them shivering.","As for the people in the hall, because of Jian Wushuang’s existence, they easily resisted the pressure, so they did not feel uncomfortable.","But after hearing this roar, Zhuo Yunfeng and the others’ expressions changed.","“It’s Master Sha Sea, Master Sha’s father!” Zhuo Peng said in a low voice.","“Master Sha Sea?” Jian Wushuang nodded secretly. “Master Sha Sea really came to us. It’s true. My previous achievements and fame might scare ordinary Principles Masters, but Master Sha Sea is a Principles Master at the pinnacle of the six realm. He won’t be scared by my previous achievements.”","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. He looked around at the people around him and said, “Since Demon Master Sha Sea has come to us, let’s go out and meet him.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang walked toward the villa with Zhuo Yunfeng and the others.","...","In the deepest part of the Nine-tailed Clan, the current Grandmaster of the Nine-tailed Clan, Miss Xiao’er, was discussing something with some senior elders of the Nine-tailed Clan.","There were many experts in the Nine-tailed Clan now, but most of them were controlled by Miss Xiao’er using the nine-fate charm heaven technique. They would definitely obey Miss Xiao’er’s orders, but these elders of the Nine-tailed Clan...Xiao’er would not be able to control all of them.","But at this moment...","“Everyone from the Clearwater Villa, get out here for this old man!!”","The Demon Master Sha Sea’s furious roar did not only resound throughout the entire Clearwater Villa, it also resounded throughout the entire Nine-tailed Clan. Xiao’er, the numerous elders of the Nine-tailed Clan who were discussing this matter, as well as countless members of the Nine-tailed Clan...almost all of them heard this furious roar.","“Clearwater Villa?”","Xiao’er’s expression suddenly changed. “This voice and this furious aura...it’s the Demon Master Sha Sea. Damn it!”","Xiao’er no longer cared about the matters in front of her and immediately set off toward the Clearwater Villa as fast as she could."]},{"number":3652,"title":"Chapter 3652 - Certain Death","paragraphs":["Because of that furious roar, the Clearwater Villa had become the focal point of the Nine-tailed Clan.","A large number of Nine-tailed Clan Masters who had heard that furious roar had rushed over. When these clansmen saw the Demon Master Sha Sea standing in the void outside the Clearwater Villa, his robes fluttering, and his murderous aura like a rainbow...as well as the ice-cold corpse supported by a Principles Master beside him, they were all greatly shocked.","They all recognized that corpse. It was surprisingly Demon Master Sha Sea’s son, Young Master Sha!","Demon Master Sha Sea was a supreme expert who had reached the pinnacle of Principles Masters. Moreover, this existence had been invited by their Clan Master at a great price, his goal was naturally to deal with the three great celestial races that had already joined forces.","After all, it was the three great celestial races that had joined forces, and their strength was not weak. And although the Nine-tailed Clan’s strength had soared over the years because of Miss Xiao’er, their overall strength was not much stronger than the three great celestial races joining forces. Therefore...if the Nine-tailed Clan wanted to crush the three great celestial races with an overwhelming force and even unify the entire Demon Realm, they would have to have even stronger combat strength joining forces.","An expert at the pinnacle of the six realm could play a decisive role in the battle between the two camps in the Demon Realm.","Therefore, one could imagine how important this Demon Master Sha Sea was to the Nine-tailed Clan.","Not to mention how much Miss Xiao’er had paid in order to invite the Demon Master Sha Sea to the Nine-tailed Clan, just the fact that Miss Xiao’er had silently allowed the Demon Master Sha Sea’s son, Young Master Sha, to act wantonly in the Nine-tailed Clan all these years...one could see just how much Miss Xiao’er valued Demon Master Sha Sea.","It was also because of this that the Nine-tailed Clan usually held Demon Master Sha Sea in Great Reverence. They also kept a respectful distance from his son, Young Master Sha, and did not dare to provoke him. But now...that Young Master Sha was actually dead?","It was no wonder that Demon Master Sha Sea was so shocked and furious.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, get out here!”","Just as everyone was discussing, Demon Master Sha Sea let out another cold and stern shout.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","Upon hearing this name, many members of the Nine-tailed Clan were shocked again.","Not far away in the void, Miss Xiao’er, who was rushing over, as well as the elders and high-level experts of the Nine-tailed Clan, were also shocked.","Heavenly Sword Marquis’ name, for the Nine-tailed Clan of these clansmen, but will not be unfamiliar.","“Demon Master Sha Sea, you really dare to come.”","Jian Wushuang’s cold laughter echoed in the air. He slowly walked out of the Clearwater Villa and followed behind him, and Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin in the Clearwater Villa.","At the sight of Jian Wushuang, Demon Master Sha Sea’s eyes seemed to burst with anger.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, how dare you kill my son? Not only are you going to die today, but everyone in the Clearwater Villa will die without a burial place. These people in the Clearwater Villa should be your family. Later, I will torture them to death in front of you,” Demon Master Sha Sea said coldly.","“You want to kill me and my family?” Jian Wushuang smirked and said, “You have to be able to do that.”","“I’ll show you. Don’t think that you can do whatever you want in the Divine Beginning Realm just because you have some minor achievements.” Demon Master Sha Sea’s killing intent surged, a large amount of divine power spread out like a tide.","In an instant, a terrifying pressure filled the world.","“Demon Master Sha Sea, stop!”","Before Demon Master Sha Sea made his move, many higher-ups of the Nine-tailed Clan had already arrived.","Xiao’er, the current patriarch of the Nine-tailed Clan, and the elders of the Nine-tailed Clan had also arrived in the void outside the Clearwater Villa. When Miss Xiao’er arrived, she took a look at the corpse around Demon Master Sha Sea, as well as Jian Wushuang, who was standing outside the Clearwater Villa, her pupils constricted. She could roughly guess what had happened.","“Clan Master of the Nine-tailed Clan, are you going to stop me?” Demon Master Sha Sea glanced at Xiao’er coldly.","Although Xiao’er was the Clan Master of the Nine-tailed Clan and the Nine-tailed Clan was at their peak, as an expert of the ultimate six realms, Demon Master Sha Sea did not take Xiao’er and the Nine-tailed Clan seriously.","“Demon Master Sha Sea, I’m afraid there’s been a misunderstanding,” Xiao’er said.","“A misunderstanding?” Demon Master Sha Sea sneered, “Heavenly Sword Marquis killed my son and asked his guards to bring his body back for me to see. Is this a misunderstanding?”","“Well...” Xiao’er’s face darkened slightly. Then she looked at Jian Wushuang and asked, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, when did you return to the clan?”","“Just now,” Jian Wushuang replied.","“Did you kill Master Sha?” Xiao’er asked again.","“If you’re talking about the corpse next to Demon Master Sha Sea, I did kill him,” Jian Wushuang admitted frankly.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s answer, Xiao’er’s face became even more unsightly.","“Nine-tailed Clan Master, you heard it too. Heavenly Sword Marquis killed my son and is still so arrogant. He doesn’t respect me at all. No matter who comes out today, I won’t give him face, and he will die today!”","Demon Master Sha Sea’s voice was cold. As soon as he finished his words, a sharp electric arc suddenly flashed in his eyes.","Whoosh!","Without any warning, Demon Master Sha Sea appeared in front of Jian Wushuang. At the same time, a cold spear stabbed toward Jian Wushuang’s divine body at lightning speed.","It was too fast.","Demon Master Sha Sea was indeed an expert of the six realms in a fierce battle. His attack speed was too slow. The surrounding experts of the Nine-tailed Clan, including Miss Xiao’er, did not react at all.","Miss Xiao’er wanted to stop him, but it was obviously too late.","Moreover, the spear thrust by Demon Master Sha Sea was too fast and too powerful. It was the full-strength attack of an expert of the pinnacle of the six realm, and it had already locked onto Jian Wushuang, it was clear that he did not intend to give Jian Wushuang any chance.","Seeing the spear thrust out like lightning, many of the Nine-tailed Clan patriarchs around were terrified.","The power of the spear alone was enough to frighten many Principles Masters. One could imagine how powerful the spear was.","The spear was aimed at Jian Wushuang.","“Shuang ‘er!”","“Third brother, be careful!”","Zhuo Yunfeng and the others behind Jian Wushuang were shocked. Although Jian Wushuang had said that they did not need to care about Demon Master Sha Sea, now that they saw Demon Master Sha Sea attack personally...feeling the terrifying power contained in the spear, they still began to worry about Jian Wushuang.","However, in the face of this extremely terrifying spear, Jian Wushuang only smiled faintly. He raised his right hand and slowly extended two fingers..."]},{"number":3653,"title":"Chapter 3653 - Dominating Battle Prowess","paragraphs":["“Clang!”","A sound akin to the collision of metals rang out. That shocking divine might formed a terrifying shockwave that swept out in all directions.","The many Nine-tailed Clansmen standing in the surrounding void were all blown away by this shockwave. Even those who were relatively far away could not open their eyes from the shockwave. It was not until a moment later...when the shockwave dissipated, they looked up again and looked at the void in front of them.","Everyone’s eyes were wide open.","Jian Wushuang was still standing casually in the void. He had one hand behind his back and the index finger of his other hand was blocking the tip of Demon Master Sha Sea’s spear.","The power contained in Demon Master Sha Sea’s spear could easily kill any Principles Master below the sixth realm. Even a Principles Master of the sixth realm of the void would have to use all his strength to block the spear, at the very least, he would be severely injured.","However, Jian Wushuang only used one finger to block Demon Master Sha Sea’s spear, but he did not move at all.","What kind of strength was this?","“How, how is this possible?”","Demon Master Sha Sea was also in a daze.","He knew very well that he had used all his strength to block the spear. With his battle strength at the pinnacle of the six realm, even the three Supreme Saint Realm Masters of the Divine Beginning Realm would not dare to underestimate him, he had to use some means to block it.","However, he had stopped his spear with just one finger. Even the three masters of the Saint Realm did not have such strength.","“The battle strength of a Ruler?”","Demon Master Sha Sea could not help but think about it. At the thought of it, a huge wave rose in his heart.","He had heard of Jian Wushuang before and had heard of some of his battle achievements. Although those achievements were quite shocking, the real strength that Jian Wushuang displayed in those battle achievements...was actually not enough to make him, an expert at the pinnacle of the six realm, fear.","Not to mention fear, he did not even have to take it to heart.","The reason why he did not want to provoke Jian Wushuang before was mainly because of Jian Wushuang’s potential.","Jian Wushuang’s talent and potential were so strong that no one knew how strong he would be in the future. That was why he did not want to provoke Jian Wushuang.","However, talent and potential did not mean that Jian Wushuang’s current strength was strong. At least, when he met Jian Wushuang today, Demon Master Sha Sea did not think that Jian Wushuang’s battle strength would be stronger than his.","After all, Jian Wushuang had disappeared in the Divine Beginning Realm less than 100,000 years ago. In a short period of 100,000 years, it was actually only a short period of time for the Principles Master. He had thought that...Jian Wushuang’s strength might have improved in the past 100,000 years, but he did not expect that Jian Wushuang’s strength had improved to such an incredible level.","The strength of a finger followed by a spear thrust with all his strength was at the level of a Ruler.","After thinking this through, Demon Master Sha Sea made a decision in his heart.","“Run!”","Without any hesitation, Demon Master Sha Sea turned around and began to flee the moment he knew Jian Wushuang’s battle strength.","As for his son’s revenge, he had no intention of avenging it now.","What a joke. His son could be reborn without him, but he only had one life.","Demon Master Sha Sea had worked hard to get to where he was today, so he naturally cherished his life.","Seeing Demon Master Sha Sea turn around and flee, the Clan Masters of the Nine-tailed Clan who were watching the battle were stunned.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, “Demon Master Sha Sea, didn’t you just say that you wanted to kill me and torture my predecessors to death? You haven’t even achieved your goal yet. Why are you in such a hurry to leave?”","Jian Wushuang’s words were full of mockery. He watched Demon Master Sha Sea run away, but he had no intention of chasing after him.","It was not until Demon Master Sha Sea had fled to the end of the Void and was about to escape from his sight that Jian Wushuang slowly stretched out his finger.","“Freeze!”","As soon as he said that, a large amount of the power of space-time principles, along with the mighty divine power, directly covered the entire Nine-tailed Clan.","In an instant, the space-time of the Nine-tailed Clan was completely frozen. Demon Master Sha Sea, who had fled to the end of the Void, was also frozen in space-time and could not move at all.","Heaven-designated skill!","It had been a long time since Jian Wushuang had used the first move of the space-time divine skill.","After all, he was only a saint, so his divine power was not very strong. In addition, he did not use the space-time rules very well. Most importantly, most of the opponents he met along the way were existences whose realms were far higher than his, this also meant that even if he used the heaven-designated technique at full strength, it would be very difficult to affect his opponents.","But now, it was different.","The divine power he had now was definitely at the Ruler Realm. Even if his usage of space-time principles was not too high, just by relying on this tyrannical divine power and using the heaven-designated technique, there was basically no Principles Masters, he could withstand it.","Once the heaven-designated skill was used, even an expert at the pinnacle of the six realm like Demon Master Sha Sea would immediately be stuck in space-time stagnation.","Then, Jian Wushuang’s figure flashed and he left the place. When he reappeared, Demon Master Sha Sea was completely under his control, and the divine power in his body...more than 90% of his divine power had been restrained by him. He was in the weakest state and even fell into a deep sleep.","“Miss Xiao’er, I know that Demon Master Sha Sea is very important to you. However, he is an expert in the ultimate six realms, so your nine-life charm can’t control him completely. So, I’ll help you push him into the weakest state and deep sleep. If you can’t control him now, you can’t blame me.”","With a faint smile, Jian Wushuang casually waved his hand and threw Demon Master Sha Sea, who was extremely weak and had lost the ability to fight back, to Xiao’er.","Jian Wushuang was right. Demon Master Sha Sea was very important to her. She had to rely on his strength to suppress the three celestial races. However, Demon Master Sha Sea was too strong for her to control, she could only ask him for help with some advantageous conditions or benefits. She even turned a blind eye when Master Sha was lawless in the Nine-tailed Clan.","However, she was afraid that she could not really control her strength, which was like a ticking time bomb.","Now, Jian Wushuang’s action was definitely a great help to her."]},{"number":3654,"title":"Chapter 3654 - Ready to Make a Move?","paragraphs":["Without any hesitation, Xiao’er directly used the nine lives succubus heaven technique and began to control the Demon Master Sha Sea.","If the Demon Master Sha Sea was at his peak, even if he was heavily injured, Xiao’er would not be able to directly use the succubus technique to control him. But now, the Demon Master Sha Sea was weak and fell into a deep sleep. At this juncture...he was completely unable to resist.","In just a short moment, Xiao’er had already controlled the Demon Master Sha Sea.","After controlling the Demon Master Sha Sea, Xiao’er’s heart was filled with an uncontrollable joy.","One had to know that this was a genuine expert at the pinnacle of the six realm. Now that he had become her slave, it meant that she could control this combat power as she wished in the future...although Demon Master Sha Sea had fallen into a deep sleep, with the help of some natural treasures, it would not be difficult for her to wake up and regain her peak strength.","Taking a deep breath, Xiao’er finally walked toward Jian Wushuang.","When she came in front of Jian Wushuang and looked at him, Xiao’er felt a little complicated.","When she first met Jian Wushuang in the Endless Territory, he was just an ant in her eyes. It was only because she saw that he had several secret skills from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect that she was willing to befriend or even ally with him, seeing that he was closely related to the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, she was willing to befriend or even ally with him.","Later, when they met again, Jian Wushuang was already very famous in the Divine Beginning Realm. He was accompanied by a powerful devil master, deepfire, and experts from Star Palace. Unexpectedly, Jian Wushuang was also respected, it was because of Jian Wushuang’s help that she was able to regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan. Until now, she had led the Nine-tailed Clan to become the number one clan in the Demon Realm.","Now, it was the third time she had met Jian Wushuang.","However, this time, Jian Wushuang’s monstrous strength made her look up to him.","The Demon Master Sha Sea, who was at the pinnacle of the six realm, was like an infant in Jian Wushuang’s hands. He had no ability to struggle or resist.","After three meetings, Jian Wushuang’s growth speed was really terrifying.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, if I’m not wrong, you should have reached the level of a Ruler by now, right?” Xiao’er asked.","The surrounding Nine-tailed Clansmen also looked at Jian Wushuang.","They also had questions in their hearts. Was Heavenly Sword Marquis already a Ruler?","Most of them thought that he had already achieved it. After all, the terrifying battle strength that Jian Wushuang had just displayed should only be achieved by an expert at the Ruler Realm.","However, some people thought that although Jian Wushuang was far stronger than the Principles Master, he should not have reached the Ruler Realm yet.","Jian Wushuang just smiled and said, “You can treat me as an ordinary Ruler.”","Xiao’er immediately understood.","She knew that although Jian Wushuang was not a real Ruler, he definitely had the battle strength of a Ruler.","“I didn’t expect you to reach this level in less than 100,000 years...” Xiao’er could not help sighing.","“Miss Xiao’er, thank you for taking care of my parents and others all these years,” Jian Wushuang said.","Through the conversation with Zhuo Yunfeng and the others, Jian Wushuang knew that Miss Xiao’er had treated them well during his time in the Universe Battlefield. She had opened a Clearwater Villa for them in the Nine-tailed Clan, she had also told them that the status of the people in the Clearwater Villa in the Nine-tailed Clan was equal to that of the consecrators of the Nine-tailed Clan.","Therefore, Zhuo Yunfeng and the others had been living very comfortably in this place for nearly 100,000 years. At least no one dared to cause trouble for them. and the Nine-tailed Clan would usually give them whatever they wanted.","Even Master Sha did not dare to overstep his boundaries these years because of Xiao’er’s strict orders and restrictions.","It could be said that Miss Xiao’er did her best to take care of them, and Jian Wushuang was satisfied with her care.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, do you mean that you’re going to take your family away with you?” Xiao’er asked.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “I came back to take them back to the Endless Territory and their own place.”","As soon as Jian Wushuang finished his words, Zhuo Yunfeng and the others who were standing behind him immediately became excited.","“Shuang ‘er, did you just say that we are going back to the Witch Desert Region?” Zhuo Yunfeng came forward.","“Yes, father.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile. “Previously, because I provoked strong enemies in the Divine Beginning Realm, I was worried that they would harm you. That’s why I asked Miss Xiao ‘er to take care of you. But now, although those strong enemies are still there, with my current strength, I don’t need to care about them anymore. It won’t be long before I kill all of them. Naturally, you can also return to the Witch Desert Region.”","Jian Wushuang knew that among his close relatives, Zhuo Bing and Zhuo Peng were fine, but Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin had been staying in the Witch Desert Region and had long regarded it as their root, they had been under the protection of Xiao’er all these years. Although they had been living a comfortable life, they still wanted to return to their hometown.","However, they also knew that Jian Wushuang must have had an ulterior motive for leaving them in Xiao’er’s care. Therefore, they did not ask Xiao’er to send them back until now, hearing that they could return to their hometown, they were naturally excited and happy.","“Father, mother, go and prepare. We will leave tomorrow,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.”","Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin agreed happily. Soon, the people of the Clearwater Villa went back to prepare, and the Nine-tailed Clansmen began to leave.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, do you have time to talk about it?” Xiao’er asked.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Follow me.”","Xiao’er led Jian Wushuang to a secret chamber of the Nine-tailed Clan.","Except for Xiao’er and Jian Wushuang, there was no one else in the secret chamber. Even the high-level elders of the Nine-tailed Clan were not present.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you said that it would not take long for you to kill your strong enemies. And your strong enemies are...” Xiao’er looked at Jian Wushuang.","“The three Saint Realms,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“I knew it.” Xiao’er took a deep breath.","She knew about Jian Wushuang’s background, so she knew that his enemies were the three Saint Realms. However, she did not expect that Jian Wushuang was ready to attack the three Saint Realms.","“The three Saint Realms are deeply rooted in the Divine Beginning Realm, and the three masters of the Saint Realm have the power of the will of heaven. It’s not easy to uproot them,” Xiao’er said."]},{"number":3655,"title":"Chapter 3655","paragraphs":["“The three masters of the Saint Realm are nothing, but it’s true that the three Saint Realms are so deeply rooted that it’s difficult to uproot them,” Jian Wushuang said.","The three masters of the Saint Realm were only slightly stronger than the masters of rules, even with the power of the will of heaven. However, they were still far inferior to the real Rulers. With Jian Wushuang’s current battle strength, it was easy for him to defeat or even kill the three masters of the Saint Realm.","However, there were three Rulers in the Devil Cloud Star who had already arrived in this territory. It was very likely that they had also arrived in the Divine Beginning Realm. If the three Rulers joined hands with the three masters of the Saint Realm...it would cause him some trouble.","However, it was only a little trouble.","After all, the Divine Beginning Realm was only a third-grade world star. The rules did not allow the Ruler’s battle strength to exist. Any Ruler who came to the Divine Beginning Realm would have their strength greatly restricted. Even those three Rulers...were subordinates of Devil Cloud Star Master. The power of the Divine Beginning Realm’s Heavenly Dao will would still suppress them.","Even if Devil Cloud Star Master was unwilling to suppress them, the universe principles in the dark made him have no choice but to suppress them.","Since the three masters’ battle strength would be greatly suppressed, they would not be able to fight against him.","“Miss Xiao’er, when I attack the three Saint Realms, I hope you can lead the entire Demon Realm and help me destroy the three Saint Realms,” Jian Wushuang said.","“It’s not a problem for me to help you with all my strength. Now that I can fully control the battle strength of Demon Master Sha Sea, who is at the pinnacle of the six realm, it’s not difficult for me to unify the entire Demon Realm. However, the three Saint Realms have dominated the Divine Beginning Realm for so long. It’s impossible for us to destroy all the powers of the three Saint Realms with the power of the Demon Realm alone,” Xiao’er said.","“The Demon Realm alone is not enough, but what about the three Freedom Alliances?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“The three Freedom Alliances?” Xiao’er was stunned.","“Miss Xiao’er, I’m telling you the truth. The three Freedom Alliances and I are on the same side. As long as I attack the three Saint Realms, the three Freedom Alliances will help me at all costs. Not only the three Freedom Alliances, but also the many experts left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. They will also help me,” Jian Wushuang said.","Hearing this, Xiao’er’s body trembled and she quickly looked at Jian Wushuang, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, are you saying that on the day you attack the three Saint Realms, the experts left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect will see the light of day again? Then...that person will also appear?”","Xiao’er’s voice was obviously anxious and nervous.","Jian Wushuang naturally knew who the person Xiao’er was talking about was. He smiled. “Miss Xiao’er, don’t worry. There are many experts left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, and the person you mentioned will naturally be among them. Miss Xiao’er, you can naturally meet him then.”","Jian Wushuang had learned from Xiao’er that she had a special relationship with Di Shisan, the leader of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","The person that Xiao’er had been dreaming about all these years was Di Shisan.","Di Shisan was in the seal formation. Only Jian Wushuang could refine the seal formation into his own Heaven and Earth Secret Realm. By then, he could certainly let the people inside come to the Divine Beginning Realm, it was easy to arrange a meeting between Di Shisan and Miss Xiao’er.","“In that case, I’ll speed up and suppress the three divine races. Before you attack the three divine realms, I’ll unite the power of the entire Demon Realm and help you destroy the three divine realms,” Xiao’er said solemnly.","“Okay, but I have a favor to ask,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said.","“Please go ahead.” Xiao’er was very polite.","“The ancient race, one of the three celestial races, has something to do with me. I’ve received some favors from the ancient race, so I hope you can show mercy to the ancient race when you unify the Demon Realm,” Jian Wushuang said.","The ancient clan, one of the four great divine clans...Jian Wushuang had a good relationship with the ancient clan.","Of course, this was because in his previous life, in the Seven Star Divine Realm, he had the bloodline of the ancient clan, and he had once received the legacy left behind by an expert of the ancient clan, he had also cultivated the most powerful body-refining secret skill of the ancient clan.","It could be said that in his previous life, his growth was definitely related to the ancient clan. Even though he did not have any contact with the ancient clan in this life, the ancient clan still held a bit of status in his heart.","Jian Wushuang knew that if Xiao’er wanted to unify the entire Demon Realm, she would have to deal with the three divine races. If she just defeated the three divine races head-on and made them submit to her, that would be fine, but if it was more serious...Xiao’er could destroy the three divine races at any time.","That was why Jian Wushuang would plead for mercy for the ancient race now.","“As far as I know, you don’t have any interactions with the ancient race. How could you ask me to show mercy to them?” Xiao’er looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","“There was some history, but no one knew about it,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Well, since you’re pleading for mercy, I’ll show mercy to the ancient race. At least, I won’t kill them. At the very least, I won’t let their race be destroyed. If they are sensible and willing to submit to us, the ancient race will still be the top race in the Demon Realm,” Xiao’er said.","“Thank you very much.” Jian Wushuang smiled and cupped his hands.","After the discussion with Xiao’er, Jian Wushuang returned to the Clearwater Villa.","Everyone in the Clearwater Villa was ready. Then, under Jian Wushuang’s lead, a group of people rushed toward the Endless Territory.","Ten days later, in the Pill Sun Sacred World, one of the Nine Realms of Golden Crow in the Endless Territory.","In the vast void, there were dozens of human figures, both male and female, flying rapidly through the void. Along the way, they passed by some cities and even some sects, when the cultivators in those cities or sects raised their heads and saw these human figures, they were all so scared that their faces turned pale.","It must be known that this was the endless territories, and it was in an ordinary sacred world. In an ordinary sacred world, the most powerful cultivators were only at the level of Immortal Saints, and they were even Immortal Saints who had the lowest strength, but now, any of the dozens of human figures that passed through the void gave off an aura that was enough to shock many cultivators along the way.","It was very obvious that these dozens of human figures were all experts above the Immortal Saint level. In the Pill Sun Sacred World, in the Nine Realms of Golden Crow, and even in the entire endless territories, the Immortal Saints were all top-notch experts, with so many Immortal Saints gathered together, it was naturally terrifying.","And these dozens of figures were naturally Jian Wushuang and the others."]},{"number":3656,"title":"Chapter 3656 - Entering the Secret Realm of the North Blood","paragraphs":["There were dozens of people because in the 100,000 years since Jian Wushuang left, the Zhuo family had produced many generations. Except for some direct descendants who were not too far away from Jian Wushuang, the other descendants did not live in the Nine-tailed Clan, so Jian Wushuang did not see them when he went to the Clearwater Villa.","Now that he was going back to the Endless Territory, Zhuo Yunfeng came back with some of his closest descendants, which was why there were dozens of them.","“Father, we are about to arrive at the Burning Moon City,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Zhuo Yunfeng clenched his hands, feeling extremely excited.","Not only him, but also Luo Xinqin, Zhuo Bing, and Zhuo Peng.","They were all born in the Endless Territory, so they had a high sense of belonging to the Witch Desert Region, especially Zhuo Yunfeng, who was the governor of the Burning Moon City.","As for the other descendants of the Zhuo family, including Zhuo Peng’s wife, Princess Ying, they were more curious about the Endless Territory and the Burning Moon City.","Soon, they finally arrived above the Burning Moon City.","Looking down at the city, Jian Wushuang’s soul power saw every corner of the city, and he sighed in his heart.","In this life, he had fought in the Burning Moon City. He also knew that before he was born, the Burning Moon City had snowed for nine years, nine months, and nine days. His mother had been pregnant with him for nine years, nine months, and nine days.","After he was born, the snowing in the Burning Moon City immediately stopped, and the Blood Mountain Sword fell from the sky, causing a commotion.","All of this made Jian Wushuang sigh.","He only sighed slightly, but Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo xinqin were already very excited.","“It’s the Burning Moon City. I’ve seen the governor’s mansion. Although it’s very different from before, the willow tree in the mansion is still there. It’s been more than 100,000 years, but this willow tree is still alive.”","Zhuo Yunfeng’s body trembled. He ignored Jian Wushuang and the others and dived down toward the governor’s mansion.","“Look at how anxious you are. You don’t know how to control yourself in front of me.”","“Father, wait a minute.”","Luo Xinqin and Zhuo Bing spoke, and they immediately flew down.","Jian Wushuang and the others naturally followed.","The mansion of the governor of Burning Moon City was still there, but the governor of Burning Moon City had changed several times.","The current governor was a cultivator who had reached the Divine Demon Realm.","The Divine Demon Realm was an expert in the Witch Desert Region.","However, when Jian Wushuang and the others arrived at the mansion, any one of them released a bit of divine power, which scared the governor to kneel down and worship, not to mention the weaker cultivators in the mansion.","After an hour, the mansion finally calmed down. At this moment, Zhuo Yunfeng had reopened the mansion of the govenor of Burning Moon City. As for the original govenor, Zhuo Yunfeng gave him some treasures, the assistants were so grateful that they left with the treasures in excitement.","Zhuo Yunfeng was an Immortal Saint and had stayed in the Nine-tailed Clan for so many years. With his special status, he naturally received a lot of resources. Therefore, he casually took out some treasures, for a Divine Demon Realm expert, it was a gift from God. The Divine Demon Realm govenor was overjoyed. As for the position of govenor, he did not care.","“After 100,000 years, the Burning Moon City has changed a lot.”","Zhuo Yunfeng stood under the ancient willow tree in the govenor’s mansion and stroked the willow tree. He sighed quietly.","“100,000 years is a long time for an ordinary wasteland in the Saint Realm of the endless territories. In the past 100,000 years, not only has the Burning Moon City changed a lot, but the entire Witch Desert Region has changed a lot.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","He released his soul power immediately after he arrived at the Pill Sun Sacred World.","It should be known that the space in the endless region was far less stable than the third firmament. The range of his soul power could be even wider. With a thought, he could see the entire Pill Sun Sacred World, he was naturally aware of the changes in the Pill Sun Sacred World.","Not to mention the changes in the Witch Desert Region, even the entire pill sun sacred world was very different from before.","However, just like 100,000 years ago, the Pill Sun Sacred World was still under the control of Crimson Stone Fort. The person in charge of Crimson Stone Fort was still Saint Crimson Rock’s daughter, Yin Su’er. 100,000 years had passed, Yin Su’er’s strength had also increased a little. She was now a genuine first rank True Saint and was an absolute overlord in the Nine Realms of Golden Crow.","Jian Wushuang had some connections with Yin Su’er, but he had only promised Crimson Stone Saint that he would help her take full control of the Crimson Stone Fort. They did not have any unnecessary friendship, so this time, Jian Wushuang did not intend to tell Yin Su’er, let alone meet her.","He was only here to bring his loved ones back, and to refine the Secret Realm of the Xue Bei.","Now that Zhuo Yunfeng and the others had returned to the Burning Moon City, Jian Wushuang casually arranged a simple magic array for the castellan mansion of the Burning Moon City to ensure that nothing else would happen in the Burning Moon City, he told Zhuo Yunfeng and the others that he was going to the Xue Bei Secret Realm.","The Xue Bei Secret Realm was in the Pill Sun Sacred World.","Jian Wushuang had only learned about the existence of the Xue Bei Secret Realm by chance. But later, he got many good opportunities in the Xue Bei Secret Realm, especially the star map of the Universe Battlefield given by the Xue Bei, it led him to the special time and space in the unknown region of Devil Smoke Valley.","And he got a great opportunity in that special time and space.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang was still grateful to Xue Bei.","The boneyard...was one of the recognized dangerous places in the Pill Sun Sacred World, but to Jian Wushuang now, it was like flat land.","Jian Wushuang easily arrived at the entrance of the Xue Bei Secret Realm. Looking at the entrance in front of him, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile in his heart.","He remembered that when he first came to the entrance of the Secret Realm of the Xue Bei, he had brought a token. Without a token, he could not find the existence of the Secret Realm of the Xue Bei. At that time, he thought that the Secret Realm of the Xue Bei was very well hidden and its methods were very clever.","But now, Jian Wushuang could see through the Secret Realm of the Xue Bei with a glance.","Ignoring the obstruction of the Secret Realm’s array, Jian Wushuang directly entered the Secret Realm. He rampaged all the way and easily arrived at the core of the Secret Realm.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang also saw the Spirit Valley Elder of the Secret Realm and the trace of consciousness left by Xue Bei."]},{"number":3657,"title":"Chapter 3657 - Farewell to Xue Bei","paragraphs":["“Mr. Xue Bei, Elder Gu, how have you been?”","When Jian Wushuang appeared in front of Xue Bei and Elder Gu, they were shocked, especially Elder Gu.","He was the spirit of the Secret Realm, so he knew everything that happened in the Xue Bei Secret Realm. But now, someone had come to the Xue Bei Secret Realm and appeared in front of them, how could he not notice it?","When Xue Bei and Elder Gu saw who it was, they were even more shocked.","“You are the little guy from before?” Xue Bei looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","“Yes, it’s me. It’s been more than 100,000 years. I didn’t expect that your consciousness was still there, Mr. Xue Bei.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“It’s just consciousness. It doesn’t matter whether it exists or not. As for you, even I can’t see through you when I see you again after 100,000 years. Moreover, you were able to enter the Secret Realm quietly and appear in front of me. Your current strength should be extraordinary. I wonder what level you have reached?” Xue Bei asked.","He was really curious about Jian Wushuang’s current strength.","Because he could not see through Jian Wushuang at all.","However, he was a Principles Master of the void five realm when he was alive, so he could not see through Jian Wushuang’s strength. At the very least, Jian Wushuang’s strength should not be lower than his at his peak.","“I just became a Principles Master not long ago, so I am only a Principles Master in terms of realm. However, my battle strength is slightly stronger than my realm, so I can barely match a Ruler,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","He did not hide it.","He had nothing to hide from a person who was already dead and only had a trace of consciousness left.","“Match a Ruler?” Xue Bei stared at him.","Elder Gu, who was standing beside him, was also shocked.","If it were anyone else who said that his battle strength was comparable to a Ruler’s, they would definitely not believe it. However, it was Jian Wushuang who said it.","100,000 years ago, when Jian Wushuang came to the Xue Bei Secret Realm, he revealed his incredible talent and the shocking secrets he contained.","At that time, Xue Bei knew that Jian Wushuang’s background was extraordinary.","Such a person, who had reached the level of a Ruler in terms of battle strength at the level of a Principles Master, was still somewhat convincing.","However, they were still shocked.","After all, he was a Ruler.","How many Rulers were there in the entire Divine Beginning Realm?","It could be counted on one hand, right?","“I was just unwilling to die in obscurity, so I gave all the opportunities to you. I also wanted to use you to make my name known in the Divine Beginning Realm again. I didn’t expect that my actions back then would actually create a monster that could rival a Ruler at the level of a Principles Master.” Xue Bei sighed, he was also a little excited.","He knew that Jian Wushuang must have put in a lot of effort to get to where he was today. As for the opportunity that he gave to Jian Wushuang, it might have helped him a little, however, it was impossible for Jian Wushuang to get to where he was today by relying on his opportunity.","Even if it was not so, it was still worthy of Xue Bei’s excitement and pride.","After all, Jian Wushuang had once obtained his good fortune and also received his favor. To put it bluntly, it was indeed a matter of pride for Jian Wushuang to have played a part in his growth.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis...” Xue Bei had just opened his mouth when he paused and said, “Is it okay for me to call you that?”","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","In fact, Jian Wushuang’s battle strength was already at the level of a Ruler, and Xue Bei was only a Principles Master of the five void realms at his peak. In terms of strength, Xue Bei would bow to Jian Wushuang, it would not be too much to bow to him.","However, Xue Bei had died a long time ago, and he owed Jian Wushuang a favor. Jian Wushuang could accept him calling him by his name.","“When I gave you the opportunity, I asked you to do something for me. How did it go?” Xue Bei asked.","“I’ve done what you asked. I gave your interspatial ring to the experts of the Blood Ancestor lineage of the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect, and I helped you regain your position in the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect. Although the Blood Clan is not the strongest among the sects in the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect, at least other sects don’t dare to provoke them,” Jian Wushuang said.","“As for the leader of the Blood Clan, the Blood Ancestor...It’s a pity that the Blood Ancestor has been wandering in the Universe Battlefield. Although I have been to the Universe Battlefield, I have never met him. Therefore, until now, I have never met him.”","Jian Wushuang had read about the Blood Ancestor when he was wandering in the Universe Battlefield.","The Blood Ancestor was a powerful Principles Master who had reached the pinnacle of the six realm. When Jian Wushuang went to the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect, the Blood Ancestor was trapped somewhere in the Universe Battlefield, Jian Wushuang knew that the Blood Ancestor had been trapped in the Witch Desert Region, one of the three battlefields.","However, when he stepped into the Universe Battlefield, the Blood Ancestor had already escaped from the Witch Desert Region. He had been wandering there all these years, but Jian Wushuang had never been to the Witch Desert Region, naturally, he did not have any contact with the Blood Ancestor.","“Although I don’t have any contact with the Blood Ancestor, the leader of the Heaven Ancestor Daoist sect, the Heaven Ancestor, has a special relationship with me.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly in his heart.","“I’m already very grateful that you were able to complete my task and bring the news of my death and the things I left behind to the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline, not to mention that you helped the Blood Clan’s bloodline regain its position.","“As for Brother Heaven Ancestor...it doesn’t matter whether you’ve seen him or not.” Xue Bei’s voice was indifferent.","“By the way, you just said that you’ve also been adventuring in the Universe Battlefield. Have you been to the star map that I gave you previously, the special space-time where the star map is located?” Xue Bei suddenly asked.","“Yes. It’s precisely because I’ve been to that special space-time that my strength has improved by leaps and bounds. Of course, I’ve also stayed in that special space-time for 97,000 years. Speaking of which, it’s considered to be a narrow escape,” Jian Wushuang said.","“What exactly is in that special space-time?” Xue Bei could not wait to ask.","He had entered that special space-time by chance. He had obtained some opportunities in that special space-time, but he did not dare to go too deep. He only chose to leave halfway, he did not really come to the high platform where the 18-ultimate formation was located, so he naturally did not know the real secret of that space-time.","He had given the star map to Jian Wushuang in the hope that he would go to the special space-time to explore. As expected, Jian Wushuang had been there and had come back alive."]},{"number":3658,"title":"Chapter 3658 - Refining the Xue Bei Secret Realm","paragraphs":["“That special space-time has a great origin.”","Jian Wushuang briefly recounted his experience in that special space-time.","Not only had he been trapped in that special space-time for 97,000 years, but he had also seen Devil Cloud after he had broken through the 18-ultimate formation.","However, although Jian Wushuang had mentioned that there was a universe overlord from the depths of the universe behind that special space, a supreme expert, he did not tell Xue Bei the name of that supreme expert, which was Supreme Devil Cloud.","After all, he had promised Devil Cloud not to tell anyone about what had happened in that special space. Now, even though he had already died, all that was left was a trace of his consciousness, however, Jian Wushuang still only told Xue Bei some things that would not hurt him even if he knew about it.","After learning from Jian Wushuang that the special space-time was really hidden, Xue Bei could not help sighing.","“I guessed that the special space-time was extraordinary. It must contain a great opportunity. Now it seems that it really is so.”","“However, any opportunity is accompanied by danger. Heavenly Sword Marquis, you were indeed incredible to have been able to break through the eighteen absolute formations, which even the Rulers were helpless against. It is only right that you were able to obtain the opportunity within. As for me, I was lucky that I was smart enough to not continue. Otherwise...”","Xue Bei could not help but shake his head.","When he first entered the special space-time, he had been looking forward to the opportunities in the special space-time. Fortunately, he felt an extremely terrifying sense of crisis in the special space-time. It was precisely that sense of crisis...that made him stop and finally choose to leave.","If he had not stopped and continued to walk forward, walking into the trap on the high platform, he would have died long ago, and it would have been impossible for him to leave behind the star map that led to the special space-time, Jian Wushuang would probably have nothing to do with the same special space-time.","“Mr. Xue Bei, I have come to this Secret Realm for another matter besides giving you an answer,” Jian Wushuang said seriously.","“Do you want to refine my Xue Bei Secret Realm?” Xue Bei looked at Jian Wushuang.","When Jian Wushuang left the Xue Bei Secret Realm after obtaining the opportunity, he had told Jian Wushuang that if he broke through to become a Principles Master in the future, he could come back and refine the Xue Bei Secret Realm. This would save him a lot of effort.","Now that Jian Wushuang had obviously just become a Principles Master, the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm had not been opened yet.","“Yes, I want to refine this Secret Realm.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“I’m very curious...” Xue Bei said in surprise, “Your battle strength is now comparable to a Ruler. With your strength, you can easily open a Heaven and Earth Secret Realm of your own, but it will take some time and energy. Or if you really want to save time and refine the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm, with your strength, you can find a stronger and more magnificent Heaven and Earth Secret Realm to refine. Why are you still interested in my Xue Bei Secret Realm?”","“Well, to tell you the truth, I already have a better choice of the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm, but it’s very difficult to refine it. I need some experience, so I came here,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You came to refine my Xue Bei Secret Realm just to accumulate experience?” Xue Bei frowned slightly.","“Well, I hope you can help me, Mr. Xue Bei,” Jian Wushuang said.","Xue Bei pondered for a moment, then he said, “Well, I’m already dead, so there’s no use for me to keep this Secret Realm. I was going to give it to you, but you can use it however you want. If you want to refine it and then collapse, it’s up to you. But Elder Gu...”","“Mr. Xue Bei, don’t worry. When I collapse the Secret Realm, I’ll give it a chance to survive. At the same time, I’ll give Elder Gu a batch of treasures so that it can recover in a short time,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s good.” Xue Bei breathed a sigh of relief.","“Elder Gu, I don’t have much experience in refining the Secret Realm. You’re the spirit of the Secret Realm, so I hope you can guide me...” Jian Wushuang glanced at Elder Gu.","“My friend, although my Secret Realm is a common one among the many Heaven and Earth Secret Realm, it is still a Heaven and Earth Secret Realm. You don’t have any experience in refining the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm, so even if I guide you personally, I’m afraid it will take some time to completely refine this Secret Realm,” said Elder Gu.","“Time is not a problem. Let’s start without delay.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Immediately, Jian Wushuang began to refine the Xue Bei Secret Realm under the guidance of the old man.","Three years passed in the blink of an eye.","During these three years, under the guidance of the old man, Jian Wushuang refined the Xue Bei Secret Realm step by step. Finally, he completely refined the Xue Bei Secret Realm into his own Heaven and Earth Secret Realm.","“It’s done.”","Jian Wushuang stood up and looked around at the Xue Bei Secret Realm that was completely under his control. A smile appeared on his face.","After refining the Xue Bei Secret Realm, everything in the Xue Bei Secret Realm was under his control. He could even completely absorb the Xue Bei Secret Realm into his body with just a thought.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang also found that he had an additional power of will.","However, in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, this portion of the power of his will was pitifully weak.","“Too weak, too weak!”","“Previously, I casually comprehended a rule, and the power of my will was much stronger than the power of my will now. No wonder in the Divine Beginning Realm, very few people choose to refine someone else’s Heaven and Earth Secret Realm. After all, they did not open it themselves, so the power of their will is too little.”","“Unless it’s a vast Secret Realm like the sealing formation, which has formed a complete cycle of the Heavenly Dao, only then can I get a huge benefit,” Jian Wushuang murmured.","“Now that the Secret Realm has been refined, I only need to familiarize myself with it for a few more days before it can collapse.”","Soon, Jian Wushuang began to familiarize himself with the structure of the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm.","Ten days later, under Jian Wushuang’s guidance, the Xue Bei Secret Realm began to collapse to the extreme. When the will power that Jian Wushuang had obtained completely dissipated, Jian Wushuang finally stopped.","At this moment, the Xue Bei Secret Realm was actually dead in name. However, the spirit of the Xue Bei Secret Realm, which was Elder Gu, was still barely alive. Jian Wushuang gave Elder Gu a batch of treasures and told him to restore the Secret Realm on his own, after bidding farewell to the Xue Bei and Elder Gu, Jian Wushuang went to the Fourth Heaven.","He had already refined a Heaven and Earth Secret Realm and had some experience. Now, he could try to refine the seal formation."]},{"number":3659,"title":"Chapter 3659 - Docile","paragraphs":["The Temporal Temple Master had taken Jian Wushuang to the Fourth Heaven. Jian Wushuang knew where the only space passage to the Fourth Heaven was, and he had the battle strength of a master, so he could open the space passage.","Soon, he reached the Fourth Heaven through the space passage again.","In the Fourth Heaven, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master were waiting for him.","“My young friend, how is it?” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master asked.","“I’ve refined a Heaven and Earth Secret Realm according to my master’s request. I’ve accumulated some experience. Now, I can start to refine the seal formation,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Then go quickly. We can’t wait any longer,” the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said with a smile.","“That’s right. Xuan Yi has spent a lot of money to construct a complete Heavenly Dao cycle with a special array formation. This is basically equivalent to a small-scale astral world. I’m very curious. If you can refine this small-scale astral world into your own Heaven and Earth Secret Realm, how many benefits will you get? Will you be able to obtain a portion of the will power just like an ordinary Principles Masters?” said the Temporal Temple Master.","“If you can refine this small astral world and obtain a portion of the power of the will, it will definitely be very powerful,” the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“No matter what you get, you’ll know when you try it.” Jian Wushuang smiled and then walked directly toward the sealing formation.","When he came to the surroundings of the sealing formation, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness immediately merged into the formation and awakened Xuan Yi’s remnant soul.","“Master.”","Looking at Xuan Yi, Jian Wushuang bowed respectfully.","“Have you refined a Heaven and Earth Secret Realm?” Xuan Yi looked at him.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “However, although I have refined a Heaven and Earth Secret Realm and gained some experience, this small astral world is nothing compared to an ordinary Heaven and Earth Secret Realm. I still don’t know how to completely refine it.”","“You don’t have to worry about that. This small astral world has cost me a lot of effort. How can you completely refine it in one day?” Xuan Yi smiled. “However, as long as you have some experience in refining it and I guide you from the side, you should be able to refine this small astral world. However, it won’t take too short a time. Even a conservative estimate would take more than a thousand years.”","“More than a thousand years is nothing,” Jian Wushuang said.","“In that case, let’s begin. Follow my instructions and take it step by step. Remember not to be impatient, or you may suffer the crazy counterattack of this small astral world at any time,” Xuan Yi warned.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded heavily.","Immediately, Jian Wushuang followed Xuan Yi’s instructions and flew directly into the sealing formation. Soon, he merged with the formation. With the naked eye, it seemed that he had become one with the formation.","Inside the formation, Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged and began to refine the small astral world according to Xuan Yi’s instructions.","Time passed quietly.","Just as Xuan Yi had said, the small astral world was so amazing that refining it was not a matter of a day.","Even with Xuan Yi’s guidance, Jian Wushuang still had to concentrate on the refining process. He must not be distracted at all because a casual distraction would cause all his previous efforts to be wasted, he would also be immediately attacked by the small astral world. Once the small astral world attacked, even if he could withstand it, it would not be easy. Moreover, it would bring him a lot of trouble for the subsequent refinement.","While Jian Wushuang was refining the small astral world, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the spacetime temple master had been guarding the Fourth Heaven to avoid unnecessary trouble.","In the blink of an eye, 1,800 years had passed.","Inside the seal formation.","“There’s only one step left. Be careful,” Xuan Yi warned.","“Yes.”","Jian Wushuang nodded heavily. His soul had already covered the deepest part of the seal formation with a ball of transparent white light.","The white light looked pure and flawless. There was nothing special about it.","However, under Xuan Yi’s guidance, Jian Wushuang knew that the white light was the most important thing in this small astral world. It was the will of the Heavenly Dao of this small astral world!","Although the will of the Heavenly Dao had just been formed and was still in its infancy stage.","Although the will of the Heavenly Dao was far less tough than the will of the Heavenly Dao of the Divine Beginning Realm.","After all, the will of the Heavenly Dao formed a complete cycle of the Heavenly Dao.","The reason why Jian Wushuang was careful and did not dare to make any mistakes during the refinement process was that he was worried that the will of the Heavenly Dao, which was still in its infancy stage, would be alerted and he would not be able to proceed with the next step.","But now, he had completed all the previous steps. He was only one step away from making the will of the Heavenly Dao submit!","“It’s starting.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. His soul power had already made contact with the white light.","He had also sensed the existence of the will of the Heavenly Dao at the first moment. However, when he was ready to use his enormous soul power to force the will of the Heavenly Dao to submit, he was shocked to find that the white light, the will of the Heavenly Dao, it did not seem to have any intention of resisting him.","Instead, it was very docile, as if it was willing to listen to him.","“How could this be?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","Xuan Yi, who was beside him, smiled and said, “It seems that the will of Heavenly Dao has been somewhat affected by me.”","“Master, what’s going on?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s simple. I created the seal array myself. It can be said that I created the will of the Heavenly Dao. When I created it, I added some of my will. That is to say, the will of the Heavenly Dao that you are now in contact with contains some of my will. As your master, of course, I am close to you. This little guy may be influenced by some of my will, which is why he is so docile to you,” Xuan Yi said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood, but then he smiled and said, “Since this little guy doesn’t intend to resist, this last step is the easiest for me.”","Jian Wushuang smiled. He made contact with the will of Heavenly Dao in the white light and communicated with it. The will of Heavenly Dao did not resist from the beginning until the end. Soon, Jian Wushuang took control of the will of heaven and earth. From then on, the seal formation...the small astral world was finally refined by Jian Wushuang.","“I finally succeeded after 1,800 years!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with surprise and joy.","At this moment, he could already sense the connection between himself and the seal formation, and he could also completely sense the existence of the seal formation.","And at this moment...","Boom!","A violent boom echoed in the sky. The entire Divine Beginning Realm was shaken."]},{"number":3660,"title":"Chapter 3660 - The Arrival of the Universal Principles","paragraphs":["Outside the seal formation in the Fourth Heaven, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master were waiting quietly.","“It has been 1,800 years. I wonder if Heavenly Sword Marquis has refined the seal formation,” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“We have been guarding this place for 1,800 years, but there hasn’t been any movement in the seal formation. It seems that Heavenly Sword Marquis Wushuang hasn’t refined the seal formation yet,” Temporal Temple Master said.","They all knew that.","The huge sealing formation had already formed a complete cycle of Heavenly Dao. If Jian Wushuang really refined this sealing formation, it would be impossible for there to be no movement at all. Since there was still no movement...it naturally meant that Jian Wushuang had not completely refined this sealing formation.","“Such a huge sealing formation and a complete cycle of Heavenly Dao is equivalent to a small astral world. It’s indeed not easy to refine it into your own Secret Realm,” Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","However, he had just finished speaking.","Boom!","The world rumbled and the entire Fourth Heaven trembled.","The leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance and the Temporal Temple Master were immediately alarmed. In the next moment, both of them raised their heads at the same time.","They saw that above the endless void, the sky seemed to have been forcefully pierced through. A huge, boundless dark hole appeared out of thin air.","That dark hole was too big. It completely covered the entire sky, and at the same time, it also covered the entire Fourth Heaven.","And then, from that dark hole, a dazzling multicolored light lit up, and a supreme principle slowly descended!","This principle was too transcendent, supreme!","Most importantly, this descending principle seemed to be able to completely represent everything in the world. Its descent instantly caused the Heavenly Dao cycle of the entire Divine Beginning Realm to stop.","“This, could this be...the universal principles!”","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master sensed the principles that descended from the dark void above, and both of them revealed expressions of disbelief.","The universal principles, the vast universe, the Heavenly Dao cycle, the most supreme principles!","This principles represented the operation of the universe, and represented everything in the universe.","For example, the Divine Beginning Realm was just an astral world that was born from the vast universe. This astral world was like a living being, and it also had its own Heavenly Dao will. However, this Heavenly Dao will had to operate according to the universal principles.","It was set by the universal principles, and the Heavenly Dao wills of countless astral worlds in the universe had to operate according to them.","Therefore, the universal principles were supreme!","But now, what the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master did not expect was that the universal principles would come in person!","“It’s Heavenly Sword Marquis. It must be him who attracted the universal principles!” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said with a trembling voice.","“Yes, this dark hole is above the Fourth Heaven, and the universal principles is obviously coming to the Fourth Heaven. In the Fourth Heaven, the only one who can attract the universal principles must be the Heavenly Marquis.” The Temporal Temple Master also widened his eyes, he stared at the descending universal principles.","Sure enough, after the universal principles descended, it went directly to where Jian Wushuang was, which was the huge sealing formation in front of them.","The universal principles finally landed on the sealing formation, and it entered the sealing formation at once, enveloping Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang still had his eyes closed. At this moment, he had completely refined the seal formation. However, after refining it, it caused a commotion that he had never expected, especially the arrival of the universal principles.","The moment the universal principles landed on him, Jian Wushuang felt his body shake, and then he could not move.","Although he could not move, he could feel the existence of the universal principles around him, and at the same time, he felt a warm feeling.","“What is this?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","Xuan Yi, who was standing next to him, also had an unprecedented glint in his eyes. “The universal principles, it really is the universal principles!”","“Haha, God bless our Divine Beginning Realm.” Xuan Yi laughed loudly, “I’ve heard that in the vast universe, if a cultivator achieves some incredible achievements, he will be recognized by the universal principles. At the same time, the universal principles will come and give great benefits to the cultivator!”","“I thought it was just a legend, but I didn’t expect it to be true. Moreover, after refining the seal formation, you will be recognized by the universal principles. This is definitely a great luck and an unprecedented opportunity!”","Hearing Xuan Yi’s laughter, Jian Wushuang did not understand, but he knew that the arrival of the universal principles was definitely a good thing for him.","“Little guy, the arrival of the universal principles is definitely a great fortune for you. Don’t sit around and carefully feel the universal principles. It will be very beneficial for your cultivation in the future,” Xuan Yi said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded heavily and then concentrated on comprehending.","The arrival of universal principles, although it was only in the Fourth Heaven, was still incredible.","In the core of the Divine Beginning Realm, countless cultivators in the Third Heaven could feel the existence of a supreme principles. At this moment, countless cultivators...they could not help but want to worship it.","The entire Third Heaven fell into silence because of the arrival of this universal principles.","In the Grand Palace of the three great Saint Realm’s lair.","The three Rulers from Devil Cloud Star had never looked so solemn before.","“What is this feeling?” The tall man frowned.","“This supreme principles aura...even us Rulers can’t help but want to kneel down. It’s as if he’s a Ruler in the dark. Could this be...” The white-haired elder guessed, his pupils constricted.","At this moment, Life and Death Saint Master, one of the three great Saint Realm Masters, rushed in and said respectfully, “My lords, master told us that just now, the universal principles personally descended.”","“Universal principles?” The tall man and the bewitching young man were shocked.","“Indeed.” The white-haired elder inhaled a breath of cold air.","“The supreme universal principles, the operation of the universe, and all the laws are set by the universal principles. The countless astral worlds in the vast universe are also affected and restricted by the universal principles. Such a supreme existence, even a supreme expert would not be able to spy on it. But today, it actually descended in the Divine Beginning Realm?","“What is the reason?” The white-haired elder said in a low voice.","“My lord, master has already said that the universal principles descend on the Fourth Heaven, and that Sword Heavenly Marquis is currently at the Fourth Heaven!” The Life and Death Saint Master suddenly said."]},{"number":3661,"title":"Chapter 3661 - Bestow","paragraphs":["“What did you say?”","The words of the Life and Death Saint Master caused the three hegemons to rise to their feet.","“The universal principles have descended because of Heavenly Sword Marquis?” The tall man’s voice was low and deep.","“The universal principles are so high-level that even autarchs are unable to summon them. What does Heavenly Sword Marquis do?” The devilish youth asked.","“Star Master, do you know what Heavenly Sword Marquis did to cause the universal principles to descend?” The white-haired elder looked down.","“Master doesn’t know why the universal principles descended.” Life and Death Saint Master shook his head. “Master said that although he controls the will of the Heavenly Dao of the Divine Beginning Realm, this matter is related to the universal principles. From the moment the universal principles descended, the Heavenly Dao of the Divine Beginning Realm had already come to a standstill.”","“Right now, he has no way of coming into contact with the Fourth Heaven. He only deduced that the descent of the universal principles is related to Heavenly Sword Marquis because he knew that Heavenly Sword Marquis was in the Fourth Heaven and that the universal principles had descended in the Fourth Heaven.”","Although Devil Cloud Star Master controlled the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm, the Heavenly Dao will of a mere astral world was nothing in front of the universal principles. Since the universal principles had already descended, then during this period of time...the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm would not have anything to do with it.","“If that’s the case, we have no idea what method that Heavenly Sword Marquis used to make the universal principles descend,” the tall man said.","“No matter what method he used, since he was able to make the universal principles descend personally, then he must be extraordinary,” the white-haired elder said solemnly.","“Master has also said that the descent of the universal principles is no trifling matter. Furthermore, that Heavenly Sword Marquis might be able to obtain huge benefits from the universal principles. Hence, master wants the three of you to try your best to defend the three great Saint Realms. In addition, you must try your best to find out why that Heavenly Sword Marquis caused the universal principles to descend. You must also find out what he has obtained from the universal principles,” the Life and Death Saint Master said.","“In the end, master also said that the Divine Beginning Realm would descend with the universal principles. This has caught his attention. He will try to understand the situation in Devil Cloud Star as soon as possible and then come over personally.”","“Sir is prepared to come over personally?”","The three Rulers were startled.","They were very clear about Devil Cloud Star Master’s situation. Under normal circumstances, Devil Cloud Star Master would not leave Devil Cloud Star at this time. But now...it seemed that it was because of the descent of the universal principles, it made Devil Cloud Star Master pay more attention to Heavenly Sword Marquis.","“We already know what you said. You may leave.” The tall man waved his hand.","Life and Death Saint Master immediately bowed and left.","After the Life and Death Saint Master left...","“Star Master wants us to think of a way to find out the purpose of the descent of the universal principles. Also, what did Heavenly Sword Marquis get from the universal principles? What do you two think?” The white-haired elder looked at the two people around him.","“What can we think about it?” The tall man curled his lips. “Previously, we thought that even though Heavenly Sword Marquis had already broken through to become a Principles Masters, and his combat power was comparable to a Ruler’s, as long as the three of us joined hands, we would be able to fight him head-on even in the Divine Beginning Realm. We could even suppress him. But now, he actually caused the descent of the universal principles. Then, we can’t be sure about this.”","“Yes, the universal principles never come easily. Now that he has come, Heavenly Sword Marquis must have gained a lot of benefits from the universal principles, and his strength will probably have a big breakthrough. Now, even if the three of us join hands, we won’t be his match,” the evil-looking young man said.","“That’s right. Even if the three of us join hands, we might not be his match. How can we figure out those things? At most, we can only try our best to force him to use his trump card,” the white-haired elder said.","“That’s all we can do.”","The other two nodded one after another.","Previously, the three of them had been full of confidence in Jian Wushuang.","They thought that even if their strength was greatly limited in the Divine Beginning Realm, they could still easily suppress Jian Wushuang if they joined hands.","But now, they did not dare to think so.","After all, Jian Wushuang had triggered the arrival of the universal principles.","In addition, the arrival of the universal principles had caused the magic cloud star-lord to really pay attention to Jian Wushuang. It would not be long before his original body would personally come. This was definitely something Jian Wushuang had not expected.","Of course, Jian Wushuang did not know about this.","At present, he was still under the coverage of the universal principles.","The universal principles was covering his body, and it was very beneficial for Jian Wushuang to feel the universal principles at such a close distance.","It was also his first time experiencing such supreme power at such a close distance. Although the process was very short, in this short period of time, he gained too many benefits.","Finally, the universal principles disappeared.","The dark hole in the void at the top had slowly disappeared, and the entire world returned to peace.","In the seal formation, Jian Wushuang was still sitting cross-legged, but there was a trace of astonishment on his face.","“Little guy, how’s the harvest?” Xuan Yi looked at Jian Wushuang.","Hearing Xuan Yi’s words, Jian Wushuang was startled awake, he immediately said, “It’s a great harvest. After all, this is a power that is even more profound than the principles. Although I can’t control this power now, I have a general impression of it. In the future, it will be much easier to comprehend it.”","“That’s it. You’re too weak now and can’t master the supreme universal principles. The universe origin power alone is already very profound for you. But when you’re strong and start to touch the universe origin and comprehend it, what you see and feel today will be very useful to you,” Xuan Yi said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang also nodded with a smile.","He knew very well how much help his comprehension would bring him in the future.","“By the way, the arrival of the universal principles will certainly give you a lot of things. What are they?” Xuan Yi asked.","“First, a portion of the power of will,” Jian Wushuang said.","“The power of will?” Xuan Yi nodded slightly. “If you refine this seal formation into your own Secret Realm, you will definitely receive a portion of the power of the will. However, since the power of the will is personally bestowed by the universal principles, it must be very powerful, right?”","“Yes, it’s very powerful and unique. For example, the power of the will is fixed, but the power of the will bestowed by the universal principles is different. The power of the will is completely determined by my own power. It can directly double my own power!” Jian Wushuang said."]},{"number":3662,"title":"Chapter 3662 - The Original Universe","paragraphs":["“Double my power?” Xuan Yi looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","“For example, although I’m only a Principles Master, my divine power is no weaker than that of an ordinary primary Ruler because of my perfect life level. If I use my secret skill and heaven-cleaving skill, my divine power will be three times stronger than that of a primary Ruler!”","“But now, with the power of the will given by the universal principles, my divine power will be twice as strong as that of a primary Ruler, which is six times stronger than that of a senior Ruler,” Jian Wushuang said.","The difference in divine power between a primary Ruler and a senior Ruler was not too big. Previously, Jian Wushuang could release three times the power of a primary Ruler, which was close to that of a senior Ruler.","However, the power of the will given by the universal principles could double his divine power, which was equivalent to six times the power of a primary Ruler. Among senior Rulers, this divine power was indeed very powerful, it was indeed very powerful.","“Yes, it is indeed the power of the will given by the universal principles. It is much stronger than ordinary will power,” Xuan Yi said with a smile.","“Yes, it’s very strong. Moreover, the power of the will is changed according to my own divine power. In other words, as my strength increases, the power of the divine power will continue to increase. However, the power of the will will not weaken my overall strength at all,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“What about the power of the will? Did the universal principles give you anything else?” Xuan Yi looked at him again.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded heavily. “In addition to the power of the will, the universal principles also gave me a unique secret skill. To be exact, it’s an innate divine power.”","“Innate divine power?” Xuan Yi’s eyes lit up and he smiled. “It’s indeed an innate divine power.”","“Master, you’ve guessed it?” Jian Wushuang was surprised.","“It’s not a guess. When I was adventuring in the three battlefields, I entered a Secret Realm by chance and obtained part of the memory of an ancient supreme-being in that Secret Realm. In that part of the memory, there were some things about the arrival of the universal principles.”","After a pause...Xuan Yi continued, “In the vast universe, the universal principles rarely descend. However, as long as it descends and descends on a certain cultivator, that cultivator will receive enormous benefits. Most of the time, the universal principles will bestow a unique innate divine ability to the other party. This innate divine ability is also based on the special conditions that the cultivator has reached.”","“For example, now that you have refined a Heaven and Earth Secret Realm that is comparable to a small astral world, the innate divine power bestowed upon you by the universal principles must have a lot to do with this small astral world.”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “The innate divine power bestowed upon me by the universal principles is called the original universe. It uses the small astral world that I have refined as the core to form the original universe that covers everything around it. In this original universe, my strength will be greatly enhanced.”","“However, there is a limit to the use of this innate divine power. It can only be used once every 12 hours, which means that it can only be used once a day. Each time it is used, it can only last for 10 breaths at most.”","After being bestowed by the universal principles, Jian Wushuang already had a certain understanding of this innate divine power that he had obtained.","The original universe was undoubtedly an extremely powerful innate divine power. However, because it was powerful, it had many limitations.","“There are some limitations to any innate divine power, let alone an innate divine power given by the universal principles. Although your innate divine power is powerful, the universal principles will not allow you to use it without restraint,” Xuan Yi said.","“That’s right.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“In any case, you’ve earned a lot from the arrival of the universal principles,” Xuan Yi said.","“It’s all thanks to my master.” Jian Wushuang was extremely grateful.","Indeed, Xuan Yi had specially prepared this small astral world for him.","And the universal principles had come because he had refined this small astral world into his own Secret Realm.","In other words, the arrival of the universal principles, including the bestowment, was largely thanks to his master.","“I’m already dead. The only thing I can do now is to give you as many opportunities as possible. But there’s really not much I can give you now. Other than this small astral world, the only thing I have left is the heaven-suppression tablet!”","“However, the heaven-suppression tablet is an ultimate treasure that is superior to the most powerful supreme treasure. Even a supreme expert might be envious of such a treasure. Although I got one, it took me a long time and effort to refine it. I can’t help you with the refinement of the heaven-suppression tablet. You can only work hard on it yourself,” Xuan Yi said.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Well, you’ve already refined this small astral world. I’ve given you everything I can, so there’s no need for my remnant soul to exist. Little guy, you’re the only hope in the Divine Beginning Realm. I’ve prepared so much for you, so you must succeed in the last step.”","Xuan Yi took a deep look at Jian Wushuang, but his body had already begun to slowly disappear.","“Farewell, Master!”","Jian Wushuang’s face was cold as he watched his master’s last remnant soul disappear. Although there was grief in his heart, it was more of determination.","He knew that his master had given him too much, and he could not repay his great kindness.","The only thing he could do to make his master rest in peace was to complete what his master had failed to do in the past and take back the Divine Beginning Realm from the hands of the Star Master!","He had to reach that step.","Finally, Xuan Yi’s figure disappeared completely, but Jian Wushuang still stood there. He looked at the place where his master had disappeared and exhaled heavily after a long while.","“Since I’ve refined the seal formation, the Seven Star Divine Realm in the seal formation will naturally be under my control.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly and moved his mind, in an instant, he saw the entire Seven Star Divine Realm through the will of the Heavenly Dao that was automatically nurtured in the small astral world.","“As expected, the evolution process of the Seven Star Divine Realm is completely modeled after the universe,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","The Seven Star Divine Realm used to be a complete continent in the Divine Beginning Realm, but now it was completely different."]},{"number":3663,"title":"Chapter 3663 - Hometown, Green Fire World!","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang was born in this seal formation in his previous life, so he knew what was going on inside.","In his era, this territory was no longer called the Seven Star Divine Realm, but the Eternal Chaotic World. Since its birth, the Eternal Chaotic World had gone through three eras.","The first was the ancient era, which was before the collapse of the Seven Star Divine Realm. At that time, the Seven Star Divine Realm was still a part of the Divine Beginning Realm. However, because of the war, the Seven Star Divine Realm collapsed, the ancient battlefield was left behind, and the Seven Star Divine Realm was completely isolated by the sealing magic array.","Since then, the territory began to evolve under the operation of the magic array, and then the first era was born.","The first era lasted for a long time, but eventually collapsed. Then came the second era, which was Jian Wushuang’s era.","In his era, the Seven Star Divine Realm was no longer a whole, but made up of countless Eternal Worlds. These Eternal Worlds were actually equivalent to the world stars in the vast universe.","The principles and evolution of the entire Eternal Chaotic World seemed to be simulated in accordance with the cycle of the universe.","However, the Eternal Chaotic World only imitated a model. The most supreme principle in the vast universe was the universal principles, which did not exist in the Eternal Chaotic World.","After completely refining the sealing formation, Jian Wushuang also found that the time flow in this territory, the Eternal Chaotic World, was completely different from the outside world.","The flow of time in the Eternal Chaotic World was much faster than that in the outside world.","Jian Wushuang estimated that the flow of time in the Eternal Chaotic World should be 100 times faster than that in the outside world.","In other words, a year had passed in the Divine Beginning Realm, but a full 100 years had passed in the Eternal Chaotic World.","“100 times the flow of time?” Jian Wushuang was immediately shocked. “I have been in the Divine Beginning Realm for more than 100,000 years in this life. If I were in the Eternal Chaotic World, wouldn’t more than 10 million years have passed?”","More than 10 million years?","Thinking of this number, Jian Wushuang immediately became anxious.","More than 10 million years. How long had it been? He had been away for so long. What would the Eternal Chaotic World become?","What about his hometown, the Green Fire World?","And his parents, his relatives, and his good friends. Would they still be safe after more than 10 million years?","Jian Wushuang was suddenly worried.","Without hesitation, he immediately looked at the entire Eternal Chaotic World through the will of Heavenly Dao.","He saw everything in the Eternal Chaotic World.","He saw the countless Eternal Worlds in the Eternal Chaotic World, and at the same time, he saw the core of the Eternal Chaotic World, where the Saint Realms were located. It was still the most prosperous place in the Eternal Chaotic World, it had the most experts.","However, what surprised Jian Wushuang was that the quality of the cultivators in the Saint Realms was indeed much higher than in other places. However, the top experts, such as the Masters of the Saint Realms, were nowhere to be found, in the Eternal Chaotic World, there was no existence known as an ‘Ruler’.","As the core of the Eternal Chaotic World, under normal circumstances, the ‘Ruler’ level cultivators should have gathered there. Even if it was impossible for all of them to be there, there should at least be a few of them, however, there was not a single one. This was too abnormal.","“Where did all the ‘Rulers’ go? White Emperor, Nine Serenity Saint Master, Tian Chen Grandmaster...I haven’t seen any of them?” Jian Wushuang was even more confused.","He controlled the Heavenly Dao will of the Eternal Chaotic World and continued to look at the edge.","Soon, he found the place where he was born, which was the largest ancient battlefield, and the huge, incredible head!","That head was the head of his Master Xuan Yi, and the place between the eyebrows of that head was the Green Fire World.","The Green Fire World was born from Xuan Yi’s life essence.","“This head is really too big.”","Seeing the huge head in the ancient battlefield again, Jian Wushuang could not help but exclaim in his heart.","When he saw the head for the first time, he was completely shocked, and the shock in his heart was unprecedented.","However, as he learned more about his master and became a perfect being, he subconsciously felt that as long as his strength reached his master’s level, his divine body could also be infinitely enlarged, he could also have his master’s enormous divine body and head.","However, as he became more and more powerful, especially now that he was fully equipped with the battle strength of a Ruler, he realized that even if he was a perfect being and his strength was comparable to his master’s, he could not have an incredible divine body like his Master Xuan Yi’s.","Jian Wushuang could tell that the reason why Xuan Yi’s divine body was so huge was mainly because he had cultivated a unique secret skill.","That secret skill should be able to make his divine body infinitely big and thus increase his battle strength. Such a secret skill should come from the Universe Battlefield.","In addition, although the secret skill that made his divine body infinitely big would increase his strength to a certain extent, it would also have disadvantages. Therefore, Jian Wushuang had nothing to ask for such a secret skill.","“Green Fire World!”","Jian Wushuang had already fixed his eyes on the Green Fire World.","The Green Fire World was his root.","After tens of millions of years, the Green Fire World still existed in the ancient battlefield. Moreover, because of the evolution of tens of millions of years, the territory of the Green Fire World was obviously larger than green before, it almost occupied the entire forehead of the head. In the Green Fire World, Jian Wushuang also sensed the auras of countless cultivators.","Among those cultivators’ auras, there were many that he was extremely familiar with.","“Father, mother!”","Jian Wushuang’s body began to tremble.","He had already sensed the existence of his parents in the Green Fire World. Although it had been a lifetime and tens of millions of years, the two auras were still very familiar and warm to him, however, they were much stronger than before.","“Not only them, boss Wang Yuan, fourth brother, sword one, Gu King, and all the higher-ups of the Green Fire World are also here.”","“Huh? White Emperor? Nine Serenity Saint Master, Tian Chen Grandmaster...no wonder these ‘Rulers’ had to stay in the Saint Realms. It turns out that they have come to our Green Fire World. Right, the current Green Fire World is definitely the most abundant spiritual power in the Eternal Chaotic World. It’s not far from the Divine Beginning Realm. Of course, these ‘Rulers’ would choose to stay here.”","Jian Wushuang smiled. Then he could not help himself and went to the Green Fire World."]},{"number":3664,"title":"Chapter 3664 - Brother and Sister","paragraphs":["Green Fire World, unparalleled sacred city!","After more than ten million years, the unparalleled sacred city was still the sacred cultivation ground that countless cultivators of the Green Fire World yearned for.","In the grand manor, two figures sat on the grass.","One of the two was not only tall, but also quite fat. At a glance, it looked as if a small mountain had fallen there.","The other person was a beautiful girl dressed in black with a hint of weakness. This girl looked weak, but the invisible coldness she exuded was enough to make countless cultivators revere her.","These two people, one was called Wang Yuan, and the other was called Su Rou.","“So boring. These days are getting more and more boring.” Wang Yuan held a wine pot in his hand and drank by himself.","“Don’t you have a Chamber of Commerce under you? That Chamber of Commerce is already publicly acknowledged as the number one Chamber of Commerce in the Eternal Chaotic World. With such a huge industry, there will naturally be countless things to do. Logically speaking, you should be very busy. How can it be so boring?” Su Rou looked over.","“You don’t know that my Chamber of Commerce has long been left to someone else to manage. Normally, I just eat, drink, and have fun. But after so many years, I’m already tired of having fun. I’ve already gotten what I want long ago. In my life, I have no more pursuits. Without pursuits, I’m naturally bored.” Wang Yuan curled his lips.","“By the way, fourth brother, I heard that some time ago, there was a Divine Ruler who was madly pursuing you. What was the result?” Wang Yuan asked.","“What do you think?” Su Rou looked at Wang Yuan unhappily.","“It seems that you still haven’t taken a fancy to him.” Wang Yuan raised his eyebrows. “That’s right. A mere Divine Ruler is indeed not qualified to be your Dao companion. At the very least, he should be at the level of an Ruler.”","“Divine Ruler...if it were tens of millions of years ago, when Jian Wushuang was still alive, the Divine Ruler would definitely be the top expert in the Eternal Chaotic World, second only to the Ruler. Then, tens of millions of years have passed...” Now, because of the Green Fire World, the number of experts born in the Eternal Chaotic World had increased.","There were a lot of ‘Rulers’, and there were countless Divine Rulers.","If it were not for the limitations of the Eternal Chaotic World and the fact that the strongest cultivator was only at the ‘Ruler’ level, there would be many existences that surpassed the ‘Ruler’ level.","As Jian Wushuang’s sworn brother and sister, Su Rou had been a top expert in the Green Fire World thousands of years ago and was also one of the Rulers. Now, tens of millions of years had passed...her strength had long reached the top of the Eternal Chaotic World, and her power was monstrous.","A mere Divine Ruler was indeed not in her eyes.","“But fourth brother, it’s been tens of millions of years. My wife has taken more than 100 of them. As for my descendants, they have been passed down for countless generations. But you’re still alone. It’s too lonely. In my opinion, if there’s a chance, you’d better find someone who’s pleasing to the eye and make do with it,” Wang Yuan said.","Hearing Wang Yuan’s words, Su Rou’s expression changed slightly, but she did not say anything.","Wang Yuan suddenly said, “Fourth brother, you’re not still waiting for third brother, are you?”","Hearing the term ‘third brother’, Su Rou’s expression immediately changed. “What nonsense are you talking about?”","“I’m not talking nonsense. Back then, I could see that your feelings for third brother were not as simple as brother and sister. Unfortunately, third brother has always treated you as his sister. Moreover, he is also a devoted person. Since he has already decided on Princess Leng of the Tang Empire, he will never change. Therefore, as your brother, I advise you to stop thinking about third brother and find someone who is pleasing to the eye to live your life.” Wang Yuan said.","“I will handle my own matters,” Su Rou said.","Wang Yuan shrugged and did not say anything more about this issue. Instead, he sighed lightly, “It has been tens of millions of years since third brother left the Eternal Chaotic World. I don’t know where he is now and whether he is living well or not. To be honest, I really miss the scene of us four siblings drinking and chatting happily. Unfortunately, second brother died and third brother also left. Only the two of us are left here, living a boring life. I don’t know when it will end.”","“If you feel that living is meaningless, let me know. I can help you,” Su Rou said.","Wang Yuan could only smile.","And at this moment...","“Boss Wang Yuan, fourth brother!”","An excited voice suddenly sounded in the manor.","Wang Yuan and Su Rou’s figures shook violently.","“Wang Yuan, boss?”","Wang Yuan’s mind was a little muddled.","In the Eternal Chaotic World, Su Rou was the only one who called him boss Wang Yuan, and only when Su Rou was in a good mood.","But now that Su Rou was in front of him, the person who called him boss Wang Yuan would be...","“Old, third brother?”","Wang Yuan looked at the figure in front of him in surprise.","“Third brother, is it really you?” Su Rou was also stunned.","“Haha, why? Don’t you recognize me?” Jian Wushuang laughed.","Looking at Wang Yuan and Su Rou, Jian Wushuang was also very excited.","After all, these two were his best elder brother and fourth sister.","When they became sworn brothers, went through hardships together, and experienced life and death together, their feelings for each other did not weaken even after tens of millions of years.","Now that they saw each other again, Jian Wushuang was filled with emotions.","“Haha, third brother, you’re finally back.”","Wang Yuan finally confirmed that the person in front of him was indeed Jian Wushuang, and he was not dreaming. He immediately laughed and gave Jian Wushuang a bear hug.","Jian Wushuang did not resist. At the same time, he pulled his fourth brother, Su Rou, to his side. The three of them directly hugged each other, and Su Rou happened to be in Jian Wushuang’s left arm.","Su Rou did not resist Jian Wushuang’s embrace at all. There was actually a hint of shyness on her face.","If the cultivators of the Green Fire World saw Su Rou’s expression, they would definitely be shocked. Usually, Su Rou was recognized as the goddess of ice and snow in the Green Fire World. Not only was her strength monstrous, but she was also very powerful, she was also very dignified.","With her words, countless Divine Rulers and Divine Rulers could only worship her.","How could such a snow goddess be shy?","Phew!","After taking a deep breath, the three of them finally separated.","“Third brother, what’s going on? Where have you been all these years? Why have you been gone for so long?” Wang Yuan asked immediately.","He did not know the exact whereabouts of Jian Wushuang. He only knew some things from the White Emperor and the others. He knew that Jian Wushuang was still alive, but they did not know much about where he had gone.","He and Su Rou had been very worried about Jian Wushuang all these years."]},{"number":3665,"title":"Chapter 3665 - Ye Chen","paragraphs":["“Let’s talk about it later. I just came back and haven’t had the chance to meet my parents yet,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes, yes. Filial piety comes first. It’s only right for you to meet your parents first. However, they are not in the Wushuang Saint Realm now,” Wang Yuan said.","“I know where they are,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","He was now the true master of the Eternal Chaotic World, so he knew every move in the Eternal Chaotic World like the back of his hand.","Of course, he knew where his parents were.","“How about this, I will go to see my parents first. Boss Wang Yuan, inform the high-level experts of the Green Fire World about my return and ask them to come to the Saint Realm. When I come back, I will meet them and tell them something,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay, I’ll make the arrangements right away.” Wang Yuan nodded.","Jian Wushuang soon set off to the place where his parents were.","After Jian Wushuang left, Wang Yuan and Su Rou were still very excited.","“It’s been tens of millions of years. Third brother is finally back,” Wang Yuan said excitedly, “fourth brother, I haven’t seen a smile on your face for a long time. Today, when third brother came back, you immediately smiled, and it was not an ordinary smile.”","Su Rou rolled her eyes at Wang Yuan, but the surprise on her face could not be hidden.","Then, Wang Yuan went to inform the high-level experts of the Green Fire World according to Jian Wushuang’s instructions.","...","At the foot of a towering mountain in the Green Fire World, there was a small town called Green Mountain Town.","All the residents of Green Mountain Town made Jade for a living. The whole town was quiet and peaceful. There were no disputes and killings in the outside world. In the cultivation world where the experts were respected, it was very abrupt.","In the town, there was a couple who had lived in the town for more than a hundred years.","In the wooden house.","“Aunt, if the people in the town go to the city to sell Jade Stones in the future, let me go with uncle. The distance from our Green Mountain Town to the nearest city is not close, and there will inevitably be bandits on the way. If I go with uncle, I can take care of him,” said a young man in black who was about twenty years old.","Hearing the black-clothed young man’s words, the couple in front of the table looked at each other and smiled. The woman said, “It is because of the danger that you are not allowed to go.”","“Why? Could it be because I am too weak?","“However, I have been training with the people in the town these few years and have already developed quite a lot of strength. Moreover, my swordsmanship is also very good. Even the instructor in the town praised that my talent in swordsmanship is very high. If I really meet bandits now, it will definitely not be a problem for me to save my life. In fact, if I am lucky, I can even kill a few bandits.” The black-clothed young man said.","The woman smiled bitterly.","The man with a stubble on his face glanced at the black-robed young man and said indifferently, “Alright, you can come with me next time. It’s better to see the world outside. It’s much better than staying in this mountain all the time.”","“Haha, alright then. Uncle and aunt, I’ll go and cultivate first.”","After saying that, the black-robed young man happily walked out of the house and went to the town’s drill ground to cultivate.","After the couple saw the black-clothed young man leave, the woman sighed and said, “Nantian, do you think this child is like our Shuang’er?”","“Yes, he is very similar. He is as filial, as unyielding, as unyielding to fate. He is also very hard-working. Even his talent in sword principle is really good,” the man with a stubble said.","The couple were Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng, Jian Wushuang’s parents.","As for the black-clothed young man, he was Ye Chen, whom they had saved by accident ten years ago.","In the past ten years, Ye Chen had lived in this small town with them and lived a carefree life. Ye Chen was very hard-working, and his talent in sword principle was very high, but he had an innate defect, as a result, he did not have much success in the Dao of cultivation.","“In terms of talent in the Dao of the sword, he is very high. I have seen his progress in the Dao of the sword all these years. It’s a pity that this little fellow is unable to cultivate. Otherwise, I would have wanted to take him in as my personal disciple,” Jian Nantian said.","“Nantian, is there really no way to deal with this little fellow’s physique?” Ji Wumeng asked.","“There’s no way.” Jian Nantian shook his head. “I’ve been thinking of all sorts of ways over the past ten years. I’ve even asked all the top ‘Rulers’ of the Eternal Chaotic World, including the White Emperor, but no one has been able to change this little fellow. It can be said that it’s almost impossible for this little fellow to cultivate in the future.”","“Sigh, then this little fellow will really have to suffer.” Ji Wumeng sighed softly, “He clearly has a deep-seated hatred, but he has no strength to take revenge. All these years, he has been suppressing his hatred in the bottom of his heart. It’s fine for a short period of time, but if this continues for a long time, I’m afraid that he won’t be able to bear it. Nantian, why don’t we tell him our true identity and help him take revenge?”","“No.” Jian Nantian waved his hand directly. “This little guy has an unyielding spirit in his bones. He will never bow his head so easily. Right now, we are revealing our identity to him and telling him that there is no way to change his constitution. This is definitely an unprecedented blow to him. It might even cause him to completely collapse. And now, we are hiding it from him. At the very least, we are letting him have a sliver of hope for himself so that he can live on.”","“As for his revenge, when the time is right, I will let him take it personally.”","“Alas, this is the only way.” Ji Wumeng sighed lightly.","Although they had only lived together for ten years, Ji Wumeng really hoped for Ye Chen because he saw the shadow of Jian Wushuang in Ye Chen, in the past ten years, she had treated Ye Chen as her own son.","However, Ye Chen was not Jian Wushuang, so they had kept many things from him, including their identities.","At this moment...","“Huh?” Jian Nantian suddenly frowned.","Ji Wumeng also slightly frowned.","They had already sensed that a large group of people were rushing toward the town, and they were very aggressive. They still remembered a few of them. They were the people who had chased Ye Chen.","“This little guy’s enemies actually came looking for him?” Jian Nantian said softly.","“How did those people know that this little guy would be in this town?” Ji Wumeng frowned.","“I don’t know. But since they’ve already rushed over, I’m afraid that it’s impossible for us to hide our identities from that little guy anymore.” Jian Nantian sighed softly, “Since we’ll be exposed sooner or later, we might as well tell that little guy today. I hope that little guy’s heart can be a little stronger and can hold on.”","Ji Wumeng did not say a word.","Soon, the couple left the wooden house and came to the drill ground where Ye Chen was cultivating.","At this moment, Ye Chen was still cultivating desperately on the drill ground. He obviously could not condense a trace of spiritual power, but he was able to cultivate brute force, and the swordsmanship he displayed was also very impressive."]},{"number":3666,"title":"Chapter 3666 - Back","paragraphs":["“I can’t help but think of Shuang’er when I see this little guy,” Ji Wumeng looked at Ye Chen in the drill ground and said softly.","“Yeah, I wonder when Shuang’er will come back.” Jian Nantian also sighed softly.","Suddenly, a figure appeared on the drill ground without any warning, right in front of Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng.","Both Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng were shocked.","“Nantian, Nantian, I think I saw Shuang’er. Am I seeing things?” Ji Wumeng said in disbelief.","“I saw him too.” Jian Nantian also widened his eyes.","Jian Wushuang, who appeared at this moment, looked at Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng in front of him. He could no longer control the guilt, self-blame, and longing in his heart.","Plop!","Jian Wushuang directly knelt down and heavily knelt on the ground of the drill ground.","“Parents, mother, Shuang’er is back!” Jian Wushuang said with a hint of sobs in his voice.","“Shuang’er? Are you really our Shuang’er?”","Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng had already walked forward and looked at the person kneeling in front of them. Even though thousands of years had passed, they still recognized Jian Wushuang’s appearance and aura at a glance.","This was indeed their son, Jian Wushuang.","“Boy, it’s really you!”","Jian Nantian suppressed the excitement in his heart and stretched out his hand to help Jian Wushuang up. “Get up, quickly get up and let me have a good look.”","Jian Wushuang stood up, while Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng kept sizing up Jian Wushuang from top to bottom.","“You haven’t changed. You haven’t changed at all. Good Boy, you’ve made your mother and I wait for a long time.”Jian Nantian finally revealed a smile.","“It’s good that you’re back. It’s good that you’re back,”Ji Wumeng said softly, her face full of tears.","Their family was incomplete from the beginning.","In the past, it was Ji Wumeng who separated from their father and son. In order to make their family full, Jian Wushuang and Jian Nantian had put in countless efforts, especially Jian Nantian, who had experienced hundreds of deaths, in the end, he killed Heaven’s edge and saved Ji Wumeng.","After that, their family had a short reunion.","However, the good times did not last long. Jian Wushuang reincarnated and went to the Divine Beginning Realm. He had been gone for tens of millions of years.","After tens of millions of years of separation, Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng, who were his parents, missed and worried deeply.","But now, Jian Wushuang had finally returned.","No matter how much they missed and worried, now that he was back, everything was fine.","“Uncle, aunt!”","Ye Chen, who was practicing swordsmanship on the drill ground, ran over.","Jian Wushuang’s appearance on the drill ground and his next move had attracted everyone’s attention, including Ye Chen.","“Is this the son you’ve been worried about?” Ye Chen looked at Jian Wushuang.","He had been with Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng for ten years, and he often heard Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng mention Jian Wushuang. He also knew that Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng had such a son, but he had left a long time ago, he had gone to a very far place, but there had been no news of him for years.","“Shuang’er, let me introduce you. This is Ye Chen, a little guy we adopted,” Ji Wumeng said.","“As the only son of uncle and aunt, you haven’t been with uncle and aunt, and there has been no news at all. It’s really unfilial of you to make uncle and aunt worry for so long.” Ye Chen glanced at Jian Wushuang, there was a trace of reproach in his words.","After living with Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng for ten years, he had long regarded Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng as his parents. He knew that his ‘parents’ had been worrying about Jian Wushuang night and night all these years. Now that they saw Jian Wushuang...of course, he had to blame his ‘parents’.","“Ye Chen, don’t talk nonsense.” Ji Wumeng frowned.","“Aunt, what I said is the truth,” Ye Chen said.","Jian Wushuang was not angry at all after hearing Ye Chen’s reproach. He knew that Ye Chen was right.","He had been away for tens of millions of years, and there was no news at all. How could his parents not be worried?","“Shuang’er, Ye Chen is only in his 20s and very young. Don’t mind what he said,” Ji Wumeng said.","“Don’t worry, mother. I won’t mind. Besides, this little guy is also very interesting.” Jian Wushuang smiled and deliberately glanced at Ye Chen. “Little guy, I can see that there is a strong hatred hidden in you. If I’m not wrong, you should have a deep-seated blood feud. And if nothing unexpected happens, the people who came from outside the town should be looking for you.”","“People from outside the town?” Ye Chen’s expression changed.","“Oh, they’re already here.” Jian Wushuang smiled and then turned to look at the void in front of him.","There were close to a hundred figures rushing over. Almost all of them were at the True Saint level, and none of them were above the Divine Ruler Realm. In Jian Wushuang’s eyes, they were not even ants, but in the Green Fire World...especially in the territory where Green Mountain Town was located, a True Saint was definitely a top expert.","Nearly a hundred of them were True Saints. Such a lineup was quite astonishing.","When he saw the approaching hundred figures, Ye Chen’s expression immediately turned ugly because he recognized them at a glance. They were the people who had destroyed his family. The leader of them was someone he had met ten years ago, he had even met him.","“Is that remnant of the Ye family in this town?”","The person in the lead among the nearly one hundred human figures was a green-haired old man.","This green-haired old man had a cold expression on his face. His eyes were icy cold and carried a trace of a cold glint. His tone also carried a haughty attitude. His voice also spread throughout the entire Green Mountain Town.","The many residents of Green Mountain Town revealed terrified expressions when they heard his voice and sensed the extremely terrifying auras from these people.","They knew very well that any one of these people would be able to turn Green Mountain Town into ashes.","“Sir, he’s in this town. I’ve already seen him. He’s right there,” a True Saint beside the green-haired old man said respectfully. At the same time, he extended his hand and pointed at Ye Chen in the drill ground below.","“Oh, he’s really there. We haven’t seen each other for ten years, but he has grown quite a bit. However, his cultivation is still the same as before. He hasn’t made a single step forward.” The green-haired old man smiled coldly. Then, he raised his hand. “Since we’ve found him, we’ll directly kill him and bring his corpse back. As for this town, we’ll wipe it out as well.”","“Yes.”","The True Saints behind him accepted the order and prepared to attack.","“Wait!”","A low shout suddenly sounded. Ye Chen’s expression was somewhat savage. He raised his head and stared at the crowd above, and a shocking killing intent rose up.","It must be known that Ye Chen did not have any cultivation base, but he was able to possess such killing intent. It could be imagined how strong the hatred and unwillingness in his heart was."]},{"number":3667,"title":"Chapter 3667 - Leave No One Alive","paragraphs":["“Qing Zhong, the person you want is me. It has nothing to do with the people in this town. If you let them go, I’ll be at your disposal,” Ye Chen said in a deep voice.","“My lords, this has nothing to do with us!”","“My lords, please show mercy and let me go!”","“My lords, please spare my life.”","Many residents in Green Mountain Town had already started begging for mercy. Most of them knelt on the ground and begged for their lives.","Only Jian Wushuang, Jian Nantian, and Ji Wumeng remained standing there. They just watched quietly and did not speak.","Hearing Ye Chen’s words, the green-haired elder in the void above smiled malevolently, “I am here to kill you on the orders of the great Divine Ruler. The great Divine Ruler’s orders are to eliminate anyone who has anything to do with you. You have lived in this town for a full ten years. Naturally, the people in this town have something to do with you.”","“Since they have something to do with you, then all of them must die!”","“Let’s do it!”","The moment the green-haired old man gave the order, the people behind him immediately moved out.","“It’s going to be a massacre.”","“There are more than 300 people in this town. Kill them all and leave no one alive!”","“Tsk tsk, it’s been a long time since I’ve had a massacre. It’s a pity that the ones I’m going to kill this time are all ants.”","Sinister smiles rang out one after another, and the hundreds of figures instantly swooped down.","“No, no!”","Ye Chen became anxious, and his eyes turned red.","It did not matter if he died, but he didn’t want to implicate Jian Nantian, Ji Wumeng, and everyone else in the town who treated him as their son.","Unfortunately, although he was anxious, he could not do anything to stop the many True Saints.","Suddenly...","“Freeze!”","As soon as he said that, the hundreds of cultivators who were swooping down froze in the void.","Including the green-haired old man in the lead, they all froze in the void. Although they were still conscious, they were frightened to find that their god bodies could not move at all, they couldn’t even move their fingers.","“What...what is this technique?”","The green-haired old man was frightened. The hundreds of cultivators around him were also frightened.","The sudden change of events shocked everyone.","In Green Mountain Town, when the three hundred residents saw the people above taking action, they all thought that the end of the world was coming. However, what happened next was out of everyone’s expectations, seeing the assassins being fixed in the void like statues, these residents were also somewhat confused.","“What, what’s going on?”","“What’s going on?”","“I just heard the word ‘fixed’, and then these people were fixed. Did some earth-shaking expert make a move?”","The soldiers and civilians began to discuss, and at the same time, a glimmer of hope burned in their hearts.","“What, what’s going on?” Ye Chen was also confused.","Only Jian Wushuang, Jian Nantian, and Ji Wumeng, who were standing beside him, remained calm.","“This is space-time stagnation, right? With just a thought, it can cause space-time stagnation and immobilize nearly a hundred True Saints. Shuang’er, your current means are getting more and more unbelievable.”","Jian Nantian was the first to speak, and there was a hint of surprise in his words.","After all, he was one of the top experts in the Green Fire World. He could even be said to be one of the top experts in the entire Eternal Chaotic World. His vision was also very high in the entire Eternal Chaotic World, however, what Jian Wushuang was doing now made him feel a little incredulous.","“It’s just some small tricks.” Jian Wushuang just smiled faintly.","He was being modest. The heaven-designated skill was not a small trick. It was one of the divine skills created by the Ruler of time and space. However, when it was used on the cultivation of True Saints, it would not show its true power.","“Father, mother, the little guy named Ye Chen that you adopted is not bad.” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Of course, if he didn’t have a good heart, your father and I wouldn’t have saved him ten years ago, and we wouldn’t have kept him by our side all the time. It’s a pity that this child was born with a poor heart. His physique is too unique. Your father thought of countless ways to change his physique, but he couldn’t change it so that he could cultivate,” Ji Wumeng said.","“His physique is very special.” Jian Wushuang also nodded, but his tone suddenly changed. “But it’s not impossible to solve his physique.”","“Oh?” Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng immediately looked at Jian Wushuang.","The conversation between the three people was not concealed at all, but was clearly heard by the people around them.","In an instant, everyone understood that the three people were the ones who had made the nearly 100 cultivators freeze in the void at the same time.","“Uncle, aunt, you...” Ye Chen looked at Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng in astonishment.","“Ye Chen, we’ll talk about your business later. Let’s get rid of these people,” Jian Nantian said.","Jian Wushuang nodded and then looked up at the nearly 100 True Saints in the void.","The cultivators who were frozen in the void were all panicking. The green-haired elder in the lead was also frightened and asked, “Who...who are you?”","“Who are we?” Ji Wumeng’s expression turned cold. “Didn’t you say that you wanted to kill all the people related to Ye Chen in this town? Let me tell you, ten years ago, it was the two of us who saved Ye Chen. During these ten years, this little guy has always been by our side and can be considered as our adopted son. Speaking of which, the two of us are the closest to him in this town. If you want to kill him, you should kill the two of us first.”","“This...” The green-haired elder cleared his throat, he laughed dryly, “Haha, there might be some misunderstanding regarding this matter. We are acting under the orders of our sirs. Our masters are the Purple Emperor of the Azure Sea Cloud Pavilion. His master is the famous Magic Water Emperor of the Eternal Chaotic World. I hope that you will spare us on account of our masters.”","“Purple Emperor? Magic Water Emperor? Haha, what great names.” Jian Nantian said sarcastically.","He had heard of Magic Water Emperor. He was just an ordinary Ruler and did not think much of him, let alone Purple Emperor.","The two people who did not even care about him were nothing to Jian Wushuang.","“Purple Emperor, Magic Water Emperor, right?” Jian Wushuang smiled coldly and grabbed at the surrounding void with his bare hands.","The void shattered and two miserable figures rolled out from the shattered void."]},{"number":3668,"title":"Chapter 3668 - Wushuang City Lord","paragraphs":["Looking at the two figures rolling out from the shattered void, the green-haired old man was completely stunned.","He did not recognize one of the two figures, but he was very familiar with the other person. That was his backer, the Purple Emperor that he had just mentioned!","And the aura emitted by the person whom he did not recognize was even stronger than the Purple Emperor. This instantly made the green-haired old man guess that that person was most likely the Purple Emperor’s master, the Magic Water Emperor!","The two people whom he had mentioned earlier were obviously deliberately brought out. In the blink of an eye, they had appeared in front of him. Moreover, these two people had clearly been captured and brought here.","“Where is this place?”","“Master, you are here too? What on Earth is going on?”","The Purple Emperor and the Magic Water Emperor, who had rolled out from the shattered void, were currently in a daze.","They did not know what had happened at all. They only knew that they were originally fine when a large hand suddenly grabbed them. Following that, the two of them appeared here, it was obvious that they were very far from where they had been before.","They had broken through the void and caught them from a very far place. Such a method was enough to shock the Purple Emperor and the Magic Water Emperor.","“I, the Great Ruler, was caught here without any resistance. This is unbelievable. Even the most powerful expert in the Eternal Chaotic World, Lord White Emperor, could not do this. Who is it? Who is it?”","Magic Water Emperor immediately looked around.","Soon, he saw Jian Wushuang, who was on the ground, and Jian Nantian.","When he saw Jian Nantian, Magic Water Emperor’s pupils constricted.","As one of the Rulers of the Green Fire World, Jian Nantian was also a superior Ruler, so Magic Water Emperor knew him.","Magic Water Emperor was a little respectful toward Jian Nantian, but he was only respectful. He was not too afraid. Moreover, he knew Jian Nantian’s strength more or less. He was much stronger than him, but compared to the White Emperor...he might be slightly weaker, so it was impossible for him to catch Jian Nantian in an instant.","Then he saw Jian Wushuang.","When he saw Jian Wushuang, Magic Water Emperor immediately frowned.","At first, he felt that Jian Wushuang looked familiar, but he could not remember when he had seen him. Although Jian Wushuang did not emit any aura, he looked like an ordinary person at first glance, however, it was this ordinary feeling that made Magic Water Emperor’s heart heavy.","“My name is Jian Wushuang, you may have heard of it,” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","“Jian Wushuang?” Magic Water Emperor’s expression changed, but then he turned pale with fright, ‘Jian Wushuang’? Thousands of years ago, the leader of the Eternal Chaotic World was equal to, or even better than, the White Emperor, Sword Ruler Wushuang? “The Savior of the Eternal Chaotic World, the creator of the unparalleled Saint Realm in the Green Fire World, and the Wushuang City Governor?”","“Sword Ruler Wushuang? Savior? City Governor Wushuang?” Jian Wushuang smiled. “When did I get so many titles?”","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s admission, Magic Water Emperor could not help but take a deep breath.","He was, after all, an expert at the level of an Ruler. As one of the top experts of the Eternal Chaotic World, he was well aware of some things that happened tens of millions of years ago. Tens of millions of years ago, the Eternal Chaotic World once fell into a desperate situation, in that desperate situation, a genius expert named Jian Wushuang had turned the tide and helped the Eternal Chaotic World tide over the crisis.","Jian Wushuang was also called the savior of the Eternal Chaotic World by the later generations of cultivators. Now, tens of thousands of years had passed, and his name had long become a legend and a myth, however, many cultivators who had been left behind tens of thousands of years ago still remembered this super existence.","Therefore, when Magic Water’s eldest brother learned that the person in front of him was the legendary Jian Wushuang, he was shocked beyond words.","In addition to shock, Magic Water Emperor was also shocked!","He knew that since the person in front of him was the legendary castellan wushuang, he must have caught him and brought him here. If nothing had happened to such a super existence...why would he forcefully catch him and bring him here for no reason?","“Magic Water and his disciple, Zi Tian, pay their respects to Jian Wushuang. I wonder, castellan, what can I do for you?","“As long as we can help you, we will not refuse.” Magic Water Emperor looked extremely respectful.","Beside Magic Water Emperor, Purple Emperor did not even dare to breathe loudly.","Although he did not know much about Jian Wushuang’s name, he knew from the terrifying strength that Jian Wushuang had just displayed and the respectful look on his master’s face that the person in front of him...was not someone they could afford to provoke.","“Magic Water Emperor, I have no enmity with you and your disciple. However, just now, this person said that he was ordered by your disciple, Purple Emperor, to kill everyone in this town, including my parents. After I stepped in to stop him, he even brought your names out to threaten me. What do you think I should do?” Jian Wushuang’s voice was calm.","Although Jian Wushuang did not show any anger or killing intent, his words were like a bolt from the blue in the ears of Magic Water Emperor and Purple Emperor.","“You want to kill the parents of City Governor Wushuang?” Magic Water Emperor felt a little dizzy.","“Idiots, these damn idiots!” Purple Emperor roared and looked at the green-haired elder and the others with killing intent.","He wanted the green-haired elder and the others to go after Ye Chen and ordered them to kill everyone who was related to Ye Chen, but he did not ask them to provoke Jian Wushuang.","He also wanted to kill Jian Wushuang’s parents? This was a big joke.","In fact, the green-haired elder and the others were innocent. They did follow Purple Emperor’s orders, but they did not expect that there were a few big Buddhas hidden in the town that they could not afford to offend.","They wanted to cry but had no tears.","At this moment, the Magic Water Emperor spoke again, “City Lord, don’t worry. I will definitely give you a satisfactory explanation.”","“Really? Then I’ll wait.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","The Magic Water Emperor’s eyes turned cold, but in the next moment, he attacked as fast as lightning.","He naturally did not dare to attack Jian Wushuang, including the residents of the town. At this moment, he was dealing with the green-haired elder and nearly a hundred True Saints."]},{"number":3669,"title":"Chapter 3669 - Ye Chen’s Constitution","paragraphs":["A Ruler expert, a peak existence in the Eternal Chaotic World, was like an elephant crushing a bunch of ants when dealing with a group of True Saints.","In less than a breath’s time, the nearly one hundred True Saints were all killed. Not a single one escaped.","However, after killing those True Saints, Magic Water Emperor did not intend to stop. Instead, he looked at Purple Emperor.","“Master, what are you doing?”","Sensing Magic Water Emperor’s gaze, Purple Emperor’s expression immediately changed.","“Purple Heaven, I have always treated you well. However, it was your subordinates who offended governor Wushuang this time. In order to appease the Wushuang Governor’s anger, you can only go with them,” Magic Water Emperor said calmly.","Hearing this, the Purple Emperor was shocked.","He did not expect that his master would kill him after killing his subordinates?","“Master...” The Purple Emperor was about to speak.","“Die.” The Magic Water Emperor did not hesitate to attack.","To the Magic Water Emperor, his life was more important than anything else.","As for Purple Emperor, although he was his disciple, he could give up his own son, let alone a disciple.","However, just as Magic Water Emperor was about to kill Purple Emperor..","“Enough!” Jian Wushuang said.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Magic Water Emperor immediately stopped what he was doing and showed a respectful expression.","“This little guy has a blood feud with Purple Emperor. It’s better to let him take his own life in the future.” Jian Wushuang pointed at Ye Chen beside him and said indifferently.","“Yes.” Magic Water Emperor nodded respectfully.","Purple Emperor exhaled heavily. He glanced at Ye Chen and narrowed his eyes slightly at first, but soon relaxed.","It was true that he had a deep-seated hatred for Ye Chen. Ye Chen’s family was also a first-class family in the Green Fire World. He had uprooted the family and wiped it out. Ye Chen definitely wanted to kill him.","However, Jian Wushuang said that Ye Chen would kill him in the future, so he was not afraid.","After all, he knew a little about Ye Chen. He was a man who was born unable to cultivate and destined to be mediocre. If it were not for the fact that Ye Chen might have something left behind by the Ye family, he would not have bothered to chase after such a waste.","He was not afraid of such an innate waste, even with Jian Wushuang backing him up.","“City Governor Wushuang, may I leave now?” Magic Water Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang carefully.","“Get lost.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand.","Magic Water Emperor immediately turned and left as if he was about to be pardoned. Purple Emperor also left at the same time.","“Shuang’er, are you sure you can change this little guy’s physique so that he can cultivate?” Jian Nantian looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang smiled and finally looked at Ye Chen.","At this moment, Ye Chen was still in a daze.","He had not recovered from the shock just now. Not only him, but also all the residents of the town.","What had just happened was beyond their imagination.","With a thought, nearly 100 True Saints could not move.","With a casual stretch of his hand, the Purple Emperor and Magic Water Emperor, who were hundreds of millions of miles away, were caught.","They were super experts at the level of Divine Ruler and Ruler.","Although the residents of the town were not very worldly, they knew that Divine Ruler and Ruler were already standing at the top of the world.","However, such an existence was like a newborn baby in front of Jian Wushuang. They had no ability to resist at all.","The Ruler even killed nearly 100 True Saints and almost killed his disciples in order to erase his anger.","This scene was too unbelievable for the people of the small town. It was like a dream.","Looking at Ye Chen, who was in a daze, Jian Wushuang revealed a playful smile and shouted, “Hey, wake up, little guy.”","Ye Chen finally came back to his senses. He looked at Jian Wushuang in horror and asked subconsciously, “Who are you?”","“I said my name is Jian Wushuang. I’m the son that your uncle and aunt have been thinking about. I’m also the unfilial son that you mentioned just now,” Jian Wushuang said.","Ye Chen was shocked.","He did speak up for Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng just now, saying that Jian Wushuang was an unfilial son.","However, now that he knew Jian Wushuang’s strength and means, he was shocked.","After all, this was a super expert who was respectful even to an Ruler Realm expert. How could he be scolded by him?","If he had a bad temper, he could kill him with a thought.","“Okay, Shuang’er, stop teasing this little guy.”","Ji Wumeng opened her mouth to ease the awkwardness.","“Ye Chen, don’t be afraid. Shuang’er is strong, but she has a good temper and a broad mind. She won’t stoop to your level,” Ji Wumeng said with a smile.","Ye Chen secretly heaved a sigh of relief, but he still did not dare to look up at Jian Wushuang.","“Uncle, aunt, your identities should not be so simple, right?” Ye Chen said carefully.","Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng looked at each other and smiled, then Jian Nantian smiled and said, “Silly boy, no matter what our identities are, we are still your uncle and aunt. This will not change. You have lived with us for ten years, and we treat you as our own son. Otherwise, I would not have gone through so much trouble to find a way to change your physique.”","Hearing this, Ye Chen gave a simple and honest smile, but then his expression changed. “Uncle, you mentioned my constitution many times just now. is my constitution really that special?”","Ye Chen’s expression also became nervous.","He knew that his constitution was a little special, which was also the reason why he had been unable to truly cultivate.","However, he had always thought that as long as he worked hard enough, he would have the opportunity to change, but now...","“Your constitution is indeed very special...” After Jian Nantian briefly described the method he had thought of for the person he had previously looked for...he said, “Let’s put it this way. I have already approached all the methods. It can be said that it is impossible to change your constitution within the limits of the Eternal Chaotic World. Even i previously believed that you were destined to become an ordinary person in this lifetime. However, now that Shuang’er has returned, everything is different.”","“Little guy, if you want to change your physique and become a real cultivator, you’ll have to beg Shuang’er.”","Jian Nantian smiled."]},{"number":3670,"title":"Chapter 3670 - The Restrictions Are Lifted","paragraphs":["“Brother, Brother Wushuang.” Ye Chen could not help looking at Jian Wushuang.","“Brother?” Jian Wushuang touched his nose.","Ye Chen had been adopted by Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng, and they had treated him as an heir for the past ten years. It was understandable that Ye Chen called him brother.","“I will help you with your physique.” Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Come here, let me take a closer look.”","Ye Chen walked to Jian Wushuang. Jian Wushuang reached out his right hand and gently touched Ye Chen’s forehead. “Don’t resist.”","In an instant, a strange divine power burst out from Jian Wushuang’s hand and entered Ye Chen’s body. Then, everything about Ye Chen’s body was exposed to Jian Wushuang.","“It really is a naturally terminated meridians.” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and a trace of surprise appeared on the corner of his mouth.","“Naturally terminated meridians? What is that?” Jian Nantian looked over.","“Naturally terminated meridians are a layer of restriction imposed on him by the will of the Heavenly Dao. This layer of restriction will prevent this little guy from becoming a cultivator for the rest of his life. However, this kind of physique has both advantages and disadvantages,” Jian Wushuang said.","“How can it be beneficial to prevent a person from cultivating for the rest of his life?” Jian Nantian frowned.","“Of course, this physique may seem terrifying, but in fact, a person who possesses such a physique is definitely an incredible super genius. His talent would even make the Heavenly Dao jealous. That’s why the will of the Heavenly Dao imposed a restriction on him. However, if he is lucky enough to meet a top expert to remove this restriction for him, his talent will be better displayed. From then on, a carp will leap through the Dragon Gate and soar into the sky!” Jian Wushuang said.","“Is that so?” Jian Nantian was surprised.","“Naturally terminated meridians are very rare. Not to mention in the Eternal Chaotic World, even in my previous world, few people have such a physique. I was lucky to meet two of them,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","The reason why he was able to determine that Ye Chen had naturally terminated meridians was because he had come into contact with cultivators with naturally terminated meridians.","His good friend, Demon Master Chenhuo, was a possessor of naturally terminated meridians. When he and Demon Master Chenhuo were adventuring in the Demon Realm, they met another possessor of naturally terminated meridians, Zhao Mang, in the end, Zhao Mang was taken in as a disciple by Demon Master Chenhuo, and his naturally terminated meridians were also removed by Demon Master Chenhuo.","After removing his naturally terminated meridians, Zhao Mang displayed an extremely terrifying cultivation talent. At that time, even Jian Wushuang was extremely amazed.","“With such a unique physique, I didn’t expect there to be one in the Eternal Chaotic World.” Jian Wushuang could not help sighing.","“Shuang’er, you just said that only the top experts in your world can remove this restriction. Can you do it now?” Jian Nantian asked.","“Don’t worry. If I had to remove the restriction on this little guy before, I would have to spend some effort and even collect some rare treasures. But now...it’s very simple.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and immediately willed a wisp of faint golden divine power to rush toward Ye Chen.","There was an extremely special power contained in the golden divine power. This power was the power of the will given by the universal principles!","The power of the will given by the universal principles contained the aura of the universal principles. After entering Ye Chen’s body, the restriction was lifted almost instantly, Ye Chen felt his body shake, and then he could clearly sense the existence of the vast spiritual power ocean around him.","“This is...spiritual power?” There was still shock in Ye Chen’s eyes.","However, the corner of Jian Wushuang’s mouth curled up again. “Little guy, let me help you again.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the trace of the power of the will that had entered Ye Chen’s body instantly began to circulate. Rumble! The world shook, and an extremely terrifying devouring power suddenly erupted from Ye Chen’s body.","Instantly, the surrounding void, and the boundless spiritual power, immediately gathered at an inconceivable speed toward Ye Chen’s body. Ye Chen was like a huge spring, and all of the spiritual power gathered toward him, after that, it was mercilessly devoured by him.","Along with the crazy devouring of this spiritual power, the aura on his body also began to soar at an astonishing speed.","One had to know that Ye Chen was originally just an ordinary person, but in just an instant, he had already reached the peak of celestial venerables.","And then...kacha!","Thunderclouds churned, and dark clouds covered the void above. The Thunder Tribulation had already begun to brew.","“World Divine Tribulation?”","Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng both raised their heads in astonishment.","Any cultivator born in the Eternal World would have to undergo the World Divine Tribulation when they broke through to become a World God.","Jian Wushuang had also experienced it before, but now, Ye Chen’s strength had suddenly soared. He had gone from an ordinary person to a World Divine Tribulation, and this was obviously just the beginning.","Boom! Crack!","The Thunder Tribulation did not take long to brew before it descended.","Below, Ye Chen was still crazily devouring the surrounding spiritual power, turning a blind eye to the Lightning Tribulation.","Upon seeing this, Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng both frowned.","“Shuang’er, this world deity tribulation is naturally nothing to us. However, this little fellow has just met the conditions to cultivate, yet he’s already transcended the world deity tribulation. Can he transcend it?” Jian Nantian asked.","“Father, you’re underestimating this little guy. To be more precise, you’re underestimating his physique and potential. Although I’ve just stimulated his physique slightly, it’s enough for him to instantly reach the peak of the True Saint Realm, or even the Divine Ruler realm. As for the World Divine Tribulation, it’s just a small transition for him. How can it threaten him?” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“You said he could reach the top of the True Saint Realm, or even the Divine Ruler Realm?” Jian Nantian widened his eyes.","“That’s right.” Jian Wushuang nodded and sighed in his heart.","Cultivators with special physiques were indeed far beyond ordinary cultivators, especially those with naturally terminated meridians like Ye Chen and Zhao Mang. They were simply born monsters.","When these natural freaks cultivated, it was as simple as eating and drinking.","Back in the other domain, after the Demon Master Chenhuo removed the restrictions on Zhao Mang, Zhao Mang only used a short ten years to leap from an ordinary person to the Immortal Saint Realm. This was extremely shocking.","And now, Ye Chen had also stimulated some of his potential. Unfortunately, he was in the Eternal Chaotic World after all. The restrictions in a small-scale astral world were too great, hence, he could only reach the Divine Master Realm at most.","If he was in the Divine Beginning Realm, Ye Chen would be able to improve far more than that."]},{"number":3671,"title":"Chapter 3671 - One Stroke","paragraphs":["Just as Jian Wushuang had said, Ye Chen’s improvement this time was no mere World God.","And the World Divine Tribulation posed no threat to Ye Chen at all.","When the first World Divine Tribulation descended, Ye Chen’s cultivation had almost reached the peak of stage three World Gods. When the stage three World God descended, Ye Chen’s cultivation had already surpassed that of an ordinary True Saint.","Therefore, the layers of World Divine Tribulations were not enough to tickle Ye Chen and strengthen his divine body.","Soon, the World Divine Tribulation was over. Ye Chen’s cultivation had also reached the peak of the True Saint Realm, but he continued to improve.","After a while, Ye Chen’s aura soared again, and his cultivation also advanced to the Divine Ruler Realm.","Just a moment ago, he was just an ordinary person who had not even mastered spiritual power. In the blink of an eye, he had already reached the Divine Ruler realm. When Jian Wushuang had just started cultivating, he had become a Divine Ruler step by step, it had taken a lot of hardship and time, not to mention countless life-and-death experiences.","However, a cultivator like Ye Chen, who was favored by God, was different. As long as the restriction was lifted, he would immediately soar to the sky.","It was no wonder that Jian Wushuang could not help sighing. He could not help but feel a trace of jealousy.","Finally, the devouring power in Ye Chen’s body gradually weakened, and the growth of his aura gradually subsided. In the end, Ye Chen’s cultivation stopped at the level of a normal Divine Ruler.","“Phew!”","After exhaling a mouthful of turbid air, Ye Chen opened his eyes and felt the majestic divine power he now had. An unprecedented joy appeared on his face.","“Little guy, come here.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand.","Ye Chen immediately walked forward.","“How do you feel?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Very good, better than ever.” Ye Chen looked around his body and then asked, “Brother Wushuang, I wonder what realm I have reached?”","Ye Chen was not a cultivator before, so his knowledge of a cultivator’s realm was limited. Although he had mastered a very strong power now, he did not know what step he had reached.","“You are now a Divine Ruler. Of course, if you were in the world I have been in, you would be a Chaos Realm cultivator,” Jian Wushuang said.","“A Divine Ruler?” Ye Chen could not help clenching his hands.","He knew what a Divine Ruler was. His destroyed ye family had a Divine Ruler expert before, and his enemy, Divine Ruler Zi Tian, was only a Divine Ruler. Above a Divine Ruler was a Divine Ruler.","He did not expect that the gap between him and his enemy, Divine Ruler Zi Tian, would be so close in such a short time.","“Little guy, I see that you have a sword on your back. It seems that you are also good at swordsmanship?”Jian Wushuang suddenly asked.","“Yes, I am good at swordsmanship,” Ye Chen said.","“Shuang’er, although this little guy couldn’t become a real cultivator because of his physique, he worked harder than anyone else. In the past ten years, not only did he practice brute force, but he also made some achievements in swordsmanship. His talent in sword principle is very good. He is much stronger than many sword principle geniuses I have met. Even I don’t dare to say that my talent in sword principle is stronger than his,” Jian Nantian said.","“Father, even you don’t dare to say that your talent in sword principle is better than his?” Jian Wushuang was really shocked.","He knew that his father had an extremely rare sword spirit body.","It was the reincarnation body of a top-tier magic sword and the sword spirit of a magic sword that could step into the reincarnation on its own during the shocking battle that destroyed the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. This magic sword must be an extremely high-level universe supreme treasure, such a sword spirit body was extremely talented in sword principle.","It was much stronger than many Principles Masters who were good at sword principle in the Divine Beginning Realm. However, Jian Nantian’s achievements were limited because he stayed in the Eternal Chaotic World and had no contact with the outside world. Otherwise...","Even Jian Nantian, who had an incredible talent in sword principle, said that his talent in sword principle might not be as good as Ye Chen’s.","Jian Wushuang immediately became interested.","“Little guy, now you can practice your swordsmanship in front of me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Ye Chen nodded.","Without any hesitation, he began to practice his swordsmanship on the drill ground.","After this practice, Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","“Before he met me, he was an ordinary person, but his understanding of swordsmanship was so high. Father, did you teach him?” Jian Wushuang looked at Jian Nantian.","“If I had taught him, he wouldn’t have been so surprised by his talent in sword principle. The point is that he didn’t receive any guidance from anyone. He only grew up step by step in sword principle. Ten years ago, when I saved him, he started to really touch the sword,” Jian Nantian said.","“No one taught him and he just relied on himself. In just ten years, his understanding of swordsmanship is so high?” Jian Wushuang nodded secretly. “Yes, his talent in sword principle is indeed very good, but it’s not necessarily better than you, father.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and waved his hand. “That’s enough, little guy. Come here.”","Ye Chen walked over again.","“Big Brother Wushuang, how’s my swordsmanship?” Ye Chen asked expectantly.","“Haha, you call that swordsmanship? What a joke.” Jian Wushuang mocked him rudely and then took a step back. “Little guy, watch carefully.”","Jian Wushuang did not draw his sword. Instead, he stretched out a finger and slowly drew a line in the air in front of him.","There was no movement or power. There was not even sword essence or sword shadow.","On the drill ground, many residents of the town were still watching. They also saw Jian Wushuang’s finger.","However, in the eyes of these residents, Jian Wushuang was just casually waving his finger. There was nothing magical about it, including the strongest person in the small town.","Even Ji Wumeng was a little stunned. She did not know what Jian Wushuang was doing.","Only Jian Nantian, who had a sword spirit body, saw Jian Wushuang waving his finger. His eyes suddenly lit up with an unprecedented flash of light. He...he could see the incredible mystery contained in the stroke.","As for Ye Chen, he was stunned.","He finally came back to his senses when Jian Wushuang withdrew his hand.","But when he came back to his senses, he was at a loss."]},{"number":3672,"title":"Chapter 3672 - Discussion","paragraphs":["“Little guy, did you see what I just did?” Jian Wushuang looked at Ye Chen.","Ye Chen shook his head subconsciously.","It was normal. Jian Wushuang was the top existence in the Divine Beginning Realm. As for sword principle, it was at the level of the origin of the sword universe. The swordsmanship he displayed, even if it was just a casual display...it was not something that a little guy like Ye Chen could see clearly.","“I have completely imprinted that sword in your mind. In addition, I will give you ten years. Within ten years, if you can comprehend one-thousandth of that sword skill, I will take you as an in-name disciple and teach you sword principle. In the future, I will also take you to explore the wider world.”","“But if you can’t comprehend one-thousandth of the swordsmanship in ten years, then your achievements in this life will be limited to this Eternal Chaotic World,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Ten years, just one-thousandth of the swordsmanship?” Ye Chen was immediately delighted.","Although he knew that Jian Wushuang’s sword was unfathomable, it was only one-thousandth of the swordsmanship, and he still had ten years.","Ten years was a long time for him, who was only 20 years old.","He was confident that he would be able to comprehend some of the swordsmanship within ten years, or even more than one-ten-thousandth.","“Little guy, I advise you not to be so confident. The swordsmanship I just displayed, even if I only comprehended one-ten-thousandth of it, is not something an ordinary person can do,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","What he said was the truth. His sword just now contained the universe origin of sword principle. That level of power was unattainable even for Jian Nantian, let alone Ye Chen. In ten years’ time...comprehending one-tenth of a profound mystery was definitely a huge and extremely difficult test for Ye Chen.","“No matter how difficult it is, I will definitely achieve it.” Ye Chen clenched his hands.","“Alright, then work hard. When you feel that you have comprehended some profound mysteries, you can look for me. If you haven’t comprehended any profound mysteries within ten years, there’s no need to look for me again.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, at this moment, he suddenly received a message from Wang Yuan.","“Father, mother, boss Wang Yuan has sent me a message. Many top experts from the Green Fire World and the Eternal Chaotic World have gathered in Wushuang City. I’m going to go over now and announce some things to the public. You guys should come too.” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.”","Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng nodded.","“Ye Chen, you should come with us,” Jian Nantian said.","“Yes.” Ye Chen also nodded.","Then the four of them left the small town and went to the Wushuang Saint Realm.","The Wushuang Saint Realm was originally a Saint Realm for cultivators from the Green Fire World. There were many cultivators who stayed there all year round, but most of them were not at the top yet. They were cultivating with the help of the cultivation resources of the Wushuang Saint Realm, as for the top experts in the Green Fire World and the Eternal Chaotic World, not many people stayed there.","However, today, the Wushuang Saint Realm was filled with experts.","Not only were there many top experts in the Green Fire World, but there were also many Ruler existences in the Eternal Chaotic World who had rushed here.","Among them were some people who had interacted with Jian Wushuang before, as well as some people who were close to him.","For example, his good friend Duan Ling Feng, who had gone through life and death together when he was adventuring in the Eternal Chaotic World.","His senior brother was also Xue Lingtian, a disciple of Xuan Yi.","His disciple was Lin Lan.","There was also the full moon Gu King, who had once lived in his body for a long time!","In addition, the ancient god Clan’s Gu Tong King and the others had also come here.","Buzz!","In the towering and Majestic Divine Hall, throne after throne stood on both sides. At a glance, there were at least several hundred thrones.","These several hundred thrones sat the top experts of the Green Fire World and the Eternal Chaotic World.","As for the front of the Divine Hall, there were only two thrones lined up side by side. On one of the thrones, there was a white-skinned man with a graceful figure. This man was none other than the White Emperor!","After tens of millions of years, the White Emperor was still recognized as the number one expert in the Eternal Chaotic World. He was also the most exalted existence in the Eternal Chaotic World.","As for the other throne, it was originally empty until Jian Wushuang’s figure slowly appeared and finally landed on the throne, standing side by side with the White Emperor.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re finally back.” The White Emperor glanced at Jian Wushuang.","“White Emperor, how have you been?” Jian Wushuang smiled indifferently.","He had a good relationship with the White Emperor. Later, he learned that the White Emperor was an experimental figure of his master, Xuan Yi. Like him, he had been striving for the perfect life level. Unfortunately, due to some special reasons, the White Emperor had long lost the potential to become a perfect Ruler.","However, since they were both valued by Xuan Yi, they were naturally closer to each other.","The seemingly leisurely conversation between Jian Wushuang and the White Emperor was heard by the hundreds of top experts from the Green Fire World and the Eternal Chaotic World on the throne below. They immediately began to discuss.","“That person is Jian Wushuang?”","“It’s rumored that Jian Wushuang saved the Eternal Chaotic World from fire and water tens of millions of years ago. Many people said that he was the savior of the Eternal Chaotic World. It’s also said that his strength was recognized at that time and he was not weaker than the White Emperor. Now that he has disappeared for tens of millions of years, I wonder what level his strength has reached.”","“I don’t think he’s weaker than the White Emperor, but I don’t know if he’s stronger than the White Emperor.”","Most of the people were talking about Jian Wushuang’s strength, and most of them compared the White Emperor to Jian Wushuang.","Many people thought that Jian Wushuang was once a super genius who was not much weaker than the White Emperor before he disappeared. Now that he had returned after tens of millions of years, he must be stronger and should be able to completely rival the White Emperor, he might even be stronger than the White Emperor.","Of course, this was only because he knew more about Jian Wushuang, or because he had lived from tens of millions of years ago until now.","However, there were still many people on the field who had only grown up during these tens of millions of years.","Because of the improvement of the cultivation environment in the Green Fire World during these tens of millions of years, many geniuses were born in the Eternal Chaotic World, which naturally created many experts.","Nearly half of the hundreds of experts present had only grown up in the past tens of millions of years. They did not live in the era where Jian Wushuang was from. Even if they had grown up, they had only heard some legends about Jian Wushuang.","After all, they had not seen the legends with their own eyes, so there would be some doubts about them.","For example, many people now had doubts about Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3673,"title":"Chapter 3673 - Questions","paragraphs":["“Who is that man? He is on the same level as Lord White Emperor?”","“His name is Jian Wushuang. It is said that he was from tens of millions of years ago, and his strength does not seem to be weaker than Lord White Emperor’s.”","“His strength is not weaker than Lord White Emperor’s?”","“Are you kidding me? Lord White Emperor is an extraordinary figure who has been left behind since the first era. In the entire Eternal Chaotic World, apart from those ancient experts who have been sleeping, who else could be a match for Lord White Emperor?”","“I don’t know, but since Jian Wushuang can stand on the same level as Lord White Emperor, it means that he must have some strength.”","The discussions and whispers echoed in the hall.","White Emperor looked around and heard the conversations of many people. He could not help but smile. “Jian Wushuang, you disappeared for tens of millions of years. These tens of millions of years just happened to be the time when the number of experts in the Eternal Chaotic World exploded. There are many new experts who don’t know about you now.”","“It doesn’t matter. I won’t stay in the Eternal Chaotic World for long this time. It doesn’t matter whether these little guys know about me or not.” Jian Wushuang was very calm. “White Emperor, tell them to be quiet. I have something to say.”","Originally, Jian Wushuang only needed to show some divine power to easily suppress the cultivators present and make them tremble. However, Jian Wushuang felt that it was unnecessary, so it was better to let White Emperor speak.","“Everyone, please stop.”","As expected, as soon as the White Emperor opened his mouth, these discussions immediately stopped.","The hundreds of experts present all looked at the White Emperor and Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang, speak.” The White Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Everyone, many of you know me to a certain extent, but there are also many who don’t know who I am. But it doesn’t matter. This time, I came back to tell you some things. After that, I will leave.” Jian Wushuang paused, he continued, “What I want to tell you is related to the Eternal Chaotic World.”","“As we all know, the Eternal Chaotic World has existed for three eras, namely the ancient era, the first era, and now the second era. Among them, the ancient era is the most glorious. Even now, there are many sleeping experts of the ancient era in the Eternal Chaotic World. Those experts of the ancient era are all extremely powerful, far beyond the level of the ‘Ruler’ that you all know.”","“But why were the experts of the ancient times so powerful?”","“Actually, it’s very simple. It’s because the cultivators of the ancient times were from another world. And that world is a world that is far more vast and vast than the Eternal Chaotic World. The experts are as numerous as the clouds, far beyond what the Eternal Chaotic World can compare to.”","“For example, the strongest cultivator in the Eternal Chaotic World is now recognized as an ‘Ruler’. In that world, they are called the Chaos Realm. In that world, the Chaos Realm is just an insignificant figure, or even an ant. Above the Chaos Realm, there are Divine Demon Realm, Divine Master Realm, and Saint Realm!”","“After reaching the Saint Realm, in some barren places in that world, you can barely be considered an expert. But in the core of that world, you are still just an ant.”","Jian Wushuang said a lot in one breath.","Hearing his words, most of the hundreds of cultivators present were stunned, and many of them were in disbelief.","“Mr. Jian Wushuang, is what you just said true? Is there an even wider world outside the Eternal Chaotic World?","“You have disappeared for tens of millions of years. Could it be that you have gone to that wider world?”","“a Ruler is an ant? Even a Saint Realm expert who is far beyond the Ruler realm is an ant in some core places. How is that possible? Jian Wushuang, are you kidding?”","What Jian Wushuang said was indeed a little too shocking for the cultivators in the Eternal Chaotic World.","Because of the shock, it caused a lot of doubts. Some people even directly refuted, and their words were somewhat unkind.","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. “Shut up!”","With a low shout, the time and space in the palace instantly froze.","Except for those who were friends with Jian Wushuang, the other Rulers on the thrones immediately found that they could not move their bodies at all, they could not open their mouths anymore and could not say a word.","They could only stare with their eyes wide open in terror.","“How noisy.” Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold.","The Eternal Chaotic World was his hometown, and he did have great feelings for it. He was also close to the cultivators here, but that did not mean that they could question or provoke him. After all...he was an expert at the Ruler level.","In the Divine Beginning Realm, even a Principles Master who dared to challenge the authority of a Ruler would die, let alone a mere Chaos Realm expert.","“Listen up. I don’t have the time or the need to answer your questions. I’m willing to tell you all this because you were born in the Eternal Chaotic World. Just listen to me obediently. As for whether you believe me or not, it’s up to you.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand, immediately, the stagnant space-time in the hall began to flow again.","Only those cultivators who were stuck in the space-time stagnation could move again.","However, even though they could move again, the cultivators were still extremely terrified.","They did not know what method Jian Wushuang had used just now, but at that moment, they could not move at all and could only be butchered by others. It made them feel terrified from the bottom of their hearts. With this move...Jian Wushuang had already proved his terrifying strength.","His strength was definitely far beyond that of the White Emperor.","Immediately, the doubts of the cultivators toward Jian Wushuang disappeared, leaving only fear and awe.","They listened to what Jian Wushuang said and did not dare to refute him.","“I just said that there is an even wider world outside the Eternal Chaotic World. Actually, it’s not all like this because the Eternal Chaotic World and that world are originally one. However, due to some special reasons, the Eternal Chaotic World is completely isolated...”","Jian Wushuang immediately described the origin of the Eternal Chaotic World, its relationship with the Divine Beginning Realm, and the location of the seal formation in more detail.","After hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, hundreds of cultivators present, including White Emperor, who was sitting next to Jian Wushuang, were shocked."]},{"number":3674,"title":"Chapter 3674 - I Am the Heavenly Dao","paragraphs":["“Jian Wushuang, are you saying that our Eternal Chaotic World was separated from the Divine Beginning Realm?” White Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Over the years, the Divine Beginning Realm was completely isolated from the Eternal Chaotic World because of the existence of the seal formation. This led to the gradual decline of the Eternal Chaotic World. Even the experts left behind from the ancient times were forced to sleep, but they were unable to leave this world. If you want to change this situation, you must remove the seal formation.”","“Jian Wushuang, since you can return to the Eternal Chaotic World from the Divine Beginning Realm, you must have a way to remove the seal formation, right?” The White Emperor asked.","“Of course I have a way to remove the seal formation, but I won’t do it.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “To be honest, the existence of the seal formation has a very special meaning. Now that I’ve completely refined the seal formation, I’ve also refined the Eternal Chaotic World into my Secret Realm.”","“Under such circumstances, it’s impossible for me to remove the seal formation. However, I can leave a passage to the Divine Beginning Realm. In the future, any cultivator from the Eternal Chaotic World who meets certain conditions can enter the Divine Beginning Realm by themselves through the passage.”","White Emperor nodded secretly.","Although Jian Wushuang did not remove the seal formation directly, it was enough as long as there was a passage connecting the Divine Beginning Realm so that the cultivators from the Eternal Chaotic World could enter the Divine Beginning Realm normally.","“By the way, you just said that after you refined the seal formation, the entire Eternal Chaotic World became your Secret Realm. What do you mean?” The White Emperor asked, puzzled.","“It means that the Eternal Chaotic World is now completely under my control. To be more precise, I now represent the will of the Heavenly Dao of the Eternal Chaotic World. All the rules and order of the Heavenly Dao of the Eternal Chaotic World are under my control,” Jian Wushuang said.","“What?” The White Emperor was shocked.","The hundreds of cultivators on the throne were also shocked when they heard Jian Wushuang’s words.","The current Jian Wushuang was equivalent to the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Eternal Chaotic World?","The cultivators in the Eternal Chaotic World had always been in awe of the will of the Heavenly Dao because that power was simply out of their reach. However, what Jian Wushuang said now...he had become the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Eternal Chaotic World. This was simply unbelievable to everyone present.","“Jian Wushuang, are you...are you telling the truth?” White Emperor was in disbelief.","“Of course it’s true, and I will naturally prove it.” Jian Wushuang did not explain too much. Instead, he waved his hand.","In an instant, the world changed.","The people who were in the Hall of the Wushuang Saint Realm came to a vast and dark void in the next moment.","“Dark void?”","“We are in the dark void?”","“It’s really the dark void. With a wave of his hand, he quietly brought us to the dark void. What kind of trick is this?”","Jian Wushuang raised his hand again in shock.","He pointed at the dark and boundless void in front of him.","“Condense!”","As soon as he said that, a special power suddenly descended.","This power represented the heavenly will of the Eternal Chaotic World and the order and principles of this world. It directly descended into the vast void.","Then, under Jian Wushuang’s guidance, an Eternal World began to grow and evolve rapidly.","Under normal circumstances, it took a long time for an Eternal World to fully grow. But now, under Jian Wushuang’s guidance, the Eternal World was growing and evolving at an incredible speed, in just a moment, it had completed the early stages of its growth.","An incomparably complete Eternal World appeared in front of everyone, and the Eternal World had begun to give birth to cultivators.","This scene shocked the hundreds of cultivators present and rendered them speechless.","Many people subconsciously thought that this was an illusion. They had quietly fallen into the illusion. But soon, as their perception became clearer and clearer, and they even had a short contact with the Eternal World, only then did they understand.","This was not an illusion, but a real one.","With just a thought, Jian Wushuang had formed a complete Eternal World!","And when he condensed the Eternal World, the unseen power descended. All of this proved that what Jian Wushuang said before was true.","Now, he had completely controlled the Eternal Chaotic World. His will was equivalent to the will of the Heavenly Dao of the Eternal Chaotic World.","He was the Heavenly Dao of the Eternal Chaotic World!","“Jian Wushuang, I can’t believe that you’ve reached such an incredible level in less than ten million years. You’ve directly refined the Eternal Chaotic World and controlled the Heavenly Dao Order of the Eternal Chaotic World. Tsk, tsk...”","White Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang and could not help but exclaim in admiration, “If I’m not wrong, you, who can control the Heavenly Dao Order of the Eternal Chaotic World, must be a top expert even in the Divine Beginning Realm, right?”","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, which was a tacit agreement.","“I knew it.” The White Emperor sighed, then he said seriously, “You said that you would leave a passage to the Divine Beginning Realm so that the cultivators of our Eternal Chaotic World can enter the Divine Beginning Realm. However, in the Eternal Chaotic World, apart from us native cultivators, there are also those ancient experts who are sleeping. Once you open the passage, those ancient experts will definitely be alarmed.”","“Of course. Although the cultivation conditions in the Eternal Chaotic World have improved a lot compared to tens of millions of years ago, they are still incomparable to the Divine Beginning Realm. Those ancient experts had no choice but to sleep here. Once they have a chance to return to the Divine Beginning Realm, they will certainly seize it. When the passage to the Divine Beginning Realm is opened, those ancient experts will probably wake up,” Jian Wushuang said.","“If that’s the case, we have to be careful. After all, those ancient experts are all extremely powerful. If they were to wake up in one go...it would be fine if they could follow the rules. But if they don’t, it would definitely be a disaster for our Eternal Chaotic World.” The White Emperor frowned.","Although he had been publicly acknowledged as the number one expert in the Eternal Chaotic World all these years, he knew very well how terrifying those ancient experts who slept in the Eternal Chaotic World were. Toward those ancient experts...the White Emperor had always been incomparably fearful."]},{"number":3675,"title":"Chapter 3675 - Wake Up","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang also knew why the White Emperor was so afraid of those ancient experts.","After all, the Eternal Chaotic World had almost been destroyed by those ancient experts tens of millions of years ago.","Of course, those were mainly the experts left behind by the three saint realm camps. The people left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect would not pose a threat to the Eternal Chaotic World, after all, the Eternal Chaotic World was derived from the Seven Star Divine Realm.","“Don’t worry. Since I can open the passage to the Divine Beginning Realm, I naturally have ways to restrain the ancient experts who have awakened. With me around, they won’t act recklessly.” Jian Wushuang’s words were filled with absolute confidence.","He was indeed confident.","Whether it was the experts left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect or the people left behind by the three Saint Realm camps, they did not need to care anymore.","Not to mention that this was the Eternal Chaotic World, the strength of the ancient experts would be greatly suppressed. Even in the Divine Beginning Realm, their strength would be at its peak, Jian Wushuang could still easily suppress them.","The only one who was more troublesome was probably that existence.","“White Emperor, let’s go meet the ancient experts.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and waved his hand again.","The world changed. The people who were originally in the dark void came to a huge ancient battlefield in the blink of an eye.","This ancient battlefield was the huge battlefield where the Green Fire World was located.","Over the years, because the spiritual power of the Green Fire World began to recover rapidly, the spiritual Qi of the ancient experts became more and more abundant. This led to the ancient experts who were scattered around the Eternal Chaotic World sleeping, most of them came here.","There were a lot of ancient experts who were sleeping on the ancient battlefield.","“Everyone from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, wake up.”","Jian Wushuang looked down at the ancient battlefield and said softly.","His voice was very casual, but it carried a transcendent will and spread out at an astonishing speed.","This ancient battlefield, and even the entire Eternal Chaotic World, a large number of experts from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect camp who had been sleeping here since the world-ending battle, regardless of how long they had been sleeping...regardless of their current state, they could hear this voice extremely clearly. At the same time, they could also sense that transcendent will.","Immediately, the experts from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect who were sleeping on the ancient battlefield and in the Eternal Chaotic World woke up.","Buzz! Buzz! Buzz!","The world began to shake.","Ancient and majestic auras rose from every corner of the Eternal Chaotic World, especially on the ancient battlefield where the Green Fire World was located.","Jian Wushuang, the White Emperor, and hundreds of high-level experts of the Eternal Chaotic World gathered in the void of the ancient battlefield, at this moment, they could clearly sense the terrifying aura that came from their surroundings, which made them tremble and suffocate.","Any one of these auras gave people the feeling that they could not block it.","Among the hundreds of cultivators in the Eternal Chaotic World, most of them were trembling even though they were ‘Rulers’. Even those ‘Rulers’ who had reached the top level were trembling, their hearts were also trembling.","Even the White Emperor had a terrible look on his face.","Only Jian Wushuang had a faint smile on his face when he sensed the rising auras.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Towering figures rushed over from every corner of the ancient battlefield.","In the blink of an eye, more than 100 ancient experts had arrived, and the number was still increasing.","An hour later, there were more than 400 ancient experts, some of whom Jian Wushuang had seen before.","Saint Soul, Granny Snake Flower, Icefire Saint, Old Monster Mang, and Barbaria Ruler had all helped him in the past.","Among them, there was One Star Weng.","“Haha, I was wondering who it was. So It’s you, little guy.” One Star Weng saw Jian Wushuang in front of him and immediately understood that it was Jian Wushuang who had woken them up. He could not help laughing heartily.","“One Star Weng, long time no see.” Jian Wushuang also smiled slightly.","One Star Weng had once saved his life and given him an opportunity. Although the strength of One Star Weng was nothing in front of him now, Jian Wushuang had been anxious about that favor. Therefore, he treated One Star Weng differently, Jian Wushuang’s attitude was naturally different.","“This time, there are quite a lot of people who have woken up. Except for those top existences, most of the others are here.” One Star Weng looked around the void.","“Well, the battle was too heavy. There were very few experts left in the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. More than 90% of the experts who slept in this realm for countless years died or could never wake up again. Now, we are the only ones who can be woken up,” Granny Snake Flower said.","“Little guy, you woke us up this time. Do you need our help?” One Star Weng looked at Jian Wushuang.","“No rush. Let’s wait for them to come,” Jian Wushuang said.","One Star Weng and the others nodded secretly. They were not in a hurry. After all, the spiritual power in the ancient battlefield was quite strong. Even if they did not sleep, they could stay for a long time.","While everyone was waiting, nine figures flew over as if they had discussed it.","Seeing the nine figures, One Star Weng, Granny Snake Flower, and the others who had arrived earlier immediately showed respect.","Jian Wushuang also smiled when he saw the nine people.","He had seen all nine of them.","Eight of them were the eight experts who had helped him greatly when he was awakened by Xuan Yi during his reincarnation. At that time, Jian Wushuang did not know how strong these eight people were, but now he could tell at a glance.","These eight people were all Principles Masters, and three of them were very strong among Principles Masters.","As for the other person, he was wearing a white robe. His skin was fair and his face was as warm as jade, but he was extremely cold. There seemed to be no emotion in his eyes. He stood at the front, and the eight Principles Masters faintly took him as their leader.","The moment this person arrived, Jian Wushuang immediately felt a shocking sword essence from him. That sword essence was not only powerful and terrifying, but it could also activate the universe origin of Sword Principle!","In the entire Divine Beginning Realm, there was only one other person who could activate the universe origin of sword principle who had reached the fourth stage of sword principle.","Di Shisan!"]},{"number":3676,"title":"Chapter 3676 - Xuan Yan","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang could sense the astonishing sword essence hidden in Di Shisan’s body, and Di Shisan could also sense the sword essence hidden in his body.","“When you left this world, you had just begun to learn sword principle. Now, when you learn sword principle, you have gathered such a powerful sword essence. If I’m not mistaken, you should have already taken that step.” Di Shisan looked at Jian Wushuang.","Of course, Jian Wushuang knew what Di Shisan meant by that step. He could not help smiling and said, “I went to the Universe Battlefield and had a special opportunity. That’s why I was able to take that step.”","“That’s right. Before me, of course, no one in the Principles Master of the Divine Beginning Realm was able to take that step in sword principle. I was the first, but do you know if you’re the second?” Di Shisan asked.","He had been sleeping in the Eternal Chaotic World for too long, so he did not know what had happened in the Divine Beginning Realm. Naturally, he did not know whether there had been other sword principle geniuses in the Divine Beginning Realm over the years, those who had stepped into the origin of the sword universe at the level of Principles Master.","“I don’t think so.” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","“In that case, you are the only Principles Master in the Divine Beginning Realm who is qualified to be on par with me in sword principle. Jian Wushuang, I would like to experience your current swordsmanship,” Di Shisan said.","“I’d like to see your swordsmanship too, but I’m not in a hurry. After all, there are too many restrictions in this realm, so you can’t fully display your strength. Let’s wait until we go to the Divine Beginning Realm and try again,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Go to the Divine Beginning Realm?” Di Shisan’s expression changed.","The eight Principles Masters behind him, as well as the top Immortal Saints such as One Star Weng and Granny Snake Flower, immediately looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang, have you found a way to leave this world since you woke us up?” Di Shisan asked.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. Then, he suddenly looked at the void around him. “Is that person finally here?”","As Jian Wushuang murmured, the void around him shattered like a piece of paper.","A huge space passage appeared out of thin air, followed by a stout figure slowly stepping out.","It was a tall, handsome man with black hair. He was extremely beautiful and more charming than ordinary women. His long and narrow eyes were as calm as the vast ocean. On his right shoulder, there was a palm-sized Golden Dragon Turtle.","After he walked out of the spatial tunnel, a transcendent aura slowly spread out and the entire world around him fell into silence.","This person instantly became the focus of everything in the world.","Upon seeing this person, the experts from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect and even Di Shisan immediately revealed respectful expressions.","“Greetings, Lord Palace Master!”","Everyone from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect bowed respectfully.","Xuan Yan was one of the three overlords of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect at his peak. He was also the Palace Master of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect’s Divine Punishment Heaven Palace.","During the world-destroying battle, the three overlords of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, Xuan Yi, died in battle. Xuan God escaped by a fluke and hid in the Divine Beginning Realm. During these years, he kept accumulating power and built a huge star palace.","Xuan Yan, the Palace Master of Divine Punishment, was left in this world with many experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. He had been in a deep sleep.","When Jian Wushuang was adventuring in the Eternal Chaotic World, he first came into contact with the experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. Besides his master, Xuan Yan was the first. At that time, he had accidentally entered Xuan Yan’s deep sleep, he also saw Xuan Yan who was sleeping.","Of course, there was also the Golden Dragon Turtle on Xuan Yan’s shoulder. The Golden Dragon Turtle was only the size of a palm, but Jian Wushuang knew that it was Xuan Yan’s mount. Its real size was huge, it was comparable to a huge mountain.","This time, Jian Wushuang woke up all the experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, so Xuan Yan would also be awakened.","“Hello, Mr. Xuan Yan.”","Looking at Xuan Yan in front of him, Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Are you the little guy that Xuan Yi took a fancy to?” Xuan Yan glanced at Jian Wushuang. “Xuan Yi used a lot of effort and even with the help of me and others, he sent your soul into the reincarnation passage and entered the Divine Beginning Realm. Why are you back now? And your aura...”","Xuan Yan’s pupils constricted slightly.","He was a Ruler. Although he was still at the weakest stage and could not use his strength, his sense of aura was still very sharp, he could tell at a glance that Jian Wushuang had reached the level of a Principles Master.","And he was not just an ordinary Principles Master.","“It seems that you have received some special opportunities and fortunes during your stay in the Divine Beginning Realm.” Xuan Yan’s voice was calm. “You are the one who woke me up this time, right? Tell me, why did you wake me up?”","“Mr. Xuan Yan, I woke you and everyone from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect today to tell you that I’ll soon open a passage to the Divine Beginning Realm so that you can return to the Divine Beginning Realm and recover your peak strength,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You can open a passage to the Divine Beginning Realm?” Xuan Yan’s expression changed. “Xuan Yi spent a great deal of effort to set up the sealing formation in this world. Even the experts of the three Saint Realms couldn’t open a passage that could only be seen in the two worlds. Can you do it?”","Xuan Yan was a little doubtful.","He was not the only one. The experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect were also like this.","“Don’t worry. I have a way to open the passage. But after the passage is opened, I hope you can listen to my arrangements and leave as soon as possible,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Boy, did you just say you want me to listen to your arrangements?” Xuan Yan’s eyes turned cold.","The experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect were shocked when they saw Xuan Yan’s change in expression.","They were well aware of the temperament of the Palace Master of divine punishment. Xuan Yan, the Palace Master of Divine Punishment, was the most temperamental and irascible among the three masters of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. That was why he was the Palace Master of divine punishment, he was in charge of all kinds of punishments within the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","At the same time, this palace master of Divine Punishment was extremely proud and arrogant. He was also very difficult to get along with. This could be seen from the fact that he had been complaining about Xuan Yi for many years.","And this person who was not easy to get along with, who was also arrogant, and who was a great Ruler, now actually said that Xuan Yan had to listen to his arrangements?","Just this sentence alone, in the eyes of these people from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, had probably already angered this Xuan Yan Palace Master.","As expected, this Xuan Yan Palace Master was enraged."]},{"number":3677,"title":"Chapter 3677 - Shock and Awe","paragraphs":["“Kid, you first forcefully woke me up from my deep sleep, and then I didn’t see you kneeling or bowing when I saw you. That’s fine, I didn’t want to argue with a junior like you for the sake of Xuan Yi, but now you actually want me to listen to your arrangements? What a joke.”","Xuan Yan’s eyebrows were cold.","“It seems that you are as self-righteous as your master Xuan Yi. However, Xuan Yi is dead and can’t discipline you. Today, I will discipline you on behalf of Xuan Yi.”","As soon as he finished his words, Xuan Yan’s body was immediately covered with large white flames. These white flames contained extremely terrifying temperature. The moment they rose, they immediately burned the void crazily, it caused the surrounding void to shatter.","The white flames were still spreading crazily and had already spread toward the void where Jian Wushuang was.","Upon seeing these white flames, the cultivators of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect all revealed a look of shock.","As for the so-called ‘Rulers’ in the Eternal Chaotic World, even the White Emperor’s face was pale at this moment.","The white flames were too terrifying in their eyes.","Even a little bit of it could easily burn them to ashes, not to mention the sea-like waves of flames.","However, in the face of the surging white flames, Jian Wushuang only smiled faintly.","“Destroy!”","A simple word was spat out, and in an instant, a terrifying power spread out.","This power was not only Jian Wushuang’s own power, but also contained the power of the will of heaven that he had gained after refining the Eternal Chaotic World.","Boom!","Under the impact of the power, the white flames that rushed toward him like a tide were instantly extinguished as if they had met their nemesis.","In the blink of an eye, the white flames had disappeared. The power that swept out from Jian Wushuang’s body filled the surrounding void and covered Xuan Yan’s entire body, although Xuan Yan was a Ruler Realm expert, he was in his current state. He had no room to resist the power.","He stood there and wanted to use his power. However, as soon as his power rose, it was mercilessly destroyed by the surrounding will power.","This scene made his face extremely ugly.","“Mr. Xuan Yan, you may not know this, but I was able to come back from the Divine Beginning Realm because I had completely refined this world and called it my Secret Realm. Even the will of the Heavenly Dao in this world has been controlled by me. Now, I am absolutely omnipotent in this world. Since you are in this world, you will naturally be bound by me.”","“In this world, I am the God. Even if your strength is at its peak, as long as you come here, I can still easily suppress you. I hope you can understand this,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You’ve completely refined this world and even refined it into your own Heaven and Earth Secret Realm?”","Even Xuan Yan was quite shocked when he heard this.","The experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect were also shocked.","Although this world was now called the Eternal Chaotic World, it was once the most prosperous Seven Star Divine Realm in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Jian Wushuang had actually refined the Seven Star Divine Realm into his own Secret Realm?","“It seems that I’ve underestimated you.” Xuan Yan narrowed his eyes and stared at Jian Wushuang.","“Don’t worry, Mr. Xuan Yan. As long as you follow my arrangements, I guarantee that you will be able to enter the Divine Beginning Realm smoothly and recover your strength to the peak in a short time,” Jian Wushuang said.","“What guarantee do you have?” Xuan Yan looked at him.","“It’s very simple.” Jian Wushuang smiled, then with a flip of his hand, a token appeared in his hand.","As a stream of divine power entered the token, a blurry figure slowly rose from it.","“Xuan Yan, Di Shisan, and everyone, long time no see.” A magnificent voice came from the blurry figure.","“Eh?” Xuan Yan was shocked when he saw the blurry figure clearly.","“Sect Master?”","The people of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect were shocked at first, but then they bowed in unison. “Greetings, Sect Master!”","“All of you, stand up.” The Xuan God waved his hand, and everyone from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect stood up.","“Xuan Yan, looking at your unconvinced face, could it be that you just fought with Heavenly Sword Marquis?” The Xuan God looked at Xuan Yan with interest.","Xuan Yan’s face darkened, and he did not answer.","Since he did not answer, he naturally tacitly agreed.","“Haha, you really fought with Heavenly Sword Marquis.” The Xuan God immediately laughed out loud, “Xuan Yan, I’m not the one who said that after so many years, your arrogant personality has not changed. You don’t know anything about the strength of young friend Heavenly Marquis, yet you dare to fight with him?”","“What do you mean?” Xuan Yan looked over.","“To tell you the truth, don’t look at young friend Heavenly Sword Marquis now as a Principles Masters, but he is the same as Xuan Yi back then. He is at the level of a perfect being. Although he is only a Principles Masters, his combat strength is not weaker than an ordinary Ruler. In addition, young friend Heavenly Sword Marquis has had some great fortuitous encounters over the years. His strength is already comparable to a high-level Ruler.”","“In the entire Divine Beginning Realm, other than Zhan Tian, who has the hope of fighting him to a draw, none of us Rulers are his match. And your strength is slightly weaker than mine. All these years, you’ve been sleeping in the Seven Star Divine Realm. I’m afraid that you have no chance to improve, not to mention that you’re still in a weakened state!”","“How dare you provoke my young friend, the Heavenly Sword Marquis? You are lucky that you are one of us. If it were anyone else, you would have died.” Xuan Yan smiled brightly.","Xuan Yan was stunned after hearing Xuan God’s words.","The people of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","Jian Wushuang had the battle strength of an advanced Ruler?","“Xuan Yan, is what you said true?” Xuan Yan was still in disbelief.","“Of course, why would I lie to you?” Xuan Yan sneered.","“That was before. Now that the Heavenly Sword Marquis has refined the Seven Star Divine Realm into his own Heaven and Earth Secret Realm and attracted the universal principles, he must have gained more benefits. His strength has already reached a higher level. Even I don’t know what level he has reached. But I’m sure that he is invincible in the Divine Beginning Realm. In the Seven Star Divine Realm, he is equivalent to the Heavenly Dao.”","“You actually dare to take the initiative to provoke him in this Seven Star Divine Realm. I don’t even know where you get your courage from.”"]},{"number":3678,"title":"Chapter 3678 - Ten Years","paragraphs":["Daoist Xuan God spoke casually as if he was joking.","However, when Xuan Yan heard these words, it undoubtedly stirred up a huge storm in his heart.","“Absolute invincibility in the Divine Beginning Realm?”","Xuan Yan knew the weight of these words.","“He also has a perfect life level and is comparable to a Ruler at the level of a Principles Master. It seems that Xuan Yi’s plan really succeeded?”","Xuan Yan was full of disbelief.","He knew how crazy and Unbelievable Xuan Yi’s plan was.","He did not think that the plan would succeed at all, nor did he think that the Seven Star Mysterious Sect had a chance to turn things around. But now...looking at Jian Wushuang in front of him, he had to admit...Xuan Yi’s plan had indeed succeeded.","Xuan Yi had nurtured Jian Wushuang, a successor who could replace him and even surpass him.","The Divine Beginning Realm and the Seven Star Mysterious Sect now had a chance to fight again because of Jian Wushuang’s existence.","Taking a deep breath, Xuan Yan raised his head again and looked at Jian Wushuang. “Jian Wushuang, I apologize for what happened just now. I admit that you have the right to be my equal. Now that this world has been refined by you, I will listen to your arrangements in this world.”","“Thank you, Mr. Xuan Yan.” Jian Wushuang smiled slightly.","He did not have a good impression of Xuan Yan, but he did not dislike him. After all, although Xuan Yan was a bit overbearing and unreasonable, he was a master level expert left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. In the world-destroying battle, he had contributed a lot to the world-ending battle.","In addition, when he was adventuring in the Eternal Chaotic World, he had benefited from the Golden Dragon Turtle on Xuan Yan’s shoulder.","In view of this, Jian Wushuang was willing to have a normal relationship with Xuan Yan.","“Since Mr. Xuan Yan has agreed, I’ll start making arrangements.” Jian Wushuang glanced at the experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect in front of him.","After seeing the Xuan God and knowing Jian Wushuang’s monstrous strength, these experts were all convinced.","“This world is, after all, an evolution of the Seven Star Divine Realm. It means a lot to everyone here. Although you have been sleeping for years, I’m afraid you still miss this world. So, I’ll give you ten years.”","“In these ten years, you can move around freely in this world. As long as you don’t kill recklessly, I won’t care. In ten years, I’ll directly open the passage to the Divine Beginning Realm. At that time, all the experts left by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect will have to leave!” Jian Wushuang said, it sounded a bit like an order.","There was nothing he could do. Although he knew that the Seven Star Divine Realm was actually the place of the experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, he had refined this world into his Heaven and Earth Secret Realm, which still had a complete cycle of Heavenly Dao, it was just a small cycle.","Under such circumstances, the current Eternal Chaotic World could no longer accommodate these Seven Star Mysterious Sect experts.","If these Seven Star Mysterious Sect experts continued to stay here, first of all, they would not be able to recover their own strength and could only fall into a deep sleep.","At the same time, because of their existence, they would have a great impact on this world’s Heavenly Dao cycle.","Putting everything else aside, just in terms of the heaven and Earth Spiritual Qi, over the long years, most of the heaven and Earth Spiritual Qi in the Eternal Chaotic World had actually been absorbed by these ancient experts, even if they were sleeping, they had to ensure that they absorbed enough Heaven and Earth Spiritual Qi before they could continue sleeping.","Hence, the cultivation environment in this world was getting worse and worse. Now, with great difficulty, because of the array formation left behind by Xuan Yi, there was slowly room for improvement.","However, the experts left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect definitely could not stay here.","“In ten years, we will all leave, but where is the space passage?” Xuan Yan asked.","“It’s in my Wushuang Saint Realm. Please come here in advance,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.”","Xuan Yan nodded and waved his hand, crushing the void and leaving.","As for the experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, most of them bowed slightly to Jian Wushuang and left.","After the experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect left, Jian Wushuang looked at the ‘Rulers’ in the Eternal Chaotic World.","“In ten years, the passage to the Divine Beginning Realm will be opened in Wushuang Saint Realm. If any of you want to go to the Divine Beginning Realm, be prepared to go together,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.”","The ‘Rulers’ nodded respectfully and quickly went to prepare.","Although ten years was short, it was enough for the ‘Rulers’ to go back and make arrangements.","...","The Green Fire World, Tang of the East.","Tang of the East had been established in the Green Fire World for countless years. When Jian Wushuang was in the beginning, Tang of the East was already recognized as the first country in the Green Fire World. Even now, tens of millions of years had passed, the Tang of the East was still the strongest country, and no one dared to provoke it.","After all, behind the Tang of the East stood the Wushuang Saint Realm!","“Third brother, this is the Imperial City of the Tang of the East. It has been tens of millions of years. The Imperial City of the Tang of the East is much larger than before, but its geographical location is still here.”","Wang Yuan and Su Rou personally led Jian Wushuang to a void in the Imperial City of Tang of the east.","“The 13 blood demon gods directly entered the Imperial City and fought with second brother and the others in the Imperial City. In the end, second brother, Ruler Xiao, and Ruler Tang all died in that battle.” Wang Yuan looked a little lonely, but soon, there was a flash of brilliance.","“Third brother, is what you just told us true? Do you really have a way to resurrect second brother and the others?”","Wang Yuan and Su Rou looked at Jian Wushuang with a trace of disbelief.","After Jian Wushuang asked the Seven Star Mysterious Sect and the Rulers of the Eternal Chaotic World to prepare to leave this world, Jian Wushuang found Wang Yuan and Su Rou and told them that he had a way...he could bring the dead second brother, Yang Zaixuan, back to life.","Wang Yuan and Su Rou were naturally overjoyed, and the three of them immediately came to this place.","However, although Jian Wushuang said this, to bring a dead person back to life, and it was someone who had been dead for tens of millions of years, in Wang Yuan and Su Rou’s eyes...it was indeed a little too incredible.","“It’s not impossible to resurrect the dead. Tens of millions of years ago, at the ends of the Earth, I actually died once. However, my master Xuan Yi immediately used space-time reversal to save my soul. Then, he sent me to the Divine Beginning Realm. That’s how I am now.”"]},{"number":3679,"title":"Chapter 3679 - Space-Time Reversal","paragraphs":["“Space-time reversal?”","Wang Yuan blinked and asked, “Third brother, do you know this move too?”","“Well...” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly. “Space-time reversal requires a high level of understanding and application of the principles of space-time. Even in the entire divine origin world, only the Temporal Temple Master can perform it. As for me, although I have completely comprehended the rules of space-time, I’m still a little lacking in the application of the rules of space-time.”","“Slightly weaker?”Wang Yuan and Su Rou’s expressions changed.","“Don’t worry, listen to Me First.”Jian Wushuang smiled, “If we were in the Divine Beginning Realm, even with the help of a time-space treasure, it would be difficult for me to reverse time and space. Naturally, I wouldn’t be able to revive second brother and the others. However, this is not the Divine Beginning Realm, but the Eternal Chaotic World!”","“In this world, the Heavenly Dao operating principles are far less powerful than those in the Divine Beginning Realm, and the restrictions are naturally not as high. Furthermore, I have already completely refined this world, and even the Heavenly Dao is within my control. In this place, with the support of the will of the entire Heavenly Dao, even if I am still lacking in the use of the laws of space-time, I should be able to reverse space-time.”","“If that’s the case, what are you waiting for? Hurry up and use it,”Wang Yuan said impatiently.","Jian Wushuang did not delay. He directly activated the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Eternal Chaotic World, followed by a buzz","A majestic power of space-time principles surged out of Jian Wushuang’s body. This power of space-time principles was obviously much stronger than before under the support of the will of the Heavenly Dao. Under the guidance of Jian Wushuang’s will, this power of space-time principles completely covered the void in front of him.","“Space-time...reverse!”","Jian Wushuang pointed his right hand in the distance.","Immediately, the space-time in front of him began to change rapidly.","The space-time that was originally flowing normally began to reverse under Jian Wushuang’s guidance!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","As the space-time reversed, a large number of images of the void appeared in front of Jian Wushuang one by one, and they flowed wildly at a terrifying speed.","The speed of the space-time reversal also became faster and faster.","A moment later, the space-time in the void had returned to thousands of years ago, and it was finally fixed on a picture.","That picture was the scene where the 13 blood demon gods, who were controlled by Dao Yuanzi, rushed into the Imperial City and started a massacre. They also fought with Yang Zaixuan, Ruler Xiao, and the Tang Ruler.","In that battle, Yang Zaixuan, Ruler Xiao, and the Tang Ruler were killed by the 13 blood demon gods without any resistance.","Jian Wushuang did not personally experience that battle, but now he saw the complete scene in the long river of time.","Wang Yuan and Su Rou also saw it.","“Second brother, it’s second brother,” Wang Yuan immediately cried out in surprise, “And Ruler Xiao and the others are all there.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was extremely solemn.","He had thought that with his current use of the power of time and space and the support of the Heavenly Dao will of this world, it should be relatively easy for him to reverse time and space. However, in fact, it was not easy at all. On the contrary, it was extremely difficult, in particular, controlling the flow of time consumed too much of his divine power.","It was no wonder that even the Temporal Temple Master would not easily reverse time and space. The price was simply too high.","In particular, to resurrect some dead people from the past, the price was even more arrogant. Even one of the Temporal Temple Master’s favorite personal disciples had only been able to reverse time and space once...after his disciple died again, he did not use it a second time.","Because once Tang Ruler reversed time and space and resurrected the past, the backlash in the river of time would definitely cause him unprecedented damage.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang had a perfect life, so his endurance was much stronger than Tang Ruler’s, so he could bear the price.","“Freeze!”","“Freeze!”","“Freeze!”","Jian Wushuang exhaled three words in one breath. In the picture in front of him, three figures slowly walked out of the picture under his influence.","Buzz, buzz, buzz!","The river of time disappeared, and the space-time in front of him returned to normal again.","The difference was that there were three more figures in the void besides Jian Wushuang, Wang Yuan, and Su Rou.","The three figures were Yang Zaixuan, Ruler Xiao, and Tang Ruler.","Yang Zaixuan was Jian Wushuang’s life-and-death brother, Ruler Xiao was a great benefactor to Jian Wushuang, and he was Leng Rushuang’s father. As for Tang Ruler, he was also very close to Jian Wushuang, so Jian Wushuang...resurrected all three of them in one breath.","However, after resurrecting, Jian Wushuang found that he had used up more than 80% of his divine power to resist the backlash of the river of time.","He had used up 80% of his divine power in one breath.","This was because he had a perfect life, abundant divine power, and a stronger endurance.","If an ordinary Ruler forcefully resurrected these three people from the river of time, they would probably be killed by the backlash of the river of time.","“Where...where am I?”","“Aren’t we already dead? Why do we seem to be alive now?”","“Is this still the Tang of the east or the Green Fire World?”","The resurrected Yang Zaixuan, Ruler Xiao, and the Tang Ruler were at a loss.","Although Jian Wushuang had forcefully resurrected them from the river of time, their memories were still intact. They knew that they had died and had been killed by the 13-blood demon god, therefore, they could not accept the fact that their consciousness had returned to this place.","They were still in a state of shock, but Wang Yuan and Su Rou had already lost control of themselves.","“Haha, second brother!”","“Second brother!”","Wang Yuan and Su Rou had already rushed up. Even Jian Wushuang appeared beside Yang Zaixuan in a flash.","“Second brother, long time no see.” Jian Wushuang directly grabbed Yang Zaixuan’s shoulder.","“Third brother, Wang Yuan, and fourth brother? It’s you guys...” Yang Zaixuan was still in a daze.","Jian Wushuang did not explain too much to Yang Zaixuan. Instead, he walked toward Ruler Xiao and the Tang Ruler.","“Uncle Xiao, Senior Tang Ruler, welcome back,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Jian Wushuang...”","“What the hell is going on?”","Ruler Xiao and the Tang Ruler immediately recognized Jian Wushuang when they saw him, but their expressions were still very strange.","Half a day later, Yang Zaixuan, Ruler Xiao, and Tang Ruler finally understood what had happened. At the same time, they also knew that they were indeed dead, and they had been dead for tens of millions of years. But now...Jian Wushuang had forcibly resurrected them with great magic power."]},{"number":3680,"title":"Chapter 3680 - Brothers Gather","paragraphs":["In the manor of the Wushuang Saint Realm.","Jian Wushuang, Wang Yuan, Yang Zaixuan, and Su Rou were sitting together, drinking and chatting.","“Haha, that’s great. It’s been a long time since we’ve sat together and drank like this.” Wang Yuan kept drinking and laughing.","It had been a long time since he had been so happy.","Ever since Yang Zaixuan died and Jian Wushuang left the Eternal Chaotic World, Wang Yuan could not be happy even if he wanted to.","“It’s all thanks to third brother for reviving me. Third brother, here’s a toast to you.” Yang Zaixuan raised his glass and looked at Jian Wushuang with gratitude.","“There’s no need for us to treat each other as strangers. Just drink.” Jian Wushuang was completely relaxed and drank with his brothers.","The four of them drank happily.","“By the way, third brother, I just heard from you that in ten years, you will open a passage to the Divine Beginning Realm in the Eternal Chaotic World?","“Many top experts in our world, including Wang Yuan and fourth brother, will go to the Divine Beginning Realm?” Yang Zaixuan suddenly asked.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Why? Do you want to go with us?”","Yang Zaixuan frowned slightly, then he shook his head slowly. “Forget about me. I’ve been dead for more than ten million years, and my current strength is still at a very low level. My strength is pitifully weak in the current Green Fire World or the Eternal Chaotic World. If I go to the larger Divine Beginning Realm, I’m afraid I won’t even have room to live. At the very least, I have to break through to the Chaos Realm, which is the Divine Emperor Realm. I’ll go to the Divine Beginning Realm again.”","When Yang Zaixuan died, he had just broken through to become stronger.","Now, tens of millions of years had passed. Although Jian Wushuang had resurrected him from the river of time, he could not change Yang Zaixuan’s strength.","He was still an ordinary Divine Master.","In the Eternal Chaotic World, Divine Masters were everywhere. Even true gods were nothing.","In other words, he still had a long way to go in the Eternal Chaotic World. If he went to the Divine Beginning Realm now, he could, but in the beginning, he had to rely on Jian Wushuang’s protection and care. Otherwise, the risk would be too great.","However, Yang Zaixuan was not the kind of person who would rely on the protection of others, even if he was his brother.","Another thing was that Yang Zaixuan had stayed in the Green Fire World when he was alive. He had not lived for a long time, so he could continue to wander in the Eternal Chaotic World.","Unlike Wang Yuan and Su Rou, they had lived in the Eternal Chaotic World for tens of millions of years and had always been in high positions. They had long been bored here, so they definitely wanted to go to the Divine Beginning Realm.","“In that case, the three of us will wait for you in the Divine Beginning Realm. I believe that with your talent, you will soon reach the Divine Emperor Realm,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang knew Yang Zaixuan’s talent.","In the entire Eternal Chaotic World, he was definitely a top genius. Moreover, he had once obtained an extraordinary opportunity on the ancient battlefield and had a special physique. Under such circumstances...he would definitely make rapid progress when he cultivated in the Green Fire World.","It would not take long for him to become a Divine Emperor.","“Come on, let’s continue drinking.”","The four of them continued to chat.","The four of them drank for three days and three nights before they ended.","After that, Jian Wushuang went to see Emperor Xiao again.","“Uncle Xiao, Shuang ‘er is inside the star-moon agarwood.” Jian Wushuang took out the star-moon agarwood.","Although Emperor Xiao’s strength was only at the Divine Master Realm, he could not sense anything if he did not touch the star-moon agarwood. However, when he touched the star-moon agarwood with his hands...he immediately sensed the sleeping soul inside the star-moon agarwood.","“It’s Shuang ‘er, it’s her!” Emperor Xiao’s body trembled as he asked, “Wushuang, how did Shuang ‘er become like this?”","“I failed to protect her, but don’t worry, Uncle Xiao. It won’t be long before I take back her divine body and wake her up completely,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Well, I believe you.” Emperor Xiao nodded.","He had absolute trust in Jian Wushuang.","After all, he had watched Jian Wushuang grow step by step, so he knew Jian Wushuang’s character and ability very well.","“In ten years, the passage to the Divine Beginning Realm will be opened. Uncle Xiao, do you want to go to the Divine Beginning Realm with me?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“What about Yang Zaixuan? How did he decide?” Emperor Xiao asked.","As Yang Zaixuan’s master, Emperor Xiao wanted to know his disciple’s decision.","“Second brother will continue to stay in the Eternal Chaotic World. He will go to the Divine Beginning Realm when he reaches the Divine Emperor Realm,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Well, I knew he would choose this.” Emperor Xiao smiled. “This kid is just like that. As long as it’s something he can do through hard work, he will never ask for help from others. He doesn’t want to go to the Divine Beginning Realm now because he doesn’t want to rely on your strength. He wants to test his strength and slowly grow up, just like you did in the past.”","“I know.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Since Yang Zaixuan chose to stay, I’ll stay too. After some time, when my strength grows up with him, we can barely protect ourselves in the Divine Beginning Realm. Then we’ll leave,” Emperor Xiao said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang did not force him.","Time passed quickly.","Countless experts in the Eternal Chaotic World were quietly preparing because of Jian Wushuang’s previous announcement. Once ten years had passed and Jian Wushuang opened the passage to the Divine Beginning Realm, they would leave the Eternal Chaotic World, they would travel to the even more vast Divine Beginning Realm.","In the eighth year...something happened in the Green Fire World.","Although it was not a big event, it still caused some waves.","It originated from Purple Emperor of the Blue Sea Cloud Pavilion. More than 10 years ago, he destroyed a big family, the Ye family, for some benefits. The entire Ye family was uprooted by purple emperor, it was said that all the cultivators in the Ye family were exterminated. Only a ten-year-old boy, Ye Chen, was lucky enough to escape.","It was said that Ye Chen was a trash who was born unable to cultivate. But in the end, it was this trash who obtained a great opportunity from God knows where. Not only did he recover his physique...he also used only a dozen years to break through to the Divine Master Realm. More importantly, he had a set of unparalleled sword techniques.","In that year, Ye Chen, who was at the Divine Master Realm, single-handedly charged into the Green Sea Cloud Pavilion. With just one strike, he had penetrated through the sect-protecting array of the Green Sea Cloud Pavilion. Then, he began a massacre in the Green Sea Cloud Pavilion."]},{"number":3681,"title":"Chapter 3681 - In-Name Disciple","paragraphs":["The Green Sea Cloud Pavilion was considered a first-rate faction in the Green Fire World. During this period, there were a total of 18 Divine Masters and three Divine Emperors. It was even rumored that there was a great emperor behind the Green Sea Cloud Pavilion. After Ye Chen charged into the Green Sea Cloud Pavilion...the three Divine Emperors of the Green Sea Cloud Pavilion, many Divine Masters, including the Purple Heaven Divine Emperor, joined forces to kill Ye Chen.","However, they never expected that Ye Chen alone would be able to wipe out all the cultivators above the Divine Master Realm in the Green Sea Cloud Pavilion.","Eighteen Divine Masters and three Divine Emperors were all killed by him.","Furthermore, regardless of whether it was a divine lord or a Divine Emperor, they were unable to receive Ye Chen’s strike head-on.","In other words, Ye Chen was able to kill a Divine Emperor with a single strike!","One had to know that Ye Chen was only at the Divine Master Realm.","He could kill a Divine Emperor with a single strike in the Divine Emperor Realm. One could imagine how amazing Ye Chen’s swordsmanship was.","Therefore, this matter caused quite a stir in the Green Fire World.","Of course, this matter also reached Jian Wushuang’s ears.","...","A quiet bamboo forest was where Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng usually lived.","“Father, mother!”","Jian Wushuang came to Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng.","“Shuang ‘er, you’re here.” Jian Nantian glanced at Jian Wushuang and said, “Look at that little guy. has his swordsmanship met your requirements?”","Jian Wushuang immediately looked at the lake in front of him. There was a black-robed young man sitting cross-legged on the lake. His body was obviously condensed with extraordinary sword essence, but the lake water around him did not have any ripples, it was as if the black-robed young man, including his sword essence, was just a feather that landed on the lake.","“His control of sword essence has reached the point of returning to its original state. Not bad.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. “It seems that this little guy has not wasted the past eight years.”","Jian Nantian also smiled. “Since you left that sword in his mind eight years ago, he has been focusing all his energy on the study of swordsmanship. In the first three years, he made no progress at all. He did not even manage to find any mysteries in the swordsmanship. It was not until the fourth year that he saw some things in the swordsmanship. Since then, his swordsmanship has begun to improve.”","“Did he really develop it all by himself? Father, didn’t you give him some pointers?” Jian Wushuang looked at Jian Nantian with interest.","“My understanding of sword principle is limited by the heaven and earth, so it’s not very strong. I also don’t understand your sword, so how can I give him some pointers? I only gave him some suggestions based on my own experience. It’s up to him to comprehend the profound mysteries,” Jian Nantian said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. “I can see that he has made great progress in sword principle in the past eight years. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to kill the Divine Emperor head-on, one by one, in the Divine Emperor Realm.”","“Has he met your requirements?” Jian Nantian asked.","“He is far from meeting my requirements. However, he has made great progress in sword principle in the past eight years. His talent in sword principle is indeed impressive. With his special physique, he is qualified to be my in-name disciple,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Only in-name disciple?” Jian Nantian frowned.","“Father, don’t fight for this little guy. Although he is only an in-name disciple, I will still teach him some things and give him some appropriate tests. When he has truly completed my test, I will truly accept him as my personal disciple. After all, my requirements for accepting disciples are very strict,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","He had been a person for two lifetimes and had taken in disciples before.","For example, he had taken in Lin Lan in the Green Fire World.","However, Lin Lan was his early disciple after all. Moreover, she was born in the ancient world, so her potential was not great. This Eternal Chaotic World was already the end for her. If she wanted to obtain some achievements in the Divine Beginning Realm...it was almost impossible.","However, he had taken quite good care of this disciple. Even now, he had personally taught Lin Lan some things.","However, because he had met Lin Lan this time and clearly realized the completely different level between him and Lin Lan, he felt that he had to be very careful when taking in disciples, it was not necessary to say that his disciple must be able to keep up with his pace, or at least not be too different from him.","The gap between Lin Lan and him was too big.","Now, Ye Chen had the innate terminated meridians first, and his talent in sword principle was really great. That was why Jian Wushuang had considered taking him as an in-name disciple.","“It’s not bad to be able to become an in-name disciple. I’ll tell him the news now,” Jian Nantian said.","“Don’t worry.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand. “Let him continue in his current state and study for two more years. After two years, when the ten-year deadline is up, you can tell him about this. In addition, bring him to the Wushuang Saint Realm in ten years. I plan to bring him to the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“Is he going to the Divine Beginning Realm too?” Jian Nantian’s expression changed.","“With his current strength, he is still far from being able to establish himself in the Divine Beginning Realm. However, everything has to be done step by step. It was the same when I first arrived in the Divine Beginning Realm. At that time, I will arrange a place for him to rely on his own ability to improve himself step by step. I won’t interfere too much with him. As for how far he can grow in the future, it’s up to him,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.”","Jian Nantian and Ji Wumeng nodded slightly.","They did have some feelings for Ye Chen, which was why they cared so much about him.","However, it was up to Jian Wushuang to decide how to settle Ye Chen.","Jian Wushuang left quickly.","In the blink of an eye, another two years passed.","The ten-year deadline had finally arrived.","The Wushuang Saint Realm had long become the focus of the entire Eternal Chaotic World.","There were a large number of experts in the Eternal Chaotic World, mainly the ‘Emperors’ who stood at the top. There were about 200 to 300 people gathered in the void on the left. As for the void on the right...there were also quite a number of experts left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","They were all gathered here, waiting for Jian Wushuang to appear.","“He’s coming!”","No one knew who was the first to speak, but everyone looked toward the void in front of them and saw dozens of figures flying toward them. The leader was Jian Wushuang, there were Jian Nantian, Ji Wumeng, Wang Yuan, Su Rou, Ye Chen, who had become Jian Wushuang’s in-name disciple, and many others who wanted to go to the Divine Beginning Realm with them."]},{"number":3682,"title":"Chapter 3682 - Death Penalty","paragraphs":["“Is everyone here?”","Jian Wushuang stood in the center of the crowd and glanced at the people around him.","“Everyone who has woken up from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect camp is already here,” Xuan Yan said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He controlled the Heavenly Dao of the Eternal Chaotic World and knew everything about it like the back of his hand.","Indeed, all the experts from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect camp had woken up. The remaining ones were either seriously injured or had been asleep for too long due to the lack of spiritual power, as a result, they could never wake up.","“Besides the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, the people from the other camp seem to have also received the news.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and looked at the void.","There were also many figures in the void. These people were obviously not indigenous experts of the Eternal Chaotic World, but they did not stand together with the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, instead, they could keep a distance from the people of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","They were even full of vigilance and vigilance against the experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","The people of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect looked at these people with hostility.","Jian Wushuang immediately understood that these people were from the three Saint Realm camps who had stayed in the Eternal Chaotic World after the battle.","During the battle, the Seven Star Divine Realm was completely sealed. Many people from the three Saint Realm camps did not have time to escape from the Seven Star Divine Realm and were left behind. When Jian Wushuang was wandering in the Eternal Chaotic World, he had met and even fought with these people.","Later, because the three masters of the Saint Realm opened the temporary passage, some people left proudly. However, there were still many people who stayed here and did not wake up until now, tens of millions of years later, they slowly woke up because of the recovery of the Spiritual Qi in the Eternal Chaotic World.","Ten years ago, the news that Jian Wushuang was about to open the passage to the Divine Beginning Realm caused an unprecedented sensation in the highest level of the Eternal Chaotic World. These people had also received the news, and now they had rushed here, naturally, they also wanted to return to the Divine Beginning Realm through the passage.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang’s figure flashed, and he directly came in front of the group of people.","“Did you belong to the three Saint Realm camps during the battle?” Jian Wushuang stared at the group of people with a cold expression.","Their expressions changed. The brown-haired elder in the lead smiled awkwardly and said, “Yes, we belong to the three Saint Realm camps, but most of us joined them out of helplessness.”","“I know a little about your helplessness, so I won’t pursue the matter with you. Since you’re here now to leave this world and return to the Divine Beginning Realm, I’ll help you,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Thank you, thank you, sir.”","The leading brown-haired elder was so grateful.","The dozens of cultivators behind the brown-haired elder were also pleasantly surprised.","“Although I promised to let you go, there is only one passage, and there are too many of you. I can’t send you off at once. How about this? You will be divided into three teams according to your origin and enter the passage according to my instructions later,” Jian Wushuang said.","“It’s all up to you, sir.” Although the brown-haired old man was a genuine Principles Master, he could see the insurmountable gap between him and Jian Wushuang at a glance. Therefore, when he faced Jian Wushuang, he was in awe.","“In that battle, in addition to the three Saint Realms, the four Divine Clans and the Octagonal Heaven Sect joined the three Saint Realms. Now, according to what I said, everyone from the Octagonal Heaven Sect will stand on this side.” Jian Wushuang pointed to the void on the left.","Immediately, nearly half of the dozens of figures walked to the void that Jian Wushuang pointed to.","“Oh, there are quite a lot of people from the Eight Directions Celestial Sect.” Jian Wushuang smiled, but he was not surprised.","Although the three Saint Realms were the main force in the world-destroying battle, the three Saint Realms relied heavily on top experts. As for the weaker cultivators who acted as cannon fodder, most of them came from the four Divine Clans and the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, among them, the Eight Directions Celestial Sect had the largest number of participants.","“Everyone from the four divine races, stand here.” Jian Wushuang pointed to the void on the right.","Immediately, more than a dozen figures walked to the void on the right.","There were still more than a dozen cultivators who remained there.","These people were neither from the Eight Directions Celestial Sect nor the four divine races, so their origins...","“The rest of you are from the three Saint Realms?” Jian Wushuang looked down at the dozen figures.","“Yes, sir. Among us, six are from the Life and Death Saint Realm, four are from the Destruction Saint Realm, and three are from the Flame Saint Realm,” one of the Peak Saints said.","“Oh, really?” Jian Wushuang smiled, but his smile was as cold as a blade. “Since you all come from the three Saint Realms, I hereby announce, as the actual controller of this world, that all 13 of you...will be sentenced to death!”","“What?”","The 13 cultivators from the three Saint Realms were all shocked.","However, Jian Wushuang did not pay any attention to their expressions. He had already announced the death penalty the moment he announced it.","Jian Wushuang did not need to use many methods to completely refine this world. He had complete control over the will of this world’s Heavenly Dao, so he could freely unleash his strongest battle strength in this world. With a wave of his sleeve, a wisp of divine power swept out.","The wisp of divine power swept across the 13 people like a breeze. In an instant, their divine bodies were blown into pieces like paper.","There was no room for them to struggle. Before they could even let out a scream, they were all killed by Jian Wushuang!","This scene caused the expressions of the surrounding people to change drastically.","The people from the Eight Directions Celestial Sect and the four Divine Clans standing on the left and right sides of the void were especially shocked.","After all, they were the lackeys of the three Saint Realms in the previous battle. Now that Jian Wushuang had killed the people of the three Saint Realms, would they still be alive?","“Sir!”","“We really had no choice in that battle. Sir, please be magnanimous and spare our lives!”","The brown-haired elder, who had reached the level of a Principles Master, knelt down to Jian Wushuang on the spot.","As a Principles Master, he no longer cared about his dignity in order to save his life.","Since the Principles Masters were like this, the others immediately began to beg for mercy."]},{"number":3683,"title":"Chapter 3683 - Everything Is Ready!","paragraphs":["“Get up.”","Jian Wushuang put his hands behind his back and looked coldly at these people who were begging for mercy. “I only want to kill the three Saint Realms. As for the four Divine Clans and the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, I won’t pursue it. After I open the passage, you can leave.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang ignored them and left.","Seeing Jian Wushuang leave, they let out a long sigh.","“Mr. Xuan Yan, and everyone from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.”","Jian Wushuang came to the Seven Star Mysterious Sect and said, “Before opening the passage to the Divine Beginning Realm, I have to tell you something.”","“What is it?” Xuan Yan looked at him.","“The Fourth Heaven, where the Seven Star Divine Realm used to be, has become completely desolate because of the operation of the World Array. It’s completely isolated from the other territories of the Divine Beginning Realm. Therefore, even if you return to the Divine Beginning Realm now, it’s impossible for you to return to the Fourth Heaven,” Jian Wushuang said.","“The Fourth Heaven has been completely destroyed?”","Hearing this news, the people of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect found it hard to accept.","“But don’t worry. Although you can’t go to the Fourth Heaven, I will arrange a new place for you so that the Seven Star Mysterious Sect can make a comeback,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Where to?” Xuan Yan asked.","“The Third Heaven, the nest of the three Saint Realms!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold.","“What?” Everyone from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was stunned.","The taciturn Di Shisan frowned, he said, “Jian Wushuang, although the Seven Star Mysterious Sect has a blood feud with the three Saint Realms, all the experts under the Seven Star Mysterious Sect want to uproot the three Saint Realms and turn the three Saint Realm Masters into ashes","“However, there are only these people left in our Seven Star Mysterious Sect. Each of them has been asleep for too long, so they are still at their weakest. If we go to confront the three Saint Realms now, it would be like hitting a rock with an egg.”","The experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect agreed with Di Shisan’s words.","Now, the remaining top experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect were all here, and they were all at their weakest stage. Even if they went to the Divine Beginning Realm, they would not be able to fully recover in a short time. Even if they were able to fully recover...facing the three Saint Realms, they would have no choice but to flee in embarrassment.","Naturally, they could not face the three Saint Realms head-on now.","“Everyone, the reason why I said that I would place you in the Third Heaven, in the nest of the three Saint Realms, is because soon...today, the day you return to the Divine Beginning Realm, the three Saint Realms will no longer exist,” Jian Wushuang said.","When he said this, everyone from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, including the cultivators from the four Divine Clans and the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, turned pale with fright.","“Jian Wushuang, do you mean that you really intend to completely destroy the three Saint Realms?” Xuan Yan looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","“Can’t I?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Xuan Yan.","“Yes, but the three Saint Realms are not weak. Even at the peak of our Seven Star Mysterious Sect, the three Saint Realms can fight us head-on. Now that our Seven Star Mysterious Sect has been destroyed for so many years, the three Saint Realms must be the strongest in the Divine Beginning Realm. Their accumulated strength must be even stronger!”","“Besides, the three masters of the Saint Realm are supported by the will of the Heavenly Dao. Any one of them can be said to be invincible in the Divine Beginning Realm. Even the Rulers can’t do anything to them. With such strength, how can we destroy them?” Xuan Yan asked.","“How to destroy the three Saint Realms...don’t worry, I’ll let you see it with your own eyes.” Jian Wushuang just smiled faintly and did not explain much.","“Everyone, please wait here for a moment. Let me go to the Divine Beginning Realm to make arrangements.”","With that, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and disappeared into the world.","In the Fourth Heaven, the huge magic formation was still there and was still slowly operating.","Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master had also been waiting there. Although Jian Wushuang had stayed in the Eternal Chaotic World for a full ten years, the flow of time in the Eternal Chaotic World was completely different from that in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Ten years had passed in the Eternal Chaotic World, but only a month had passed in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang rushed out of the formation and appeared in front of Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master.","“My young friend, you’ve come out so quickly. Have you seen your relatives?” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","“I’ve seen them all.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile. “Temporal, Heaven-cleaving, have you prepared what I asked you to prepare?”","“Don’t worry. After receiving your message, I, Zhantian, and Desolate Emperor immediately gave the order to prepare. So far, the Heavenly-cleaving Alliance, the Temporal Temple, and the divine ancestor Daoist sect have all been prepared. As soon as you give the order, all the Principles Masters of the three freedom alliances will lead countless saints to attack the Third Heaven!”","“In addition, there are six sects in the Eight Directions Celestial Sect who are willing to stand on the side of the three freedom alliances. They have also formed an army of 100,000 saints led by dozens of Principles Masters. They will act as soon as we make a move!”","“And your good friend, Demon Master Chenhuo, has more than 10 powerful forces under his command, including the Purple Blood Sect, the Supreme Emotion Valley, and the Icefire Devil Palace. They are ready to form an allied army and attack together!”","The eyes of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master were burning with passion.","“What about the four divine races? Xiao’er hasn’t taken control of the other three divine races?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I’ve asked them myself. The nine clan leaders now have the battle strength of an expert in the pinnacle of the six realm. Together with the strength of their subordinates, their overall strength has completely surpassed that of the two three divine races. Since I received your message, I immediately asked the Heaven-cleaving Alliance to secretly send some experts to help them.”","“Just now, we had finished the final battle with the three divine races. Now that the battle has ended, the Nine-tailed Clan leader should have completely taken control of the other three divine races and even the entire Demon Realm,” the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“That’s great.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, he said in a deep voice, “The three Saint Realms have existed for too long and are deeply rooted. It’s not easy to destroy them all at once. That’s why we must gather all our strength and not give the three Saint Realms any chance!”","“Yes!”","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master also nodded heavily.","Then, Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and the huge sealing formation in front of them shrank at a speed visible to the naked eye. Finally, it completely merged with Jian Wushuang’s body, a fierce light flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","“Let’s...go!”"]},{"number":3684,"title":"Chapter 3684 - The Gathering of the Strong","paragraphs":["Demon Realm.","Corpses littered the ground on the huge battlefield.","The decisive battle between the Nine-tailed Clan and the other three Divine Clans had already reached the final stage.","“The tide has already passed. Three clan leaders, do you still want to continue fighting to the death?”","Xiao’er’s expression was ice-cold as she stood there arrogantly. Her clear and cold eyes swept over the three clan leaders in front of her.","Beside Xiao’er, the sand sea devil master stood there respectfully. He was clearly a supreme expert who had reached the peak of the sixth level, but beside Xiao’er, he was like a slave.","And on the surrounding battlefield, the situation was completely one-sided.","The three great Divine Clan’s camp had already shown signs of being defeated. Even if they continued to fight, they would only be fighting like cornered beasts. They would still be unable to change the outcome.","This scene made the three clan leaders’ faces extremely ugly.","“Three clan leaders, I’ll give you a chance. Surrender or die!” Xiao’er shouted sternly.","The three clan leaders looked at each other in dismay.","Although they were unwilling to accept it, they had no choice in the face of the absolute difference in strength.","“Surrender,” the current clan leader of the Blood Clan said first.","The Blood Clan had suffered a great loss when Jian Wushuang led Demon Master Chenhuo and eccentric Ming Huo to kill the clan leader of the Blood Clan. They had not fully recovered until now, the Blood Clan was the weakest among the three Divine Clans. Even the current clan leader was lucky enough to become the clan leader.","Now, in the face of absolute strength, he did not have any room to struggle. He was willing to submit.","As for the other two tribe leaders, they also secretly sighed and immediately chose to submit.","From then on, the Nine-tailed Clan was the leader of the four great celestial races in the Demon Realm. The other three great celestial races completely submitted to the feet of the Nine-tailed Clan.","A moment later, the curtain of this great battle had completely fallen.","However, at this moment, Xiao’er immediately ordered, “Everyone, recover your divine power as quickly as possible. In an hour, follow me!”","This order caused everyone to be extremely shocked.","“Nine-tailed Clan leader, in an hour, where do you want us to follow you?” The Gu tribe leader asked.","“The three great divine territories!” Xiao’er’s eyes flashed with a shocking cold light.","...","Heaven-cleaving Star, one of the two great headquarters of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance!","This Heaven-cleaving Star was originally the location of the Heaven-cleaving Palace, and the top geniuses of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance had all gathered here.","However, at this moment, besides the many geniuses of the Heaven-cleaving Palace, there were also countless top experts of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance gathered on this heaven-cleaving star!","Among them, the three palace masters of the Heaven-cleaving Palace and the few commanders in charge of the battle were the leaders.","There were more than a hundred Principles Masters, and the lowest among them was an army of at least a rank six True Saint.","It could be said that the Heaven-cleaving Alliance had gathered all the high-level battle forces that they could mobilize.","“So many people, close to a hundred thousand rank six True Saints and more than a hundred Principles Masters, what are they doing?”","Among the densely packed crowd, many of the Heaven-cleaving Palace’s genius disciples were also mixed in. At this moment, the hearts of these Heaven-cleaving Palace’s genius disciples were extremely shocked.","They were not the only ones. In fact, although many of the Heaven-cleaving Palace’s experts had gathered here, they did not know what exactly they were trying to do. Therefore, when they saw the Heaven-cleaving Alliance’s gathered power...a huge wave rose in their hearts.","And at the front of the crowd, the three Palace Masters of the Heaven-cleaving Palace and the few commanders stood side by side.","“All of the highest combat power that the Heaven-cleaving Alliance can mobilize is gathered here. Only those who have ventured into the cosmic battlefield can not return in a short period of time. Otherwise...” A commander said.","“It’s fine.” Palace Master Raincloud waved his hand. “This time, it’s not just the Heaven-cleaving Alliance. The Temporal divine hall and the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist sect will also take action. It’s said that the four great celestials and the Eight Directions Celestial Sect will also take part in the battle. They only have one target, and that is the three great Saint Realms!”","“The three great Saint Realms will definitely be destroyed in this battle!”","The commanders were all excited.","At this moment, one of the three Palace Masters, Askheaven Demonic God, suddenly opened his eyes.","“The Alliance Master’s orders have arrived!”","The figures of the commanders and the other two palace masters trembled.","“In that case, let’s set off!”","Instantly, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance’s army of over a hundred Principles Masters and nearly a hundred thousand True Saints and above headed toward the Third Heaven.","At the same time, in the Temporal divine hall and the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect.","The Temporal divine hall had gathered all the top-tier saints and Principles Masters together.","This time, they did not leave any leeway. The spacetime divine hall had gathered more than eighty Principles Masters, and more than a hundred top-tier saints.","Apart from that, the four ancient immortals, who had never been involved in worldly affairs, personally rushed over.","As for the heavenly ancestor Daoist sect, there were countless experts. At this moment, they had gathered an army of more than a hundred law masters and nearly a hundred thousand saints.","The moment the Heaven-cleaving Alliance’s army moved out, the experts from the spacetime divine hall and the heavenly ancestor Daoist sect also moved out.","Other than that, the eight directions heavenly sect, which was made up of six great heavenly sects, also moved out.","The Purple Blood Sect, the Supreme Oblivion Valley, and more than ten ancient sects of the Divine Beginning Realm had also moved out.","At this moment, everyone pointed directly at the three Great Saint Realms in the Third Heaven!","...","After the Fourth Heaven was completely desolate, the Third Heaven had become the absolute holy land for cultivation in the Divine Beginning Realm.","And the three great Saint Realms, which were high and mighty, occupied the territory with the best cultivation environment in the Third Heaven.","Normally, the Third Heaven was extremely lively. This was especially so for the territories around the three great Saint Realms. As they were closer to the three great Saint Realms, these territories had also benefited greatly and were extremely prosperous.","However, the territories around the three great Saint Realms appeared exceptionally quiet today.","The reason for this was because there were countless numbers of experts from all directions sweeping over these territories.","Powerful auras swept out wantonly, causing the cultivators in these territories to be like frightened birds.","“There are so many experts, there must be more than 100,000 of them, right? And there are even so many Principles Masters.”","“From the looks of it, they are heading towards the three great Saint Realms!”","“What’s going on? What’s going on? Why are there so many experts heading towards the three great Saint Realms? could something have happened in the three great Saint Realms?”","Many thoughts appeared in the minds of the cultivators in the three great Saint Realms.","Most of the cultivators in the three great Saint Realms did not know what had happened, but they could tell from the army of experts that something big must have happened in the three great Saint Realms!"]},{"number":3685,"title":"Chapter 3685 - Impenetrable","paragraphs":["The three great Saint Realms had been the overlords of the Divine Beginning Realm for countless years.","This place had once been the Holy Land of cultivation that countless cultivators dreamed of.","This place had given birth to countless top experts.","This place had once been looked up to by countless cultivators and countless factions.","All this while, the three great Saint Realms had been lofty and unsurpassable existences.","The three great Saint Realm masters represented the will of the Heavenly Dao of the Divine Beginning Realm. They had spoken and followed the principles in the Divine Beginning Realm, attracting countless experts to worship them.","Until now, the three great Saint Realms were still the heavens in the hearts of most cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm!","But today, the three great Saint Realms were surrounded by countless experts.","The east side was directly in front of the three Saint Realms and was guarded by the Heaven-cleaving Alliance.","As the number one alliance in the Divine Beginning Realm, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance was undoubtedly extremely powerful. The power that the Heaven-cleaving Alliance possessed was even more powerful than a sacred land to a certain extent.","And now, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance was personally led by the three palace masters and the few commanders. They gathered more than 100 Principles Masters and close to 100,000 True Saints above rank 6. They only needed to wait for an order and this army of close to 100,000 experts...would directly attack the three Saint Realms from the front.","...","To the south was the Temporal divine hall, one of the three freedom alliances. In addition, the Purple Blood Sect, Supreme Oblivion Valley, and the other ten or so powerful forces of the Divine Beginning Realm were guarding it.","Although the Temporal divine hall was relatively weak in the three freedom alliances, it did not have many cultivators. However, in terms of top-tier combat power, it was not much weaker than the other two freedom alliances.","As for the Purple Blood Sect, Supreme Emotion Valley, and the other ten or so great factions with deep foundations, they did not have many Principles Masters. However, they had countless cultivators at the level of saints, therefore, the two sides just so happened to combine together. They also had over a hundred Principles Masters and an army of over a hundred thousand Immortal Saints!","...","In the north, the top experts of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect, who were called ‘Ancestors’ led the way. Ghost Ancestor, Spirit Ancestor, and even the Blood Ancestor had rushed back from the Universe Battlefield, these top experts, who were called ‘Ancestors’ led countless experts under their command.","In addition, there were the coalition forces of two of the six celestial sects.","In total, there were more than 100 Principles Masters gathered in the north, and there were more than 150,000 troops of rank six True Saints and above.","...","In the west, behind the three Saint Realms.","According to Jian Wushuang’s guess, once the three Saint Realms were defeated, countless cultivators would probably choose to flee to the rear. Therefore, the combat strength guarding the rear was definitely the strongest.","With Xiao’er as the commander, the combat strength of the four divine races was gathered under her command.","Each of the four divine races was extremely powerful. At their peak, there were more than 10 to 20 Principles Masters in any divine race, and the Nine-tailed Clan was even more powerful, because of Xiao’er’s relationship, the number of Principles Masters gathered had reached as many as sixty to seventy.","Even though they had just experienced a great battle and the four great celestial races had lost a lot of their combat power, after the four great celestial races were united, there were still more than one hundred and twenty Principles Masters, there were also other top races like the Blood Marten Clan, Devil Ape race, and other races from the Demon Realm who were all present.","It could be said that in this battle, Xiao’er commanded nearly 90% of the Demon Realm’s highest combat strength.","Other than that, there was also the remaining four-sided Sky Sect Alliance army from the six-sided Sky Sect Alliance Army.","With all of these added up, the combat strength here was shockingly strong. There were nearly 200 Principles Masters alone, and there were more than 300,000 experts above the sixth level True Saint Realm!","This strongest combat power would completely block the path of retreat for the cultivators of the three great Saint Realms, not giving them any chance to escape!","...","Of course, even though the three great Saint Realms were now completely surrounded, to truly destroy the three great Saint Realms and uproot them, there was still the most important link. If this link was not done, then this allied army operation...was nothing but a joke.","This link was the three great Saint Realm Masters!","The three Saint Realm Masters were supported by the will of the Heavenly Dao. They represented the will of the Heavenly Dao of the Divine Beginning Realm.","With these three Saint Realm Masters around, the three great Saint Realms would have nothing to worry about.","Therefore, if they wanted to destroy the three great Saint Realms, they first had to kill the three Saint Realm Masters.","However, the strength of the three masters of the Saint Realm was obvious. In the Divine Beginning Realm, even an expert at the Ruler Realm could not do anything to the three masters of the Saint Realm.","Buzz!","The space shook slightly.","Three figures appeared one after another in the empty void around the nest of the three Saint Realms.","These three figures were Jian Wushuang, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Temporal Temple Master.","As soon as they arrived in the void, they sensed the countless experts gathered around the three Saint Realms.","“They are all here. It seems that we are only waiting for our attack,” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","“This time, we have gathered 80-90% of the top forces of the Divine Beginning Realm to attack the three Saint Realms together. In terms of overall strength, the Coalition army is much stronger than the three Saint Realms. They definitely have the ability to completely destroy the three Saint Realms.”","As the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master spoke, he suddenly changed the topic, “However, if we want to completely uproot the three Saint Realms, we must first kill the three Saint Realm Masters. Even if I, spacetime, and the Heaven Ancestor join hands, we can’t do that. Only you, Heavenly Sword Marquis, can do that.”","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","“In addition, Xuan God has also sent word that star palace is fully prepared. As long as we attack the three Saint Realms, he and the Heaven Ancestor will lead the experts of Star Palace to immediately destroy the three Saint Realms’ base in the universe battlefield, which is the Holy Island,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Destroy the Holy Island?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. “Aren’t the Rulers from the Devil Cloud Star in the Holy Island? With them, Xuan God and the others won’t be able to do it easily, right?”","“No.” Temporal Temple Master shook his head. “Xuan God has already placed people in the holy pill, but according to the news from the Holy Island, the three Rulers from Mo Yunxing have already left the Holy Island. I don’t know where they are. Xuan God guessed that the three Rulers are most likely in the Divine Beginning Realm. They are most likely in the nest of the three Saint Realms.”","“Are the three Rulers here too?” Jian Wushuang looked into the void ahead.","His soul power had already spread out, but the three Saint Realms were too vast and were blocked by many magic arrays. Even he could not sense the auras of the three Rulers."]},{"number":3686,"title":"Chapter 3686 - Battle, Begin!","paragraphs":["“Three masters of the Saint Realm and three Rulers. Although the three Rulers are restricted by the Heavenly Dao and can not display their peak strength, their combined strength should not be weaker than that of a real Ruler. Moreover, the three Rulers may have special treasures in their hands. Heavenly Sword Marquis, are you confident?” asked the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","“Yes.”","Jian Wushuang nodded calmly.","“Let the people from the Eternal Chaotic World come out first.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand lightly, and the void in front of him instantly shattered. A complete space passage had taken shape.","At the same time, in the Wushuang Saint Realm of the Eternal Chaotic World.","The cultivators who were waiting carefully all heard Jian Wushuang’s voice at this moment.","“Everyone, get ready to move.”","As soon as Jian Wushuang’s voice fell, a huge space passage appeared in the void above the Saint City.","Seeing the space passage take shape, the cultivators below all looked excited and rushed toward the space passage one after another.","Through the space passage, they soon appeared in the void in front of Jian Wushuang.","There were numerous figures, including experts from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, the four Divine Clans and the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, as well as native cultivators from the Eternal Chaotic World, it was their first time in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Therefore, when they appeared in the void of the Divine Beginning Realm, the first thing they did was to look around and feel the surrounding void.","“This is the Divine Beginning Realm?”","“What abundant spiritual energy. It’s indeed much more abundant than our Eternal Chaotic World!”","“The space here is also very stable.”","Exclamations sounded one after another.","The native cultivators of the Eternal Chaotic World were all in a state of excitement and shock.","However, the experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, the four great Divine Clans, and the Eight Directions Celestial Sect all frowned at this moment.","“Is this the Third Heaven, the location of the Three Saint Realms?” Xuan Yan’s face darkened.","“It’s in front of the nest of the three Saint Realms,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“You are...Temporal Temple Master? And the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master beside you?” Xuan Yan narrowed his eyes.","“Xuan Yan, Palace Master of Heaven Punishment Palace, one of the three masters of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, I’ve heard a lot about you.” Temporal Temple Master smiled.","“Everyone.” Jian Wushuang looked over. “This is the lair of the three Saint Realms. However, the three Saint Realms have been surrounded by the three Freedom Alliance, the four Divine Clans, the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, and many ancient sects in the Divine Beginning Realm. The three Saint Realms will be completely destroyed. What you need to do is to stay here and watch quietly.”","“After the three Saint Realms are destroyed, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect will take over the territory again.”","The Seven Star Mysterious Sect members looked at each other in dismay and then nodded secretly.","Although they had returned to the Divine Beginning Realm, they were still in their weakest state and had not reached the peak of their combat strength. Even if they helped Jian Wushuang now, they would not be able to help him much, it would be better to just wait and see.","“As for the people of the Eternal Chaotic World, you should stay in this void and not run around. When the battle starts, the situation will be quite chaotic. If you stay here, the people of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect will protect you. However, if you run around and accidentally get involved in this battle, you will become cannon fodder at any time,” Jian Wushuang warned.","The native cultivators from the Eternal Chaotic World nodded in agreement.","Although they were emperor-level experts in the Eternal Chaotic World, they were nothing but ants in the Divine Beginning Realm. Jian Wushuang had called them cannon fodder, in fact, he had thought highly of them.","After giving some instructions to his parents, Wang Yuan, and Su Rou, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said, “It’s time to attack! Heaven-cleaving, Temporal!”","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master nodded in unison. In the next moment, the three figures disappeared into the void.","At the front, above the vast territory of the three Saint Realms, boom! Boom! Boom!","Three terrifying auras suddenly descended.","Each of these three auras was ridiculously powerful. In the Divine Beginning Realm, they were absolutely terrifying existences.","Three figures also appeared in the void above the three Saint Realms.","“Space-time.”","Jian Wushuang glanced at Temporal Temple Master.","Temporal Temple Master smiled faintly and waved his hand. In an instant, vast space-time power swept out crazily like a tide.","In the blink of an eye, the entire three Saint Realms was covered. The space-time in the territory where the three Saint Realms were located had been completely imprisoned and sealed.","“Space-time, I haven’t seen you attack for many years. Your use of the space-time laws is becoming more and more brilliant. In the Divine Beginning Realm, your strength is restricted, but you can still easily seal the space-time of the three great Saint Realms. What a good method.” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master laughed.","“Don’t praise me. I also have the assistance of the space-time treasure. If it was just me, I wouldn’t be able to do this.” The Temporal Temple Master said.","The territory of the three Saint Realms was extremely vast. It was indeed difficult to cover the entire three Saint Realms in one go.","Jian Wushuang was also good at space-time principles. However, even if he used the heaven-painting golden flag to use space-time imprisonment, he could only cover half of the Saint Realms at most, however, Temporal Temple Master covered the three Saint Realms in one go. Even if he really used a time-space treasure, it was still very impressive.","The space-time of the three Saint Realms had been completely sealed, which meant that the earth-shaking battle had begun.","As the three of them descended above the three Saint Realms, a huge mirror image appeared in the void in four directions around the three Saint Realms. In the mirror image, it was the scene of Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Temporal Temple Master descending above the three Saint Realms.","“It’s the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master!”","When the three people appeared in the picture, the army of experts of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance and the experts of the Temporal Temple immediately burst into a commotion.","But soon, the commotion calmed down and was replaced by a wave of confusion.","“Apart from the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master, the one standing in the middle seems to be Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","“It is indeed the Heavenly Sword Marquis. He has disappeared for nearly 100,000 years. It is said that he went to the Universe Battlefield to explore. Now, it seems that he has come back from the Universe Battlefield.”","“Why is this Heavenly Sword Marquis standing together with the leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance and the Temporal Temple Master? And why is he standing in the middle of them?”","“It seems that the leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance and the Temporal Temple Master seem to be the Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","“What’s going on?”"]},{"number":3687,"title":"Chapter 3687 - The Three Rulers","paragraphs":["In front of the mirror image, countless experts from the three freedom alliances, the four Divine Clans, the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, the Purple Blood Sect, the Supreme-emotion Forgetting Valley, and more than a dozen ancient sects were all astonished and puzzled.","In the image, Jian Wushuang was indeed standing in the center, while the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master stood on both sides. Judging from their appearances and behaviors, Jian Wushuang was indeed the leader, Jian Wushuang was indeed the leader of the three.","However, in the impression of these experts, although Jian Wushuang was a top genius, when he became famous, his battle strength was only at the level of a Principles Master. There was a big gap between him and a top Principles Master. Since when...could he be on the same level as a Ruler expert?","And even let the two masters take charge of him?","What they did not know was that Jian Wushuang was the absolute number one battle force in today’s battle!","As for the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master, although they were both Ruler-level experts, their strength was limited by the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm, at best, they were only slightly stronger than Saint Realm Masters.","The two of them had come together with Jian Wushuang to assist him. They wanted to defeat and even kill the three Saint Realm Masters and the three Rulers hidden in the three Saint Realms, they could only rely on Jian Wushuang.","That was why Jian Wushuang was qualified to stand in the center.","That was why they chose Jian Wushuang as their leader.","In the three Saint Realms, as the Temporal Temple Master completely sealed the time and space of the three Saint Realms, countless cultivators in the three Saint Realms were naturally alarmed.","In fact, they had long been alarmed.","The Three Freedom Alliance, the four Divine Clans, the allied army of the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, and the army formed by more than a dozen ancient forces had rushed over from all directions. This news had been known to almost all of the Third Heaven, of course, the three great Saint Realms knew.","They also knew that they were now in the center of a storm.","But even so, there was not the slightest trace of fear or fear in the three great Saint Realms.","This was because the three strongest pillars of the three great Saint Realms, the three Saint Realm Masters, were still there.","In the eyes of the cultivators of the three great Saint Realms, their Saint Master was absolutely invincible in the Divine Beginning Realm.","As long as their Saint Master was still around, no one could do anything to the three great sacred zones.","Even if all the forces of the Divine Beginning Realm joined hands, they would not be afraid at all.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Under the expectant gazes of countless cultivators of the three great Saint Realms, the three Saint Masters finally appeared.","The bald man, Life and Death Saint Master, who was wearing a white robe and bathing in the sunlight.","Flame Saint Master, clad in purple armor and with his arms crossed, was exuding endless Demonic Qi.","Destruction Saint Master, who was clad in blood-red clothes, was exuding a lofty aura.","Three Masters of the Saint Realm appeared in this world at the same time.","The aura they emitted was still as aloof and lofty as before.","The power they displayed with their every move could still make countless cultivators bow down to them.","However, if one looked carefully, they would find that the three masters of the Saint Realm had a gloomy and solemn look on their faces when they faced Jian Wushuang and the other two.","The three of them had already guessed that Jian Wushuang would not let the three Saint Realms go, so they were ready to fight him.","However, they did not expect that Jian Wushuang would be so generous. He had gathered so many forces and experts at once. It was clear that he wanted to uproot the three Saint Realms and not give them any chance.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you’re finally here.” Holy Master Yan stared at Jian Wushuang with a gloomy look.","He had personally dealt with Jian Wushuang on the Saha Island. Unfortunately, he had not been able to kill Jian Wushuang in that battle.","At the thought of Jian Wushuang’s current strength, the Saint Master often secretly regretted that he had not spared no effort to kill Jian Wushuang. That was why he had given Jian Wushuang a chance to continue to grow up until now.","“You three Saint Realms have stood in the Divine Beginning Realm for so many years. It’s enough. It’s time to disappear,” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","“Humph, if you want to destroy the three Saint Realms in one breath, you have to see if you have the ability,” Destruction Saint Master snorted.","“Ability?” Jian Wushuang smiled disdainfully. “You don’t even have the right to be looked at. You’d better ask your backers to come out. The three people who came from the magic cloud planet, show yourselves!”","As soon as Jian Wushuang finished his words, three figures soared into the sky from the three Saint Realms.","“Haha, Heavenly Sword Marquis, when we met last time in the universe battlefield, you were just an ant in front of me. If it weren’t for Temporal Temple Master’s help, you would have died long ago. But now, you dare to take the initiative to kill us even though you know we are here. How dare you?”","The tall man among the three Rulers let out a hearty laugh that reverberated in the surrounding area.","His laughter revealed a lot of information, which shocked the three great Saint Realms and countless cultivators watching the battle in the surrounding area.","“These three...are Rulers?”","“Yes, they are Rulers. There are actually three Rulers hiding in the three great Saint Realms?”","“How is that possible? Aren’t there only these few Rulers in the Divine Beginning Realm? When did three more appear?”","“It seems that these three people are not Rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm, but are from the vast universe. It’s just that I don’t know why they came here. From what he said, the Heavenly Sword Marquis, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master all knew that these three people existed. Moreover, they had met each other in the cosmic battlefield.”","“They know they have three Rulers as their helpers, but they still dare to attack us. It seems that they have a way to deal with us.”","The cultivators from the various forces had begun to discuss among themselves.","They were shocked by the appearance of the three Rulers, but they were not afraid. After all, they could see that Jian Wushuang and the others had known about their existence and dared to attack them. They must have a way to deal with them.","The three Saint Realm camps were overjoyed when they found out that the three Rulers and their helpers had suddenly appeared.","They were already filled with blind trust and admiration for their three Saint Masters. Now that they had three Rulers as their helpers, they were even more confident, they did not even think that Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the Temporal Temple Master could pose a threat to them.","“Enough nonsense. Today, the three Saint Realms will be destroyed. As for the three of you, since you are all from the Devil Cloud Star, you should die together with the dog of the Devil Cloud Star Master.”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold. He had already sentenced the three masters and the three Saint Realm Masters to death!"]},{"number":3688,"title":"Chapter 3688 - Fierce Battle","paragraphs":["Clang!","Jian Wushuang moved his body, and the sound of metal clashing rang out of nowhere.","As if the heaven and earth had just opened and was being torn apart, the sword essence that Jian Wushuang burst out instantly swept across the nine heavens.","The terrifying aura and the shocking sword essence swept in all directions, causing the expressions of the three masters of the Saint Realm to change.","Even the three Masters of the Devil Cloud Star were stunned.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you are too arrogant.” The white-haired elder said with a hint of anger.","“Die.” The tall man took a step forward and directly rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","Whoosh!","A dazzling silver light suddenly flashed.","The silver claw formed by the tall man’s right hand easily tore the space apart like a blade.","As the air trembled, the silver claw rushed toward Jian Wushuang’s chest at lightning speed.","Seeing the silver claw coming, Jian Wushuang did not dodge and let the claw tear at his body.","Hiss...","The silver claw left a clear claw mark on Jian Wushuang’s body, but Jian Wushuang did not move at all.","“What?”","The tall man raised his head in shock.","Not long ago, in the Magic Smoke Valley, one of the three cosmic battlefields, he and the evil young man worked together to kill Jian Wushuang.","At that time, Jian Wushuang was still very weak in front of him, and his casual attack could cause great damage to Jian Wushuang. If Temporal Temple Master had not arrived in time, that battle...he could easily kill Jian Wushuang.","However, it had only been 3,000 years since the battle, yet Jian Wushuang did not dodge or dodge his attacks. He allowed all of his power to affect his divine body, but he did not move or suffer any damage?","How did this jump get to be so big?","Even if Jian Wushuang had broken through to become a Principles Master and possessed the battle strength of a Ruler, it was impossible for him to completely ignore his attacks?","“Your attacks are just scratching my itch.” Jian Wushuang looked at the tall man in front of him with a mocking expression.","“Bastard, if it weren’t for the fact that I was too restricted in this world and was unable to unleash my full strength, do you think you would be able to withstand my attack head-on?” The tall man was still unwilling to admit Jian Wushuang’s current strength.","What he did not know was that since Jian Wushuang had cultivated the first level of the supreme eternal celestial body, an attack at the level of an elementary Ruler like him was indeed unable to shake him.","Even if the tall man’s strength was at its peak, Jian Wushuang could still easily withstand that claw attack without dodging.","“I’ve already asked you to attack first. Now, you should also take my attack.”","Jian Wushuang did not use his supreme treasure magic weapon. Instead, he used his finger as a sword and slashed with one hand.","It was a casual strike, but it had activated the origin of the sword principle universe. At the same time, it carried the power of Jian Wushuang’s divine power, which was comparable to that of an elementary Ruler.","Crash!","As his finger fell, a towering sword shadow instantly slashed out.","The tall man’s face changed drastically.","Behind him, the evil-looking young man’s face suddenly sank. Buzz!","The space-time trembled, and endless power of space-time principles pressed toward Jian Wushuang. Even the sword shadow he used was weakened by the power of space-time.","However, it was only weakened. The sword shadow did not completely disappear, but continued to slash at the tall man.","“Get lost!”","The tall man waved his sharp claws and forcefully collided with the sword shadow.","As a result, the towering sword shadow seemed to look at each other as if they were facing a huge sea wave. In an instant, it defeated his attack. Then, the mighty sword shadow covered his body.","“Hum!”","With a muffled groan, the tall man suddenly retreated. His face was a little paler than before.","It was slow to say, but in fact, from the moment the tall man fought with Jian Wushuang to the moment when the tall man was defeated by Jian Wushuang’s sword shadow annihilation, it was all done in a flash.","In this flash, the battle between Jian Wushuang and the tall man had already been decided, and the outcome was very clear.","“It seems that the Ruler of the three Saint Realms has been pushed back?”","“Not just pushed back, but completely crushed by the Heavenly Sword Marquis.”","“Yes, crushed. I saw it clearly. The Heavenly Sword Marquis didn’t dodge or dodge the Ruler’s attack, but his body wasn’t moved at all. On the contrary, the Ruler simply used his finger as a sword and casually used his sword techniques to crush him.”","“How can this be? Isn’t that an expert at the Ruler Realm?”","“It feels like their identities have been switched. Heavenly Sword Marquis is the real Ruler, while the Ruler is just an Immortal Saint. The gap between the two is too big.”","The countless experts from various forces who watched the battle through the mirror images were shocked.","They had doubted Jian Wushuang’s strength before and did not understand why he was qualified to stand between the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master. But now, they vaguely understood.","The tall man’s face was extremely ugly when he was easily crushed by Jian Wushuang in front of so many people in the three Saint Realms.","But no matter how ugly it was, he had to admit that the gap between his strength and Jian Wushuang’s was indeed a little big.","“It seems that this kid’s strength is not affected at all in this world. He can completely unleash the power of a Ruler, but the three of us are too restricted. We can only use one-tenth of our strength at our peak. We are absolutely no match for him in a one-on-one fight,” the tall man said in a low voice.","“If that’s the case, then the three of us will attack together,” the devilish youth said.","“Mm.” The white-haired elder nodded slightly and said, “Let’s use the plan that the three of us have been using to attack the enemy together.”","“Alright.” The tall man and the devilish youth nodded in unison.","The three of them had been sent here by the Devil Cloud Star Master not only because they were experts at the Ruler level, but more importantly, the three of them often went on adventures together. The three of them had a very good understanding of each other, and he’s very good at killing people.","The three of them have even ganged up to kill a high master, although the high master escaped, but the high master almost died in the hands of the three of them, this is an indisputable fact.","Now, even though the strength of the three of them was greatly restricted and they could only display one-tenth of their peak strength, if the three of them worked together, they still had the confidence to rely on one-tenth of their combat strength, if the three of them worked together, they would be able to defeat a new Ruler.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, had just made a breakthrough, and he was not a Ruler yet."]},{"number":3689,"title":"Chapter 3689 - The Power of a Sword","paragraphs":["“Attack!”","The three Rulers from Devil Cloud Star Master moved at the same time.","The tall man who had just collided with Jian Wushuang suddenly swayed, and a burst of dazzling silver light flashed. His body directly turned into a 30-meter-tall silver Sirius, whose entire body was silvery-white, it was filled with a shocking murderous aura.","With a swoosh, the Silver Skywolf directly disappeared in the void. When it reappeared, it was directly in front of Jian Wushuang.","The moment the Silver Skywolf moved, the surrounding space completely froze. In this frozen space, there were transparent space-time spears, which were dozens of feet long, with terrifying piercing power, they shot toward Jian Wushuang from all directions.","As for the child-faced, white-haired elder, he narrowed his eyes and suddenly turned into a dark fog, like a large dark cloud that filled the heaven and earth. With the help of the dark cloud, he completely disappeared from Jian Wushuang’s sight and even soul perception.","As long as there was a chance, the white-haired elder, who was covered by the dark clouds, would certainly attack Jian Wushuang with lightning speed and give him a fatal blow.","It had to be said that the three of them worked together perfectly.","However, no matter how well they worked together, in the face of absolute strength, everything was just empty talk.","“Ridiculous!”","Jian Wushuang smiled coldly. With a flip of his hand, a black magic sword emitting a cold and heart-palpitating aura appeared in his hand.","This black magic sword was the yellow spring.","As soon as the yellow spring appeared, the three Rulers’ expressions changed.","They could immediately sense the terrifying power contained in this black magic sword.","“Supreme treasure magic weapon!”","The three of them were surprised.","Although they were also Rulers and had some background from the Devil Cloud Star, they all had a supreme treasure magic weapon. However, Jian Wushuang was only a Principles Master, it was obvious that he had just made a breakthrough, but he had a suitable supreme treasure magic weapon. Of course, they were surprised.","With the Netherworld Sword in hand, Jian Wushuang waved his sword.","“Disperse.”","Jian Wushuang said softly. The Netherworld Sword in his hand immediately streaked across the surrounding void with endless cold light.","The void around him was completely cut open like a piece of paper, and it spread out with a ruthless black sword shadow.","The space was still shattering crazily.","The ruthless black sword shadow destroyed everything around it.","It was the Wushuang Sword Manual, Star Dream!","The first move of Star Dream was originally used at close range to tear apart the opponent’s defense and cut through the opponent’s divine body.","But now, with absolute strength suppression, Jian Wushuang directly used it across the void while attacking the surrounding void.","For a moment, chi chi chi!","The space-time spear that shot out from all directions was directly destroyed by the black sword shadow.","The dark clouds that filled the surrounding void were also completely swept away by the shocking sword essence of the black sword shadow. The figure of the elder with a child-like face and white hair was completely revealed and even completely locked by the sword essence.","However, whether it was the evil-looking young man who used the space-time spear or the white-haired elder, they were still some distance away from Jian Wushuang. The Star Dream first move of Jian Wushuang was not aimed at them.","But the tall man who transformed into the Silver Skywolf...","He was immediately baptized by the terrifying black sword light.","When the sword light attacked, the Silver Skywolf immediately raised its two sharp claws and mercilessly slashed out like two silver lightning bolts.","But in the end...","The cold black sword light seemed to be unimpeded as it passed through Silver Skywolf’s body.","Silver Skywolf immediately dissipated, and the silver light that filled the sky was completely extinguished.","The tall man’s figure was revealed, but at that moment, his eyes were wide open, and he looked at his chest in disbelief.","A silver true treasure armor appeared there. This silver true treasure armor was at the Pinnacle Universe true treasure level, and its protective abilities were extremely powerful. However, at that moment, there was a deep white mark on this silver true treasure armor, in the deepest part of the white mark, there was a faint trace of blood.","This blood color indicated that his pinnacle true treasure armor had already been cut open by a crack.","It was this crack that had pierced through his godly body, and it had already split his godly body in half.","“With just one sword strike, he tore open a crack in my pinnacle true treasure armor and pierced through my godly body. How is this possible?” The tall man’s face was filled with disbelief.","His godly body had been pierced through, and the godly power in his body had been annihilated crazily. At the first moment, nearly 30 percent of his godly power had been consumed.","This undoubtedly made him even more terrified.","The evil-looking youth and the white-haired elder beside him also noticed the tall man’s condition, and their expressions changed drastically!","Indeed, if they were at their peak, the three of them could fight against an advanced Ruler.","Even though they were suppressed by the Heavenly Dao and could only use 10% of their strength, the three of them could still fight against an ordinary primary Ruler.","However, the strength that Jian Wushuang displayed at this moment was clearly not only at the level of a primary Ruler.","He tore apart the tall man’s supreme treasure armor with one strike. Although Jian Wushuang was using the most powerful supreme treasure, he needed to be strong enough to tear apart the Supreme Treasure armor with a good weapon, the fact that Jian Wushuang could do this meant that his current strength was no weaker than that of an advanced Ruler.","An advanced Ruler with the most powerful supreme treasure divine sword could not be defeated by the three of them in their current state.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang moved like a ghost and attacked again.","This time, he appeared directly in front of the tall man. The black divine sword in his hand stabbed at the tall man’s chest like a Meteor Phantom. A terrifying strangling power suddenly erupted.","It was a seventh-level absolute art, Sword Rainbow!","The tall man could not resist the terrifying speed and penetrating power.","Chi!","The cold blade almost instantly entered the tall man’s divine body through the cracks on his supreme treasure armor.","A terrifying strangling power suddenly burst out.","The tall man’s entire divine body was twisted. His divine power was completely strangled by the sword, and his voice began to fade.","“I didn’t expect that I would die here.”","The tall man’s face was still full of disbelief. He stared at Jian Wushuang with unprecedented fear in the depths of his eyes.","Buzz!","The tall man’s divine body collapsed and his consciousness was completely cut off. All that was left was his interspatial ring and the supreme treasure armor on the surface of his body.","The three Rulers of the Devil Cloud Star, the first Ruler, had been killed by Jian Wushuang’s thunderbolt!"]},{"number":3690,"title":"Chapter 3690 - Thunderbolt Kill","paragraphs":["Too fast!","Before the tall man could react, he was killed by Jian Wushuang’s sword.","This scene made the evil-looking young man and the white-haired elder change their expressions.","The tall man was the strongest among the three of them in terms of direct combat ability. However, he did not even have the chance to struggle in front of Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, an unprecedented fear emerged in the hearts of the two Rulers.","“Run!”","The white-haired elder roared and immediately turned around to flee.","The death of the tall man was too much of a shock to him.","Although he had come to this territory under the orders of the Devil Cloud Star Master, who wanted to protect the three Saint Realms, it did not mean that he would risk his life for the three Saint Realms. He was a Ruler, he valued his life very much.","Moreover, the strength displayed by the other party in this battle was not something he could fight against.","As soon as the white-haired elder fled, the evil-looking young man immediately fled as well.","“Can you escape?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. “Temporal!”","“Leave it to me,” the Temporal Temple Master said loudly. Then, he saw the vast power of the rule covering the white-haired elder and the evil-looking young man.","This power of principles was vast and majestic, and it had a huge restriction on the white-haired old man and the young man.","Even though the young man had activated the power of principles to resist it, it was clear that the Temporal Temple Master had the absolute advantage in the battle against the Temporal Temple Master.","“How is this possible? How can the Temporal Temple Master’s control of the laws of space and time be so amazing?” The young man was shocked.","Temporal Temple Master burst into laughter, “Haha, your use of the power of spacetime principles is slightly inferior to mine. Now that I’m in the Divine Beginning Realm, my understanding of the use of spacetime in this world and my ability to use the strongest power of principles under the suppression of the Heavenly Dao is as clear as the palm of my hand.”","“How can you fight me in this situation?”","Temporal Temple Master’s laughter echoed throughout the void.","His laughter made the evil-looking young man pale, because he had noticed that Jian Wushuang was chasing after him.","If he was at his peak and did not have Temporal Temple Master’s suppression, he would have been able to escape from Jian Wushuang. But now, his strength was completely underestimated, and his speed was greatly reduced by the suppression of spacetime, he could only watch as Jian Wushuang caught up with him.","Then, Jian Wushuang attacked with lightning speed.","With just a few strikes, the evil-looking young man was killed by Jian Wushuang in a head-on fight.","“There’s only one left.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with a shocking killing intent. His eyes had already locked onto the white-haired elder in the void not far away.","Because he was chasing after the evil-looking young man, the white-haired elder had already fled a certain distance, but this distance was still under the Temporal Temple Master’s time and space suppression.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang used his fastest speed and caught up with the elder in just a moment.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, don’t go too far!”","The elder’s face was cold and his eyes were extremely cold as he stared at Jian Wushuang.","“Go too far?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","He had killed the tall man and the evil-looking young man, so he should have been able to kill the white-haired elder easily. However, the latter dared to say such threatening words to him, this made Jian Wushuang feel that something was wrong.","“Could it be?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, but a cold smile appeared on his face. “It seems that Devil Cloud Star Master not only sent you three Rulers to this territory, but also gave you the special treasure, right? Is it in your hands now?”","The white-haired elder looked gloomy and did not speak.","Jian Wushuang was right. He did have a trump card, which was the special treasure that Devil Cloud Star Master gave him. The special treasure was extremely effective against special life forms and possessed extraordinary power.","The special treasure had played a great role in Xuan Yi’s death during the world-ending battle.","However, Devil Cloud Star Master was the one who had killed Xuan Yi. He was the one who had personally controlled the treasure.","However, the treasure in his hands could not exert its strongest power. If he were in the universe void, his strength would not be restricted. He could barely exert a certain amount of the treasure’s power.","But now, in the Divine Beginning Realm, his strength was limited to only one-tenth. Under such circumstances, although he could use the treasure, the price was too high, so high that it was difficult for him to bear.","Therefore, in the Divine Beginning Realm, he did not want to use the strongest treasure unless it was absolutely necessary.","But now, if Jian Wushuang continued to be aggressive, he had no other choice.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you just want to kill the three Saint Realm Masters. There’s no need to kill me. Otherwise, if you really force me, you won’t have a good life,” the elder with white hair shouted in a deep voice.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and sneered, “You’re too conceited. If you don’t have the treasure, I can spare your life as long as you kowtow and beg for mercy. But since you have the treasure, you deserve to die!”","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate at all.","He did not have much killing intent toward the white-haired elder. Previously, he only wanted to kill him because he came from the Devil Cloud Star.","But now, since he mentioned the special treasure, Jian Wushuang had to kill him.","He was very interested in the special treasure in the white-haired elder’s hand!","That treasure had a great restraining effect on special life forms. It was a nemesis to special life forms. Therefore, he had to destroy it.","Even if he could not destroy it, he could not let the white-haired elder take it back to the Magic Cloud Planet!","“Die!”","Jian Wushuang did not want to waste any more time with the white-haired elder. With a flash of his body, he charged forward, and a shocking sword essence instantly swept out.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you’re courting death!”","The white-haired elder looked like he was going crazy. When he saw Jian Wushuang charging toward him, his eyes turned scarlet.","Buzz! A special wave suddenly spread out.","A black spear with a special aura appeared in the hand of the white-haired elder. It was the spear that had killed Xuan Yi. “...”"]},{"number":3691,"title":"Chapter 3691 - Black Divine Spear","paragraphs":["Buzz!","Layers of strange black divine power spread out from the black spear.","This black divine power was full of destruction and tyranny. As the white-haired elder poured all his divine power into it...the black divine power suddenly soared and in the blink of an eye, it blotted out the sky. As for the black spear...directly turned into a destructive black light beam and shot toward Jian Wushuang.","At the moment it shot toward him, the endless black divine power crazily condensed and condensed into a demonic human face.","This human face only had a rough outline, but it was still filled with absolute majesty. Especially the pair of deep and strange eyes, there was a kind of disdain that looked down on the universe and above everyone else, the eyes that looked down on the common people were already staring at Jian Wushuang.","The condensation of the face made Jian Wushuang’s face change.","Especially being stared at by the face, Jian Wushuang felt his body tremble, and an unprecedented sense of fear rose from the bottom of his heart.","This sense of fear came from his life level!","This sense of fear was as if he had met his nemesis.","“This feeling...” Jian Wushuang’s face was gloomy. “Whose face is this? Is it the face of the Devil Cloud Star Master or someone else?”","Jian Wushuang did not know the origin of this human face, but he knew that it was formed by the power from the spear.","Without a doubt, the spear did have a great restraint on his life level.","Jian Wushuang did not have time to think, because the dark light beam formed by the black spear had already appeared in front of him.","Jian Wushuang did not care about the white-haired elder, but he did not dare to underestimate the black spear that had once killed his master.","In an instant, he used his life divine power and heaven-cleaving skill.","His divine power immediately rose to a level that was barely comparable to an advanced Ruler.","“Starfire burning the sun!”","Jian Wushuang shouted, and a demonic sword light flashed across the Netherworld Divine Sword in his hand.","Crack! Crack!","The sound of the void cracking suddenly rang out.","A terrifying sword light that seemed to be able to burn everything in the world, with a shocking power, rushed toward the black light beam formed by the spear. In the blink of an eye, the two collided head-on.","Sizzle, sizzle, sizzle!","The collision of the two terrifying attacks did not produce a terrifying explosion. Instead, there was only the sound of divine power being pressed against each other, the fear in Jian Wushuang’s heart grew stronger and stronger.","At the same time, there was a special power slowly eroding toward him from the black light beam.","Jian Wushuang’s face was solemn, and the power in his hands increased a little.","The two terrifying powers attacked crazily, but suddenly, Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","“The power contained in the spear has been weakened by about 70% by my swordsmanship. The remaining power should be about 30%,” Jian Wushuang muttered, but he had already made a bold decision, it was an extremely crazy decision.","Jian Wushuang focused his eyes. The sword light, which was able to fight against the dark light beam, collapsed without any warning.","The reason why it collapsed was not because the power of the sword light had been completely exhausted. It was because Jian Wushuang deliberately controlled it and withdrew its power.","Without the obstruction of the sword light, the dark light beam naturally charged toward Jian Wushuang.","In the blink of an eye, it had already arrived in front of Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang had no intention of dodging at all. He only exerted the power of the Blood Demon Cave Armor with all his strength. It was obvious that he wanted to forcibly resist the impact of the long spear.","“I want to see for myself how special this long spear is and how much it can restrain special life forms like me!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a trace of madness.","He knew very well that this spear was very important to both him and the Devil Cloud Star Master.","Even the Devil Cloud Star Master would only be able to kill him with this spear.","Because of this, he wanted to truly experience the power of this spear.","Therefore, he deliberately dissipated his sword light and allowed the remaining 30% of its power to stab toward his divine body.","“Chi!”","The dark spear, which was emitting a strange aura, hit Jian Wushuang’s chest and was immediately blocked by the Blood Demon Cave Armor.","After all, it was a supreme supreme treasure armor. The remaining 30% power of the dark spear could not penetrate the Blood Demon Cave Armor directly, but there was a special power in the dark spear, it completely ignored the Blood Demon Cave Armor and entered Jian Wushuang’s body at once.","Rumble...","Jian Wushuang felt his body roaring crazily. A large amount of his divine power began to be destroyed under the impact of the special power.","In the blink of an eye, more than 10% of his divine power had been destroyed, and the special power continued to attack.","“What a terrifying, special power!”","Jian Wushuang was shocked. He immediately mobilized all his divine power to counter the special power.","After three breaths, Jian Wushuang’s body calmed down again.","However, at this moment, he had less than 80% of his divine power!","In other words, the special power that had just poured into his body from the black spear had destroyed more than 20% of his divine power in just a few breaths!","After all, as a special life form, his divine power was as vast as the sea after he became the Principles Masters. Now, even if he had received a full-power blow from the Sky Roc Ruler who had reached the level of a top Ruler, he had only lost less than one percent of his divine power.","But now, the black spear into the special force, directly annihilated more than 20% of his power.","What did this mean?","“This is the Ruler of the Devil Cloud Star Master. He can’t use his peak strength in the Divine Beginning Realm. If he could use his peak strength, this attack would definitely hurt me more. But if the stronger and more terrifying Devil Cloud Star Master were to control this spear personally, the result would be...” Jian Wushuang thought, he could not help but suck in a breath of cold air.","He finally understood why his master had died at the hands of the Devil Cloud Star Master even though he was so powerful and his methods were so brilliant.","This was not only because the Devil Cloud Star Master was stronger, but most importantly, it was because of this special long spear.","The special power contained within this long spear was too terrifying!","The threat it posed to the special life forms was too great.","And he definitely could not let such a spear fall into the hands of the Devil Cloud Star Master."]},{"number":3692,"title":"Chapter 3692 - Kill Them All","paragraphs":["The situation on the battlefield suddenly changed.","After Jian Wushuang killed the tall man and the evil-looking young man, the two masters, almost everyone thought that Jian Wushuang should be able to kill the white-haired elder easily, however, they did not expect the white-haired elder to use his trump card and hit Jian Wushuang head-on.","When the strange black spear stabbed Jian Wushuang and weakened his aura, everyone was shocked.","However, they were only shocked. Although Jian Wushuang had lost a lot of divine power, he was still full of battle strength, so he quickly attacked again.","On the other hand, the white-haired elder was forcibly activating the power of the black spear. Although it had caused some damage to Jian Wushuang, he himself had paid a huge price, he had lost more than 70% of his divine power and even suffered a severe backlash in his soul.","Now, he was seriously injured and had little battle strength left.","Seeing Jian Wushuang attacking again, the elder was in disbelief.","He did not expect that he could not cause much damage to Jian Wushuang despite activating the black spear.","Immediately after, he revealed a look of despair.","He knew that in his current state, he would definitely die if he faced Jian Wushuang again.","Sure enough, Jian Wushuang came to his side and killed him with a casual sword attack.","Since then, the three masters who had specially rushed over from Devil Cloud Star Master had all died.","The three of them had all died under Jian Wushuang’s sword.","After killing the three masters, Jian Wushuang’s cold eyes immediately swept over the three masters of the Saint Realm.","The three masters of the Saint Realm had long turned pale.","They looked up at Jian Wushuang with despair in their hearts.","“It’s your turn.”","Jian Wushuang held the Netherworld Divine Sword and walked toward the three masters of the Saint Realm step by step.","The three masters of the Saint Realm were so depressed that they no longer had any intention of resisting.","Even if they wanted to resist, it would be useless. After all, they were only Principles Masters. Even with the power of the will of heaven, they could not compete with Rulers. In the Divine Beginning Realm, in terms of battle strength, the three of them could not compare to the three Rulers.","Jian Wushuang could easily kill the three Rulers, so it would be even easier to kill them.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you won this time! If I had known earlier, I would have killed you at all costs!”","“I didn’t expect that the three of us would really die at your hands. How ridiculous, how ridiculous!”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, don’t be too happy. Master will definitely take revenge in his body! He will!”","The three masters of the Saint Realm said their last words before they were killed by Jian Wushuang.","This scene completely stunned the countless cultivators from the three Saint Realms.","They stared at the scene with their eyes wide open in disbelief.","“The Saint Master and the others are dead?”","“How, how is this possible?”","“Impossible, impossible! The Saint Master’s power is monstrous, and he represents the will of the Heavenly Dao. They are absolutely invincible in the Divine Beginning Realm. No one can kill them. It’s impossible!”","“It’s fake. This must be an illusion. Yes, it must be an illusion!”","“Damn it, why haven’t I woken up from this illusion yet?”","Hysterical roars sounded from every corner of the three great Saint Realms.","Even though they had seen the three great Saint Realm masters being killed with their own eyes, those people in the three great Saint Realms who had blindly worshipped the three great Saint Realm Masters were still unwilling to believe that all of this was real, they had thought that they had just fallen into an illusion and had only seen the scene in the illusion.","Even the Principles Masters of the three Saint Realms...they were still in disbelief.","They did not care about the death of the three Rulers. After all, the three Rulers had suddenly appeared and did not leave a deep impression on them. They did not feel invincible, but the three Saint Realm Masters were different.","Of course, no matter how unbelievable they were, it was a fact that the three Saint Realm Masters were dead.","After killing the three masters of the Saint Realm, Jian Wushuang turned his eyes to the void beside him.","There was no one there. There was only a black spear floating quietly.","The black divine spear had been floating quietly in the void ever since the white-haired elder had finished using it. Even though the white-haired elder had died, no one could control the black spear, it still emitted an extremely strange aura.","Jian Wushuang had not paid attention to the spear immediately after killing the elder. Until now, he had killed the three masters of the Saint Realm, and the three most powerful experts of the Saint Realm had all died, Jian Wushuang looked at the spear.","“This spear must be destroyed!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a sharp light. He raised the Netherworld Divine Sword in his hand, and an extremely powerful divine power aura burst out.","Whoosh!","A majestic sword shadow slashed directly at the floating black spear in an attempt to split it in half.","However, when the sword light landed on the black spear, the spear was sent flying far away. However, there were no cracks on the surface of the spear, let alone any marks left by the sword shadow.","This scene made Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrow, but he was not surprised.","The spear was extremely powerful, unique, and priceless. It was definitely a supreme treasure among supreme treasures.","How could such a supreme treasure be destroyed so easily?","It was like a supreme universe supreme treasure. Even if it was placed in front of Jian Wushuang, he could not destroy it no matter how hard he tried. The level of the spear was probably higher than that of the Supreme Universe Supreme Treasure.","“If I can’t destroy it and want to suppress it, I don’t have a suppression-type supreme treasure on the same level as it. It seems that I have to find a way to keep it with me.” Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and made a decision.","If he had no other choice, he would not want to keep the spear with him.","Because the spear was too threatening to him, it had a constant impact on his life level. If he kept the spear with him, the impact would not be broken, which would make him very uncomfortable.","Unfortunately, he had no choice but to keep the spear by his side.","However, when Jian Wushuang reached out his hand and wanted to put the spear into his interspatial ring...","Boom!","A supernatural power suddenly descended.","“Humph! Is my treasure something you can touch?”","A cold voice suddenly echoed in the world."]},{"number":3693,"title":"Chapter 3693 - Giant Green Hand","paragraphs":["This cold shout contained an unquestionable will that exploded in the world.","At the moment the voice sounded, the world suddenly shook.","From the void at the highest point, a giant dark green hand suddenly extended out and grabbed toward the Black Divine Spear.","The attack of this huge green hand caused the pupils of everyone present to shrink.","No matter who it was, they could feel that supreme power from this huge green hand.","That power did not originate from the cultivators, but from the Heavenly Dao!","“The power of the Heavenly Dao’s will!”","“The will of the Heavenly Dao has descended?”","“That’s not right, the will of the Heavenly Dao is only a will. The power of the Heavenly Dao that can be mobilized is extremely limited. At most, it can threaten some masters of laws. However, why does this huge hand formed by the will of the Heavenly Dao feel so powerful?”","Looking at the giant green hand that suddenly appeared, many people present were terrified, including some Principles Masters who were extremely powerful.","The power contained in the giant green hand was indeed too powerful.","At least, it was much stronger than the Principles Masters. Unsurprisingly, the power contained in the giant hand had reached the Ruler Realm.","However, when could the will of the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm mobilize the power of the will of the Ruler Realm?","Unless...boom!","The earth began to shake violently. Jian Wushuang could vaguely feel that the moment the giant green hand extended out, the void of the Divine Beginning Realm also had some influence.","“It seems that he’s desperate.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed slightly.","He knew that under normal circumstances, in order to maintain the normal operation and evolution of the Divine Beginning Realm, the divine will could not use too much power. At most, it would be like before, he chose three Principles Masters who were not weak as his spokespersons. Then, because of the blessing of the heavenly will, these three people could burst out with power far stronger than that of the Principles Masters.","These were the Three Saint Realm Masters.","But this was only under normal circumstances.","But now, it was obviously not under normal circumstances.","The Three Saint Realm Masters were dead, and the Black Spear was about to fall into Jian Wushuang’s hands. How could Devil Cloud Star Master not be anxious? Thus, Devil Cloud Star Master recklessly mobilized the power of the heavenly will of the Divine Beginning Realm, that was why the giant green hand had descended.","Although the giant green hand had descended, it had a huge impact on the Divine Beginning Realm at that moment. The price for it was also very high for Devil Cloud Star Master.","“Do you think you can get the spear back just like that?”","Jian Wushuang smiled coldly. Just as the giant green hand was about to grab the black spear, he moved and took a step forward.","When he took a step forward, a shocking power burst out from his body.","He used his life divine power and heaven-cleaving skill at the same time.","At the same time, because he had refined the Eternal Chaotic World, he was favored by the universal laws, which gave him a lot of benefits.","Among them, there was an extremely powerful will power.","Jian Wushuang had not used this will power since he got it.","But now...buzz!","The power of the will was directly integrated into Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship.","“The most powerful skill, Starfire Burning Sun!”","Jian Wushuang attacked with all his strength. A sword light containing explosive power suddenly swept out.","The sword light was so huge that it covered half of the world. It immediately went to meet the giant green hand.","The sound of a blade passing through a person’s divine body rang out. The giant green hand was cut in half by the sword light.","The giant hand was cut in half, and a large amount of majestic power of the Heavenly Dao spread out in all directions.","“The power of the universe principles? How is this possible?!”","An unbelievable voice echoed in the deepest part of the Heaven and Earth.","Devil Cloud Star Master knew very well that the power of the will of Heavenly Dao that he mobilized at all costs was extremely powerful. Even though Jian Wushuang was strong enough now, he was confident that he could still resist or even suppress him, but in the end, his giant hand formed by the power of Heavenly Dao was cut open?","The power contained in that sword and the special power contained in it completely shocked Devil Cloud Star Master.","He knew that the power had already surpassed that of most advanced Rulers.","The extremely special but supreme power contained in the sword was even the power of the universe principles!","Even if Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship only contained a trace of the universe principles, it could still make his swordsmanship extremely terrifying.","“It seems that the arrival of the universe principles really gave you a lot of good things.” The mighty voice sounded again.","Jian Wushuang sneered.","But at this moment...","“Huh?”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils suddenly shrank because he had noticed that at the same time when he used his swordsmanship to cut the giant green hand into two, a strange figure had appeared beside the black spear, he put the black spear into his interspatial ring.","After doing all this, the figure did not leave immediately. Instead, she stood there and looked at him calmly.","“This person...”","Jian Wushuang looked at the person.","She was an extremely beautiful woman. Her temperament was cold and without any emotion. She looked at him with a strange smile in her eyes.","“It’s you, Ruler Star Luo!”","Jian Wushuang’s voice turned cold. He had already recognized her.","In his previous life, he had interacted with Ruler Star Luo in the Eternal Chaotic World, so he knew her appearance very well.","The person in front of him was obviously Ruler Star Luo. She looked exactly the same and her aura was exactly the same.","The only difference was that Ruler Star Luo had only sent a consciousness clone to the Eternal Chaotic World, but now it was her original body.","She also possessed the strength of a real Ruler.","“Jian Wushuang...I really didn’t expect that you could reach such a level in such a short time. Not only the three masters of the Saint Realm in the Divine Beginning Realm, but even the three masters from the Devil Cloud Star died at your hands?” Ruler Star Luo stared at Jian Wushuang.","“Since you know that the three masters of the Saint Realm and the three Rulers from the Devil Cloud Star have died at my hands, how dare you show up in front of me?","“You even dare to steal my things. You have guts.” Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold, his eyes were filled with killing intent.","“Haha, Jian Wushuang, you underestimate me. Although we are both Rulers, I’m not as useless as that trash. In the Divine Beginning Realm, I can’t do anything to you, but if I want to leave, you can’t stop me.”","With that, Ruler Star Luo disappeared in front of Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3694,"title":"Chapter 3694 - Two Days and Three Nights","paragraphs":["Before she disappeared, Jian Wushuang’s soul power had already locked onto her.","However, as soon as she disappeared, Jian Wushuang found that his soul power had lost its target. No matter how much his soul power swept around, he could not find any trace of her.","“Temporal, can you sense her existence?” Jian Wushuang immediately asked.","At present, the world was still confined by Temporal Temple Master, so logically, everything in this spacetime should be within his sensing range.","However, after hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Temporal Temple Master frowned, “No, I can’t sense her existence. It’s very likely that she has cultivated some special secret skill or has some special treasure with her. In short, I can’t sense her.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s face turned extremely ugly.","“Jian Wushuang, I told you, I’m leaving. You can’t keep me here. Goodbye. I hope you’re still alive when we meet again.”","Ruler Star Luo’s voice rang out again and slowly faded away. However, the voice did come from all directions at the same time. Even though it was slowly fading away, Jian Wushuang still could not identify the position of Ruler Star Luo through the voice.","“Damn it!” Jian Wushuang could not help cursing in his heart. He was extremely angry.","He was angry not only because Ruler Star Luo had snatched the long spear and left him with a big threat in the future.","Most importantly, Ruler Star Luo was Leng Ruxue’s master. Only she knew where Leng Ruxue was.","He had thought that if Ruler Star Luo appeared, he could capture her or suppress her and force her to tell him where Leng Ruxue was. But now...he could only watch her leave. How could he not be angry?","After Ruler Star Luo left...","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you are not bad. I will remember you. Soon, my true body will come here personally. At that time...I will let you die like your master, Xuan Yi, in pain and despair!”","“Hahahaha!”","A deranged laughter echoed in the air, but it gradually disappeared.","Jian Wushuang’s face was cold. He looked down at the ground and slowly raised his right hand.","“Kill all Three Saint Realms!”","With Jian Wushuang’s order.","In the four directions around the Three Saint Realms, except for the four divine clans and the Four Heaven’s Sect Coalition army led by Xiao’er, the Saint Army and many Principles Masters from the other three directions all moved out.","Numerous experts were rushing toward the Three Saint Realms from different directions.","The shouts and cries of killing soared to the sky. In just a moment, the Three Saint Realms were drowned in a frenzy of fighting.","The situation in this fight was completely one-sided.","The Three Saint Realms were very strong and had a deep foundation. However, no matter how strong they were, there was still a huge gap between them and more than 90% of the high-level experts in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Not to mention, the Three Saint Realms’ biggest reliance was also the god in the hearts of countless cultivators in the Three Saint Realms. The Three Saint Realm Masters had already died. Moreover, they were easily killed by Jian Wushuang in front of countless experts in the Three Saint Realms.","The death of the Three Saint Realm Masters was too much of a shock to the cultivators in the Three Saint Realms. It also made them lose their backbone in an instant. They completely lost their fighting spirit and faced the oncoming armies, it was almost impossible to stop the effective resistance and counterattack. In the end, they were at the mercy of others.","The massacre. This war was a one-sided massacre.","Of course, Jian Wushuang would not act personally in this massacre.","After killing the three masters of the Saint Realm and giving the order to destroy the Three Saint Realms, he returned to the Void where the Seven Star Mysterious Sect and the Eternal Chaotic World were located with the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and Temporal Temple Master.","As for the fierce battle that followed, he just watched it coldly.","Not only him, the experts from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect and the people from the Eternal Chaotic World were also watching.","The experts from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect were all excited when they saw the scene in front of them.","As for the people from the Eternal Chaotic World, their faces were all pale.","To the cultivators from the Eternal Chaotic World, the scene before their eyes was simply too shocking.","Countless experts were madly fighting. Any one of these experts was unbelievably strong in their eyes. However, the experts participating in this exhibition had reached the level of a million. Such a terrifying and inconceivable battle...they had never thought about it before.","But now, they had seen it with their own eyes. It had happened right in front of them.","Moreover, they had just arrived at the Divine Beginning Realm, yet they had already seen this great battle. The shock in their hearts couldn’t be described with words.","Moreover, through this battle, they clearly understood what kind of world the Divine Beginning Realm was.","Not only were there countless experts here, but there were also endless massacres.","In this place, the Eternal Chaotic World was even crazier and crueler.","Just like the battle before them, it was extremely cruel.","“It’s too cruel. Although these Three Great Saint Realms are detestable and should be destroyed, many of the cultivators in these Three Great Saint Realms are actually innocent. In particular, many of them are children who haven’t experienced many storms. But now, they are being killed together. Almost no one can survive.”","Ji Wumeng frowned when he saw the scene in the picture. He was obviously unhappy.","Jian Nantian, who was next to him, was a little calmer.","Jian Wushuang had yet to speak when he heard Ji Wumeng’s words, but Xuan Yan, who was from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect’s camp, said directly, “Is this cruel? Wasn’t it the same when our Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed? If Xuan Yi didn’t create that layer of array, do you think that one of my Seven Star Mysterious Sect would have been left alive?","“Not to mention my Seven Star Mysterious Sect, even the entire Seven Star Divine Realm probably wouldn’t have a single living person. As for the Eternal Chaotic World formed in the future, that’s simply a joke. It’s impossible for it to exist anymore!","“This is the Divine Beginning Realm, not the Eternal Chaotic World that you’ve stayed in before. Compared to the world you’ve stayed in, this place abides by the laws of the jungle. The strong prey on the weak, and strength reigns supreme. Back then, my Seven Star Mysterious Sect’s strength wasn’t enough, and we were almost doomed. But today, the same result has happened. It’s just that the target is these Three Great Saint Realms!”","Xuan Yan’s expression was extremely cold.","The experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect also had the same expression. They did not have the slightest bit of pity toward the Three Saint Realm cultivators who had been crazily massacred. Some of them even had a trace of pleasure, this pleasure stemmed from their revenge."]},{"number":3695,"title":"Chapter 3695 - The Three Saint Realms Were Completely Destroyed!","paragraphs":["Xuan Yan’s words shocked everyone from the Eternal Chaotic World.","Ji Wumeng’s frown deepened.","“Mother, this is indeed the case in the Divine Beginning Realm. There is no mercy here, especially for the enemy,” Jian Wushuang said, “If we let the cultivators of the Three Saint Realms leave today, they will not hesitate to show their claws at us in the coming year. They will stab us in the back when they have the chance.”","“Mother, you have just arrived in the Divine Beginning Realm, so you don’t know much about it. But you will get used to it after a long time.”","Ji Wumeng nodded and did not say anything else.","Two days and three nights!","The great battle within the Three Great Saint Realms lasted for two days and three nights.","This was very normal. After all, the Three Great Saint Realms were too big, and there were too many cultivators.","Even if the allied armies of the various forces all attacked, it would still take some time to kill all the cultivators of the Three Great Saint Realms.","Two days and three nights were still under the situation where the experts from the highest echelons of the various factions personally took action.","After the great battle ended, the Three Great Saint Realms, which had stood tall in the Divine Beginning Realm for countless years and were supported by the will of the Heavenly Dao, were finally completely wiped out.","They were completely wiped out. There were practically no fish that escaped the net.","As for the countless resources and treasures left behind by the Three Great Saint Realms, a small number of them had been snatched away during the battle. However, the majority of them were still gathered together and distributed.","Weng!","In the vast void, countless figures stood erect.","The armies of experts from various forces remained in this void, and no one left.","In the center of this void, thrones condensed from divine power stood erect. On these thrones, there were many figures emitting tyrannical auras. These figures...they were the Rulers of the forces participating in the war, or the highest level.","In front of these people, there were five towering thrones floating quietly.","These five thrones were obviously higher than the other thrones, but no one dared to object.","Because the people on these five thrones were the five strongest and most powerful people in the Divine Beginning Realm.","They were Jian Wushuang, Daoist Xuan God, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Temple Master, and Heaven Ancestor!","Except for Jian Wushuang, the other four were all Rulers. Although Jian Wushuang was not a Ruler, his battle strength was above that of a Ruler. Moreover, he was the absolute main force in this battle, he had single-handedly killed the Three Saint Realm Masters and three Rulers from the Devil Cloud Star.","Therefore, he sat in the middle of the five.","Xuan Yan was also a Ruler, but he was from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. Now that the Xuan God was there, he did not need to show up.","“Xuan God, Heaven Ancestor, how is the Star Palace?” Jian Wushuang asked.","While the forces of the Divine Beginning Realm attacked the Three Saint Realms, on the Universe Battlefield, Daoist Xuan God and Heaven Ancestor led the Star Palace to attack the Holy Island.","Now that the Three Saint Realms had been destroyed, the Holy Island should have a result.","“It’s over. The Holy Island has been destroyed. More than 80% of the hundreds of Principles Masters have been killed. Although some escaped, it’s not a big deal,” Daoist Xuan God said with a smile.","His and the Heaven Ancestor’s original bodies were still on the Holy Island. As for the ones who had arrived, they were just consciousness incarnations.","“That’s good.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","This time, the Divine Beginning Realm and the Universe Battlefield had attacked at the same time, and the final result could be considered satisfactory.","The only regret was that he had not destroyed or obtained the black spear.","“After this battle, the Three Saint Realms can be said to be completely destroyed. Next, it’s time to divide the spoils of war,” Jian Wushuang said grandly.","After hearing his words, the Rulers and the highest-level officials from all sides became excited.","They had left without destroying the Three Saint Realms to divide the spoils of war.","After all, the Three Saint Realms had been the overlords of the Divine Beginning Realm.","Not only did the Three Saint Realms have countless resources and treasures, but they also had countless territories, secret realms, and all kinds of things, especially the territories where the Three Saint Realms were located, this was the most superior territory for the cultivation of illusions in the Third Heaven.","Who would not be envious?","“Heavenly Sword Marquis.”","A figure stood up from below.","This person was the sect master of the Blood Fire Heaven Sect, one of the Eight Directions Celestial Sect who participated in the battle.","As the sect master of a heaven sect and a top expert in the Divine Beginning Realm, he had once regarded Jian Wushuang as a little guy. But now that he had personally experienced this battle, the strength that Jian Wushuang displayed...all the experts were impressed by him, including the sect master of the Blood Fire Sect.","Therefore, the sect master of the Blood Fire Sect was now extremely respectful to Jian Wushuang, and he naturally addressed him as ‘sir’.","“Lord Heavenly Sword Marquis, there are too many sects participating in the extermination of the Three Saint Realms. Although it seems that the results of this battle are great, I’m afraid it won’t be easy to distribute them. So, how do you plan to distribute the results of this battle?” The sect master of the Blood Fire Sect looked at Jian Wushuang carefully.","“It’s simple. We will distribute the results according to the strength of each force. The stronger the force, the more contribution they make, and the more results they will get. First of all, I was the first to kill the three Rulers and three masters of the Saint Realm, which basically made the Three Saint Realms lose the ability to resist. Therefore, I want 30% of the results.”","Jian Wushuang was very direct and did not beat around the bush.","He alone wanted 30% of the battle results.","When he said this, most of the people on the field secretly nodded and did not have any objections.","This was very normal, because the most crucial part of the battle was the three masters of the Saint Realm and the three Rulers from the Devil Cloud Star. If the three masters of the Saint Realm were still alive, the battle would not have been possible.","It was because Jian Wushuang killed them that the Three Saint Realms were destroyed.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang contributed the most to this battle. It was reasonable for him to ask for 30% of the battle results.","Even if he asked for 50%, not many people would object, considering Jian Wushuang’s monstrous strength.","Of course, although most people agreed, a few people were secretly dissatisfied and felt that Jian Wushuang was too greedy.","After all, Jian Wushuang was only one person, and there were no forces or sects under his command. If he wanted 30% of the results, what was the use of it?","..."]},{"number":3696,"title":"Chapter 3696 - Dividing the Spoils of War","paragraphs":["It was normal for these people to think so. After all, the spoils of war were mainly the resources and treasures left behind by the Three Saint Realms.","The Three Saint Realms had dominated the Divine Beginning Realm for so long, so they had accumulated too many resources and treasures.","Thirty percent of the resources...was enough for a large force and sect to squander for a long time.","Jian Wushuang was alone, so why did he need so many resources?","They did not know that Jian Wushuang himself did not need these resources, but the people around him did.","First of all, it was the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","After the battle, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect had lost all its resources. Although they now had the opportunity to rise again, they naturally needed a lot of resources in addition to a certain number of experts. Therefore, Jian Wushuang wanted 30% of the resources, 10% of the resources would definitely be reserved for the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","With this 10% of resources, it would be easy for the remaining experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect to rise again.","As for the other 20% of the resources, Jian Wushuang prepared them for the many cultivators in the Eternal Chaotic World.","The Eternal Chaotic World was still far from the Divine Beginning Realm. Those cultivators who came to the Divine Beginning Realm from the Eternal Chaotic World would definitely need a place to stay, therefore, Jian Wushuang planned to find a territory in the Divine Beginning Realm and create a force. These resources would be used to operate that force.","Although some people were dissatisfied with Jian Wushuang’s demand for 30% of the battle results, no one dared to say anything.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang spoke again, “Among the remaining 70% of the battle results, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, the Temporal Temple, the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect, and the four great divine clans contributed the most, each taking 10%. As for the remaining 30%...it will be evenly distributed among the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, the Purple Blood Sect, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, and more than a dozen other major forces.”","“I wonder who is here to object to this distribution?”","Jian Wushuang did not say who had different opinions, but directly said who opposed it. The meaning of this was very clear.","It meant that he had already decided on this distribution and would not change it.","For the various forces present, Jian Wushuang’s distribution was considered fair. Even if there were a few who were dissatisfied, they would not dare to voice their objections at this moment.","After all, to object in front of so many people was to refute Jian Wushuang’s face. Who would dare to do so?","Jian Wushuang looked down coldly for a long time. Seeing that no one objected, he said, “Since no one objects, then the resources and treasures of the Three Saint Realms will be distributed in this way.”","“In addition to these resources and treasures, there is one more thing, which is about the territories and territories controlled by the Three Saint Realms...”","Those who held power or were at the highest level immediately perked up.","To them, the greatest result of this battle was not the resources and treasures left behind by the Three Great Saint Realms, but the territories and territories!","The Three Great Saint Realms had dominated the Divine Beginning Realm for so long, and the territories they controlled had always been the best in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Especially the headquarters of the Three Great Saint Realms, which was the void they were currently in.","This place was the core of the Third Heaven. Even though they had just encountered a fierce battle, the battle had only destroyed the various construction arrays in this territory, it would not have much of an impact on the cultivation environment of this territory.","This was still the territory with the best cultivation environment in the Divine Beginning Realm. Such a territory would naturally be of great use to cultivators.","If any force or sect could occupy this territory and make it their home, then their disciples’ cultivation speed would definitely be much faster than in other places, the chances of producing experts would naturally be higher.","That was why they cared so much about these territories.","Under everyone’s anticipation, Jian Wushuang spoke.","“I don’t care about the territories and territories that the Three Saint Realms previously controlled. However, the territories where the Three Saint Realms are located will be controlled by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. I wonder if there are any different opinions on this.” Jian Wushuang let everyone express their opinions.","“The Heaven-cleaving Alliance has no objections.” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance master was the first to speak.","“Temporal Temple Master, no objections,” Temporal Temple Master also said.","“The Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed by the Three Saint Realms. Now that the Seven Star Mysterious Sect is going to rise again, it’s reasonable for it to occupy the nest of the Three Saint Realms. The Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect also has no objections,” the Heaven Ancestor said.","The three Freedom Alliances all made their positions clear.","When the sects below saw this, they looked at each other and did not dare to say anything more.","Judging from Jian Wushuang’s attitude and the attitude of the three Freedom Alliances, it was obvious that they had decided to give the territory where the Three Saint Realms were located to the Seven Star Mysterious Sect so that the Seven Star Mysterious Sect could rise again.","In that case, there was no chance for them to force it?","Of course, even if the best territory was given to the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, the remaining territories that the Three Saint Realms had previously controlled were still very attractive to them.","“You can divide the remaining things among yourselves.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand, but he had already turned around and left.","“The three Freedom Alliances are not interested in territories and territories. You can take care of those things yourself.”","The leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, who was the representative of the three Freedom Alliances, said this and then left.","As for the four divine races, since they already had a huge monster territory with good cultivation conditions, they were not interested in other places, so they did not get involved in the fight for territories and territories.","On the contrary, the Eight Directions Celestial Sect and the dozen or so powerful forces began to fight over these territories.","Of course, no matter how they fought, it had nothing to do with Jian Wushuang.","Above the void, Jian Wushuang, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the Temporal Temple Master, Daoist Xuan God, and the Heaven Ancestor’s consciousness clones stood there, looking down at the ground.","“The Three Saint Realms have been destroyed after all.” Jian Wushuang sighed.","He clearly remembered that he had been pushed to the limit by the Three Saint Realms several times.","On several occasions, he had almost died at the hands of the Three Saint Realms.","At the same time, since his last life, the Three Saint Realms had been like a mountain to him. This mountain had been blocking him and even wanted to crush him, but he had been lucky enough to survive until now, finally, the mountain was completely shattered.","“Once upon a time, the Three Saint Realms were like a giant to me. I was scared just by looking at them, but now, they are just ruins.” Jian Wushuang chuckled, but a complicated look flashed in his eyes."]},{"number":3697,"title":"Chapter 3697 - The Mysterious Sorcerer God’s Sect","paragraphs":["?","Seeing the Three Saint Realms completely destroyed by him, Jian Wushuang felt a strange emotion in his heart, except for the joy of revenge.","After all, they were the Three Saint Realms. They had a deep heritage and had been high and mighty in the Divine Beginning Realm for countless years. But now, they were completely destroyed in just two days and vanished into thin air in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Thinking back to the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, in terms of strength, it was much stronger than the Three Great Saint Realms. It even had a total of three Ruler-level experts, but it had also perished in a great battle. Fortunately, it had Xuan Yi’s methods, otherwise, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect would have been completely submerged in history. It would not have had the chance to rise up again until now.","Even the powerful Three Great Saint Realms and the Seven Star Mysterious Sect were the same.","Moreover, the Lingyun Planet that he had joined in the Devil Smoke Valley was a great force in the depths of the universe. The Lingyun Planet Master was a supreme being with extraordinary strength. He was an Ruler in the depths of the universe.","But in the end, the Lingyun Planet was also destroyed. Countless experts died and fled.","The whereabouts of the Lingyun Planet Master was also unknown.","With the change of times, no one, no force or sect could guarantee their prosperity in this world.","What they could do was to improve their strength as much as possible. Only with absolute strength could they truly protect themselves.","Jian Wushuang was still far from that step.","Although he was now invincible in the Divine Beginning Realm, he was still very weak in the entire universe.","“Although the Three Saint Realms have been destroyed, the Divine Beginning Realm is not completely peaceful. There is still a force that needs to be destroyed,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said.","“My young friend, you must be talking about the Sorcerer God’s Sect, right?” Temporal Temple Master looked at him.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","The Sorcerer God’s Sect...","Compared to the powerful and overbearing Three Saint Realms, the Sorcerer God’s Sect had been hiding in the dark.","The Sorcerer God’s Sect had been trying to capture special life forms and some high-level bloodline experts.","No one knew what the Sorcerer God’s Sect was planning to do, and no one knew where their lair was.","However, the Sorcerer God’s Sect had been active in the primordial God for many years, and there was more or less a shadow of the Sorcerer God’s Sect behind many things.","Jian Wushuang also knew that the Three Saint Realms and the Sorcerer God’s Sect used to be on the same side. When the Three Saint Realms set an inescapable net to kill him on the Saha Island, the Sorcerer God’s Sect also made a move, they helped the Three Saint Realms.","A long time ago, there was a so-called prophet in the Sorcerer God’s Sect. He used his special means to find his position and sent the Principles Master to kill him, but in the end, he failed.","Jian Wushuang would never forget a mysterious force like the Sorcerer God’s Sect.","This time, he destroyed the Three Saint Realms. He thought that the Sorcerer God’s Sect would join in and help the Three Saint Realms fight against his camp. But after this battle, he did not see any experts from the Sorcerer God’s Sect.","The Sorcerer God’s Sect did not participate in the battle at all.","Until the Three Saint Realms were completely destroyed, no one from the Sorcerer God’s Sect showed up.","This made Jian Wushuang very confused.","“This Sorcerer God’s Sect is very unique,” Temporal Temple Master said, “according to my information, the leader of the Sorcerer God’s Sect is not a cultivator from the Divine Beginning Realm. He is a Ruler from the outside world!”","“Under normal circumstances, Rulers from the outside world will be repelled by the Heavenly Dao will of the astral world when they come to an ordinary astral world. Their power will be greatly suppressed, and they are much stronger than us Rulers who were born in this astral world. However, the suppression that the Sorcerer God received in the Divine Beginning Realm doesn’t seem to be that great!","“Many years ago, I exchanged blows with him. The power he was able to unleash wasn’t much weaker than mine.”","“Could it be that this God also came from Devil Cloud Star? Is he an expert under the command of the Devil Cloud Star Master?” The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said.","“No. If he is an expert from Devil Cloud Star, then we won’t be surprised by the power he is able to display,” Daoist Xuan God said.","“More importantly, the people of our Star Palace have sent word that the Devil Cloud Star doesn’t have a Ruler like the Sorcerer God. Besides, if the Sorcerer God really is from the Devil Cloud Star, then why didn’t he make a move when we annihilated the Three Great Saint Realms?”","“You must know that in the previous battle, the three Rulers from the Devil Cloud Star all made a move, and were all killed by our young friend, the Heavenly Sword Marquis. Even in the end, when that hegemon xingluo made an appearance, the Sorcerer God still didn’t make an appearance. Thus, we can be certain that the Sorcerer God isn’t an expert from the Devil Cloud Star.”","“Perhaps, for some special reason, he reached an agreement with the Devil Cloud Star Master. That’s why he could stay in the Divine Beginning Realm, and his power wasn’t suppressed too much. Besides, the Devil Cloud Star Master also tacitly allowed him to do some things in the dark, such as capturing special life forms.”","“If that’s the case, the Sorcerer God’s Sect is quite mysterious,” said the Heaven Ancestor.","“Regardless of the purpose of the Sorcerer God’s Sect in the Divine Beginning Realm, and regardless of whether the martial god has made some kind of agreement with Star Master Mo Yun, the Sorcerer God’s Sect should not exist because it has repeatedly helped the Three Saint Realms to deal with me, as well as the shameful things that the Sorcerer God’s Sect has done in the Divine Beginning Realm over the years.” Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold.","“Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Master, and Heaven Ancestor, please try your best to use the intelligence of your alliance to find the base of the Sorcerer God’s Sect!”","“Although the Three Saint Realms have been destroyed, if we let the Sorcerer God’s Sect continue to exist and do all kinds of shameful things, we will still have a hard time sleeping and eating. We must find the Sorcerer God’s Sect and destroy it!”","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the others also nodded.","They were also aware of the potential threat of the Sorcerer God’s Sect.","If the Sorcerer God’s Sect continued to exist in the Divine Beginning Realm, it would be like a time bomb to the Divine Beginning Realm. Who knows when it would suddenly explode?","Therefore, it was better to find it quickly and destroy it.","“Don’t worry, we will immediately send people to investigate. No matter how well the Sorcerer God’s Sect is hidden, as long as it’s in the Divine Beginning Realm, it can’t escape the eyes of the three Freedom Alliances,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","Jian Wushuang still believed in the abilities of the three Freedom Alliances.","..."]},{"number":3698,"title":"Chapter 3698 - Number One in the Divine Beginning Realm","paragraphs":["The Three Great Saint Realms had been destroyed.","This news was like a huge storm. In just a few days, it had swept through the entire Third Heaven, and even the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","The entire Divine Beginning Realm, countless forces, countless sects, and countless cultivators were all shocked by this news.","It could not be helped. To many people, this news was simply too shocking.","The Three Great Saint Realms...had been aloof in the Divine Beginning Realm for too long.","They were like three giants, looking down on everything.","The three lofty Saint Realm Masters were invincible existences in the hearts of almost everyone.","It was even rumored that the Three Saint Realm Masters were the representatives of the Heavenly Dao of the Divine Beginning Realm. They represented the Heavenly Dao of the Divine Beginning Realm.","However, just like that, the Three Great Saint Realms, which had three invincible masters of the Saint Realm, were completely destroyed. It was as if the Heavenly Dao of the Divine Beginning Realm had been completely reversed. It was simply too unbelievable.","Therefore, when many people first received this news, they scoffed at it and did not believe it at all.","It was not until later, when this news spread wantonly, and even the mirror image of the battle spread out, that this news was completely confirmed.","The Three Saint Realms had indeed been destroyed.","And the reason for this result was largely because of the existence of one person.","That person was Heavenly Sword Marquis!","100,000 years ago, he had killed a Principles Master as a saint realm expert. At that time, he had fought against a Saint Realm Master and was known as the number one genius in the history of the Divine Beginning Realm. At that time, Jian Wushuang revealed his talent, it was truly terrifying.","Countless people in the Divine Beginning Realm were shocked by his talent.","However, no matter how shocked they were, talent did not represent his true strength.","For example, there had been many amazing geniuses in the Divine Beginning Realm. These geniuses had shocked people for a time, but in the end, very few of them were able to walk on the path to the peak.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang’s existence at that time was only remembered by many people. Most sects and powers did not really take him seriously.","But now...","The super genius who shocked everyone 100,000 years ago had displayed incredible strength. He had killed three masters of the Saint Realm in the battle that destroyed the Three Saint Realms, at the same time, he had killed three masters of the saint realm experts who had been invited by the Three Saint Realms.","Such terrifying strength had truly shocked everyone.","After all, masters of the saint realm, including Rulers, were almost invincible in the Divine Beginning Realm.","This had long been recognized by everyone.","However, Jian Wushuang had killed three masters of the Saint Realm and Rulers at the same time. What did this mean?","It meant that Jian Wushuang’s battle strength in the Divine Beginning Realm was far stronger than that of a master of the saint realm, or even an ordinary Ruler.","It was certain that his battle strength in the Divine Beginning Realm was much stronger than the leaders of the three Freedom Alliances, including the Heaven-cleaving Alliance master, the Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor.","Therefore, after the battle, Jian Wushuang’s strength was recognized by countless cultivators as the number one person in the Divine Beginning Realm!","This matter was quickly spread to the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, the Temporal Temple, and the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect. However, neither the Heaven-cleaving Alliance master, the Temporal Temple Master, or the Heaven Ancestor came forward to refute, but chose to acquiesce.","It was very normal. First of all, these three people had a very good relationship with Jian Wushuang, and they were all on the same side.","Secondly, Jian Wushuang’s battle strength was indeed much stronger than the three of them in the Divine Beginning Realm alone, because they would be greatly restricted in the Divine Beginning Realm, but Jian Wushuang was not.","As for the Universe Battlefield, Jian Wushuang’s battle strength was also at the advanced Ruler Realm. Among them, perhaps only the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master could fight.","In that case, it was well-deserved to say that Jian Wushuang was the number one person in the Divine Beginning Realm.","The tacit agreement of the three Rulers completely confirmed Jian Wushuang’s title as the number one person in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Soon, the name of Heavenly Sword Marquis resounded throughout the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","This time, his fame and status in the Divine Beginning Realm had completely surpassed those ancient Rulers.","The number one expert in the Divine Beginning Realm, Heavenly Sword Marquis, was completely implemented.","...","The vast universe was boundless.","In a territory that was a certain distance away from the Divine Beginning Realm, although it was still at the edge of the universe, it was no longer a barren place in the universe.","There were hundreds of astral worlds in this territory alone, and there were a total of six grade two astral worlds.","One had to know that there was not a single grade two world star in the star domain where the Divine Beginning Realm was located.","Among the six grade two world stars, there was a world star that was surrounded by a large amount of black fog. It was like a Devil Cloud that was constantly rolling.","This star world was the Devil Cloud Star.","In front of the dark purple grand hall, there was a burly man who was over three meters tall. His hair was messy and his entire body was dirty. He was extremely slovenly. Behind him, there was a snow-white demonic wolf that was crawling on the ground.","The man and the beast were leaning against each other. They looked relaxed and satisfied.","“I wonder when this day will end.” The burly man muttered. He flipped his hand and took out a wine flask. He raised his head and took a big gulp.","However, he did not have the time to put down the wine flask.","“Hmph!”","A cold snort suddenly exploded in this world.","This cold snort carried a trace of anger.","Hearing this cold snort, the burly man jumped in fright. The wine flask in his hand almost fell out. He and the demon wolf immediately stood up.","“Tell the Ice Mist King that I will give him another thirty thousand years at most. If he does not meet my requirements within thirty thousand years, I will immediately flatten his ice mist astral world.” A cold and domineering voice sounded in this world.","“Yes, sir.” The burly man immediately bowed and accepted the order.","After the voice gradually disappeared, the burly man and the demon wolf beside him finally let out a sigh of relief.","“What’s going on? Didn’t the Star Master give the Ice Mist King 100,000 years? Why did he only give him 30,000 years?”","“According to what I know, the Ice Mist King has been following the Star Master’s orders all these years. Did he not disobey the Star Master’s orders?” The burly man muttered.","“Who knows. In any case, since the Star Master has given his orders, the Ice Mist King can only obediently follow them.” The Demon Wolf spoke in the human voice.","“Tsk tsk, 30,000 years. To meet such a requirement, the Ice Mist King is in trouble this time. I wonder why the Star Master is so angry.” The burly man smiled faintly."]},{"number":3699,"title":"Chapter 3699 - Challenge","paragraphs":["“I heard that not too long ago, the Star Master sent three hegemons to accomplish an extremely important task. Could it be that something unexpected happened in this matter?” The muscular man asked.","“Who cares? It has nothing to do with us,” Demon Wolf said.","“That’s true.” The muscular man laughed, then quickly left to deliver the order.","Within the depths of the towering, deep violet hall, an endless, gloomy aura filled the entire hall.","Within the black fog at the very center of the hall, a pair of cold eyes suddenly opened.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis...this is getting interesting.”","“Just you wait. It won’t be long before I personally come looking for you. Haha...”","A maniacal laughter rang out. This laughter lingered in the hall for a long time.","...","In the Divine Beginning Realm, the old nest of the Three Great Saint Realms was now in ruins.","However, these ruins could be rebuilt.","Now, the experts of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect were starting to rebuild.","As for the many sects and forces that had participated in this battle, they left one by one after they divided the spoils of war among themselves.","The army of experts under the command of the four divine races had also returned to the Demon Realm, but Xiao’er, who was now publicly recognized as the Ruler of the four divine races, remained temporarily.","The original reason was, of course, because of Di Shisan.","On the calm lake, a wooden boat was drifting with the wind. On the wooden boat, a man and a woman were leaning against each other, whispering to each other. From time to time, faint laughter could be heard.","When Jian Wushuang came to the surrounding void and saw the scene below, his expression became strange.","The two people on the wooden boat below were, of course, Di Shisan and Xiao’er.","The two of them had always been in love with each other. In that battle, Xiao’er had even turned against the Nine-tailed Clan for Di Shisan. In the end, because of the destruction of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, the entire Seven Star Divine Realm was sealed, Di Shisan had remained in the sealed time, while Xiao’er had started the nine reincarnations to cultivate the nine-life succubus skill.","Now, after countless years, the two of them finally met again.","Although so many years had passed, the feelings between them had not changed at all.","What surprised Jian Wushuang was Di Shisan’s current appearance.","In his impression, Di Shisan was an extremely cold and arrogant person.","He had started to interact with Di Shisan in his previous life. Speaking of which, they had been friends for many years. The Di Shisan he met had always had a cold face. No matter who he was facing, whether it was his own people or his enemies...his expression had never changed.","But now, when Di Shisan and Xiao’er were together, there was no trace of coldness. The smile on his face was so natural.","“I didn’t expect Di Shisan to have such a side.”","Jian Wushuang smiled, then he rushed down and soon appeared in front of Di Shisan and Xiao’er.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re here.”","Seeing Jian Wushuang coming, the smile on Di Shisan’s face disappeared and turned into an ice mountain again.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis.” Xiao’er bowed respectfully.","Although Jian Wushuang was once her ally, and his strength was not as good as hers for a long time, and even a long time ago, Jian Wushuang was just a little guy in front of her, but now...Jian Wushuang was already recognized as the number one expert in the Divine Beginning Realm. He could easily kill a Ruler and a master of the Saint Realm.","Xiao’er could not help but feel a trace of respect for such a super expert.","“Di Shisan, did I disturb you?” Jian Wushuang asked playfully.","“No.” Di Shisan shook his head. “Palace Master Xuan Yan and the others are already handling the matters in the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. I don’t think they need my help. Are you here for that matter?”","Di Shisan had already guessed Jian Wushuang’s intention.","Jian Wushuang smiled, he said, “As you know, in the Divine Beginning Realm and even in the surrounding star field, you’re probably the only one who can match me in sword principle comprehension. Your sword principle once made me look up to you. Now that I’ve finally caught up with you, I naturally want to have a face-to-face fight with you.","“Previously, in the Eternal Chaotic World, we were unable to fully display our sword principle strength. But now, in the Divine Beginning Realm, we don’t have any scruples.","“Di Shisan, how long will it take for your strength to recover to its peak?” Jian Wushuang asked him.","He wanted to fight with Di Shisan.","Of course, Jian Wushuang only wanted to compete with him in teaching. As for his strength, he was much stronger than Di Shisan. If it was a battle between two people, it would be unfair to Di Shisan.","However, he also knew that Di Shisan had been in the Eternal Chaotic World for a long time. He had been sleeping for a long time and was completely in the weakest state. Although he had returned to the Divine Beginning Realm now...it would definitely take time for him to recover to his peak.","“About 30 years,” Di Shisan said.","“30 years?” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. “In that case, I’ll come back to you in 30 years.”","“I’ll wait.” Di Shisan nodded.","“Goodbye.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and left.","After Jian Wushuang left...","“Shisan, are you really going to fight with Heavenly Sword Marquis?” Xiao’er immediately looked at him.","“Of course. We had an agreement when we were in the Eternal Chaotic World, and we can’t avoid it,” Di Shisan said.","“But in terms of strength, this Heavenly Sword Marquis can easily kill even Saint Realm Masters and Rulers?” Xiao’er frowned.","“In terms of strength, I am definitely far inferior to him. However, I am only competing with him in sword dao and swordsmanship. In this aspect, I am confident that I will not lose to him,” Di Shisan said with a smile.","“In other words, you are confident in defeating him in that battle?” Xiao’er was surprised.","“Not really. When he fought against those three hegemons, I could tell that his understanding of the Dao of the sword wasn’t much lower than mine. In addition, he created a high-grade tier 7 absolute art. Although it was only one type, that sword attack of his was extremely formidable.”","“It can be said that there isn’t much of a gap between him and me in terms of understanding of the Dao of the sword and in terms of sword-arts. However, there is one point. The sword-arts he created aren’t as comprehensive as mine. Therefore, when the time comes for a real battle, my chances of winning should be 70%, while his chances are 30%,” Di Shisan said calmly.","His words seemed a little arrogant.","But in fact, those who were familiar with Di Shisan knew that he was an extremely arrogant person, and he never exaggerated.","Since he said that he had a 70% chance of winning, those who were familiar with him knew that his chance of winning was more than 70%, or even 80%, or even 90%.","Although Di Shisan had existed many years ago and had not made any progress in sword principle because he had been sleeping, his understanding of sword principle had always been unparalleled.","Now, although Jian Wushuang was qualified to compete with him in sword principle, it was still unknown whether he could really surpass him."]},{"number":3700,"title":"Chapter 3700 - Settling Down","paragraphs":["The Divine Beginning Realm was a vast and boundless territory.","It was the edge of the endless territory, and beyond it was the core of the Divine Beginning Realm, the Third Heaven.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang had arrived with the people of the Eternal Chaotic World,","“This is it.” Jian Wushuang looked down at the land with a calm gaze.","This territory was still within the endless territory. The cultivation environment here was certainly not comparable to the Third Heaven, but the level of the cultivators here was far from comparable to the Third Heaven.","In this place, a saint could become an Ruler.","A Divine Master was also a top existence in a holy world.","Jian Wushuang naturally would not take a second look at such a place, but it was big enough for the people of the Eternal Chaotic World.","Because of the restrictions of heaven and earth, the most powerful cultivators in the Eternal Chaotic World were only at the ‘Emperor’ Realm, which was only at the Chaos Realm.","The Chaos Realm was an ant in the endless territories.","They still had a long way to go. If Jian Wushuang placed them in the Third Heaven, they could do so because of his existence. However, for the cultivators in the Eternal Chaotic World, they lacked a lot of experience.","What Jian Wushuang wanted now was for the cultivators in the Eternal Chaotic World to have a place to stay after they came out of the Eternal Chaotic World. Then, they could rely on their own abilities to slowly grow and step by step reach the peak.","Therefore, it was undoubtedly the best choice to place the cultivators of the Eternal Chaotic World in the endless territories. Moreover, this place was at the edge of the endless territories, close to the Third Heaven, even if the cultivators of the Eternal Chaotic World grew up in the future, it would be convenient for them to go to the Third Heaven.","With Jian Wushuang’s existence, the people of the Eternal Chaotic World soon occupied a holy world in this territory. This holy world was originally called the Holy World of Allheaven, but after it was occupied by the cultivators of the Eternal Chaotic World, and was renamed the Eternal Realm.","Without a doubt, Jian Wushuang was the leader of the Eternal Saint World. Besides Jian Wushuang, the strongest white emperor was equivalent to the deputy leader. When Jian Wushuang was not around, there were many matters in the Eternal Saint World, it’s up to the white emperor.","The Eternal Saint World was just beginning to be created, and everything was in ruins.","Fortunately, with Jian Wushuang, the number one expert in the primordial chaos, many of the initial steps could be saved.","As for the resources, Jian Wushuang had directly left 20% of the resources from the Three Saint Realms in the Eternal Saint World. This amount of resources was too huge, not to mention the Eternal Saint World, which had just emerged from the Eternal Chaotic World, even building a force that was comparable to the Eight Directions Celestial Sect or the four divine clans would be very easy.","Jian Wushuang gave these resources to the White Emperor, but there were some restrictions. After all, although there were many resources, considering that there would be an endless stream of experts coming to the Divine Beginning Realm in the Eternal Chaotic World, these resources could not be wasted too much.","In addition, Jian Wushuang had left behind many tricks in the Eternal Saint World.","For example, he had personally set up a magic array for the Eternal Saint World.","Because he did not have much knowledge in the field of formation, he had only casually set up the formation. However, his current strength was at the advanced Ruler Realm. Even if he had just casually set up the formation...in the Divine Beginning Realm, no one would be able to break it by force.","In addition, Jian Wushuang had left behind many puppet fighters for the Eternal Saint World.","These puppet fighters were obtained by Jian Wushuang from the experts he had killed over the years, especially the three masters of the Saint Realm and the three Rulers. There were dozens of them in their interspatial rings, he simply took out a few of them and placed them in the Eternal Saint World to ensure its safety.","After leaving some tricks for the Eternal Saint World, Jian Wushuang left the Eternal Chaotic World in the Eternal Saint World and opened up several different passages in the Eternal Saint World, these passages could lead to several important places in the Divine Beginning Realm. Of course, there were also spatial passages leading to the Third Heaven.","In short, Jian Wushuang had left all the necessary things for a large sect. As for how far the Eternal Saint World could go with the things he left behind, he did not know.","He could only rely on the descendants of the Eternal Chaotic World to do well. As for him, although he could protect the Eternal Saint World for now, if the crisis of the Divine Beginning Realm was completely resolved in the future, he would take over the Divine Beginning Realm again, his original body would certainly go to the deeper part of the Eternal Chaotic World to explore.","He would at most pay a little attention to the Divine Beginning Realm, let alone the Eternal Saint World.","After everything was done, Jian Wushuang gave a few instructions to the white emperor and then returned to the Eternal Chaotic World.","He had already sent most of his family and friends to the Divine Beginning Realm. There was nothing left for him to miss in the Eternal Chaotic World.","He came back with only one purpose, which was to hide in the ancient battlefield. It was the last opportunity left for him by his master.","The Heaven Suppression Tablet!","He had heard from the Xuan God Daoist that when the Heaven Suppression Tablet was born, more than a dozen Rulers had participated in the competition, which had even led to the death of the Ruler.","When his master had not obtained the Heaven Suppression Tablet, his strength was only at the initial Ruler Realm. However, after obtaining the Heaven Suppression Tablet and completely refining it, his battle strength was actually close to that of a superior Ruler.","One could imagine how incredible the Heaven Suppression Tablet was.","After knowing this, Jian Wushuang was also quite eager for the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","However, he also knew that a treasure like the Heaven Suppression Tablet was not something that could be easily refined in a short period of time. Therefore, after he came to the Eternal Chaotic World, he did not pay attention to the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","Until now, he had already settled down in the Eternal Chaotic World, and the Three Saint Realms had been completely destroyed. At present, in the Divine Beginning Realm, except for the Sorcerer God’s Sect, which had yet to be destroyed, he did not know when the people from the Devil Cloud Star would come back, so he had nothing else to do.","At this time, he returned to the Eternal Chaotic World and came to the Heaven Suppression Tablet.","The gray stone tablet, which was nearly 30,000 feet tall, stood alone in front of Jian Wushuang.","When he saw the Heaven Suppression Tablet again, Jian Wushuang’s heart was still full of shock. He was even more shocked than when he first saw the Heaven Suppression Tablet under the guidance of Di Shisan.","When he first saw the heaven-suppressing tablet, he was still very weak. He had not even reached the peak of the Eternal Chaotic World. At that time, it was normal for him to not be able to see the truth of the heaven-suppressing tablet.","However, now that he was standing at the top of the Divine Beginning Realm, the heaven-suppressing tablet still gave him an extremely mysterious feeling that he could not see through.","This was somewhat inconceivable."]}]);
